\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 Vitajte v KeyNote\f0\lang3082  NF  \v\'11I102\'12\cf0\b0\v0\fs20{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:102,32,32"}}{\fldrslt {102_keynote.ico}}}}\cf2\b\fs36\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard\qj KeyNote NF je flexibiln\u253?, \b viacfunk\u269?n\u253? pozn\u225?mkov\u253? editor so z\u225?lo\u382?kami,\b0  zalo\u382?en\u253? na \u353?tandardnom ovl\u225?dacom prvku Windows Richedit, a teda vo form\u225?te \b Rich Text Format (RTF)\b0 . \par


\pard\sb120\qj Z\u225?kladn\u225? my\u353?lienka v KeyNote NF je, \u382?e \b m\u244?\u382?ete ma\u357? mnoho samostatn\u253?ch pozn\u225?mok v jedinom s\u250?bore. \b0 To znamen\u225?, \u382?e nemus\u237?te otv\u225?ra\u357? nieko\u318?ko s\u250?borov \f2\emdash\f0 pre v\u228?\u269?\u353?inu \u250?\u269?elov sta\u269?\u237? vytvori\u357? iba jeden s\u250?bor a nieko\u318?ko prie\u269?inkov (z\u225?lo\u382?ku) v \u328?om. Ka\u382?d\u253? \b prie\u269?inok \super 1\nosupersub  \b0 umo\u382?\u328?uje viac\u250?rov\u328?ov\u233?, vnoren\u233? pozn\u225?mky (uzly).\par


\pard\sa160\qr\super\b 1\nosupersub\b0  Od verzie 1.9.2 s\u250? z\u225?lo\u382?ky premenovan\u233? na \cf3\ul\b prie\u269?inky\cf0\ulnone\b0 , obsahuj\u250?ce jednu alebo viac pozn\u225?mok. {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<13|2425|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Viac inform\u225?ci\u237?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\qj KeyNote NF je tak \b jednoduch\u253? na pou\u382?\u237?vanie\b0  ako ak\u253?ko\u318?vek \b textov\u253? editor\b0 , s ve\u318?k\u253?m mno\u382?stvom funkci\u237? form\u225?tovania textu, ktor\u233? v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uj\u250? vytv\u225?ra\u357? ve\u318?mi \u269?itate\u318?n\u233?, preh\u318?adn\u233? a dobre usporiadan\u233? pozn\u225?mky. Je ve\u318?mi v\u353?estrann\u253? a v\u382?dy dostupn\u253? jedin\u253?m stla\u269?en\u237?m kl\u225?vesu, aj ke\u271? pracujete v inej aplik\u225?cii. Pon\u250?ka mnoho \b pokro\u269?il\u253?ch funkci\u237?\b0 , ako napr\u237?klad \b obr\u225?zky,\b0  \b slovn\u237?k, hypertextov\u233? odkazy, zna\u269?ky, skladanie, makr\u225?, \u353?t\u253?ly, pluginy, virtu\u225?lne uzly \b0 a mnoho \u271?al\u353?ieho. Okrem toho s\u250? rozhranie a spr\u225?vanie KeyNote NF mimoriadne konfigurovate\u318?n\u233?.\par


\pard\sb160\sa120 Volite\u318?ne, KeyNote NF \b m\u244?\u382?e bezpe\u269?ne za\u353?ifrova\u357? va\u353?e \u250?daje \b0 pomocou {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<51|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Blowfish alebo Idea}}}}}\b\f0\fs20  \b0 algoritmov.\par


\pard\li720\ri720\sb100\sa40\cf4\b\f3\lang3082 KeyNote NF\b0  je v\u253?vojom aplik\u225?cie Tranglos \b Keynote\b0  (od Mareka Jedlinsk\u233?ho), ktor\u225? bola {\cf0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<120|2692|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{uzavret\u233? v roku 2005}}}}}\f3\fs20 , pri\u269?om poslednou verziou bola 1.6.9 (verejne dostupn\u253? zdrojov\u253? k\u243?d bol verzie 1.6.5). Prvou verziou KeyNote NF bola 1.7.0, vydan\u225? v nov. 2007, hoci a\u382? v dec. 2008 (v1.7.4) bol program ofici\u225?lne premenovan\u253? na \u8222?KeyNote NF\u8220?, pre 'KeyNote New Features')\par


\pard\cf0\f0\lang1033\par

\cf5 * KeyNote NF je zadarmo. \cf0 Nemus\u237?te za\u328? plati\u357? a m\u244?\u382?ete ho pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? akoko\u318?vek chcete, v s\u250?lade s {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<6|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Licen\u269?n\u225? zmluva s koncov\u253?m pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?om}}}}}\f0\fs20 . \par

* Je vyv\u237?jan\u253? ako {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<6|219|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Projekt s otvoren\u253?m zdrojov\u253?m k\u243?dom.}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\cf6 * Svoju v\u271?aku m\u244?\u382?ete prejavi\u357? a podpori\u357? \u271?al\u353?\u237? v\u253?voj aj {\cf0\b{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf#donations"}}{\fldrslt{prispievanie}}}}}\f0\fs20 !\cf0\par

\par

