\par

Pozn\u225?mka: \f3 Koncept \ul KeyNote bol zalo\u382?en\u253? na\ulnone  podobnej aplik\u225?cii pozn\u225?mkov\u233?ho editora so z\u225?lo\u382?kami, ktor\u250? Marek nieko\u318?ko rokov pou\u382?\u237?val: \b Dart Notes\b0 , od Andreho v.d. Merweho. KeyNote dok\u225?\u382?e otv\u225?ra\u357? a uklada\u357? s\u250?bory vo form\u225?te Dart Notes. Ak ste Dart Notes u\u382? pou\u382?\u237?vali, pozrite si {\ul{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<17|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Inform\u225?cie pre pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?ov DaRT Notes}}}}}\ul\f3\fs20  \ulnone .\lang3082\par

\f0\lang1033\par

