\cf1\b\fs36\lang3082 Ako pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? t\u250?to n\u225?povedu\cf2\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Tento s\u250?bor n\u225?povedy bol \b vytvoren\u253? pomocou KeyNote NF\b0 , a je tak skuto\u269?n\u253?m pr\u237?kladom mo\u382?nost\u237?, ktor\u233? aplik\u225?cia pon\u250?ka.\par

\par

Ako ka\u382?d\u253? s\u250?bor .knt, aj tento mo\u382?no v z\u225?sade upravova\u357?. Ke\u271?\u382?e v\u353?ak tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? aktualizovan\u253? v \u271?al\u353?\u237?ch verzi\u225?ch aplik\u225?cie, neodpor\u250?\u269?am upravova\u357? ho priamo. Ak chcete vykona\u357? \u250?pravy, odpor\u250?\u269?am urobi\u357? ich na jeho k\u243?pii.\par


\pard\sb80 Prie\u269?inky s\u250? toti\u382? ozna\u269?en\u233? ako \b len na \u269?\u237?tanie\b0  (v\u253?berom Folder | Read Only ). Ak chcete vykon\u225?va\u357? zmeny, zru\u353?te ozna\u269?enie tejto mo\u382?nosti. Tie\u382?, ak v obsahu zbad\u225?te chybu alebo sa domnievate, \u382?e by sa nejak\u253? popis mal vylep\u353?i\u357?, uve\u271?te to na GitHube v podobe issue s odkazom na n\u225?povedu v predmete (napr. \u8222?[Help file] ...\u8220?)\par


\pard\par

Zv\u225?\u382?te nasleduj\u250?ce:\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak to pova\u382?ujete za potrebn\u233?, m\u244?\u382?ete nastavi\u357? a uzamkn\u250?\u357? vy\u353?\u353?ie pribl\u237?\u382?enie. Pozrite {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<20|7487|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Nastavenie pribl\u237?\u382?enia v prie\u269?inkoch}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Obr\u225?zky m\u244?\u382?ete do\u269?asne skry\u357? alebo ich otvori\u357? v prehliada\u269?i. ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) \par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Cel\u250? n\u225?povedu m\u244?\u382?ete preh\u318?ad\u225?va\u357? pomocou {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<88|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{H\u318?ada\u357? | N\u225?js\u357? v\u353?etko...}}}}}\f0\fs20  (z\u225?lo\u382?ka \u8222?Find\u8220? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<12|448|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Panel zdrojov}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}M\u244?\u382?ete si robi\u357? pozn\u225?mky v \u8222?{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<12|448|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Scratchpad}}}}}\f0\fs20 \u8220?, vr\u225?tane odkazov na uzly (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|13152|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Vkladanie intern\u253?ch KNT odkazov}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Odkazy na miesta v r\u225?mci s\u250?boru n\u225?povedy m\u244?\u382?ete ulo\u382?i\u357? na z\u225?lo\u382?ke {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<70|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Ob\u318?\u250?ben\u233?}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard\sb160 Tento s\u250?bor n\u225?povedy sa sp\u250?\u353?\u357?a pomocou profilu \u8222?Help\u8220? (Profiles\\Help), v ktorom bol s\u250?bor .ini vhodne nakonfigurovan\u253?.\par


\pard\par

Bolo vytvoren\u253?ch mnoho vz\u357?ahov (s viacer\u253?mi odkazmi), ktor\u233? pom\u225?haj\u250? n\u225?js\u357? inform\u225?cie. M\u244?\u382?ete teda za\u269?a\u357? napr\u237?klad takto:\par


