\cf1\b\fs36\lang3082 Ako stiahnu\u357? a nain\u353?talova\u357? nov\u233? verzie\cf2\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\par

Najnov\u353?iu verziu KeyNote NF si m\u244?\u382?ete stiahnu\u357? z GitHubu: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/releases/latest }}{\fldrslt{https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/releases/latest}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

N\u225?jdete tam in\u353?tala\u269?n\u253? program v tvare \u8222?\cf3\b kntSetup_<version>.exe\cf0\b0 \u8220? (zalo\u382?en\u253? na Inno Setup od Jordana Russella).\par


\pard\sb80 Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e napriek in\u353?tala\u269?n\u233?mu programu je KeyNote NF (rovnako ako Keynote) \b prenosn\u225?\b0  aplik\u225?cia. Cel\u225? konfigur\u225?cia sa uklad\u225? do s\u250?borov v prie\u269?inku Profiles (hlavne do keynote.ini. Pozrite {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<86|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie profilov}}}}}\f0\fs20 ). \par

In\u353?tala\u269?n\u253? program v\u225?m pom\u225?ha udeli\u357? potrebn\u233? povolenia vytvoren\u253?m prie\u269?inkom (prv\u225? in\u353?tal\u225?cia), volite\u318?ne vytvori\u357? odkaz na ploche alebo priradi\u357? KeyNote NF k pr\u237?pon\u225?m s\u250?borov .knt, kne a .knm. Pri aktualiz\u225?cii existuj\u250?cej verzie in\u353?tal\u225?tor nahrad\u237? zmenen\u233? s\u250?bory (hlavne keynote.exe, kntutils.dll a s\u250?bory doc vr\u225?tane s\u250?boru n\u225?povedy). Konfigura\u269?n\u233? s\u250?bory pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?a (ani in\u253? vlastn\u253? obsah) sa nemenia.\par


\pard\par

Odpor\u250?\u269?am pou\u382?i\u357? in\u353?tal\u225?tor (kntSetup), ale pre pr\u237?pad, \u382?e by ho niekto potreboval, bude k dispoz\u237?cii aj s\u250?bor Zip obsahuj\u250?ci s\u250?bory z \u250?plnej in\u353?tal\u225?cie.\par

\par

\par

\b Pozn\u225?mka: \par

\b0 Verzie KeyNote NF pred 1.9.0 nie s\u250? podp\u237?san\u233? k\u243?dom, a preto by ste mohli dosta\u357? v\u253?stra\u382?n\u250? spr\u225?vu Smart Screen (Windows). Od verzie 1.9.0 s\u250? bin\u225?rne s\u250?bory KeyNote NF podp\u237?san\u233? k\u243?dom (m\u244?\u382?ete vidie\u357?, \u382?e s\u250?bory s\u250? digit\u225?lne podp\u237?san\u233?, vo Vlastnostiach s\u250?boru \f1\emdash\f0 v Prieskumn\u237?kovi Windows).\par


\pard\sb80 O\f2\lang3082 d vydania verzie 1.8.1 m\u244?\u382?ete {\f0\lang1033{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<5|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{overenie integrity a autenticity stiahnut\u253?ch vydan\u237?}}}}}\f0\fs20\lang1033\par


\pard\par

Taktie\u382? od verzie 1.9.0 KeyNote NF obsahuje nov\u250? polo\u382?ku v ponuke Help: \u8222?\b Check for Updates\b0 "\par


\pard\sb80 Dial\u243?gov\u233? okno \u8222?Check for Updates\u8220? pon\u250?ka mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?\b Check for updates on startup\b0 \u8220?. Porovn\u225?va va\u353?u verziu (spusten\u253? .exe) a aktu\u225?lnu verziu (na GitHube, h\u318?adan\u237?m v releases/latest) a zobrazuje zmeny medzi t\u253?mito verziami na z\u225?klade s\u250?boru history.txt\par


\pard\sb120 Ak je mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?\cf3\b Check for updates on startup\cf0\b0 \u8220? povolen\u225?, kontrola sa vykon\u225? nieko\u318?ko sek\u250?nd po inicializ\u225?cii KeyNote, a to iba raz denne. Ke\u271? sa n\u225?jde nov\u225? verzia, zobraz\u237? sa dial\u243?gov\u233? okno a t\u225?to verzia sa zaregistruje ako posledn\u225? ozn\u225?men\u225? verzia, aby sa znova upozornilo iba vtedy, ak existuje nov\u353?ia verzia.\par


\pard\par

}
