\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs36 Kontrola integrity a autentickosti stiahnut\u253?ch vydan\u237?\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Od verzie 1.8.1 KeyNote NF s\u250? v\u353?etky bal\u237?ky sprev\u225?dzan\u233? s\u250?borom s ha\u353?om \b\fs22 SHA256\b0\fs20 .\par

  Tento ha\u353? m\u244?\u382?ete jednoducho porovna\u357? s ha\u353?om, ktor\u253? z\u237?skate z bal\u237?ka spusten\u237?m z CMD (pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadku):\par

    CertUtil -hashfile kntSetup.exe SHA256\par

\tab\par

  Nov\u233? verzie \b 7-Zip\b0  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK www.7-zip.org }}{\fldrslt{www.7-zip.org}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) tie\u382? umo\u382?\u328?uj\u250? vypo\u269?\u237?ta\u357? ha\u353? kliknut\u237?m prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom na s\u250?bor a v\u253?berom\par

  CRC SHA z kontextov\u233?ho menu.\par

\par

\par

\b\fs24 GnuPG (GNU Privacy Guard)\par

\b0\fs20\par

Taktie\u382? od vydania verzie 1.8.1 KeyNote NF s\u250? distribu\u269?n\u233? bal\u237?ky podp\u237?san\u233? digit\u225?lnym podpisom pomocou GnuPG (GNU Privacy Guard). To umo\u382?\u328?uje pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?om spo\u318?ahlivo overi\u357? autentickos\u357? a integritu bal\u237?kov KeyNote NF.\par

\par

M\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? nat\u237?vny \b GnuPG\b0  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://gnupg.org }}{\fldrslt{https://gnupg.org}}}}}\f0\fs20 ), ktor\u253? funguje v pr\u237?kazovom riadku, alebo pou\u382?i\u357? \b Gpg4win\b0  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://www.gpg4win.org }}{\fldrslt{https://www.gpg4win.org}}}}}\f0\fs20 ), ktor\u253? je zalo\u382?en\u253? na GnuPG a pon\u250?ka grafick\u233? rozhranie. M\u244?\u382?ete tie\u382? pou\u382?i\u357? \b PGP Desktop\b0  (v s\u250?\u269?asnosti poskytovan\u253? spolo\u269?nos\u357?ou Symantec).\par

\par


\pard\sa120\b\fs22 Vyd\u225?vac\u237? k\u318?\u250?\u269?\b0\par


\pard\fs20 Bal\u237?ky KeyNote NF s\u250? podp\u237?san\u233? pomocou Vyd\u225?vacieho k\u318?\u250?\u269?a, ktor\u253? m\u225? tieto charakteristiky:\par

\par

\cf3     Podp\u237?sal: KeyNote NF (Daniel Prado Velasco)\par

    E-mail: dprado.keynote@gmail.com\par

    Key ID: 0xFDBC8364\par

    Odtla\u269?ok k\u318?\u250?\u269?a: EB6F 9FED 0F62 7568 201C 2117 909F E709 FDBC 8364\par

    Vytvoren\u233?: 2023-12-11\par

    Platnos\u357? do: 2026-12-11\par

\cf0\par

\par


\pard\sa120\b\fs22 Z\u237?skanie a overenie Vyd\u225?vacieho k\u318?\u250?\u269?a\par


\pard\b0\fs20 Aby bolo mo\u382?n\u233? overi\u357? podpis, mus\u237?te z\u237?ska\u357? k\u243?piu tohto Vyd\u225?vacieho k\u318?\u250?\u269?a. M\u244?\u382?ete ho z\u237?ska\u357? zo str\u225?nky KeyNote NF na GitHube:\par

  {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/blob/master/KeyNoteNF_0xFDBC8364_public.asc }}{\fldrslt{https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/blob/master/KeyNoteNF_0xFDBC8364_public.asc}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

M\u244?\u382?ete ho tie\u382? n\u225?js\u357? (skontrolujte ID k\u318?\u250?\u269?a) na tomto serveri k\u318?\u250?\u269?ov:\par

    \par

    {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://keyserver.ubuntu.com }}{\fldrslt{https://keyserver.ubuntu.com}}}}}\f0\fs20    \par

    \par

\par

V pr\u237?pade Gpg4win m\u244?\u382?ete k\u318?\u250?\u269? vyh\u318?ada\u357? aj na serveri k\u318?\u250?\u269?ov prostredn\u237?ctvom \b Kleopatra\b0 . PGP Desktop m\u225? tie\u382? tak\u250?to funkciu.\par

\par

Ke\u271? sa uist\u237?te, \u382?e stiahnut\u253? k\u318?\u250?\u269? sa zhoduje s k\u318?\u250?\u269?om stiahnut\u253?m zo servera k\u318?\u250?\u269?ov, m\u244?\u382?ete ho importova\u357? do svojho \u250?lo\u382?iska k\u318?\u250?\u269?ov. Dvakr\u225?t kliknite na s\u250?bor s vyd\u225?vac\u237?m k\u318?\u250?\u269?om (Release Key), overte jeho charakteristiky a uistite sa, \u382?e v\u353?etky s\u250? presne rovnak\u233? ako uveden\u233?. Potom vyd\u225?vac\u237? k\u318?\u250?\u269? podp\u237?\u353?te svoj\u237?m s\u250?kromn\u253?m k\u318?\u250?\u269?om a nastavte \u250?rove\u328? d\u244?veryhodnosti, ak\u250? chcete.\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa120\b Overenie digit\u225?lneho podpisu\b0\par


\pard Na overenie digit\u225?lneho podpisu (a t\u253?m aj autentickosti a integrity s\u250?boru) si mus\u237?te stiahnu\u357? podpisov\u253? s\u250?bor pre bal\u237?\u269?ky, ktor\u233? ste\rquote  z\u237?skali. Podpisov\u253? s\u250?bor (.sig) sa nach\u225?dza pri odkaze na stiahnutie bal\u237?\u269?ka.\par

\par

Po stiahnut\u237? sa uistite, \u382?e oba s\u250?bory (t. j. bal\u237?\u269?ek a s\u250?bor .sig) sa nach\u225?dzaj\u250? na tom istom mieste. Potom dvakr\u225?t kliknite na podpis, aby sa spustil proces overenia.\par

\par

V\u253?sledok by mal uv\u225?dza\u357?, \u382?e s\u250?bor podp\u237?sal {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:dprado.keynote@gmail.com"}}{\fldrslt{dprado.keynote@gmail.com}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

    Pri pou\u382?\u237?van\u237? \ul Kleopatra\ulnone  sa uistite, \u382?e ozna\u269?enie m\u225? zelen\u233? pozadie. Ak je \u269?erven\u233?, bal\u237?\u269?ek bol pozmenen\u253? alebo po\u353?koden\u253? a treba ho okam\u382?ite odstr\u225?ni\u357?\par

\par

    Pri pou\u382?\u237?van\u237? \ul PGP Desktop\ulnone  sa uistite, \u382?e v\u253?sledok m\u225? zelen\u250? za\u353?krt\u225?vaciu zna\u269?ku. V opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade sa bal\u237?\u269?ka zbavte\par

\par

}
