\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs36 KeyNote NF. Po\u271?akovanie\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Ako v\u253?vojov\u253? pokra\u269?ovate\u318? KeyNote 1.6.5 od Mareka si KeyNote NF v s\u250?\u269?asnosti zachov\u225?va rovnak\u233? kni\u382?nice a komponenty tret\u237?ch str\u225?n zahrnut\u233? v tejto verzii a prid\u225?va nieko\u318?ko \u271?al\u353?\u237?ch. Prid\u225?vam sa k Marekovi a \u271?akujem autorom tohto bezplatn\u233?ho k\u243?du: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<7|1881|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{KeyNote. Po\u271?akovania}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

V KeyNote NF sa pou\u382?\u237?vaj\u250? nov\u233? kni\u382?nice a komponenty. Ve\u318?k\u225? v\u271?aka ich autorom:\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100 Kryvich, bielorusk\u253? t\u237?m Belarusian Linguistic Software, za jeho Kryvich Delphi Localizer ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://sites.google.com/site/kryvich/localizer }}{\fldrslt{https://sites.google.com/site/kryvich/localizer}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Roberto Della Pasqua a predch\u225?dzaj\u250?ci, za Delphi Fast ZLib 1.2.3 ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.dellapasqua.com/delphizlib/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.dellapasqua.com/delphizlib/}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Peter Johnson za jeho UWebBrowserWrapper ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.delphidabbler.com/articles?article=14 }}{\fldrslt{http://www.delphidabbler.com/articles?article=14}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Arnaud Bouchez za SynGdiPlus, ktor\u253? implementuje potomkov TGraphic schopn\u253?ch na\u269?\u237?ta\u357? a uklada\u357? obr\u225?zky GIF, TIF, PNG a JPG pomocou kni\u382?nice GDI+ ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://blog.synopse.info/post/2010/03/20/GIF,-TIF,-PNG-and-JPG-pictures-TGraphic-read/write-via-GDI }}{\fldrslt{http://blog.synopse.info/post/2010/03/20/GIF,-TIF,-PNG-and-JPG-pictures-TGraphic-read/write-via-GDI}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Francois Piette za jeho ICS - Internet Component Suite  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.overbyte.be/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.overbyte.be/}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}unRxLib, v1.21. Neofici\u225?lna verzia kni\u382?nice Rx pre Delphi 2005 a\u382? Alexandria  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://www.micrel.cz/RxLib/ }}{\fldrslt{https://www.micrel.cz/RxLib/}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Jordan Russell za Inno Setup ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php }}{\fldrslt{https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\par

A samozrejme v\u271?aka \b Marekovi Jedlinsk\u233?mu\b0  za KeyNote :)  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.tranglos.com/free/keynote.html }}{\fldrslt{http://www.tranglos.com/free/keynote.html}}}}}\f0\fs20 )    \par

Tento program, KeyNote NF, je len jednoduch\u253?m v\u253?vojov\u253?m pokra\u269?ovan\u237?m KeyNote s nieko\u318?k\u253?mi vylep\u353?eniami.\par

\par

\par

Kni\u382?nice a komponenty pou\u382?it\u233? v KeyNote 1.6.5, ktor\u233? v\u353?ak nie s\u250? uveden\u233? v poslednom zozname po\u271?akovan\u237?. Tie\u382? v\u271?aka:\par

\par


