\pard\par

\par

Nieko\u318?ko komponentov a kni\u382?n\u237?c sa v aktu\u225?lnej verzii (1.8.*) nepou\u382?\u237?va, ale pou\u382?\u237?vali sa predt\u253?m. V\u271?aka ich autorom:\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100 Troy Wolbrink za jeho Tnt Unicode Controls ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://tnt.ccci.org/delphi_unicode_controls/ }}{\fldrslt{http://tnt.ccci.org/delphi_unicode_controls/}}}}}\f0\fs20 )  \par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Brad Stowers' Delphi Free Stuff ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.delphifreestuff.com }}{\fldrslt{http://www.delphifreestuff.com}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) za TdfsStatusBar\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Dr. Peter Below za jeho StreamIO, ovl\u225?da\u269? zariadenia pre textov\u233? s\u250?bory, ktor\u253? umo\u382?\u328?uje vstup a v\u253?stup v \u353?t\u253?le textov\u253?ch s\u250?borov na streamoch\par


\pard   \par

\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\f1\fs36\lang1045\'11B1\'12\v0 KeyNote.\f0\lang3082  \f1\lang1045  Po\u271?akovanie\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par

\fs20 KeyNote pou\u382?\u237?va nieko\u318?ko freeware kni\u382?n\u237?c a komponentov, bez ktor\u253?ch by bolo p\u237?sanie programu nesmierne n\u225?ro\u269?nej\u353?ie. Autori t\u253?chto kni\u382?n\u237?c poskytuj\u250? komunite Delphi fantastick\u253? bezplatn\u253? k\u243?d. \u270?akujem v\u225?m v\u353?etk\u253?m!\par

\par

\b Tip: \b0 Ak niektor\u253? odkaz v nasleduj\u250?com zozname nefunguje, v\u228?\u269?\u353?inu alebo v\u353?etky tieto komponenty mo\u382?no n\u225?js\u357? na {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.torry.net }}{\fldrslt{http://www.torry.net}}}}}\f0\fs20  alebo pomocou vyh\u318?ad\u225?vania Google {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.google.com/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.google.com/}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par

\par

\b\fs22 Najm\u228? by som chcel po\u271?akova\u357? t\u253?mto:\b0\par

\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100 Bradovi Stowersovi za nieko\u318?ko skvele u\u382?ito\u269?n\u253?ch komponentov, ktor\u233? nap\u237?sal a rozd\u225?va zadarmo: TdfsBrowseDirectoryDlg, TdfsMRUFileList, TdfsStatusBar. Potrebn\u233? komponenty sa distribuuj\u250? so zdrojov\u253?m k\u243?dom KeyNote a mo\u382?no ich n\u225?js\u357? aj na {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.torry.net }}{\fldrslt{http://www.torry.net}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Autori kni\u382?nice RX Library {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://sourceforge.net/projects/rxlib/ }}{\fldrslt{http://sourceforge.net/projects/rxlib/}}}}}\f0\fs20 . \par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ryan J. Mills za jeho TPage95Control, obrovsk\u233? vylep\u353?enie oproti \u353?tandardn\u233?mu str\u225?nkov\u233?mu ovl\u225?daciemu prvku Delhi 3.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Wim Coetzee za skvel\u253? TGFXListBox so za\u353?krt\u225?vac\u237?mi pol\u237?\u269?kami a ikonami.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Jordan Russell za jeho absol\u250?tne \u250?\u382?asn\u253? ovl\u225?dac\u237? prvok Toolbar97 (panel n\u225?strojov podobn\u253? MS-Office): {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.jordanr.dhs.org/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.jordanr.dhs.org/}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Mike Lischke {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.lischke-online.de/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.lischke-online.de/}}}}}\f0\fs20  za pokro\u269?il\u253? komponent TreeNT, ktor\u253? prid\u225?va mno\u382?stvo funkci\u237? a opr\u225?v, ktor\u233? Borland a Microsoft jednoducho zabudli \u8230?\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}David Barton za jeho bal\u237?k kryptografick\u253?ch komponentov pre Delphi, DCPCrypt {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.cityinthesky.co.uk/cryptography.html }}{\fldrslt{http://www.cityinthesky.co.uk/cryptography.html}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}T\u237?m BitSoft za komponent TMathParser {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.bitsoft.com }}{\fldrslt{http://www.bitsoft.com}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Antony Lewis za TFreeWordWeb, komponent integr\u225?cie WordWeb.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Francois Piette za jeho Internet Component Suite {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.overbyte.be/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.overbyte.be/}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Gerrit Wolsink za komponent TRichPrinter.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Enzo Costantini za \u250?\u382?asn\u233? tla\u269?idlo v\u253?beru farieb podobn\u233? MS Office 2000.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}John Biederman za preform\u225?tovanie a aktualiz\u225?ciu \u269?ast\u237? s\u250?boru n\u225?povedy pre verziu KeyNote 1.6.1.\par


\pard\par

\b A v neposlednom rade v\u271?aka Andre v.d. Merwe za jeho p\u244?vodn\u253? program Dart Notes a za in\u353?pir\u225?ciu.\par

\b0\par

}
