{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b Zna\u269?ky\b0  mo\u382?no aplikova\u357? na pozn\u225?mky aj v r\u225?mci samotn\u233?ho textu, \u269?o umo\u382?\u328?uje ozna\u269?ova\u357? odseky alebo textov\u233? fragmenty metad\u225?tami ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<122|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Mo\u382?nos\u357? vytv\u225?ra\u357? \u8222?\b virtu\u225?lne uzly\b0 \u8220? v strome (uzly, ktor\u233? s\u250? dynamicky prepojen\u233? s extern\u253?mi textov\u253?mi alebo RTF s\u250?bormi) ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<28|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\f2\lang3082 "\b Prepojen\u233? uzly\b0 \u8220?: uzly, ktor\u233? zdie\u318?aj\u250? pozn\u225?mku, na ktor\u250? ukazuj\u250? ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<29|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f2\fs20 )\f0\lang1033\par

