{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Mo\u382?nos\u357? pracova\u357? s \b skryt\u253?mi uzlami\b0 . ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<27|13504|0|11"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

