{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b ROT-13\b0 , obr\u225?tenie textu, zopakovanie posledn\u233?ho pr\u237?kazu \u250?prav, sp\u225?janie a triedenie riadkov\u8230?\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b Integr\u225?cia s WordWeb\b0 , bezplatn\u253?m slovn\u237?kom a tezaurom (pozri {{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://wordweb.co.uk/free }}{\fldrslt{http://wordweb.co.uk/free}}}}\f0\fs20 ) ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<26|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}V\u228?\u269?\u353?inu pr\u237?kazov \u250?prav a form\u225?tovania \b mo\u382?no zopakova\u357?\b0  stla\u269?en\u237?m Ctrl+\u199?.\par


\pard\sa100\par

\par


\pard\sa200\fs24 Spr\u225?va obr\u225?zkov\par


