{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\f2\lang3082 R\u244?zne \b mo\u382?nosti ukladania obr\u225?zkov\b0 , \u269?i u\u382? ich vlo\u382?en\u237?m do samotn\u233?ho s\u250?boru KNT alebo externe\f0\lang1033\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\f2\lang3082 Obsahuje \b intern\u253? prehliada\u269? obr\u225?zkov\b0 . Obr\u225?zky je tie\u382? mo\u382?n\u233? otv\u225?ra\u357? v extern\u253?ch prehliada\u269?och.\f0\lang1033\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\f2\lang3082 Mo\u382?nos\u357? skry\u357? alebo zobrazi\u357? obr\u225?zky\f0\lang1033\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\f2\lang3082 Viac inform\u225?ci\u237? v {\ul\f0{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Spr\u225?va obr\u225?zkov v KeyNote NF}}}}\f0\fs20\lang1033\par


\pard\sa100\f2\lang3082\par

\f0\lang1033\par


\pard\sa200\fs24 Pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?sk\u233? rozhranie. Konfigur\u225?cia\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100\b\f2\fs20\lang3082 Mechanizmus hist\u243?rie navig\u225?cie\b0  ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<39|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f2\fs20 )\f0\lang1033\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Konfigurovate\u318?n\u225? \b hor\u250?ca kl\u225?vesa na aktiv\u225?ciu\b0 , ktor\u225? po minimalizovan\u237? do syst\u233?movej li\u353?ty privedie okno programu do popredia ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<88|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Konfigurovate\u318?n\u233? \b kl\u225?vesov\u233? skratky\b0  pre v\u353?etky pr\u237?kazy \u250?prav a spr\u225?vy s\u250?borov ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<105|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Ukotvite\u318?n\u233? a konfigurovate\u318?n\u233? panely n\u225?strojov ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<106|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Panel stromu prie\u269?inkov mo\u382?no usporiada\u357? \b horizont\u225?lne\b0  (panel stromu na\u318?avo od editora) alebo \b vertik\u225?lne\b0  (panel stromu nad editorom)\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Mo\u382?nos\u357? \b zmeni\u357? ikony\b0  priraden\u233? prie\u269?inkom (pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?sk\u233? ikony mo\u382?no extrahova\u357? zo s\u250?borov .ICO, .BMP, .EXE a .DLL)\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Mo\u382?nos\u357? \b minimalizova\u357? do syst\u233?movej li\u353?ty\b0\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Konfigurovate\u318?n\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? minimalizova\u357? program alebo automaticky zavrie\u357? aktu\u225?lny s\u250?bor \b po preddefinovanom obdob\u237? ne\u269?innosti\b0\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b Klikate\u318?n\u233? URL\b0  v editore; pou\u382?\u237?vatelia si m\u244?\u382?u nastavi\u357?, \u269?o sa stane po kliknut\u237? na URL ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|16878|0|10"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Predvolen\u233? \b pribl\u237?\u382?enie\b0  mo\u382?no nastavi\u357? pre v\u353?etky alebo ur\u269?it\u233? s\u250?bory. ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<20|7487|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Mo\u382?nos\u357? ur\u269?i\u357? \b predvolen\u233? vlastnosti pre v\u353?etky novovytvoren\u233? prie\u269?inky\b0  alebo selekt\u237?vne pre prie\u269?inky pridan\u233? do konkr\u233?tneho s\u250?boru ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<30|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\sa100\par

\par


\pard\sa200\fs24 \u270?al\u353?ie funkcie\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb100\sa100\f2\fs20\lang3082 Mo\u382?no definova\u357? viacero \b alarmov\b0 , priraden\u253?ch k prie\u269?inkom (kart\u225?m) alebo uzlom ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<76|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f2\fs20 ).\fs24\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100\b\f0\fs20\lang1033 Podpora doplnkov\b0  na roz\u353?\u237?renie funkcionality programu ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<72|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b Podpora makier\b0  vr\u225?tane makier automaticky sp\u250?\u353?\u357?an\u253?ch pri vytvoren\u237? nov\u233?ho s\u250?boru alebo pridan\u237? prie\u269?inka \u269?i pozn\u225?mky ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<71|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb100\sa100 Mo\u382?nos\u357? \b tla\u269?i\u357? \b0 a \b zobrazi\u357? uk\u225?\u382?ku \b0 pozn\u225?mok s pokro\u269?il\u253?mi mo\u382?nos\u357?ami ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<57|4839|0|13"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b\f2\lang3082 Podpora viacer\u253?ch jazykov\b0  vr\u225?tane jazykov p\u237?\u353?ucich sprava do\u318?ava.\fs24\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b\fs20 V s\u250?lade s Unicode\b0 \fs24\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100\f0\fs20\lang1033 Mnoh\u237? pou\u382?\u237?vatelia m\u244?\u382?u \b zdie\u318?a\u357? KeyNote na jednom po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?i\b0  s mo\u382?nos\u357?ou nez\u225?visl\u233?ho personalizovan\u233?ho nastavenia pre ka\u382?d\u233?ho pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?a ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<83|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}S\u250?bory Knt \b mo\u382?no bezpe\u269?ne zdie\u318?a\u357?\b0  v \b sie\u357?ovom prie\u269?inku\b0 , pri\u269?om sa zabezpe\u269?\u237?, \u382?e ich nem\u244?\u382?e s\u250?\u269?asne upravova\u357? viac ako jeden pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318? ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<83|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Automatick\u253? in\u353?tal\u225?tor a odin\u353?tal\u225?tor\par


\pard\sa100\par

\par

Pozn\u225?mka. V s\u250?\u269?asnosti nie je k dispoz\u237?cii, ale bolo s\u250?\u269?as\u357?ou star\u353?\u237?ch verzi\u237?:\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100 Mo\u382?nos\u357? \b posiela\u357? pozn\u225?mky e-mailom\b0  vr\u225?tane jednoduch\u233?ho adres\u225?ra a spracovania podpisov ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<84|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa100\par

