{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.22621}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 R\u253?chly \u353?tart\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par


\pard\li240\fs20 Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<12|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Obrazovka KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 , {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<13|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Defin\u237?cie}}}}}\f0\fs20\lang3082  a {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<14|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pr\u237?klady pou\u382?itia}}}}}\f0\fs20\lang1033\par


\pard\par

\par

Kroky v tomto postupe v\u225?m uk\u225?\u382?u, ako vytvori\u357? nov\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote, premenova\u357? prie\u269?inok, vytvori\u357? pozn\u225?mky na uchov\u225?vanie inform\u225?ci\u237? v prie\u269?inku a vytvori\u357? nov\u253? prie\u269?inok. \par

\par


\pard\sa160\b\fs22 Najprv nieko\u318?ko defin\u237?ci\u237?:\b0\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa80\fs20 S\u250?bor \b KeyNote \b0 m\u244?\u382?e obsahova\u357? jeden alebo viac prie\u269?inkov.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}\b Prie\u269?inok\b0  m\u244?\u382?e obsahova\u357? jednu alebo viac pozn\u225?mok usporiadan\u253?ch v hierarchickom strome (podobne ako \u318?av\u253? panel v Prieskumn\u237?kovi Windows).\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}\b Pozn\u225?mka\b0  (zobrazen\u225? ako \b uzol\b0  v paneli stromu)\b  \b0 m\u244?\u382?e obsahova\u357? text, form\u225?tovan\u253? text, odkazy na s\u250?bory a \u271?al\u353?ie inform\u225?cie. Pozn\u225?mka (uzol) m\u244?\u382?e ma\u357? tie\u382? jednu alebo viac podraden\u253?ch pozn\u225?mok vych\u225?dzaj\u250?cich z tejto pozn\u225?mky.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa160\b\fs22 Spustenie KeyNote\b0\par


\pard\fs20 Ak ste KeyNote nain\u353?talovali prv\u253?kr\u225?t, pri spusten\u237? KeyNote sa zobraz\u237? tento s\u250?bor n\u225?povedy. Tento s\u250?bor bol vytvoren\u253? pomocou KeyNote NF, a je teda skuto\u269?n\u253?m pr\u237?kladom mo\u382?nost\u237?, ktor\u233? aplik\u225?cia pon\u250?ka; obsahuje \u271?al\u353?ie inform\u225?cie, tipy a pr\u237?klady schopnost\u237? KeyNote.\par

\par


\pard\sa160\b\fs22 Vytvorenie nov\u233?ho s\u250?boru KeyNote\b0\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360\sl360\slmult1\fs20 V ponuke \cf3\b S\u250?bor\cf0\b0  zvo\u318?te pr\u237?kaz \cf3\b Nov\u253?\cf0\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}KeyNote sa op\u253?ta, \u269?i chcete nov\u253? s\u250?bor ulo\u382?i\u357? a zada\u357? mu n\u225?zov.\par

{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Kliknite na \cf3\b \u193?no\cf0\b0 , potom prejdite do prie\u269?inka pre s\u250?bor KeyNote a zadajte n\u225?zov. (napr. mynotes).\par

{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}Kliknite na \cf3\b Ulo\u382?i\u357?\cf0\b0 . N\u225?zov s\u250?boru sa zobraz\u237? v z\u225?hlav\u237? okna KeyNote.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa160\b\fs22 Pr\u225?ca s KeyNote\b0\par


\pard\fs20 Program KeyNote m\u225? obvykl\u233? z\u225?hlavie okna v \u353?t\u253?le MS Windows, ponuku, panel n\u225?strojov a panel form\u225?tovania. Pod panelom form\u225?tovania je karta s n\u225?zvom \ldblquote Nov\u253? prie\u269?inok\rdblquote . To je n\u225?zov prv\u233?ho prie\u269?inka (karty) nov\u233?ho s\u250?boru KeyNote. \u317?av\u253? panel zobrazuje iba jednu pozn\u225?mku s n\u225?zvom \ldblquote Nov\u253? uzol\rdblquote .\par

\par

\b Tip: \b0 \u317?av\u253? panel sa naz\u253?va panel stromu. Prav\u253? panel sa naz\u253?va panel pozn\u225?mky alebo editora.\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa160\b\fs22 Za\u269?nite premenovan\u237?m prie\u269?inka\b0\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360\sl360\slmult1\fs20 Kliknite prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom my\u353?i na kartu Nov\u253? prie\u269?inok a zvo\u318?te \cf3\b Premenova\u357? prie\u269?inok\cf0\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Zadajte n\u225?zov prie\u269?inka: My Lists.\par

{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Ikonu prie\u269?inka\rquote  m\u244?\u382?ete zmeni\u357? aj v\u253?berom \cf3\b ikony\cf0  \b0  z rozba\u318?ovacieho zoznamu Ikona.\par

{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}Kliknite na \cf3\b OK\cf0\b0 .\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa160\b\fs22 Potom premenujte pozn\u225?mku\b0\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360\fs20 Kliknite na n\u225?zov pozn\u225?mky (Nov\u253? uzol). KeyNote n\u225?zov zv\u253?razn\u237?, \u269?o znamen\u225?, \u382?e m\u244?\u382?ete zada\u357? nov\u253? n\u225?zov.\par

{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Stla\u269?en\u237?m Enter ulo\u382?te nov\u253? n\u225?zov: To do list.\par


\pard\par

\b Tip: \b0 Stla\u269?en\u237?m \b Esc \b0 m\u244?\u382?ete ponecha\u357? star\u253? n\u225?zov.\par

\b\par

\par


\pard\sa160\fs22 Vytvorme dve pozn\u225?mky pod pozn\u225?mkou \ldblquote To do list\rdblquote ; jednu pre domov a jednu do pr\u225?ce.\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sl360\slmult1\b0\fs20 Pam\u228?tajte: Ka\u382?d\u225? \u8222?pozn\u225?mka\u8220? sa m\u244?\u382?e naz\u253?va\u357? \u8222?uzol\u8220?, ak ide o panel stromu.\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360\sl360\slmult1 Kliknite do panela stromu. Uzol \ldblquote To do list\rdblquote  by mal by\u357? zv\u253?raznen\u253?.\par

{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Stla\u269?te \cf3\b Enter\cf0\b0 . T\u253?m sa vytvor\u237? nov\u253? uzol na rovnakej \u250?rovni ako zv\u253?raznen\u253? uzol.\par

{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Zadajte n\u225?zov nov\u233?ho uzla: Home a stla\u269?te \cf3\b Enter\cf0\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}Stla\u269?te \cf3\b Shift+\u353?\u237?pka doprava\cf0\b0 , \u269?\u237?m presuniete nov\u253? uzol pod uzol \ldblquote To do list\rdblquote . T\u253?m sa nov\u253? uzol stane podraden\u253?m uzlom uzla \ldblquote To do list\rdblquote .\par

{\pntext\f0 5.\tab}Stla\u269?te znova Enter, \u269?\u237?m vytvor\u237?te \u271?al\u353?\u237? uzol na rovnakej \u250?rovni ako uzol \ldblquote Home\rdblquote .\par

{\pntext\f0 6.\tab}Zadajte n\u225?zov uzla: Work a stla\u269?te Enter.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa160\b\fs22 Teraz m\u225?te jeden prie\u269?inok s n\u225?zvom \ldblquote My Lists\rdblquote . Prie\u269?inok obsahuje tri pozn\u225?mky: \ldblquote To do list\rdblquote , \ldblquote Home\rdblquote  a \ldblquote Work\rdblquote . Zadajme nieko\u318?ko \u250?loh do pozn\u225?mky \ldblquote Home\rdblquote .\b0\fs20\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360\sl360\slmult1 Kliknite na uzol \ldblquote Home\rdblquote  v paneli stromu.\par

{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Kliknite do prav\u233?ho panela (panela pozn\u225?mky).\par


\pard\li240\b Tip: \b0 M\u244?\u382?ete tie\u382? stla\u269?i\u357? \cf3\b Tab\cf0\b0 , \u269?\u237?m prejdete do panela uzla. \cf3\b Shift+Tab\cf0  \b0 v\u225?s vr\u225?ti sp\u228?\u357? do panela stromu.\par


\pard\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart3\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360 Zadajte nasleduj\u250?ci zoznam \u250?loh, ktor\u233? treba urobi\u357? doma:\par


\pard\li480 Vy\u269?isti\u357? skri\u328?u\par

Bielize\u328?\par

N\u225?kup potrav\u237?n\par

Zalieva\u357? rastliny\par


\pard\par

Teraz zadajme nieko\u318?ko \u250?loh, ktor\u233? treba urobi\u357? v pr\u225?ci.\par

\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart4\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360\sl360\slmult1 Kliknite na uzol \ldblquote Work\rdblquote  v paneli stromu.\par

{\pntext\f0 5.\tab}Kliknite do prav\u233?ho panela (panela uzlov).\par

{\pntext\f0 6.\tab}Zadajte nasleduj\u250?ci zoznam \u250?loh, ktor\u233? treba urobi\u357? v pr\u225?ci:\par


\pard\li480 Spr\u225?va za koniec \u353?tvr\u357?roka\par

Napl\u225?nova\u357? pohovory s nov\u253?mi uch\u225?dza\u269?mi\par

Prebra\u357? star\u233? projekty so \u353?\u233?fom\par


\pard\par

Tak\u382?e ste u\u382? vytvorili dva zoznamy \ldblquote To do\rdblquote : jeden pre dom\u225?cnos\u357? a jeden pre pr\u225?cu. M\u244?\u382?ete prid\u225?va\u357? \u271?al\u353?ie uzly a pres\u250?va\u357? uzly stl\u225?\u269?an\u237?m \cf3\b Shift+arrow keys\cf0\b0 . M\u244?\u382?ete dokonca vytv\u225?ra\u357? nov\u233? podraden\u233? uzly pod uzlami Home a Work. KeyNote v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje ma\u357? v strome mnoho \u250?rovn\u237?.\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa160\b\fs22 Pridajme druh\u253? prie\u269?inok. Prie\u269?inky v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uj\u250? usporiada\u357? inform\u225?cie do kateg\u243?ri\u237?.\fs20\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 7.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart7\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360\sl360\slmult1\b0 Kliknite prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom my\u353?i na kartu \ldblquote My Lists\rdblquote  a zvo\u318?te \cf3\b New Folder\cf0\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f0 8.\tab}Zadajte nov\u253? n\u225?zov: Bowling Team.\par

{\pntext\f0 9.\tab}Vyberte ikonu a potom kliknite na \cf3\b OK\cf0\b0 .\par


\pard\par

KeyNote vytvor\u237? nov\u253? prie\u269?inok a v hornej \u269?asti panelov zobraz\u237? druh\u250? kartu. Prie\u269?inok Bowling Team m\u225? jednu pozn\u225?mku (New node).\par

\par


\pard\fi-480\li480\b Tip: \b0 Medzi prie\u269?inkami \ldblquote Bowling Team\rdblquote  a \ldblquote My Lists\rdblquote  m\u244?\u382?ete prep\u237?na\u357? kliknut\u237?m na karty a v\u253?berom akt\u237?vneho prie\u269?inka.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa160\b\fs22 V KeyNote m\u244?\u382?ete robi\u357? mnoho \u271?al\u353?\u237?ch vec\u237?:\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\b0\fs20 Form\u225?tova\u357? text v pozn\u225?mke zmenou farby, p\u237?sma a ve\u318?kosti.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Vytv\u225?ra\u357? zoznamy s odr\u225?\u382?kami alebo \u269?\u237?slovan\u233? zoznamy.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Kop\u237?rova\u357? a vklada\u357? text, pozn\u225?mky alebo prie\u269?inky.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Bezpe\u269?ne za\u353?ifrova\u357? s\u250?bor KeyNote heslom.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Importova\u357? text, RTF a \u271?al\u353?ie s\u250?bory do KeyNote.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Exportova\u357? pozn\u225?mky, prie\u269?inky a s\u250?bory KeyNote.\par


\pard\par

Tieto a mnoh\u233? \u271?al\u353?ie funkcie n\u225?jdete v zvy\u353?ku tohto s\u250?boru n\u225?povedy KeyNote. M\u244?\u382?ete za\u269?a\u357? nasleduj\u250?cimi t\u233?mami, aby ste sa dozvedeli viac o mo\u382?nostiach KeyNote\rquote :\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<10|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Preh\u318?ad funkci\u237?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<19|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie KeyNote NF}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

\par

}
