{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Tahoma;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset238 Tahoma;}{\f2\froman\fcharset0 Tahoma;}{\f3\fnil\fcharset2 Symbol;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue160;\red0\green0\blue255;\red128\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.22621}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 Obrazovka KeyNote\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par

\fs20 Obrazovka KeyNote pozost\u225?va zo zn\u225?mych prvkov MS Windows.\par

 \v\'11I103\'12\v0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:103,690,305"}}{\fldrslt {103_Clipb_02ene.png}}}}\par

\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li720 Titulkov\u253? riadok\par

{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Riadok ponuky\par

{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Panely n\u225?strojov: hlavn\u253? panel a panel form\u225?tovania\par

{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}Ikona prie\u269?inka + n\u225?zov\par

{\pntext\f0 5.\tab}Panel stromu\par

{\pntext\f0 6.\tab}Panel editora\par

{\pntext\f0 7.\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<22|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{\u352?t\u253?ly}}}}}\f0\fs20  zoznam\par

{\pntext\f0 8.\tab}Stavov\u253? riadok\par

{\pntext\f0 9.\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<12|448|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Panel zdrojov}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

\par

N\u225?zov prie\u269?inka, panel stromu a panel editora s\u250? vysvetlen\u233? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<11|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{R\u253?chly \u353?tart}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par

Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<106|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Konfigur\u225?cia KeyNote/Prisp\u244?sobenie panelov n\u225?strojov}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs22\'11B1\'12\v0 Panel zdrojov\fs20   \b0 (\cf3\b F9\cf0\b0 ) \v\'11I42\'12\v0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:42,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {42_Main_42.png}}}}\par

\par

Panel zdrojov obsahuje nieko\u318?ko kariet, ktor\u233? zoskupuj\u250? r\u244?zne funkcie: \u8222?Find\u8220?, \u8222?Scratch\u8220?, \u8222?Macro\u8220?, \u8222?Plugin\u8220? a \u8222?Template\u8220?. Tu je stru\u269?n\u253? opis kariet panela zdrojov:\par

\highlight4\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 {\highlight0\f2\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<40|3096|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Karta Find:}}}}}\highlight0\f0\fs20  Vyh\u318?ad\u225?va text v pozn\u225?mkach a zobrazuje v\u353?etky zhody v preh\u318?adnom zozname. Kliknut\u237?m na polo\u382?ku prejdete na zodpovedaj\u250?ci text.\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\ul Karta Scratch\ulnone : Jednoduch\u253? RTF {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<20|29330|0|16"}}{\fldrslt{Scratchpad}}}}}\f0\fs20 , ktor\u253? sa automaticky na\u269?\u237?ta a ulo\u382?\u237?. Obsahuje plnohodnotn\u253? editor. Text m\u244?\u382?ete jednoducho pretiahnu\u357? z pozn\u225?mok do pomocn\u233?ho z\u225?pisn\u237?ka a sp\u228?\u357? a zdie\u318?a\u357? ho s in\u253?mi s\u250?bormi.\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<71|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Makra}}}}}\f0\fs20 : Zobraz\u237? v\u353?etky makr\u225? KeyNote, ktor\u233? ste vytvorili alebo nain\u353?talovali. Stla\u269?te \cf3\b Enter\cf0\b0  alebo dvakr\u225?t kliknite na makro, aby ste ho spustili. Obsahuje panel n\u225?strojov Makro na nahr\u225?vanie a prehr\u225?vanie makier.\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb40 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<72|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Plugin}}}}}\f0\fs20 : Zobraz\u237? v\u353?etky pluginy KeyNote, ktor\u233? ste nain\u353?talovali. Stla\u269?te \cf3\b Enter\cf0\b0  alebo dvakr\u225?t kliknite na plugin, aby ste ho spustili. Nach\u225?dza sa tu mal\u253? panel n\u225?strojov so z\u225?kladn\u253?mi pr\u237?kazmi. \u268?erven\u225? ikona pri plugine ozna\u269?uje \ldblquote rezidentn\u253?\rdblquote  plugin (plugin, ktor\u253? m\u244?\u382?e be\u382?a\u357? na pozad\u237? spolu s KeyNote); modr\u225? ikona ozna\u269?uje be\u382?n\u253? mod\u225?lny plugin (ktor\u253? mus\u237?te zavrie\u357?, aby ste sa vr\u225?tili do KeyNote).\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<69|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{\u352?abl\u243?na}}}}}\f0\fs20 : Zobraz\u237? v\u353?etky \u353?abl\u243?ny, ktor\u233? ste vytvorili. Stla\u269?te \cf3\b Enter\cf0\b0  alebo dvakr\u225?t kliknite na \u353?abl\u243?nu, aby ste ju vlo\u382?ili do aktu\u225?lnej pozn\u225?mky. Stla\u269?en\u237?m \cf3\b Insert\cf0\b0  vytvor\u237?te nov\u250? \u353?abl\u243?nu. Ikona \v\'11I36\'12\v0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:36,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {36_Main_36.png}}}} pri \u353?abl\u243?ne ozna\u269?uje \u353?abl\u243?nu s form\u225?tovan\u253?m textom (\u353?abl\u243?nu, ktor\u225? obsahuje form\u225?tovanie textu); ikona \v\'11I37\'12\v0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:37,17,17"}}{\fldrslt {37_Main_37.png}}}} ozna\u269?uje \u353?abl\u243?nu s \u269?ist\u253?m textom.\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<70|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Ob\u318?\u250?ben\u233?}}}}}\f0\fs20 : Zobraz\u237? n\u225?zvy va\u353?ich ob\u318?\u250?ben\u253?ch umiestnen\u237? (v KeyNote) ako aj odkazy na extern\u233? dokumenty a programy.\par


\pard\highlight4\par

\highlight0\b Tipy\b0 :\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak stla\u269?\u237?te \cf3\b F9\cf0\b0 , fokus sa presunie z editora alebo panela stromu do panela zdrojov, ak je vidite\u318?n\u253?. Ak m\u225? fokus panel zdrojov, stla\u269?en\u237?m \cf3 F9\cf0  ho skryjete. Ak je panel zdrojov skryt\u253?, \cf3 F9\cf0  ho zobraz\u237?.\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Dvojit\u253?m kliknut\u237?m na stavov\u253? riadok zobraz\u237?te alebo skryjete panel zdrojov.\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Pou\u382?ite \cf3\b Alt+PageUp\cf0\b0 , \cf3\b Alt+PageDown \cf0\b0 na prep\u237?nanie kariet\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Pou\u382?ite \cf3\b Esc \cf0\b0 na n\u225?vrat fokusu z panela zdrojov do editora (alebo panela stromu)\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}V\u353?etky karty panela zdrojov maj\u250? vlastn\u250? kontextov\u250? ponuku: zobraz\u237?te ju kliknut\u237?m prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom my\u353?i. Ponuky obsahuj\u250? \u271?al\u353?ie pr\u237?kazy, ktor\u233? inde nie s\u250?. Kliknut\u237?m prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom my\u353?i na samotn\u233? karty zobraz\u237?te ponuku mo\u382?nost\u237? s\u250?visiacich s panelom zdrojov. \par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Panel zdrojov m\u244?\u382?ete umiestni\u357? na \u318?av\u250? alebo prav\u250? stranu okna pozn\u225?mok; karty m\u244?\u382?ete usporiada\u357? \u353?tyrmi r\u244?znymi sp\u244?sobmi a dokonca m\u244?\u382?ete jednotliv\u233? karty skry\u357?.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\b\v\'11B2\'12\v0 Pozn\u225?mky k obrazovke / pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?sk\u233?mu rozhraniu\b0\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Karty prie\u269?inkov m\u244?\u382?u by\u357? okrem umiestnenia hore alebo dole usporiadan\u233? aj zvislo (pozd\u314?\u382? \u318?av\u233?ho alebo prav\u233?ho okraja okna programu).\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Poradie prie\u269?inkov (kariet) v s\u250?bore m\u244?\u382?ete zmeni\u357?. Sta\u269?\u237? klikn\u250?\u357? na kartu my\u353?ou a potiahnu\u357? ju do\u318?ava alebo doprava. Pr\u237?padne m\u244?\u382?ete zvoli\u357? pr\u237?kaz View|Shift Active Tab a potom v podmenu klikn\u250?\u357? na Shift left alebo Shift right.\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Prie\u269?inky m\u244?\u382?u ma\u357? zvisl\u233? rozlo\u382?enie (panel stromu umiestnen\u253? nad editorom namiesto na\u318?avo od neho). D\u225? sa to nastavi\u357? prostredn\u237?ctvom {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<32|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Vlastnosti prie\u269?inka}}}}}\f0\fs20  (\cf3\b F4\cf0\b0 ).\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Panely n\u225?strojov m\u244?\u382?u by\u357? ukotven\u233? aj v dolnej \u269?asti hlavn\u233?ho okna\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb100 Medzi prie\u269?inkami m\u244?\u382?ete prep\u237?na\u357? pomocou vlastn\u253?ch kl\u225?vesov\u253?ch skratiek!\lang1035  Pred p\u237?smeno v n\u225?zve prie\u269?inka umiestnite znak \u8222?\b &\b0 \u8220?; potom stla\u269?en\u237?m \cf3\b Alt+letter\cf0\b0  prejdete na tento prie\u269?inok.\par


\pard\li360\sb100\ul Tip\ulnone : Ak potrebujete pou\u382?i\u357? znak \ldblquote &\rdblquote  v n\u225?zve prie\u269?inka, zadajte ho dvakr\u225?t: \lang1033\ldblquote Black && white\rdblquote  N\u225?zov sa teraz zobraz\u237? tak, ako ste zam\u253?\u353?\u318?ali.\lang1035\par


\pard\ul\b\fs22\lang1033\par

}
