\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 S\u250?bory KeyNote\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par

\b\fs20 KeyNote nie je \u8222?norm\u225?lny\u8220? editor textov\u253?ch s\u250?borov ani s\u250?borov form\u225?tu RTF\b0 . KeyNote je postaven\u253? na koncepte ukladania mnoh\u253?ch pozn\u225?mok do jedin\u233?ho s\u250?boru na disku. To znamen\u225?, \u382?e inform\u225?cie m\u244?\u382?ete usporiada\u357? preh\u318?adnej\u353?ie a \u318?ah\u353?ie udr\u382?a\u357? s\u250?visiace inform\u225?cie na jednom mieste namiesto toho, aby boli roztr\u250?sen\u233? vo viacer\u253?ch s\u250?boroch na r\u244?znych miestach. S\u250?bor KeyNote je zbierkou pozn\u225?mok vo form\u225?te RTF. Jeden s\u250?bor KeyNote m\u244?\u382?e obsahova\u357? obsah mnoh\u253?ch samostatn\u253?ch textov\u253?ch s\u250?borov alebo s\u250?borov RTF.\par

\par

Tak\u253?to koncept si vy\u382?aduje pou\u382?\u237?vanie \u353?peci\u225?lneho form\u225?tu s\u250?borov. KeyNote vytv\u225?ra vlastn\u233? s\u250?bory s pr\u237?ponou .KNT (alebo .KNE pre \u353?ifrovan\u233? s\u250?bory). S\u250?bor KNT uklad\u225? v\u353?etky pozn\u225?mky s ich form\u225?tovan\u253?m textom a konfigura\u269?n\u253?mi nastaveniami (napr\u237?klad n\u225?zov pozn\u225?mky, ikona priraden\u225? k pozn\u225?mke, farba pozadia at\u271?.). S\u250?bory KNT s\u237?ce m\u244?\u382?ete zobrazi\u357? v textovom editore, ak\u253?m je NotePad, ale nebudete ich m\u244?c\u357? jednoducho upravova\u357?. Ur\u269?ite nebudete m\u244?c\u357? otvori\u357? s\u250?bory KNT pomocou RTF editora (napr\u237?klad WordPad). S\u250?bory s pr\u237?ponou .KNE s\u250? bin\u225?rne, \u353?ifrovan\u233? s\u250?bory a m\u244?\u382?e ich otvori\u357? iba KeyNote.\par

\par

To v\u353?etko znamen\u225?, \u382?e \b KeyNote nemo\u382?no pou\u382?i\u357? ako n\u225?hradu za NotePad alebo WordPad\b0 . KeyNote nie je navrhnut\u253? t\u253?mto sp\u244?sobom; nie je ur\u269?en\u253? ako jednoduch\u253? editor textov\u253?ch s\u250?borov alebo s\u250?borov RTF. KeyNote nedok\u225?\u382?e tak\u233?to s\u250?bory otvori\u357? priamo. (Ak sa o to pok\u250?site, KeyNote zobraz\u237? chybov\u233? hl\u225?senie: \u8222?\b Neplatn\u225? hlavi\u269?ka s\u250?boru. Toto nie je s\u250?bor KeyNote\b0 ".\par

\par

Textov\u233? s\u250?bory (.txt) alebo s\u250?bory form\u225?tovan\u233?ho textu (.rtf) mo\u382?no importova\u357? do s\u250?borov KeyNote pomocou pr\u237?kazu \b S\u250?bor | Importova\u357?...\b0  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<56|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Importovanie s\u250?borov v KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 ). Importovan\u233? s\u250?bory sa stan\u250? pozn\u225?mkami v aktu\u225?lne otvorenom s\u250?bore .KNT; p\u244?vodn\u233? s\u250?bory zostan\u250? na disku nedotknut\u233?. (S\u250?bory m\u244?\u382?ete importova\u357? aj pretiahnut\u237?m z Prieskumn\u237?ka syst\u233?mu Windows a ich pusten\u237?m na panel n\u225?strojov alebo oblas\u357? stavov\u233?ho riadka aplik\u225?cie KeyNote.)\par

\par

\u270?al\u353?\u237?m sp\u244?sobom \u250?pravy textov\u253?ch s\u250?borov alebo s\u250?borov form\u225?tovan\u233?ho textu v KeyNote je pou\u382?itie takzvan\u233?ho {\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<28|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Virtu\u225?lne uzly}}}}}\f0\fs20 . To v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? KeyNote, akoby to bol jednoduch\u253? editor textov\u253?ch s\u250?borov a s\u250?borov rtf: upravujete skuto\u269?n\u233? s\u250?bory na disku bez toho, aby ste ich importovali do s\u250?boru .KNT. Najjednoduch\u353?\u237? sp\u244?sob, ako vytvori\u357? virtu\u225?lny uzol, je pretiahnu\u357? s\u250?bor z Prieskumn\u237?ka syst\u233?mu Windows a pusti\u357? ho na okno aplik\u225?cie.\par

\cf3\b\par

}
