GI=16
ND=Prehľad príkazového riadka
LM=1402260904
%.
%:
{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Tahoma;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset238 Tahoma;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Courier New;}{\f3\fnil\fcharset2 Symbol;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue160;\red0\green0\blue255;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 Referencia pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadka\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par

\fs20 Pri sp\u250?\u353?\u357?an\u237? KeyNote z pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadka (Start->Spusti\u357?\u8230?) alebo z odkazovej ikony m\u244?\u382?ete zada\u357? jeden alebo viac argumentov pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadka. Tieto argumenty zodpovedaj\u250? niektor\u253?m mo\u382?nostiam konfigur\u225?cie a menia ur\u269?it\u233? aspekty spr\u225?vania programu.\par

\par

Pou\u382?itie: \tab\b keynote.exe [filename[.knt]] [-option [-option\u8230?]]\b0\par

\par


\pard\li240\b Pozn\u225?mka\b0 : Ak je argumentom pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadka s\u250?bor, zadajte jednoducho \u250?pln\u250? cestu a n\u225?zov s\u250?boru. Argumenty pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadka, ktor\u233? s\u250? vo\u318?bami, musia by\u357? uveden\u233? poml\u269?kou (-) alebo lom\u237?tkom (/), \u269?o je obvykl\u225? konvencia pre programy MS-DOS a MS Windows.\par


\pard\par

Mo\u382?nosti pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadka mo\u382?no zad\u225?va\u357? mal\u253?mi alebo VE\u317?K\u221?MI p\u237?smenami a m\u244?\u382?u by\u357? uveden\u233? v \u318?ubovo\u318?nom porad\u237?.\par

Nasleduje zoznam mo\u382?nost\u237? pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadka, ktor\u233? KeyNote podporuje\par

\par

\par

\b\fs24 N\u225?zvy s\u250?borov\b0\fs20\par


\pard\sb80 V pr\u237?kazovom riadku m\u244?\u382?ete zada\u357? jeden alebo viac n\u225?zvov s\u250?borov, \u269?\u237?m zmen\u237?te predvolen\u233? spr\u225?vanie programu. KeyNote pri interpret\u225?cii v\u253?znamu mo\u382?nosti vych\u225?dza z pr\u237?pony s\u250?boru (typu s\u250?boru).\par


\pard\li360\sb40\b Tip\b0 : S\u250?bory m\u244?\u382?ete zad\u225?va\u357? s absol\u250?tnymi alebo relat\u237?vnymi cestami. Z\u225?kladnou cestou pre relat\u237?vne cesty je prie\u269?inok keynote.exe\par


\pard\par

\b\fs22 Ak zad\u225?te\u8230? \tab Keynote bude\u8230?\b0\par

\fs20\par


\pard\fi-2160\li2160\sl360\slmult1\b\f2\fs22 .KNT\b0\fs20  \f0 s\u250?bor \tab Otvori\u357? tento s\u250?bor pri spusten\u237?\par


\pard\fi-2160\li2160\b\f2\fs22 .INI \b0\f0\fs20 s\u250?bor \tab Pou\u382?i\u357? ho ako konfigura\u269?n\u253? s\u250?bor namiesto predvolen\u233?ho \u8222?keynote.ini\u8220?) V\u353?imnite si, \u382?e to umo\u382?\u328?uje viacer\u253?m pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?om zdie\u318?a\u357? KeyNote na jednom po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?i a ma\u357? vlastn\u233?, samostatn\u233? predvo\u318?by.\par


\pard\fi-2160\li2160\sb120\sl360\slmult1\b\f2\fs22 .DEF \b0\f0\fs20 s\u250?bor \tab Na\u269?\u237?ta\u357? z tohto s\u250?boru predvolen\u233? nastavenia pre novovytvoren\u233? prie\u269?inky (namiesto predvolen\u233?ho keynote.def)\par


\pard\fi-2160\li2160\sl360\slmult1\b\f2\fs22 .MGR \b0\f0\fs20 s\u250?bor  \tab Pou\u382?i\u357? tento s\u250?bor na vyplnenie dial\u243?gov\u233?ho okna {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<50|496|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov}}}}}\f0\fs20  (namiesto predvolen\u233?ho keynote.mgr)\par


\pard\par

\par

\b\fs24 Mo\u382?nosti\b0\fs22\par

\fs20\par

\par

\b -min (minimalizova\u357? pri spusten\u237?)\b0\par


\pard\sb80 Hlavn\u233? okno programu sa pri spusten\u237? KeyNote automaticky minimalizuje. V\u353?imnite si, \u382?e rovnak\u253? efekt dosiahnete otvoren\u237?m okna vlastnost\u237? skratky a zadan\u237?m \ldblquote Minimalizovan\u233?\rdblquote  v pr\u237?slu\u353?nom nastaven\u237? na karte Skratka. Ak t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? nie je zadan\u225?, KeyNote obnov\u237? predch\u225?dzaj\u250?cu ve\u318?kos\u357? a polohu hlavn\u233?ho okna.\par


\pard\par

\b -debug (ulo\u382?i\u357? niektor\u233? ladiacie inform\u225?cie)\b0\par


\pard\sb80 Zap\u237?na ladenie. T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? sa uplat\u328?uje len vtedy, ak bol program zostaven\u253? s ladiacim k\u243?dom; inak sa ignoruje a nem\u225? \u382?iadny vplyv na vykon\u225?vanie programu. Ke\u271? je ladenie zapnut\u233?, KeyNote pravidelne uklad\u225? na disk s\u250?bor denn\u237?ka obsahuj\u250?ci niektor\u233? inform\u225?cie o behu programu a v\u353?etky chybov\u233? hl\u225?senia, ktor\u233? mohli by\u357? vydan\u233?.\par


\pard\par

\b -nso (neuklada\u357? mo\u382?nosti)\b0\par


\pard\sb80 Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zadan\u225?, KeyNote neulo\u382?\u237? \u382?iadne konfigura\u269?n\u233? mo\u382?nosti, ktor\u233? v programe zmen\u237?te. St\u225?le m\u244?\u382?ete otvori\u357? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Mo\u382?nosti a meni\u357? nastavenia, ale vykonan\u233? zmeny sa po zatvoren\u237? a op\u228?tovnom spusten\u237? programu stratia. T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? u\u382?ito\u269?n\u225? pri sp\u250?\u353?\u357?an\u237? KeyNote z diskety.\par


\pard\par

\b -nro (ne\u269?\u237?ta\u357? mo\u382?nosti, ZAHR\u327?A \u8222?nso\u8220?)\b0\par


\pard\sb80 Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zadan\u225?, KeyNote nebude \u269?\u237?ta\u357? svoj konfigura\u269?n\u253? s\u250?bor (keynote.ini). V\u353?etky mo\u382?nosti sa obnovia na v\u253?robn\u233? predvolen\u233? hodnoty. Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zadan\u225?, KeyNote TIE\u381? predpoklad\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? -nso (pozri vy\u353?\u353?ie), tak\u382?e nebude ani \u269?\u237?ta\u357?, ani uklada\u357? \u382?iadne zmeny konfigur\u225?cie.\par

\par


\pard Pozn\u225?mka:  Najjednoduch\u353?\u237? sp\u244?sob, ako obnovi\u357? v\u253?robn\u250? predvolen\u250? konfigur\u225?ciu, je odstr\u225?ni\u357? s\u250?bor \ldblquote keynote.ini\rdblquote , ktor\u253? sa nach\u225?dza v prie\u269?inku, kde ste KeyNote nain\u353?talovali.\par

\par

\b -reg (registrova\u357? pr\u237?ponu d\u225?tov\u233?ho s\u250?boru)\b0\par


\pard\sb80 Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zadan\u225?, KeyNote sa pok\u250?si zaregistrova\u357? svoju predvolen\u250? pr\u237?ponu dokumentov (.knt) u seba. M\u244?\u382?ete to vykona\u357? aj manu\u225?lne v Prieskumn\u237?kovi syst\u233?mu Windows pomocou pr\u237?kazu Mo\u382?nosti v ponuke Zobrazi\u357?.\par

In\u353?tala\u269?n\u253? program v\u225?m tie\u382? umo\u382?n\u237? registrova\u357? pr\u237?pony s\u250?borov.\par


\pard\par

\b -nodef (ne\u269?\u237?ta\u357? ani nezapisova\u357? predvolen\u233? nastavenia polo\u382?iek)\b0\par


\pard\sb80 Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zadan\u225?, KeyNote nebude na\u269?\u237?tava\u357? predvolen\u233? nastavenia pre nov\u233? prie\u269?inky, ktor\u233? vytvor\u237?te (keynote.def), a namiesto toho pou\u382?ije v\u253?robn\u233? predvolen\u233? hodnoty. Ak chcete obnovi\u357? v\u253?robn\u233? predvolen\u233? nastavenia pre novovytvoren\u233? prie\u269?inky, jednoducho odstr\u225?\u328?te s\u250?bor \ldblquote keynote.def\rdblquote , ktor\u253? sa nach\u225?dza v prie\u269?inku, kde ste KeyNote nain\u353?talovali.\par


\pard\par

\b -saveicn (ulo\u382?i\u357? v\u253?robn\u233? predvolen\u233? ikony do bitmapov\u233?ho s\u250?boru)\b0\par


\pard\sb80 Iba pre program\u225?tora; pre pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?ov nie je u\u382?ito\u269?n\u225?. Ulo\u382?\u237? predvolen\u250? sadu ikon do bitmapov\u233?ho s\u250?boru.\par

\par


\pard\b -noicn (NENA\u268?\u205?TAVA\u356? pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?sk\u233? ikony z extern\u233?ho s\u250?boru .ICN)\b0\par


\pard\sb80 Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zadan\u225?, KeyNote pri spusten\u237? nena\u269?\u237?ta s\u250?bor vlastn\u253?ch ikon (keynote.icn) a namiesto toho pou\u382?ije v\u253?robn\u233? predvolen\u233? ikony. T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? tie\u382? zak\u225?\u382?e kartu Ikony v dial\u243?govom okne Mo\u382?nosti, \u269?\u237?m pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?ovi zabr\u225?ni meni\u357? ikony.\par


\pard\par

\b -noreg (NEUKLADA\u356? inform\u225?cie do registra) \b0\par


\pard\sb80 Neuklada\u357? ve\u318?kos\u357? a polohu okna a zoznam naposledy pou\u382?it\u253?ch s\u250?borov do registra. Namiesto toho sa tieto inform\u225?cie ukladaj\u250? v s\u250?bore s pr\u237?ponou \ldblquote .mru\rdblquote .\par


\pard\par

\b\v\'11B1\'12\v0 -jmp"<KNTLink>"   Sko\u269?i\u357? na odkaz KNT pri spusten\u237?\par


\pard\sb80\b0 T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? umo\u382?\u328?uje sko\u269?i\u357? na intern\u253? odkaz KeyNote zadan\u253? v \u250?vodzovk\u225?ch, v ktoromko\u318?vek z rozpozn\u225?van\u253?ch form\u225?tov. Nie je povinn\u233? uv\u225?dza\u357? ako argument s\u250?bor .knt (.kne), preto\u382?e odkaz KNT m\u244?\u382?e obsahova\u357? jeden s\u250?bor. Ak odkaz KNT neobsahuje n\u225?zov s\u250?boru, odkaz sa vykon\u225? v aktu\u225?lne otvorenom s\u250?bore, a ak sa umiestnenie nen\u225?jde, zobraz\u237? sa varovn\u233? hl\u225?senie.\par

Odkaz KNT mus\u237? by\u357? pripojen\u253? k mo\u382?nosti bez ak\u253?chko\u318?vek medzier. Pr\u237?klady:\par


\pard\sb40   -jmp"{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///*1|10|201|0 }}{\fldrslt{file:///*1|10|201|0}}}}}\f0\fs20 "\par


\pard   -jmp"{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///*1|2|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{file:///*1|2}}}}}\f0\fs20 "\par

  -jmp"{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///C:\\\\myFile.knt*1|3|285|0 }}{\fldrslt{file:///C:\\myFile.knt*1|3|285|0}}}}}\f0\fs20 "\par

\par

\ul Tip\ulnone : Na ur\u269?enie odkazov, ktor\u233? chcete pou\u382?i\u357?, m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? export do \u269?ist\u233?ho textu s mo\u382?nos\u357?ou \u8222?Zobrazi\u357? skryt\u233? zna\u269?ky a ID\u8220? ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<57|15858|0|11"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}}\f0\fs20 ), ako aj \u8222?Ulo\u382?i\u357? strom do s\u250?boru...\u8220? podr\u382?an\u237?m kl\u225?vesu Ctrl ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<115|7901|0|29"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) \par

\par

\b -title"<TITLE>"  (Nastavi\u357? n\u225?zov hlavn\u233?ho okna)\par


\pard\sb80\b0 T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? umo\u382?\u328?uje nastavi\u357? vlastn\u253? n\u225?zov pri otv\u225?ran\u237? in\u353?tancie KeyNote \par


\pard\sb40 Bola za\u269?lenen\u225? najm\u228? pre pou\u382?itie s kntLauncher (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<77|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie .knt s\u250?borov KeyNote NF ako s\u250?borov n\u225?povedy}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) \par


\pard\par

\b -ignSI   (Ignorova\u357? mo\u382?nos\u357? jednej in\u353?tancie pre toto volanie)\par


\pard\sb80\b0 T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zabezpe\u269?\u237?, \u382?e sa otvor\u237? nov\u225? in\u353?tancia, preto\u382?e novo vytvoren\u225? in\u353?tancia bude ignorova\u357? mo\u382?nos\u357? SingleInstance.\par


\pard\par

\b -dnd \tab  (Neru\u353?i\u357?)\par


\pard\sb80\b0 T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? ozna\u269?\u237? vytvoren\u250? in\u353?tanciu tak, aby ju ostatn\u233? in\u353?tancie knt ignorovali (na \u250?\u269?ely \u8222?Single Instance\u8220?), ako keby neexistovala, hoci bude dostupn\u225? pre n\u225?stroj \u8222?kntLauncher.exe\u8220?.\par


\pard\par

V\u353?imnite si, \u382?e v s\u250?\u269?asnosti, ke\u271? otvor\u237?te prv\u253? s\u250?bor .knt alebo ak\u253?ko\u318?vek nasleduj\u250?ci s\u250?bor .knt pomocou s\u250?boru .ini, v ktorom je SingleInstance=0, sa s\u250?bory otvoria v samostatnej in\u353?tancii. Ak sa v\u353?ak niekedy pok\u250?site otvori\u357? \u271?al\u353?\u237? s\u250?bor pomocou profilu (.ini), v ktorom je SingleInstance=1, posledn\u225? otvoren\u225? in\u353?tancia sa dostane dopredu, aby zavrela svoj s\u250?bor a otvorila nov\u253? s\u250?bor po\u382?adovan\u253? pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?om (ak m\u225? s\u250?bor zmeny a AutoSave=0, pred zatvoren\u237?m s\u250?boru sa zobraz\u237? v\u253?zva na potvrdenie, tak\u382?e m\u244?\u382?ete odmietnu\u357? zmenu aktu\u225?lne otvoren\u233?ho s\u250?boru).\par


\pard\sb80 Pomocou prep\u237?na\u269?a -dnd m\u244?\u382?ete zabezpe\u269?i\u357?, \u382?e in\u353?tancia nebude ru\u353?en\u225? a nebude vyzvan\u225? na zmenu svojho otvoren\u233?ho s\u250?boru. (Tento prep\u237?na\u269? m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357?, ak ho potrebujete, hoci bol pridan\u253? predov\u353?etk\u253?m na pou\u382?itie n\u225?strojom kntLauncher, najm\u228? na otv\u225?ranie s\u250?borov n\u225?povedy knt)\par


\pard  \par

\b -clnks (konvertova\u357? hypertextov\u233? odkazy)\par

\b0 T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? skonvertuje intern\u233? odkazy KNT v starom form\u225?te zalo\u382?enom na ID pozn\u225?mok (ber\u250?c do \u250?vahy iba odkazy pr\u237?tomn\u233? v pozn\u225?mkach RTF) na nov\u253? form\u225?t zalo\u382?en\u253? na GID. Viac o {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|19244|0|4"}}{\fldrslt{Form\u225?t intern\u233?ho KNT odkazu}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\sb120 Napr. Ak m\u225? pozn\u225?mka s ID=10 v prie\u269?inku s ID=3 GID=12, potom:   {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///*3|10|55|0|1 }}{\fldrslt{file:///*3|10|55|0|1}}}}}\f0\fs20   =>   {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///<12|55|0|1 }}{\fldrslt{file:///<12|55|0|1}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

\b\v\'11B2\'12\v0 -clnkc (Konvertova\u357? odkazy, aby umo\u382?\u328?ovali spr\u225?vne spravovanie farby textu)\par

\b0 T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? uprav\u237? v\u353?etky odkazy v s\u250?bore vr\u225?tane t\u253?ch v zbalen\u253?ch blokoch a oprav\u237? probl\u233?m, ktor\u253? br\u225?ni zmene ich farby (Pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|19620|0|13"}}{\fldrslt{Zmena farby odkazov}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\sb40\ul Pozn\u225?mky:\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb40\ulnone Pred \u250?pravou cel\u233?ho s\u250?boru pomocou tohto parametra sa d\u244?razne odpor\u250?\u269?a ulo\u382?i\u357? \ul z\u225?lo\u382?n\u250? k\u243?piu\ulnone  s\u250?boru.\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Neaplikujte t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357? viackr\u225?t na ten ist\u253? s\u250?bor. S\u250?bor s\u237?ce nebude nespr\u225?vne ovplyvnen\u253?, jeho ve\u318?kos\u357? sa v\u353?ak mierne zv\u228?\u269?\u353?\u237?, preto\u382?e odkazy bud\u250? obsahova\u357? niektor\u233? nadbyto\u269?n\u233? pr\u237?kazy RTF, ktor\u233? sa odstr\u225?nia a\u382? po \u250?prave pr\u237?slu\u353?n\u253?ch pozn\u225?mok, ke\u271? textov\u253? editor spracuje a zjednodu\u353?\u237? pr\u237?slu\u353?n\u253? intern\u253? k\u243?d RTF \par


\pard\par

\b -clean (vy\u269?isti\u357? hypertextov\u233? odkazy)\par


\pard\sb80\b0 Mo\u382?nos\u357? zaraden\u225? na opravu n\u225?sledkov probl\u233?mu op\u237?san\u233?ho v starom hl\u225?sen\u237? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/issues/59"}}{\fldrslt{#59}}}}}\f0\fs20  (\i Niektor\u233? hypertextov\u233? odkazy m\u244?\u382?u sp\u244?sobi\u357? n\u225?hle zv\u228?\u269?\u353?enie s\u250?boru knt\i0 )\par


\pard S\u250?bor sa preh\u318?ad\u225? a vyh\u318?adaj\u250? sa neplatn\u233? hypertextov\u233? odkazy (zobraz\u237? sa okno so spr\u225?vou). Po tomto procese bud\u250? odkazy v poriadku a s\u250?bor sa po ulo\u382?en\u237? zmen\u353?\u237? na svoju norm\u225?lnu ve\u318?kos\u357?.\par

* V s\u250?\u269?asnosti by nemalo by\u357? potrebn\u233? t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357? pou\u382?\u237?va\u357?\par

}
