GI=18
ND=Pomocné súbory
%.
%:
{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Tahoma;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset238 Tahoma;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Courier New;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue160;\red0\green0\blue255;\red128\green0\blue0;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.22621}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 Pomocn\u233? s\u250?bory\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs24\par

\fs20 T\u225?to t\u233?ma opisuje \u250?\u269?el r\u244?znych s\u250?borov nain\u353?talovan\u253?ch s programom KeyNote alebo vytvoren\u253?ch programom.\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .KNT\fs28\par


\pard\b0\f0\fs20 S\u250?bor KeyNote: \par

Toto s\u250? s\u250?bory, ktor\u233? obsahuj\u250? va\u353?e pozn\u225?mky.\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .KNE\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard Za\u353?ifrovan\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .BAK\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard Z\u225?lo\u382?n\u253? s\u250?bor: \par

Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e pr\u237?ponu z\u225?lo\u382?n\u253?ch s\u250?borov m\u244?\u382?ete zmeni\u357? v dial\u243?govom okne Mo\u382?nosti, tak\u382?e va\u353?e z\u225?lo\u382?n\u233? s\u250?bory m\u244?\u382?u pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? in\u250? pr\u237?ponu. Tieto s\u250?bory m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357?. Vytv\u225?ra ich automaticky KeyNote pri ka\u382?dom ulo\u382?en\u237? v\u225?\u353?ho s\u250?boru KNT/KNE, pokia\u318? mo\u382?nos\u357? z\u225?lohovania nevypnete.\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .INI\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard Hlavn\u253? konfigura\u269?n\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote: \par

Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357?, ale KeyNote ho automaticky vytvor\u237? znova. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e niektor\u233? z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly m\u244?\u382?u vytv\u225?ra\u357? vlastn\u233? s\u250?bory INI v podprie\u269?inku \ldblquote plugins\rdblquote .\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .MGR\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard \u218?lo\u382?isko spr\u225?vcu s\u250?borov: \par

Tento s\u250?bor obsahuje zoznam v\u353?etk\u253?ch s\u250?borov KeyNote, ktor\u233? ste pou\u382?ili. Ch\u253?baj\u250?ce s\u250?bory sa automaticky odstr\u225?nia. V programe KeyNote m\u244?\u382?ete stla\u269?i\u357? \cf3\b F12\cf0\b0 , \u269?\u237?m otvor\u237?te Spr\u225?vcu s\u250?borov a r\u253?chlo vyberiete jeden zo zapam\u228?tan\u253?ch s\u250?borov, ktor\u253? chcete otvori\u357?. Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357?, ale KeyNote ho automaticky vytvor\u237? znova.\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .TIP\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard S\u250?bor tipov d\u328?a: \par

Tento s\u250?bor obsahuje zoznam \ldblquote tipov d\u328?a\rdblquote , ktor\u233? KeyNote pri spusten\u237? zobrazuje (volite\u318?ne). Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357?.\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .MRU\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard Tento s\u250?bor obsahuje inform\u225?cie o naposledy pou\u382?it\u253?ch s\u250?boroch (odtia\u318? pr\u237?pona), ako aj inform\u225?cie o ve\u318?kosti a polohe nieko\u318?k\u253?ch dial\u243?gov\u253?ch okien. Ke\u271? sa tieto dial\u243?gov\u233? okn\u225? otvoria, obnov\u237? sa ich predch\u225?dzaj\u250?ca poloha a/alebo ve\u318?kos\u357?. Odstr\u225?\u328?te tento s\u250?bor, ak chcete obnovi\u357? stav v\u353?etk\u253?ch dial\u243?gov\u253?ch okien na predvolen\u233? hodnoty z v\u253?roby. Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357?, ale KeyNote ho automaticky vytvor\u237? znova.\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b .DEF\f2\fs26\par


\pard\b0\f0\fs20 Predvolen\u233? nastavenia editora a stromu pre novovytvoren\u233? prie\u269?inky: \par

Toto s\u250? mo\u382?nosti, ktor\u233? men\u237?te pr\u237?kazom \ldblquote Predvolen\u233? nastavenia\rdblquote  (v ponuke \ldblquote N\u225?stroje\rdblquote ; alebo stla\u269?te \cf3\b F6\cf0\b0 ). Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e pre ka\u382?d\u253? s\u250?bor KNT/KNE m\u244?\u382?ete ma\u357? samostatn\u233? predvolen\u233? nastavenia, a teda viac ako jeden s\u250?bor .DEF. Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357?, ale potom budete musie\u357? znova vybra\u357? preferovan\u233? predvolen\u233? nastavenia.\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .KNS\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard S\u250?bor defin\u237?ci\u237? \u353?t\u253?lov: \par

V\u353?etky \u353?t\u253?ly dostupn\u233? v programe KeyNote s\u250? ulo\u382?en\u233? v tomto s\u250?bore. Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357?, ale KeyNote ho automaticky vytvor\u237? znova v\u382?dy, ke\u271? vytvor\u237?te alebo uprav\u237?te \u353?t\u253?ly.\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .EXP\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard S\u250?bor rozba\u318?ovania slovn\u237?ka: \par

Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357?, ale KeyNote ho automaticky vytvor\u237? znova v\u382?dy, ke\u271? prid\u225?te pojem do slovn\u237?ka.\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .KNL\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard Z\u225?suvn\u253? modul KeyNote: \par

S programom KeyNote sa in\u353?taluje nieko\u318?ko z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov; \u271?al\u353?ie si m\u244?\u382?ete stiahnu\u357? z webovej str\u225?nky KeyNote. Je tie\u382? mo\u382?n\u233?, \u382?e ste si stiahli a nain\u353?talovali z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly KeyNote od tret\u237?ch str\u225?n. Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly by ste nemali odstra\u328?ova\u357?, pokia\u318? sa ich naozaj nechcete zbavi\u357? :)\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .KNM\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard S\u250?bor makra KeyNote: \par

Ka\u382?d\u233? makro, ktor\u233? vytvor\u237?te, sa ulo\u382?\u237? na disk ako s\u250?bor .KNM. Odstr\u225?nen\u237?m s\u250?boru .KNM m\u244?\u382?ete odstr\u225?ni\u357? nepotrebn\u233? makro. To ist\u233? mo\u382?no vykona\u357? aj priamo v programe KeyNote.\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .ICN\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard \u218?lo\u382?isko ikon kariet: \par

Ke\u271? prisp\u244?sob\u237?te (prid\u225?te, odstr\u225?nite) ikony, ktor\u233? KeyNote zobrazuje na kart\u225?ch prie\u269?inkov a uzloch, va\u353?e vlastn\u233? ikony sa ulo\u382?ia do s\u250?boru .ICN. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e m\u244?\u382?ete ma\u357? viac ako jeden s\u250?bor .ICN, preto\u382?e ka\u382?d\u233?mu s\u250?boru KNT/KNE m\u244?\u382?ete priradi\u357? in\u253? s\u250?bor .ICN. Ak tento s\u250?bor odstr\u225?nite, KeyNote pou\u382?ije svoje predvolen\u233?, vstavan\u233? ikony kariet.\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .WAV\par


\pard\b0\f0\fs20 Zvuky zachyt\u225?vania schr\u225?nky / upozornenia alarmu: \par

KeyNote sa distribuuje s dvoma wave s\u250?bormi, \u8222?clip.wav\u8220? a \u8222?alert.wav\u8220?. Prv\u253? sa volite\u318?ne prehr\u225? v\u382?dy, ke\u271? sa text zachyt\u237? zo schr\u225?nky. Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357? alebo nahradi\u357? in\u253?m s\u250?borom .WAV, aby sa prehr\u225?val in\u253? zvuk. S\u250?bor mus\u237? ma\u357? n\u225?zov \u8222?clip.wav\u8220?. Druh\u253? s\u250?bor sa prehr\u225?, ak je to povolen\u233?, pri spusten\u237? alarmov.\par

\par

\par

\par

\par

\b Nepou\u382?\u237?va sa:\b0\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .KEY\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard S\u250?bor prisp\u244?sobenia kl\u225?vesnice: \par

Tento s\u250?bor vytvoril z\u225?suvn\u253? modul \ldblquote funckey.knl\rdblquote , ktor\u253? ste pou\u382?\u237?vali na priradenie makier, z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov a \u353?t\u253?lov ku kombin\u225?ci\u225?m funk\u269?n\u253?ch kl\u225?vesov.\par

V s\u250?\u269?asnosti sa v\u353?etko prisp\u244?sobenie kl\u225?vesnice uklad\u225? do s\u250?boru keyboard.ini\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .CHM\par


\pard\b0\f0\fs20 Star\u253? s\u250?bor n\u225?povedy KeyNote\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .ADR\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard Adres\u225?r pre odosielanie pozn\u225?mok e-mailom: \par

Ka\u382?d\u253? riadok v tomto s\u250?bore by mal obsahova\u357? jednu e-mailov\u250? adresu. Pri odosielan\u237? pozn\u225?mky e-mailom sa obsah tohto s\u250?boru na\u269?\u237?ta do rozba\u318?ovac\u237?ch zoznamov \ldblquote To\rdblquote  a \ldblquote Cc\rdblquote , tak\u382?e m\u244?\u382?ete jednoducho vybra\u357? e-mailov\u250? adresu. Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete upravi\u357? v textovom editore. Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357?.\par

\i Odosielanie e-mailov nie je v aktu\u225?lnych verzi\u225?ch KeyNote NF dostupn\u233?\i0\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b\f2\fs26 .SIG\b0\f0\fs20\par


\pard S\u250?bor podpisu pre odosielanie pozn\u225?mok e-mailom: \par

Tento s\u250?bor sa automaticky prip\u225?ja ku ka\u382?dej e-mailovej spr\u225?ve odoslanej z programu KeyNote. M\u244?\u382?ete ho upravi\u357? v textovom editore. Tento s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete bezpe\u269?ne odstr\u225?ni\u357?.\par

\i Odosielanie e-mailov nie je v aktu\u225?lnych verzi\u225?ch KeyNote NF dostupn\u233?\i0\par

}
