\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 Editor KeyNote\cf2\f0\fs32\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

T\u225?to t\u233?ma v\u225?s obozn\u225?mi s rozdielmi medzi form\u225?tom RTF a \u269?ist\u253?m form\u225?tom a obsahuje aj odkazy na \u271?al\u353?ie t\u233?my, kde n\u225?jdete viac s\u250?visiacich inform\u225?ci\u237? (ako {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<33|1316|0|4"}}{\fldrslt{Form\u225?tovan\u233? vlo\u382?enie vs. \u269?ist\u233? vlo\u382?enie}}}}\f0\fs20 ).\par

\par

KeyNote obsahuje be\u382?n\u253? editor s niektor\u253?mi \u353?pecifick\u253?mi vlastnos\u357?ami \u269?i zvl\u225?\u353?tnos\u357?ami. Niektor\u233? z nich s\u250? op\u237?san\u233? tu. V\u353?imnite si, \u382?e existuje ve\u318?a funkci\u237?, ktor\u233? budete pri \u250?prav\u225?ch pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? a ktor\u233? s\u250? podrobne op\u237?san\u233? v in\u253?ch t\u233?mach, napr\u237?klad pou\u382?\u237?vanie {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{odkazy}}}}\f0\fs20 , {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{obr\u225?zky}}}}\f0\fs20 , {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<24|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{glos\u225?r}}}}\f0\fs20  (na automatick\u233? nahradenie \u269?asti textu inou), pokro\u269?il\u233? {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<33|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{pou\u382?\u237?vanie schr\u225?nky}}}}\f0\fs20  alebo mo\u382?nosti ma\u357? viacero prie\u269?inkov a pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<27|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{prie\u269?inky ako stromy pozn\u225?mok}}}}\f0\fs20  vr\u225?tane {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<40|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{pou\u382?\u237?vanie H\u318?ada\u357? a N\u225?js\u357? v\u353?etko}}}}\f0\fs20  a {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<39|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{navig\u225?cia v hist\u243?rii}}}}\f0\fs20 , napr\u237?klad.\par

\par

Odpor\u250?\u269?ame v\u225?m pozrie\u357? sa na mo\u382?nosti dostupn\u233? v {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<30|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Vlastnosti prie\u269?inka a predvolen\u233? hodnoty}}}}\f0\fs20  a v {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<89|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: Editor form\u225?tovan\u233?ho textu}}}}\f0\fs20 , preto\u382?e konfiguruj\u250? r\u244?zne aspekty \u250?prav v KeyNote (napr. \u8222?Automaticky odsadi\u357? riadky\u8220? alebo \u8222?Zv\u228?\u269?\u353?i\u357? odsadenie riadkov o\u8220?).\par

\par

Aby ste boli pri \u250?prav\u225?ch produkt\u237?vni, tie\u382? sa odpor\u250?\u269?a ma\u357? aspo\u328? minim\u225?lne znalosti o dostupn\u253?ch kl\u225?vesov\u253?ch skratk\u225?ch a vedie\u357?, \u382?e ich mo\u382?no nakonfigurova\u357? pod\u318?a svojich potrieb. Ka\u382?d\u225? t\u233?ma zv\u253?raz\u328?uje hlavn\u233? skratky, ale \u250?pln\u253? zoznam n\u225?jdete aj v {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<78|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Preh\u318?ad kl\u225?vesnice}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par


