\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs34 Vlastnosti prie\u269?inka\fs36 : Nastavenia editora\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\par

\b Prie\u269?inok | Vlastnosti \b0 (\cf2\b F4\cf0\b0 )\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b N\u225?stroje | Predvolen\u233? nastavenia... \b0 (\cf2\b F6\cf0\b0 )\par

\par

\v\'11I229\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:229,385,532"}}{\fldrslt {229_Clipb_07oct.png}}}}\lang1033             \v\'11I230\'12\v0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:230,385,532"}}{\fldrslt {230_Clipb_07oct.png}}}}\par

\par

\par

Na tejto karte m\u244?\u382?ete ur\u269?i\u357? \ul nastavenia s\u250?visiace s prie\u269?inkom a editorom\ulnone  bu\u271? pre \b akt\u237?vny prie\u269?inok\b0  (\cf2\b F4\cf0\b0 ), alebo pre \b v\u353?etky prie\u269?inky, ktor\u233? nesk\u244?r vytvor\u237?te\b0  (\cf2\b F6\cf0\b0 ).\par


\pard\sb80\lang3082 V\u353?etky op\u237?san\u233? vlastnosti mo\u382?no zmeni\u357? v akt\u237?vnom prie\u269?inku alebo nastavi\u357? ako predvolen\u250? hodnotu \lang1033 pre novo vytvoren\u233? prie\u269?inky.\par


\pard\par

Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<21|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{O po\u269?iato\u269?n\u253?ch p\u237?smach a farb\u225?ch v KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\lang3082\par

\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Ulo\u382?i\u357? ako predvolen\u233? pre <filename>\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Pri \u250?prave predvolen\u253?ch nastaven\u237? pre nov\u253? prie\u269?inok si m\u244?\u382?ete zvoli\u357?, \u382?e sa tieto nastavenia pou\u382?ij\u250? nielen na v\u353?etky prie\u269?inky, ktor\u233? nesk\u244?r vytvor\u237?te (norm\u225?lne spr\u225?vanie), ale iba na v\u353?etky prie\u269?inky, ktor\u233? prid\u225?te do aktu\u225?lneho s\u250?boru. Takto m\u244?\u382?ete ma\u357? odli\u353?n\u233? predvolen\u233? nastavenia pre ka\u382?d\u253? jednotliv\u253? s\u250?bor. Napr\u237?klad zvy\u269?ajne m\u244?\u382?ete chcie\u357? pre nov\u233? prie\u269?inky biele pozadie, ale pri jednom \u353?peci\u225?lnom s\u250?bore m\u244?\u382?ete namiesto toho chcie\u357? \u269?ierne pozadie. \par

Vyberte t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357?, ak chcete ulo\u382?i\u357? vlastnosti prie\u269?inka ako predvolen\u233? iba pre aktu\u225?lny s\u250?bor.\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Ulo\u382?i\u357? ako predvolen\u233? (a pou\u382?i\u357? pre prie\u269?inok \u8222?<Folder>\u8220?)\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Pri \u250?prave nastaven\u237? akt\u237?vneho prie\u269?inka (\cf2\b F4\cf0\b0 ) sa m\u244?\u382?ete rozhodn\u250?\u357? pou\u382?i\u357? tie ist\u233? vlastnosti ako predvolen\u233? pre v\u353?etky novo vytvoren\u233? prie\u269?inky (popri norm\u225?lnom spr\u225?van\u237?, ktor\u253?m je zmena vlastnost\u237? v aktu\u225?lnom akt\u237?vnom prie\u269?inku).\par

Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? vybrat\u225?, m\u244?\u382?ete volite\u318?ne vybra\u357? vy\u353?\u353?ie op\u237?san\u250? mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?Ulo\u382?i\u357? ako predvolen\u233? pre <filename>\u8220? s rovnak\u253?m v\u253?znamom.\par

\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Zalamova\u357? dlh\u233? riadky\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Zap\u237?na/vyp\u237?na zalamovanie riadkov, ktor\u233? s\u250? pr\u237?li\u353? dlh\u233? na to, aby sa zmestili do \u353?\u237?rky panela editora. Je to ekvivalentn\u233? v\u253?beru pr\u237?kazu {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<113|15728|0|50"}}{\fldrslt{Form\u225?t | Zalamovanie slov}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard\sb80 Vysvetlenie toho, ako t\u225?to zmena ovplyv\u328?uje editor v uzloch, n\u225?jdete v \u269?asti \u8222?pozn\u225?mky\u8220? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<27|3157|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Konfigur\u225?cia nastaven\u237? stromu}}}}}\f0\fs20 \par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Predvolen\u233? pribl\u237?\u382?enie\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Umo\u382?\u328?uje pou\u382?i\u357? in\u250? predvolen\u250? hodnotu ako 100 %\par


\pard\sb80 Pozn\u225?mka: \ul Mo\u382?no pou\u382?i\u357? iba ako predvolen\u233?\ulnone .\par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? znak tabul\u225?tora\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Ur\u269?uje, \u269?i KeyNote pri stla\u269?en\u237? kl\u225?vesu TAB vlo\u382?\u237? znak tabul\u225?tora alebo ur\u269?it\u253? po\u269?et medzier. Ak t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357? vypnete, KeyNote vlo\u382?\u237? po\u269?et medzier uveden\u253? v poli \b Ve\u318?kos\u357? tabul\u225?tora\b0 .\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Ve\u318?kos\u357? tabul\u225?tora\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \b 4\b0  medzier\par

Ak je mo\u382?nos\u357? \b Pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? znak tabul\u225?tora\b0  vypnut\u225?, ur\u269?uje po\u269?et medzier, ktor\u233? KeyNote vlo\u382?\u237? pri stla\u269?en\u237? kl\u225?vesu TAB.\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Zis\u357?ova\u357? a zv\u253?raz\u328?ova\u357? URL v editore\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard\fi-240\li240 Ur\u269?uje, \u269?i maj\u250? by\u357? hypertextov\u233? odkazy (URL) v editore zv\u253?raznen\u233? a \ldblquote kliknute\u318?n\u233?\rdblquote .\par

Viac inform\u225?ci\u237? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|3323|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie rozpozn\u225?vania URL v editore RTF}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Vypn\u250?\u357? selektor zna\u269?iek\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Umo\u382?\u328?uje vypn\u250?\u357? zobrazovanie selektora zna\u269?iek v editore.\par

Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? vybrat\u225?, nov\u233? zna\u269?ky sa nebud\u250? registrova\u357? z editora tohto prie\u269?inka, hoci ich mo\u382?no registrova\u357? na karte Zna\u269?ky (v paneli zdrojov).\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Predvolene iba \u269?ist\u253? text\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Obsah pozn\u225?mok sa zvy\u269?ajne uklad\u225? ako Rich Text. Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? vybrat\u225?, obsah nov\u253?ch pozn\u225?mok v tomto prie\u269?inku (alebo v nov\u253?ch prie\u269?inkoch) sa bude predvolene uklada\u357? ako \u269?ist\u253? text (neuklada\u357? inform\u225?cie o form\u225?tovan\u237?)\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Od verzie 2.0 je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? \b predvolenou\b0  konfigur\u225?ciou pre \b nov\u233? pozn\u225?mky\b0 . \par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e od tejto verzie je mo\u382?n\u233? kombinova\u357? RTF a pozn\u225?mky s \u269?ist\u253?m textom v tom istom prie\u269?inku.\par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\v\fs22\'11B1\'12\v0 Jazyk\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Nastav\u237? jazyk textu pozn\u225?mky. T\u225?to vlastnos\u357? sa pou\u382?\u237?va na v\u253?ber spr\u225?vneho slovn\u237?ka pre kontrolu pravopisu. Nemen\u237? jazyk textu ani jazyk programu KeyNote.\par

\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Tla\u269?idlo p\u237?sma\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Vyber\u225? po\u269?iato\u269?n\u253? \u353?t\u253?l p\u237?sma pre pozn\u225?mky v akt\u237?vnom prie\u269?inku. Neovplyv\u328?uje u\u382? existuj\u250?ci text! (*)\par

Pozn\u225?mka: Zmena p\u237?sma ovplyvn\u237? iba \b nov\u233?\b0  uzly (*)\par


\pard\sb80 (*): S v\u253?nimkou pr\u237?padu, ke\u271? je akt\u237?vny prie\u269?inok prie\u269?inkom s \u269?ist\u253?m textom, vtedy ovplyvn\u237? v\u353?etok text\par

\u270?al\u353?ie vysvetlenie n\u225?jdete v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<21|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{O po\u269?iato\u269?n\u253?ch p\u237?smach a farb\u225?ch v KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Tla\u269?idlo farby pozadia\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Men\u237? farbu pozadia pre pozn\u225?mky v akt\u237?vnom prie\u269?inku.\par

\par

\cf1\b\i\fs22 Prevzia\u357? farbu pozadia z akt\u237?vneho uzla\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\i0 T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? je na tejto karte iba na \u269?\u237?tanie. Mo\u382?no ju upravi\u357? na karte {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<89|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{V\u353?eobecn\u233? nastavenia | Editor form\u225?tovan\u233?ho textu}}}}}\f0\fs20 \par

Je uveden\u225?, aby ste pochopili, pre\u269?o sa zobrazuje t\u225?to farba pozadia:\par

\par

Farba pozadia z\u225?vis\u237? od mo\u382?nosti \u8222?Prevzia\u357? farbu pozadia z akt\u237?vneho uzla\u8220?:\par

- Ak je nastaven\u225?, zobrazuje sa farba pozadia vybran\u233?ho uzla, teda farba pozadia jeho nov\u253?ch podraden\u253?ch uzlov\par

- Ak nie je nastaven\u225?, zobrazuje sa predvolen\u225? farba pozadia pre v\u353?etky NOV\u201? uzly\par

\par

Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<21|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{O po\u269?iato\u269?n\u253?ch p\u237?smach a farb\u225?ch v KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Tla\u269?idlo Obnovi\u357?\par

\cf0\b0\fs20 Obnov\u237? po\u269?iato\u269?n\u253? \u353?t\u253?l p\u237?sma a farbu pozadia pre akt\u237?vny prie\u269?inok. Neovplyv\u328?uje u\u382? existuj\u250?ci text!\par

\par

}
