\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs34 Vlastnosti prie\u269?inka\fs36 : Nastavenia stromu\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\v\'11I212\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:212,387,530"}}{\fldrslt {212_Clipb_08ene.png}}}}\lang1033\par

\par

\par

Na tejto karte m\u244?\u382?ete ur\u269?i\u357? \ul nastavenia s\u250?visiace so stromom\ulnone  bu\u271? pre \b akt\u237?vny prie\u269?inok\b0  (\cf2\b F4\cf0\b0 ), alebo pre \b v\u353?etky prie\u269?inky, ktor\u233? nesk\u244?r vytvor\u237?te\b0  (\cf2\b F6\cf0\b0 ).\par

\par

\lang3082 V\u353?etky op\u237?san\u233? vlastnosti mo\u382?no zmeni\u357? v akt\u237?vnom prie\u269?inku alebo nastavi\u357? ako predvolen\u250? hodnotu \lang1033 pre novo vytvoren\u233? prie\u269?inky.\par

\par

\b Pozn\u225?mka\b0 : zobrazen\u225? sn\u237?mka obrazovky zodpoved\u225? Prie\u269?inok | Vlastnosti (\cf2 F4\cf0 ). Je toto\u382?n\u225? s tou, ktor\u225? sa pou\u382?\u237?va v N\u225?stroje | Predvolen\u233? nastavenia...\b  \b0 (\cf2 F6\cf0 ), s v\u253?nimkou rovnak\u253?ch rozdielov zv\u253?raznen\u253?ch modrou na {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<31|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Vlastnosti prie\u269?inka: Nastavenia editora}}}}}\f0\fs20 ). V\u353?imnite si, \u382?e tieto mo\u382?nosti nie s\u250? \u353?pecifick\u233? pre \u382?iadnu z t\u253?chto kariet, ale s\u250? spolo\u269?n\u233? pre obe. V uvedenom odkaze n\u225?jdete v\u253?znam \u8222?\b Ulo\u382?i\u357? ako predvolen\u233? pre <filename>\b0 \u8220? a \u8222?\b Ulo\u382?i\u357? ako predvolen\u233? (a pou\u382?i\u357? pre prie\u269?inok \u8218?<Folder>\u8216?)\u8220?\b0 "\par

\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 N\u225?zov prie\u269?inka\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\lang3082 Z\f1\lang1033 adajte nov\u253? n\u225?zov na premenovanie akt\u237?vneho \f0\lang3082 prie\u269?inka alebo zadajte n\u225?zov, \lang1033 ktor\u253? sa pou\u382?ije ako predvolen\u253? pre novo vytvoren\u233? prie\u269?inky\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Ikona prie\u269?inka\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Vyberte ikonu, ktor\u225? sa m\u225? zobrazova\u357? na karte ved\u318?a n\u225?zvu prie\u269?inka.\par

\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 RTL (sprava do\u318?ava)\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Mo\u382?nos\u357? na \u250?rovni prie\u269?inka, ktor\u225? definuje predvolen\u253? obojsmern\u253? re\u382?im pre strom a editor v prie\u269?inku. Ak je nastaven\u225? na True, strom sa bude zobrazova\u357? ako RTL, editor sa nastav\u237? na RightToLeftNoAlign a nov\u233? pozn\u225?mky bud\u250? predvolene za\u269?\u237?na\u357? odsekom RTL.\par


\pard\sb80 Cel\u233? rozhranie sa prisp\u244?sob\u237? RTL, ak je nakonfigurovan\u253? jazyk rozhrania (pod\u318?a prelo\u382?en\u233?ho s\u250?boru .LNG) definovan\u253? ako RTL. Pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<107|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Konfigur\u225?cia jazyka pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?sk\u233?ho rozhrania}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

\b Pozn\u225?mka\b0 : Zv\u225?\u382?te aj \u250?pravu niektor\u253?ch z nasleduj\u250?cich troch {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<104|14289|0|13"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti INI s\u250?visiace s RTL}}}}}\f0\fs20 : RTLkeyShct, IMEAutoKeyboard, IMEAutoFont\par

\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Predvolen\u253? n\u225?zov pre nov\u233? uzly stromu\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard\fi-240\li240 Ur\u269?uje predvolen\u253? n\u225?zov pre v\u353?etky nov\u233? uzly stromu (pozn\u225?mky), ktor\u233? prid\u225?te do stromu\par


\pard\fi-480\li480\sb80\b Tip: \b0 Re\u357?azec m\u244?\u382?e obsahova\u357? \u353?peci\u225?lne \u8222?tokeny\u8220?, ktor\u233? KeyNote automaticky nahrad\u237? hodnotami. To v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? \u269?iasto\u269?ne automatizova\u357? pomen\u250?vanie uzlov. Napr\u237?klad pri vytv\u225?ran\u237? uzla mo\u382?no automaticky prida\u357? aktu\u225?lny d\u225?tum alebo \u269?as ako s\u250?\u269?as\u357? n\u225?zvu uzla. Kliknut\u237?m na tla\u269?idlo \v\'11I61\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:61,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {61_Main_61.png}}}}\lang1033  zobraz\u237?te dial\u243?gov\u233? okno so zoznamom dostupn\u253?ch tokenov a ich v\u253?znamov.\par


\pard\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Zvisl\u233? rozlo\u382?enie (strom navrchu)\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: vypnut\u233?\par

Ur\u269?uje rozlo\u382?enie panela stromu vo\u269?i editoru. \par

Ak je mo\u382?nos\u357? zapnut\u225?, strom sa zobraz\u237? nad editorom. \par

Ak je mo\u382?nos\u357? vypnut\u225?, strom sa zobraz\u237? v\u318?avo od editora (vodorovn\u233? rozlo\u382?enie)\par

\par

Pozn\u225?mka:\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb20 Ak v strome prid\u225?te (alebo pr\u237?padne presuniete) nejak\u233? uzly a potom zmen\u237?te rozlo\u382?enie stromu (z vodorovn\u233?ho na zvisl\u233? alebo naopak), nov\u233? uzly stratia svoju p\u244?vodn\u250? poz\u237?ciu. Net\u253?ka sa to uzlov, ktor\u233? boli vytvoren\u233? sk\u244?r. Probl\u233?m sa nevyskytne, ak bol s\u250?bor ulo\u382?en\u253? a zatvoren\u253?/znova otvoren\u253?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Obch\u225?dzanie: Ke\u271? chcete zmeni\u357? rozlo\u382?enie, najprv s\u250?bor ulo\u382?te *a znova ho na\u269?\u237?tajte*. Jednoducho s\u250?bor zatvorte a znova otvorte alebo ho vyberte z ponuky \ldblquote Ned\u225?vne s\u250?bory\rdblquote . Po op\u228?tovnom na\u269?\u237?tan\u237? s\u250?boru zme\u328?te rozlo\u382?enie stromu. Takto by v\u353?etky uzly mali zosta\u357? tam, kde boli. V tomto bode by ste s\u250?bor pravdepodobne mali ulo\u382?i\u357? a znova na\u269?\u237?ta\u357?, aspo\u328? ak pl\u225?nujete \u271?al\u353?ie zmeny stromu.\par


\pard\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Zobrazi\u357? za\u353?krt\u225?vacie pol\u237?\u269?ka vo v\u353?etk\u253?ch uzloch\tab\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: vypnut\u233?\par


\pard\fi-240\li240 Ak je mo\u382?nos\u357? zapnut\u225?, ved\u318?a ka\u382?d\u233?ho uzla v strome sa zobraz\u237? za\u353?krt\u225?vacie pol\u237?\u269?ko. \par

Ak je mo\u382?nos\u357? vypnut\u225?, za\u353?krt\u225?vacie pol\u237?\u269?ka sa nezobrazuj\u250?\par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Skry\u357? za\u353?krtnut\u233? uzly\tab\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: vypnut\u233?\par


\pard\fi-240\li240 Ak je mo\u382?nos\u357? zapnut\u225?, uzly sa po za\u353?krtnut\u237? automaticky skryj\u250?. (Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<27|13504|0|11"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie skryt\u253?ch uzlov}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Obr\u225?zkov\u233? ikony v strome\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Ikony v strome m\u244?\u382?ete zobrazi\u357? alebo skry\u357? (\ul \u381?iadne\ulnone ). A v prvom pr\u237?pade m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? vlastn\u233? ikony, ktor\u233? ka\u382?d\u233?mu uzlu explicitne prirad\u237?te (\ul Vlastn\u233? ikony\ulnone ), alebo necha\u357? KeyNote priradi\u357? ikony pod\u318?a stavu uzla a jeho druhu (\ul \u352?tandardn\u233? ikony\ulnone ).\par

\par


\pard\sa120 Ak pou\u382?ijete \u8222?\u352?tandardn\u233? ikony\u8220?, uvid\u237?te:\par


\pard\li120\v\'11I86\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:86,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {86_TV_02.png}}}}\lang1033  \v\'11I85\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:85,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {85_TV_01.png}}}}\lang1033     Vrchn\u233? uzly (uzly prvej \u250?rovne) s podraden\u253?mi uzlami, vybran\u233? alebo nevybran\u233?\par

\v\'11I88\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:88,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {88_TV_04.png}}}}\lang1033  \v\'11I87\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:87,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {87_TV_03.png}}}}\lang1033     Uzly ni\u382?\u353?ej \u250?rovne s podraden\u253?mi uzlami, vybran\u233? alebo nie\par

\v\'11I90\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:90,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {90_TV_06.png}}}}\lang1033   \v\'11I89\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:89,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {89_TV_05.png}}}}\lang1033    Uzly bez podraden\u253?ch uzlov (listov\u233? uzly), vybran\u233? alebo nie\par

\v\'11I92\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:92,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {92_TV_08.png}}}}\lang1033   \v\'11I91\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:91,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {91_TV_07.png}}}}\lang1033    Virtu\u225?lny uzol, vybran\u253? alebo nie.  \par

\v\'11I94\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:94,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {94_TV_10.png}}}}\lang1033   \v\'11I93\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:93,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {93_TV_09.png}}}}\lang1033    Prepojen\u253? uzol, vybran\u253? alebo nie.\par


\pard\par


\pard\fi-480\li480\sb40\b Tip: \b0 Medzi \u353?tandardn\u253?mi a vlastn\u253?mi ikonami m\u244?\u382?ete r\u253?chlo prep\u237?na\u357? pomocou pr\u237?kazov \ul Zobrazi\u357? | \u352?tandardn\u233? ikony stromu\ulnone  alebo \ul Zobrazi\u357? | Vlastn\u233? ikony stromu\ulnone .\par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Dodato\u269?n\u233? st\u314?pce\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Existuj\u250? dva st\u314?pce, ktor\u233? mo\u382?no zobrazi\u357?: \u8222?Ozna\u269?en\u233?\u8220?, \u8222?D\u225?tum\u8220?. Po zobrazen\u237? ich mo\u382?no preusporiada\u357?; v\u253?sledn\u225? poz\u237?cia sa tie\u382? ulo\u382?\u237? do s\u250?boru .knt.\par


\pard\sb120\b Tip\b0 : Zobrazenie volite\u318?n\u253?ch st\u314?pcov m\u244?\u382?ete prep\u237?na\u357? aj v kontextovej ponuke panela stromu (Zobrazi\u357? / Filter | Zobrazi\u357? st\u314?pce). Tieto zmeny zobrazenia panela stromu sa pri ukladan\u237? neulo\u382?ia.\par


\pard Viac inform\u225?ci\u237? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<27|22219|0|14"}}{\fldrslt{Volite\u318?n\u233? st\u314?pce: Ozna\u269?en\u233?, D\u225?tum}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Tla\u269?idlo p\u237?sma\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Vyber\u225? predvolen\u253? \u353?t\u253?l p\u237?sma pre uzly v paneli stromu (*)\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Tla\u269?idlo farby pozadia\par

\cf0\b0\fs20 Vyber\u225? farbu pozadia stromu (*)\par

\par

\ul (*) Pozn\u225?mky\ulnone :\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 M\u244?\u382?ete definova\u357? predvolen\u233? \ul p\u237?smo a farbu pozadia\ulnone  pre cel\u253? panel stromu (kartu), pri\u269?om ka\u382?d\u253? jednotliv\u253? uzol ich m\u244?\u382?e prep\u237?sa\u357?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ke\u271? zmen\u237?te predvolen\u233? hodnoty, pou\u382?ij\u250? sa iba na uzly, ktor\u233? nie s\u250? prisp\u244?soben\u233?.\par


\pard\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Tla\u269?idlo Obnovi\u357?\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Obnov\u237? \u353?t\u253?l p\u237?sma a farbu pozadia stromu\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Pou\u382?i\u357? na V\u352?ETKY prie\u269?inky\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Ak za\u353?krtnete t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357?, p\u237?smo a farby pozadia definovan\u233? v tomto okne sa pou\u382?ij\u250? naraz na V\u352?ETKY panely stromu. \par

T\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357? m\u225?te k dispoz\u237?cii v akt\u237?vnom prie\u269?inku aj v predvolen\u253?ch nastaveniach. Takto m\u244?\u382?ete jedno z t\u253?chto nastaven\u237? pou\u382?i\u357? naraz na v\u353?etky panely stromu.\par

\highlight4\par

}
