\pard {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|19244|0|4"}}{\fldrslt{Form\u225?t intern\u233?ho KNT odkazu}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\par

\cf3\b\v\fs24\'11B7\'12\v0 V\u353?eobecn\u233? inform\u225?cie o odkazoch (alebo hypertextov\u253?ch odkazoch)\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

KeyNote podporuje klikate\u318?n\u233? URL (odkazy / hypertextov\u233? odkazy) nieko\u318?k\u253?ch typov:\par

\par


\pard\sa120\b Odkazy na webov\u233? str\u225?nky\ul\b0\fs22\par


\pard\ulnone\fs20 M\u244?\u382?ete vytv\u225?ra\u357? odkazy na webov\u233? str\u225?nky (http://, https://,  www)\par

Ka\u382?d\u253? aktivovan\u253? webov\u253? odkaz budete m\u244?c\u357? otvori\u357? v novom okne prehliada\u269?a alebo ako nov\u250? kartu v okne, ktor\u233? je pr\u225?ve otvoren\u233?.\par


\pard\sb80 M\u244?\u382?ete zada\u357? URL ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|2729|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) alebo jednoducho pou\u382?i\u357? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<112|2196|0|7"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?i\u357? | URL...}}}}}\f0\fs20  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|7546|0|8"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}}\f0\fs20 ).\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa120\b Odkazy na lok\u225?lne s\u250?bory\ul\b0\fs22\par


\pard\ulnone\fs20 M\u244?\u382?ete vytv\u225?ra\u357? odkazy na dokumenty alebo programy vo va\u353?om po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?i. Napr\u237?klad, ak kliknete na odkaz na s\u250?bor .xls, s\u250?bor sa otvor\u237? v programe Excel. Ak kliknete na odkaz na program, program sa spust\u237?.\par


\pard\li360\sb80\b Tip:\b0  Ak odkaz ukazuje na s\u250?bor, ktor\u253? KeyNote podporuje (s\u250?bor s pr\u237?ponou .KNT, .KNE alebo .N_TEXT), s\u250?bor sa otvor\u237? v KeyNote, presne tak, ako keby ste pou\u382?ili pr\u237?kaz {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|2022|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{S\u250?bor | Otvori\u357?}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\b Tip: \b0 M\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? absol\u250?tne alebo relat\u237?vne (vo\u269?i s\u250?boru .knt) cesty. M\u244?\u382?e by\u357? relat\u237?vna vo\u269?i aktu\u225?lnemu s\u250?boru .knt alebo vo\u269?i umiestneniu keynote.exe.\par


\pard\par

Ako je pop\u237?san\u233? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|1379|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Vkladanie hyperodkazov}}}}}\f0\fs20 , m\u244?\u382?ete vklada\u357? odkazy na lok\u225?lne s\u250?bory p\u237?san\u237?m alebo vlo\u382?en\u237?m s predponou sch\u233?m URL {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:/// }}{\fldrslt{file:///}}}}}\f0\fs20 , hoci najjednoduch\u353?\u237? a najzvy\u269?ajnej\u353?\u237? sp\u244?sob bude pretiahnu\u357? s\u250?bor(y) alebo pou\u382?i\u357? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<112|2442|0|8"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?i\u357? | Odkaz na s\u250?bor...}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par


\pard\sa120\b In\u233? \u353?tandardn\u233? odkazy\par


\pard\b0 M\u244?\u382?ete vytv\u225?ra\u357? odkazy na in\u233? \u353?tandardn\u233? sch\u233?my URL:\par


\pard\li120\sb80 ftp:, mailto:, telnet:, news:, nntp:, gopher:, wais:, prospero:, notes:, callto:, onenote:, outlook:, tel:, webcal:, cintanotes:\par


\pard\par

* M\u244?\u382?ete dokonca vklada\u357? odkazy na \ul vlastn\u233? sch\u233?my URL\ulnone , ale v tomto pr\u237?pade mus\u237?te {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|4956|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{pou\u382?i\u357? pr\u237?kazy hyperodkazov}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par


\pard\sa120\b Intern\u233? odkazy (odkazy KNT)\b0\par


\pard KeyNote m\u244?\u382?e vytv\u225?ra\u357? odkazy na prie\u269?inky a pozn\u225?mky (uzly) v s\u250?boroch KeyNote. M\u244?\u382?ete vytv\u225?ra\u357? odkazy na miesta v tom istom (aktu\u225?lnom) s\u250?bore alebo v akomko\u318?vek inom s\u250?bore KeyNote vo va\u353?om po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?i.\par

Tento druh odkazov je zostaven\u253? ako roz\u353?\u237?renie URL \ldblquote {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:/// }}{\fldrslt{file:///}}}}}\f0\fs20\rdblquote , hoci sa spravuj\u250? nez\u225?visle. Napr\u237?klad mo\u382?nos\u357? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<95|1641|0|4"}}{\fldrslt{Sp\u250?\u353?\u357?a\u357? URL file:// bez v\u253?zvy}}}}}\f0\fs20  sa \ul nebude\ulnone  bra\u357? do \u250?vahy.\par


\pard\sb80 Vlo\u382?enie odkazu KeyNote si vy\u382?aduje dva kroky: ozna\u269?enie cie\u318?a, teda miesta, na ktor\u233? odkaz presko\u269?\u237?, a potom vlo\u382?enie odkazu niekam inam ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|13152|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa120\b Odkazy na obr\u225?zky\b0\par


\pard Od verzie 1.8.1 m\u244?\u382?e KeyNote skr\u253?va\u357? obr\u225?zky a namiesto nich zobrazova\u357? odkazy. Sp\u244?sob, ak\u253?m m\u244?\u382?ete s t\u253?mto druhom hypertextov\u253?ch odkazov pracova\u357?, je pop\u237?san\u253? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|25666|0|20"}}{\fldrslt{Spr\u225?va obr\u225?zkov v KeyNote NF}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e KeyNote pou\u382?\u237?va predponu \u8222?img:\u8220?, ktor\u225? je tak interne vyhraden\u225?.\par

\par

\par

\par

\cf3\b\v\fs26\'11B1\'12\v0 Vkladanie odkazov\b0\par

\cf0\fs20\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360\b\v\fs24\'11B3\'12\v0 Pou\u382?itie rozpozn\u225?vania URL v editore RTF\par


\pard\b0\fs20\par

Editor (ovl\u225?dac\u237? prvok RichEdit) rozpozn\u225?va a zv\u253?raz\u328?uje \u353?tandardn\u233? sch\u233?my URL, \u269?o zah\u341?\u328?a \u353?tandardn\u253? form\u225?t internetov\u253?ch URL.\par

\par


\pard\li360 Aby ste mohli t\u250?to funkciu vyu\u382?\u237?va\u357?, je potrebn\u233? ma\u357? v dial\u243?govom okne \b  akt\u237?vnu mo\u382?nos\u357? \b0 Detekova\u357? a zv\u253?raz\u328?ova\u357? URL{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<30|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Vlastnosti prie\u269?inka}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard\li360\sb60\ul Pozn\u225?mka\ulnone : Ke\u271? zapnete zv\u253?raz\u328?ovanie URL, prejav\u237? sa okam\u382?ite, ale ak ho vypnete, mus\u237?te editor znovu na\u269?\u237?ta\u357? (m\u244?\u382?ete vybra\u357? in\u253? uzol a potom sa vr\u225?ti\u357?).\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa40 M\u244?\u382?ete zada\u357? alebo vlo\u382?i\u357? nasleduj\u250?ce druhy textov a tie bud\u250? zv\u253?raznen\u233? a spravovan\u233? ako hypertextov\u233? odkazy (m\u244?\u382?ete na ne klikn\u250?\u357?):\par


\pard\li360 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.example.com }}{\fldrslt{http://www.example.com}}}}}\f0\fs20  \par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK www.example.com }}{\fldrslt{www.example.com}}}}}\f0\fs20  \par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK mailto:wizard@oz.org }}{\fldrslt{mailto:wizard@oz.org}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK ftp://xxxxxx }}{\fldrslt{ftp://xxxxxx}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

Odkazy s\u250? v\u382?dy pod\u269?iarknut\u233? a predvolene zobrazen\u233? modrou farbou. Alebo sa automaticky dedia in\u233? \u353?t\u253?ly p\u237?sma a odseku.\par

\par

Tento mechanizmus m\u225? \b obmedzenia\b0 :\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 Pre URL nem\u244?\u382?ete zobrazi\u357? alternat\u237?vny text\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}E-mailov\u233? adresy bud\u250? zv\u253?raznen\u233? iba vtedy, ak s\u250? vlo\u382?en\u233? vo forme \u250?plnej URL s pou\u382?it\u237?m predpony \u8222?{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK mailto: }}{\fldrslt{mailto:}}}}}\f0\fs20 \u8220?. \par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}T\u253?mto sp\u244?sobom nem\u244?\u382?ete prid\u225?va\u357? vlastn\u233? sch\u233?my URL.\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}V s\u250?\u269?asnosti \b rozpozn\u225?van\u233? sch\u233?my URL\b0  s\u250?:\par


\pard\li720 file:, http:, https:, ftp:, mailto:, telnet:, news:, nntp:, gopher:, wais:, prospero:, notes:, callto:, onenote:, outlook:, tel:, webcal:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 Ako definuj\u250? internetov\u233? \u353?tandardy, \b URL nem\u244?\u382?u obsahova\u357? medzery\b0  a ur\u269?it\u233? \u271?al\u353?ie \u353?peci\u225?lne znaky. Ovl\u225?dac\u237? prvok RichEdit sa v tomto smere spr\u225?va spr\u225?vne a takisto nepovo\u318?uje medzery v URL. Medzery a in\u233? \u353?peci\u225?lne znaky musia by\u357? preveden\u233? na hexadecim\u225?lne k\u243?dy, napr. %20 pre medzeru.\par


\pard\li360\sb80 Aby editor spr\u225?vne rozpoznal URL, ktor\u233? obsahuj\u250? medzery, ako napr\u237?klad: \par


\pard\li720\sb80 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///C:\\\\Program }}{\fldrslt{file:///C:\\Program}}}}}\f0\fs20  Files (x86)\\Intel\\KeyNote NF\\Profiles\\profiles.txt\par


\pard\li360\sb80 m\u244?\u382?ete \b uzavrie\u357?\b0  URL medzi \b "<" a ">"\b0 , takto:\par


\pard\li720\sb80 <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\KeyNote NF\\\\Profiles\\\\profiles.txt"}}{\fldrslt{file:///C:\\Program Files (x86)\\KeyNote NF\\Profiles\\profiles.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20 >\par


\pard\li360\sb120 Pri vkladan\u237? webovej URL s medzerami m\u244?\u382?ete urobi\u357? toto:\par


\pard\li720\sb80 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.example.com/my%20beautiful%20page }}{\fldrslt{http://www.example.com/my%20beautiful%20page}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

Alebo, \u269?itate\u318?nej\u353?ie:\par

<{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.example.com/my beautiful page"}}{\fldrslt{http://www.example.com/my beautiful page}}}}}\f0\fs20 >\par

(Zvy\u269?ajne, ak tak\u233?to URL vlo\u382?\u237?te z prehliada\u269?a, medzery sa nahradia znakom "%20")\par

\par


\pard\b Tip\b0 : V\u353?imnite si, \u382?e m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:/// }}{\fldrslt{file:///}}}}}\f0\fs20  (s "<" ">" v pr\u237?pade potreby) na vytvorenie \b odkazu na prie\u269?inok\b0 : <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\KeyNote NF"}}{\fldrslt{file:///C:\\Program Files (x86)\\KeyNote NF}}}}}\f0\fs20 >. V s\u250?\u269?asnosti sa zd\u225?, \u382?e je dokonca mo\u382?n\u233? jednoducho pou\u382?i\u357? "<{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:  "}}{\fldrslt{file:}}}}}\f0\fs20 >", ako <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\KeyNote NF"}}{\fldrslt{file:C:\\Program Files (x86)\\KeyNote NF}}}}}\f0\fs20 >\par

\par

\b Pozn\u225?mka:\par

\b0 S\u250?\u269?asn\u233? verzie RichEdit rozpozn\u225?vaj\u250? URL na lok\u225?lne s\u250?bory iba s dvoma lom\u237?tkami (ako v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file://myFile.txt }}{\fldrslt{file://myFile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20 ). V star\u353?\u237?ch verzi\u225?ch bolo povinn\u233? pou\u382?i\u357? tretie lom\u237?tko. Vy\u382?adovala to logika form\u225?tu URL: tretie lom\u237?tko znamen\u225? \ldblquote cesta za\u269?\u237?na v kore\u328?ovom prie\u269?inku\rdblquote . Umo\u382?\u328?uje to vytv\u225?ra\u357? hypertextov\u233? odkazy na s\u250?bory umiestnen\u233? na inom po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?i v sieti: n\u225?zov tohto po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?a by sa umiestnil pred tretie lom\u237?tko:\par


\pard\li480 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file://computername/c:\\\\users\\\\files\\\\document.txt }}{\fldrslt{file://computername/c:\\users\\files\\document.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par


\pard\sb80\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart2\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360\b\v\fs24\'11B2\'12\v0 Pou\u382?itie pr\u237?kazu Hyperlink\par


\pard\b0\fs20\par

Od verzie 1.7.0 KeyNote NF umo\u382?\u328?uje pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? pokro\u269?ilej\u353?\u237? druh odkazu zalo\u382?en\u253? na pr\u237?kaze RTF rozpozn\u225?vanom v nov\u353?\u237?ch verzi\u225?ch ovl\u225?dacieho prvku RichEdit:\par


\pard\li360\cf4\{\\field\{\\*\\fldinst\{HYPERLINK "hyperlink"\}\}\{\\fldrslt\{\\cf1\\ul textOfHyperlink\}\}\}\cf0\par


\pard\par

Tento pr\u237?kaz umo\u382?\u328?uje prida\u357? alternat\u237?vny text, ktor\u253? sa zobraz\u237? namiesto re\u357?azca URL.\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Odkazy vytvoren\u233? t\u253?mto sp\u244?sobom nie s\u250? ovplyvnen\u233? vo\u318?bou \b Detekova\u357? a zv\u253?razni\u357? URL\b0  aktivovanou v dial\u243?govom okne {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<30|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Vlastnosti prie\u269?inka}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa80 Na vlo\u382?enie tohto druhu odkazov m\u244?\u382?ete:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Upravi\u357? ak\u253?ko\u318?vek odkaz, hypertextov\u253? alebo nie (ako vo vzore {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK www.URL.com }}{\fldrslt{www.URL.com}}}}}\f0\fs20  vy\u353?\u353?ie)\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Pou\u382?i\u357? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<112|2196|0|7"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?i\u357? | URL...}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Pou\u382?i\u357? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<112|2442|0|8"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?i\u357? | Odkaz na s\u250?bor...}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Ozna\u269?i\u357? miesto v KeyNote a potom Vlo\u382?i\u357? odkaz KeyNote  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|13315|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Pou\u382?it\u237?m pretiahnutia a pustenia. M\u244?\u382?ete pretiahnu\u357? nieko\u318?ko s\u250?borov do \u318?ubovo\u318?n\u233?ho panela v KeyNote, dokonca aj do panela editora.\par


\pard\par

\par

\b\v\fs22\'11B8\'12\v0 Pou\u382?itie Vlo\u382?i\u357? URL...\par

\b0\fs20\par

Tento pr\u237?kaz otvor\u237? mod\u225?lne okno s dvoma edita\u269?n\u253?mi po\u318?ami, "URL" a "Text". Ke\u271? zad\u225?te obe hodnoty a potvrd\u237?te (OK), hypertextov\u253? odkaz sa vlo\u382?\u237? a bude zobrazova\u357? re\u357?azec zadan\u253? v poli "Text". Na hypertextov\u253? odkaz m\u244?\u382?ete klikn\u250?\u357? a aktivova\u357? jeho intern\u250? URL.\par

\par


\pard\li360\v\'11I122\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:122,503,128"}}{\fldrslt {122_Clipb_07ene.png}}}}\lang1033\par


\pard\par


\pard\li360 {\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.URL.com"}}{\fldrslt{Pr\u237?klad URL}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

Pozn\u225?mky:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak \b vykon\u225?te\b0  Vlo\u382?i\u357? URL \b s ozna\u269?en\u253?m textom\b0 , KeyNote tento ozna\u269?en\u253? text analyzuje:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720 Ak sa rozpozn\u225? ako URL, pon\u250?kne sa v poli URL (s fokusom v poli Text), inak v poli Text (s fokusom v poli URL).\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Ak sa rozpozn\u225? ako cesta k s\u250?boru, obe polia, URL a Text, sa predvyplnia ozna\u269?en\u253?m textom (s fokusom v poli Text)\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb60 KeyNote skontroluje, \u269?i existuje http alebo https \b URL\b0  (alebo tak\u225?, ktor\u225? v\u253?slovne za\u269?\u237?na "{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file: }}{\fldrslt{file:}}}}}\f0\fs20 ") \b v schr\u225?nke\b0 . Ak existuje URL a v editore je ozna\u269?en\u253? text (a ten sa l\u237?\u353?i od URL), vytvor\u237? sa hypertextov\u253? odkaz pomocou URL v schr\u225?nke spolu s ozna\u269?en\u253?m textom, bez potreby otv\u225?ra\u357? mod\u225?lne okno "Vytvori\u357? hypertextov\u253? odkaz". V opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade sa zobraz\u237? mod\u225?lne okno, ale mo\u382?n\u225? URL v schr\u225?nke sa zoh\u318?adn\u237? a vypln\u237? sa do pr\u237?slu\u353?n\u233?ho po\u318?a.\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Ak vykon\u225?te Vlo\u382?i\u357? URL \b s u\u382? ozna\u269?en\u253?m odkazom\b0  alebo \b s kurzorom vo vn\u250?tri odkazu\b0 , tento odkaz sa ozna\u269?\u237? (ak nebol) a okno "Create Hyperlink" pon\u250?kne polia URL a Text predvyplnen\u233? hodnotami existuj\u250?ceho hypertextov\u233?ho odkazu. Ak zmen\u237?te ak\u250?ko\u318?vek hodnotu a stla\u269?\u237?te OK, odkaz nahrad\u237?te nov\u253?m.\par


\pard\li360\sb60\sa60\b Tip\b0 : T\u253?mto sp\u244?sobom m\u244?\u382?ete vidie\u357? intern\u250? URL odkazov KNT. (Od verzie 1.9.3 sa intern\u225? URL odkazov KNT zobrazuje aj z akcie Prompt, v dial\u243?govom okne Choose Action for Hyperlink)\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ke\u271? do po\u318?a URL zad\u225?te alebo vlo\u382?\u237?te text a potom vyberiete pole Text (napr\u237?klad kl\u225?vesom TAB) alebo tla\u269?idlo OK, obsah \b po\u318?a URL \b0 bude \b skop\u237?rovan\u253? do po\u318?a Text, ak je pr\u225?zdne\b0 . Cel\u253? text zostane v poli Text ozna\u269?en\u253?, aby sa dal \u318?ahko nahradi\u357? alebo odstr\u225?ni\u357?.\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720 Ak zist\u237?, \u382?e vklad\u225?te e-mailov\u250? adresu, automaticky pred adresu (URL) prid\u225? sch\u233?mu URL \ldblquote mailto:\rdblquote .\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb60 Pri vykonan\u237? Vlo\u382?i\u357? URL v pozn\u225?mke s \u269?ist\u253?m textom sa pod\u318?a mo\u382?nosti pou\u382?ije form\u225?t ako 'text' (url). Napr\u237?klad: 'URL Title' ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK www.URL.com }}{\fldrslt{www.URL.com}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 D\u225? sa pou\u382?i\u357? na vlo\u382?enie \b odkazov na lok\u225?lne s\u250?bory alebo prie\u269?inky\b0 , hoci existuj\u250? aj in\u233?, jednoduch\u353?ie sp\u244?soby ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|11736|0|9"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}}\f0\fs20 ). \par


\pard\par

\tab\par

\ul Pozn\u225?mka\ulnone : \par

V s\u250?\u269?asnosti "Insert URL..." neumo\u382?\u328?uje necha\u357? pole URL pr\u225?zdne. Ak toto pole vyma\u382?ete v existuj\u250?cej URL (alebo v novej URL) a stla\u269?\u237?te OK, akcia sa ignoruje. \par

Tie\u382? si v\u353?imnite, \u382?e odstr\u225?nenie po\u318?a URL z dial\u243?gov\u233?ho okna {\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|20229|0|11"}}{\fldrslt{V\u253?ber akcie pre hyperodkaz}}}}}\kerning36\f0\fs20\lang3082  vyma\u382?e hypertextov\u253? odkaz aj s textom.\par

Ak potrebujete odstr\u225?ni\u357? URL a zachova\u357? text hypertextov\u233?ho odkazu, jednoducho ho v editore ozna\u269?te, stla\u269?te kop\u237?rovanie (Ctr+C) a potom vlo\u382?te v textovom re\u382?ime (Ctr+Shift+V). V pr\u237?pade potreby m\u244?\u382?ete na kop\u237?rovanie form\u225?tu pou\u382?i\u357? aj tla\u269?idlo \v\'11I84\'12\kerning0\v0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:84,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {84_Format_23.png}}}}\kerning36  (alebo in\u253? pr\u237?kaz form\u225?tu).\kerning0\lang1033\par

\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs22\'11B9\'12\v0 Vkladanie odkazov na lok\u225?lne s\u250?bory\b0\par

\fs20\par


\pard\sa180 Okrem p\u237?sania alebo vkladania s predponou {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:// }}{\fldrslt{file://}}}}}\f0\fs20  alebo pou\u382?itia Vlo\u382?i\u357? URL, ako je uveden\u233?, m\u244?\u382?ete odkazy na lok\u225?lne s\u250?bory vlo\u382?i\u357? dvoma \u271?al\u353?\u237?mi sp\u244?sobmi:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa80 Pou\u382?it\u237?m {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<112|2442|0|8"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?i\u357? | Odkaz na s\u250?bor...}}}}}\f0\fs20 , ktor\u233? v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? vybra\u357? s\u250?bor v mod\u225?lnom okne prehliadan\u237?m v\u225?\u353?ho s\u250?borov\u233?ho syst\u233?mu.\par


\pard\li360\sa80 Pozn\u225?mka: T\u253?mto sp\u244?sobom m\u244?\u382?ete vklada\u357? s\u250?bory (v\u382?dy jeden), ale nie prie\u269?inky. M\u244?\u382?ete vybra\u357? s\u250?bor v danom prie\u269?inku a potom upravi\u357? odkaz odstr\u225?nen\u237?m \u269?asti s n\u225?zvom s\u250?boru...\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa80 Pou\u382?it\u237?m \b pretiahnutia a pustenia\b0\par


\pard\li360 Jeden alebo viac \ul s\u250?borov alebo prie\u269?inkov\ulnone  m\u244?\u382?ete pretiahnu\u357? do panela stromu alebo priamo do panela editora. Druh\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje dynamicky meni\u357? poz\u237?ciu kurzora, kam sa odkaz vlo\u382?\u237?.\par


\pard\li360\sb80 Ak pretiahnete iba prie\u269?inok (prie\u269?inky), odkaz (odkazy) sa vytvoria automaticky, bez \u382?iadosti o potvrdenie.\par

Ak pretiahnete jeden alebo viac s\u250?borov, zobraz\u237? sa \b okno Import\b0 . V\u382?dy v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? vytvori\u357? odkaz (alebo hypertextov\u253? odkaz) na s\u250?bor (s\u250?bory) a tie\u382? m\u244?\u382?e tieto s\u250?bory importova\u357? r\u244?znymi sp\u244?sobmi v z\u225?vislosti od v\u253?beru:\par

\par


\pard\li720\sb80\v\'11I125\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:125,359,245"}}{\fldrslt {125_Clipb_12ene.png}}}}\lang1033\par


\pard\li360\sb80\par

Predvolene vybran\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? bude "Create hyperlink to file" okrem:\par


\pard\li720 - s\u250?bory .knt alebo .kne: Otvori\u357? s\u250?bor v KeyNote\par

- Obr\u225?zkov\u233? s\u250?bory: Vlo\u382?i\u357? obsah na poz\u237?ciu kurzora ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|12491|0|19"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\par

\par

\b Odkazy na s\u250?bory/prie\u269?inky, relat\u237?vne alebo absol\u250?tne\par


\pard\sb100\b0 KeyNote predvolene vytv\u225?ra odkazy (alebo hypertextov\u233? odkazy) s absol\u250?tnou cestou. Je mo\u382?n\u233? vytvori\u357? dva typy relat\u237?vnych ciest.\par


\pard\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360 Odkazy relat\u237?vne k aktu\u225?lnemu s\u250?boru .knt\par


\pard\sb100 KeyNote umo\u382?\u328?uje vklada\u357? odkazy s cestami relat\u237?vnymi k prie\u269?inku, v ktorom sa nach\u225?dza aktu\u225?lny s\u250?bor .knt:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Pri vkladan\u237? pomocou pretiahnutia a pustenia m\u244?\u382?ete v okne Import za\u269?iarknu\u357? pol\u237?\u269?ko "\ul Relative\ulnone "\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Pri prid\u225?van\u237? prie\u269?inkov sa odkazy pridaj\u250? bez v\u253?zvy. Ak chcete vlo\u382?i\u357? relat\u237?vny odkaz, po\u269?as p\u250?\u353?\u357?ania stla\u269?te \cf5\b Alt\cf0\b0 \par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Podobne pri prid\u225?van\u237? s\u250?borov pomocou {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<112|2442|0|8"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?i\u357? | Odkaz na s\u250?bor...}}}}}\f0\fs20  stla\u269?te v dial\u243?govom okne \cf5\b Alt+Open\cf0\b0 \par


\pard\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart2\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360 Odkazy relat\u237?vne k s\u250?boru keynote.exe\par


\pard Odkazy relat\u237?vne k prie\u269?inku, v ktorom je KeyNote nain\u353?talovan\u253? (kde sa nach\u225?dza .exe), m\u244?\u382?ete vytvori\u357? \u250?pravou URL a pou\u382?it\u237?m \b ">>"\b0 , ako ukazuj\u250? nasleduj\u250?ce pr\u237?klady:\par


\pard\sb100 Ak je keynote.exe nain\u353?talovan\u253? v "C:\\APL\\KeyNote NF" a chcete vytvori\u357? relat\u237?vny odkaz na "C:\\APL\\KeyNote NF\\Profiles\\Profiles.txt"\par


\pard m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357?: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///>>Profiles\\\\Profiles.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///>>Profiles\\Profiles.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20   (alebo {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///>>\\\\Profiles\\\\Profiles.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///>>\\Profiles\\Profiles.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) (alebo jednoducho nap\u237?sa\u357? ">>Profiles\\Profiles.txt" do po\u318?a URL hypertextov\u233?ho odkazu)\par


\pard\sb100 Ak chcete odk\u225?za\u357? na "C:\\APL\\Notepad++\\Change.log" ako na cestu relat\u237?vnu k prie\u269?inku s in\u353?tal\u225?ciou KeyNote: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///>>..\\\\Notepad++\\\\Change.log }}{\fldrslt{file:///>>..\\Notepad++\\Change.log}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\sa180\par


\pard Pozn\u225?mky:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Dve mo\u382?nosti INI, \b URLFileEncodeName\b0   a \b URLFilePrefNoHyp\b0 , ktor\u233? m\u244?\u382?u ur\u269?i\u357?, \u269?i sa odkazy na s\u250?bory a prie\u269?inky vytv\u225?raj\u250? s hypertextov\u253?mi odkazmi alebo bez nich (teda iba s {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:/// }}{\fldrslt{file:///}}}}}\f0\fs20  ) \par


\pard\li360 Existuj\u250? aj \u271?al\u353?ie mo\u382?nosti INI zahrnut\u233? v skor\u253?ch verzi\u225?ch KeyNote, v\u228?\u269?\u353?inou ur\u269?en\u233? pre XP (v s\u250?\u269?asnosti nie je potrebn\u233? meni\u357? ich predvolen\u233? hodnoty): \ul URLFileNoPrefix\ulnone , \ul URLFileQuoteSpaces\ulnone , \ul URLFileDecodeSpaces\ulnone .\par


\pard\li360\sb80 Viac v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<95|2014|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti konfigur\u225?cie... | Akcie}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak\u253?ko\u318?vek druh relat\u237?vneho odkazu sa d\u225? vytvori\u357? p\u237?san\u237?m v editore alebo \u250?pravou existuj\u250?ceho. Pam\u228?tajte, \u382?e k\u253?m absol\u250?tne cesty ako {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file://c:\\\\readme.txt }}{\fldrslt{file://c:\\readme.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20  (s dvoma lom\u237?tkami) bud\u250? rozpoznan\u233?, ekvivalentn\u225? relat\u237?vna cesta nie: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///foo.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///foo.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20 " je platn\u225?, "{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file://foo.txt }}{\fldrslt{file://foo.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20 " nie je. [ {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File_URI_scheme }}{\fldrslt{http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File_URI_scheme}}}}}\f0\fs20  ]\par


\pard\sa180\par

\par


\pard\b\v\fs22\'11B12\'12\v0 Pou\u382?\u237?vanie parametrov s hypertextov\u253?mi odkazmi\par

\b0\fs20\par


\pard\sa180 Hypertextov\u233? odkazy m\u244?\u382?u pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? parametre a spr\u225?va\u357? sa podobne ako {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<70|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Ob\u318?\u250?ben\u233?}}}}}\f0\fs20 . T\u253?mto sp\u244?sobom si m\u244?\u382?ete usporiada\u357? \i ob\u318?\u250?ben\u233? polo\u382?ky\i0  v pozn\u225?mkach pod\u318?a potreby. \par


\pard\sa60 Na umo\u382?nenie pou\u382?\u237?vania parametrov v hypertextov\u253?ch odkazoch boli pridan\u233? dve mo\u382?nosti INI:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<104|9062|0|10"}}{\fldrslt{URLFileSepParams}}}}}\f0\fs20 , predvolene definovan\u225? ako '##', umo\u382?\u328?uje identifikova\u357? za\u269?iatok \u269?asti s parametrami.\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa180 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<104|9614|0|11"}}{\fldrslt{URLFileSpaceInParams}}}}}\f0\fs20 , predvolene definovan\u225? ako '+', umo\u382?\u328?uje pou\u382?\u237?vanie medzier v hypertextov\u253?ch odkazoch pozn\u225?mok s \u269?ist\u253?m textom.\par


\pard\sa60\b Pr\u237?klad\b0 . Nasleduj\u250?ci pr\u237?kaz:\par


\pard\sa180      \cf6 E:\\Output\\bin\\keynote.exe  Profiles\\F9\\keynote.ini -dnd "E:\\Path\\With spaces\\myFile.knt" -title"MY TITLE"\cf0\par


\pard\sa100 M\u244?\u382?e by\u357? vlo\u382?en\u253? ako hypertextov\u253? odkaz RTF pozn\u225?mky pomocou dial\u243?gov \cf7\b Insert|URL\cf0\b0  a \cf7\b Choose Action for Hyperlink\cf0\b0 , zadan\u237?m:\par


\pard      \cf8 E:\\Output\\bin\\keynote.exe ## Profiles\\F9\\keynote.ini -dnd "E:\\Path\\With spaces\\myFile.knt" -title"MY TITLE"\cf0\par


\pard\sa20      \cf8 E:\\Output\\bin\\keynote.exe##Profiles\\F9\\keynote.ini -dnd "E:\\Path\\With spaces\\myFile.knt" -title"MY TITLE"\cf0\par


\pard\sb80\sa140 alebo napr. v pr\u237?pade, \u382?e ako odde\u318?ova\u269? parametrov pou\u382?\u237?vate '<=':\par


\pard\sa100      \cf8 E:\\Output\\bin\\keynote.exe <= Profiles\\F9\\keynote.ini -dnd "E:\\Path\\With spaces\\myFile.knt" -title"MY TITLE"\cf0\par


\pard\sb120\sa100\b Pozn\u225?mky:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa140\b0 Na uzavretie parametrov m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? \u250?vodzovky ("), v\u353?imnite si v\u353?ak, \u382?e sa v URL interne preved\u250? na jednoduch\u233? \u250?vodzovky. Ak URL zad\u225?vate \u8222?ru\u269?ne\u8220? v editore bez pomoci dial\u243?gov \cf7\b Vlo\u382?i\u357?|URL\cf0\b0  alebo \cf7\b Vyberte akciu pre hypertextov\u253? odkaz\cf0\b0 , mus\u237?te namiesto " nap\u237?sa\u357? '' (dve jednoduch\u233? \u250?vodzovky).\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa180 Medzery m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? v \u269?asti s parametrami, a to aj bezprostredne za znakmi definovan\u253?mi v \cf7\b URLFileSepParams\cf0\b0 . Medzery pred t\u253?mito znakmi v\u353?ak m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? iba v hypertextov\u253?ch odkazoch pozn\u225?mok RTF.\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb120\sa100 V pozn\u225?mke s \b \u269?ist\u253?m textom \b0 nem\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? medzery pred odde\u318?ova\u269?om parametrov. Napr.:\par


\pard\li360\sa20 OK:    \cf8 E:\\Output\\bin\\keynote.exe<= Profiles\\F9\\keynote.ini -dnd "E:\\Path\\With spaces\\myFile.knt" -title"MY TITLE"\cf0\par

ZLE:  \cf8 E:\\Output\\bin\\keynote.exe <= Profiles\\F9\\keynote.ini -dnd "E:\\Path\\With spaces\\myFile.knt" -title"MY TITLE"\cf0\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb120\sa60 Po zadan\u237? v dial\u243?goch sa vy\u353?\u353?ie uveden\u225? URL vlo\u382?\u237? a v pozn\u225?mke s \u269?ist\u253?m textom bude vidite\u318?n\u225? takto:\par


\pard\sa180    <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///E:\\\\Output\\\\bin\\\\keynote.exe<=+Profiles\\\\F9\\\\keynote.ini+-dnd+''E:\\\\Path\\\\With spaces\\\\myFile.knt''+-title''MY+TITLE''"}}{\fldrslt{file:///E:\\Output\\bin\\keynote.exe<=+Profiles\\F9\\keynote.ini+-dnd+''E:\\Path\\With spaces\\myFile.knt''+-title''MY+TITLE''}}}}}\f0\fs20 >\par


\pard\sb80 V\u353?imnite si, \u382?e tento v\u253?sledn\u253? re\u357?azec m\u244?\u382?ete nap\u237?sa\u357? priamo v editore \u269?ist\u233?ho textu, ale v pozn\u225?mke RTF to nie je mo\u382?n\u233?, preto\u382?e obsahuje medzery. Medzery sa v hypertextov\u253?ch odkazoch pozn\u225?mok RTF z\u225?merne neupravuj\u250?, tak\u382?e znak(y) definovan\u233? v URLFileSpaceInParams m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? v ktorejko\u318?vek \u269?asti parametrov v hypertextov\u253?ch odkazoch pozn\u225?mok RTF.\par


\pard\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs22\'11B5\'12\v0 Vkladanie intern\u253?ch odkazov Keynote (odkazov KNT)\b0\par

\fs20\par

Ke\u271?\u382?e ide o \u353?peci\u225?lny druh odkazu, vlo\u382?enie odkazu KeyNote vy\u382?aduje dva kroky: ozna\u269?enie cie\u318?a, teda miesta, na ktor\u233? odkaz presko\u269?\u237?, a potom vlo\u382?enie odkazu na inom mieste.\par

\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360 V editore umiestnite kurzor alebo kliknite na miesto, na ktor\u233? chcete vytvori\u357? odkaz. Po kliknut\u237? na odkaz sa sem presko\u269?\u237?.\par


\pard\li360\sb60 V ponuke vyberte Vlo\u382?i\u357? | {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<112|2609|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{Ozna\u269?i\u357? umiestnenie KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 , alebo jednoducho stla\u269?te \cf5\b Ctrl+F6\cf0\b0\line\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart2\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360 Prejdite na miesto, kde sa m\u225? odkaz zobrazi\u357?. M\u244?\u382?e to by\u357? \u318?ubovo\u318?n\u233? miesto v \u318?ubovo\u318?nej pozn\u225?mke, \ul v pr\u225?ve otvorenom s\u250?bore\ulnone  alebo v \ul inom s\u250?bore\ulnone  (mus\u237?te ho otvori\u357? v aktu\u225?lnej in\u353?tancii KeyNote a najprv zatvori\u357? u\u382? otvoren\u253? s\u250?bor)\par


\pard\li360\sb60 V ponuke vyberte Vlo\u382?i\u357? | {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<112|2900|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?i\u357? umiestnenie KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 , alebo jednoducho stla\u269?te \cf5\b Shift+F6\par


\pard\li360\sb80\cf0 Tip\b0 : Ak t\u250?to akciu vykon\u225?te \b s vybran\u253?m textom\b0 , KeyNote tento text prevedie na intern\u253? odkaz KeyNote smeruj\u250?ci na vybran\u253? cie\u318?. \par

* \b M\u244?\u382?ete dokonca vybra\u357? \u318?ubovo\u318?n\u253? existuj\u250?ci odkaz\b0 : prevedie sa na intern\u253? odkaz zobrazuj\u250?ci aktu\u225?lne vybran\u253? text. (M\u244?\u382?ete tie\u382? pou\u382?i\u357? fragment odkazu tak, \u382?e ho \f2\emdash\f0 rozdel\u237?te\f2\emdash\f0 , ale nie s\u250?\u269?asne fragment a text pred hypertextov\u253?m odkazom alebo za n\u237?m)\par


\pard\li360\sb60\par


\pard\sb60 Pozn\u225?mky:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\ul Odkazy KNT bud\u250? predvolene \b viazan\u233? na zna\u269?ky\b0 , nielen na poz\u237?ciu kurzora.\ulnone\par


\pard\li360 Do verzie 1.8.0 obsahovali odkazy KNT okrem prie\u269?inka a pozn\u225?mky (uzla) iba poz\u237?ciu kurzora. Ak sa pozn\u225?mka upravila, absol\u250?tna poz\u237?cia, na ktor\u250? sme ukazovali, sa mohla zmeni\u357?, a preto n\u225?\u353? odkaz u\u382? nesmeroval na zam\u253?\u353?\u318?an\u233? miesto.\par


\pard\li360\sb100 Od verzie 1.8.0 KeyNote pri ozna\u269?ovan\u237? odkazu KNT (\cf5\b Ctrl+F6\cf0\b0 ) vlo\u382?\u237? ved\u318?a textu ur\u269?en\u233?ho ako cie\u318? mal\u250? \b skryt\u250? zna\u269?ku\b0 . Pri vkladan\u237? odkazu (\cf5\b Shift+F6\cf0\b0 ) bude nov\u253? hypertextov\u253? odkaz odkazova\u357? na vytvoren\u250? z\u225?lo\u382?ku a \b n\u225?jde ju, aj ke\u271? sa cel\u253? text medzit\u253?m presunul\b0  (v r\u225?mci toho ist\u233?ho prie\u269?inka/uzla). Ak by sa zna\u269?ka odstr\u225?nila, pou\u382?ila by sa poz\u237?cia kurzora, ako predt\u253?m.\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720 \u268?\u237?sla skryt\u253?ch zna\u269?iek za\u269?\u237?naj\u250? od 1 a s\u250? \u353?pecifick\u233? pre ka\u382?d\u253? uzol\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Pri ozna\u269?ovan\u237? cie\u318?ov\u233?ho bodu KeyNote znova pou\u382?ije existuj\u250?cu skryt\u250? zna\u269?ku, ak nejak\u225? existuje. N\u225?poveda v stavovom riadku navy\u353?e zobraz\u237? \u269?\u237?slo novo vytvorenej (alebo znova pou\u382?itej) skrytej zna\u269?ky ako referenciu. \par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Pam\u228?tajte, \u382?e pomocou pr\u237?kazu Sp\u228?\u357? m\u244?\u382?ete odstr\u225?ni\u357? nov\u250? skryt\u250? zna\u269?ku vytvoren\u250? omylom. \par


\pard\li720 Napr.: "\i Aktu\u225?lne miesto ozna\u269?en\u233? [Zna\u269?ka: 1]  (Sp\u228?\u357? odstr\u225?ni nov\u233? skryt\u233? zna\u269?ky)\i0 "\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720 Pri vkladan\u237? odkazu KNT (Shift+F6) zobraz\u237? \u271?al\u353?ia n\u225?poveda v stavovom riadku \u269?\u237?slo skrytej zna\u269?ky, na ktor\u250? odkaz smeruje (ak nejak\u225? existuje)\par


\pard\li720 Napr.: "\i Miesto vlo\u382?en\u233? [Zna\u269?ka: 1]\i0 "\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\b Tip\b0 : Ak potrebujete ukazova\u357? iba na za\u269?iatok prie\u269?inka alebo pozn\u225?mky (uzla), mali by ste cie\u318? ozna\u269?i\u357? od \u250?pln\u233?ho za\u269?iatku dan\u233?ho uzla alebo pozn\u225?mky (poz\u237?cia kurzora = 0). T\u253?m sa pri cieli nevlo\u382?\u237? \u382?iadna skryt\u225? zna\u269?ka a vytvoren\u253? odkaz bude v\u382?dy smerova\u357? na t\u250?to poz\u237?ciu 0.\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Pozn\u225?mka: Odkazy KNT vytvoren\u233? star\u353?\u237?mi verziami neobsahuj\u250? \u382?iadnu zna\u269?ku, iba poz\u237?ciu kurzora, a preto maj\u250? st\u225?le uveden\u233? obmedzenie.\par


\pard\li360\sb40 Pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|22294|0|6"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie odkazov KNT vytvoren\u253?ch vo verzii 1.8.0 a nov\u353?ej zo star\u353?\u237?ch verzi\u237?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 Od verzie 1.8.2 KeyNote pri \b preskoku\b0  na intern\u253? odkaz KNT \b zobraz\u237? cie\u318? na prvom riadku\b0  editora.\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb60 Pomocou INI volieb \b RelativeKNTLinks\b0  a \b CaretInKNTLinks\b0  m\u244?\u382?ete riadi\u357?, ako sa intern\u233? odkazy zobrazuj\u250?, ke\u271? pri vkladan\u237? odkazu nie je vybran\u253? \u382?iadny text ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<91|2470|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Viac}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Pomocou form\u225?tu odkazov KNT m\u244?\u382?ete ukazova\u357? aj na prie\u269?inky, nielen na uzly (teda bez zmeny aktu\u225?lne vybran\u233?ho uzla). Pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|19873|0|4"}}{\fldrslt{Form\u225?t intern\u233?ho hyperodkazu}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

\par

\b\v\fs22\'11B13\'12\v0 Zmena farby odkazov\b0\par

\fs20\par

Po\u269?iato\u269?n\u225? farba odkazov je po vytvoren\u237? modr\u225?, ale mo\u382?no ju \u318?ubovo\u318?ne zmeni\u357?. Je mo\u382?n\u233? meni\u357? farbu aj in\u233? \u353?t\u253?ly form\u225?tovania: tu\u269?n\u233? p\u237?smo, kurz\u237?vu, farbu zv\u253?raznenia at\u271?.\par


\pard\sb160\sa100\b Pozn\u225?mky:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\b0 Na odkazoch vytvoren\u253?ch automaticky editorom ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|3027|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{pou\u382?\u237?vanie rozpozn\u225?vania URL}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) je mo\u382?n\u233? priamo pou\u382?i\u357? form\u225?ty, ako je tu\u269?n\u233? p\u237?smo, kurz\u237?va alebo farba zv\u253?raznenia, ale na zmenu farby textu hypertextov\u233?ho odkazu je potrebn\u233? najprv v\u253?slovne pou\u382?i\u357? atrib\u250?t pod\u269?iarknutia (napr. pomocou \v\'11I64\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:64,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {64_Format_03.png}}}}\lang1033 tla\u269?idla).\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 Pokia\u318? sa farba odkazu v\u253?slovne nezmen\u237?, zobrazuje sa dynamickou farbou prisp\u244?sobenou jasu farby pozadia editora. Toto prisp\u244?sobenie farby vykon\u225?va editor automaticky a jeho cie\u318?om je zabezpe\u269?i\u357? primeran\u253? kontrast. Ak m\u225? teda editor biele alebo svetl\u233? pozadie, odkaz sa zobraz\u237? modr\u253?, pri\u269?om tento modr\u253? odtie\u328? sa m\u244?\u382?e mierne l\u237?\u353?i\u357?. Pod ur\u269?itou hodnotou jasu sa odkaz zobraz\u237? biely. To sa stane napr\u237?klad vtedy, ak je pozadie editora modr\u233?.\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Ke\u271? sa farba odkazu raz zmen\u237?, zostane pevne dan\u225? bez oh\u318?adu na jas farby pozadia editora.\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}V s\u250?vislosti s vy\u353?\u353?ie uveden\u253?m: vo \b verzi\u225?ch pred 2.1.5\b0  sa odkazy vytv\u225?rali s \ul v\u253?slovne nastavenou modrou farbou\ulnone . T\u253?m sa vypnulo automatick\u233? prisp\u244?sobenie farby op\u237?san\u233? vy\u353?\u353?ie. Sp\u244?sob, ak\u253?m sa t\u225?to modr\u225? farba aplikovala, navy\u353?e spolu so zjavnou chybou v ovl\u225?dacom prvku RichEdit sp\u244?sobil, \u382?e zmena farby odkazov bola mimoriadne n\u225?ro\u269?n\u225?: hoci sa nov\u233? nastavenie farby prejavilo, pri ukladan\u237? pozn\u225?mky sa ignorovalo (viac inform\u225?ci\u237? n\u225?jdete v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/issues/923"}}{\fldrslt{probl\u233?m #923}}}}}\f0\fs20\lang3082 ).\lang1033\par


\pard\li360\sb40\lang3082 Od verzie 2.1.5 odkazy nevynucuj\u250? \u382?iadnu farbu a umo\u382?\u328?uj\u250? dynamick\u233? prisp\u244?sobenie farby pod\u318?a jasu pozadia. Farbu t\u253?chto odkazov je tie\u382? mo\u382?n\u233? bez probl\u233?mov zmeni\u357? (a v tomto pr\u237?pade nie je potrebn\u233? vopred pou\u382?i\u357? atrib\u250?t pod\u269?iarknutia, ako je to nutn\u233? pri odkazoch odvoden\u253?ch editorom). \par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 Pribudla nov\u225? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<16|7188|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{vo\u318?ba pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadka}}}}}\f0\fs20 , ktor\u225? prev\u225?dza v\u353?etky existuj\u250?ce odkazy na nov\u253? form\u225?t.\lang1033\par


\pard\par

\par

\par

\cf3\b\v\fs26\'11B10\'12\v0 Aktiv\u225?cia odkazov\b0\par

\cf0\fs20\par

Ka\u382?d\u253? odkaz pridan\u253? vn\u250?torn\u253?m rozpozn\u225?van\u237?m URL v editore alebo v\u253?slovn\u253?m vlo\u382?en\u237?m hypertextov\u233?ho odkazu mo\u382?no aktivova\u357? rovnak\u253?m sp\u244?sobom.\par


\pard\sb100 Predvolene sa odkazy aktivuj\u250? jedin\u253?m kliknut\u237?m my\u353?ou:\par


\pard\li120\sb80\cf5\b Kliknutie \cf0\b0 alebo \cf5\b kliknutie prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom\tab\cf0\b0 V\u253?zva\par


\pard\li120\cf5\b Ctrl+kliknutie \tab\tab\cf0\b0 Otvori\u357?\par

\cf5\b Alt+kliknutie \tab\tab\cf0\b0 Kop\u237?rova\u357? URL do schr\u225?nky\par


\pard\par

M\u244?\u382?ete nastavi\u357?, ak\u250? \b akciu\b0  m\u225? KeyNote vykona\u357?, ke\u271? na hypertextov\u253? odkaz \cf5\b kliknete\cf0\b0  alebo \cf5\b kliknete s kl\u225?vesou Ctrl\cf0\b0 . K dispoz\u237?cii s\u250? dve mo\u382?nosti rozba\u318?ovacieho zoznamu, \u8222?\b Pri kliknut\u237? na URL\b0 \u8220? a \u8222?\b Ctrl + kliknutie\b0 \u8220?, na karte {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<95|1059|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{akcie URL}}}}}\f0\fs20  (v dial\u243?govom okne Mo\u382?nosti konfigur\u225?cie... | Akcie)\par


\pard\sb40 Dostupn\u233? akcie s\u250?: \ul Otvori\u357?\ulnone , \ul Otvori\u357? v novom okne\ulnone , \ul Kop\u237?rova\u357? do schr\u225?nky\ulnone , \ul Obidve (otvori\u357? a kop\u237?rova\u357?)\ulnone , \ul V\u253?zva\ulnone , \ul Nerobi\u357? ni\u269?\ulnone , \ul Vytvori\u357? alebo upravi\u357?\ulnone\par


\pard\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Akcie vykon\u225?van\u233? pri \cf5 kliknut\u237? prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom\cf0  a \cf5 Alt+kliknut\u237?\cf0  nemo\u382?no konfigurova\u357?.\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Odkaz m\u244?\u382?ete aktivova\u357? aj z kl\u225?vesnice: umiestnite kurzor do textu hypertextov\u233?ho odkazu a potom stla\u269?te \cf5\b Enter\cf0\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}KeyNote nebude rozpozn\u225?va\u357? kliknutia na URL v pozn\u225?mkach patriacich do prie\u269?inkov, pre ktor\u233? ste vypli mo\u382?nos\u357? \b Rozpozna\u357? a zv\u253?razni\u357? URL\b0  v dial\u243?govom okne {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<31|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Vlastnosti prie\u269?inka}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}M\u244?\u382?ete povoli\u357? mo\u382?nos\u357? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<95|1491|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{Minimalizova\u357? KeyNote pri spusten\u237? URL}}}}}\f0\fs20 , inak sa stav okna KeyNote nezmen\u237?.\par


\pard\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 V pr\u237?pade intern\u253?ch \ul odkazov KNT\ulnone , ktor\u233? ukazuj\u250? na miesta v \ul s\u250?boroch in\u253?ch ako aktu\u225?lne otvoren\u253?\ulnone , budete ho m\u244?c\u357? otvori\u357? v aktu\u225?lnej in\u353?tancii KeyNote, pri\u269?om sa najprv zatvor\u237? u\u382? otvoren\u253? s\u250?bor, alebo v inej in\u353?tancii. Odkaz sa otvor\u237? v novej in\u353?tancii, ak:\par


\pard\li360\sb80  - je povolen\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?Otvori\u357? extern\u233? odkazy KNT v inej in\u353?tancii\u8220? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<95|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{mo\u382?nos\u357?}}}}}\f0\fs20 , alebo\par


\pard\li360  -  odkaz URL bol aktivovan\u253? akciou \u8222?Otvori\u357? v novom okne\u8220?\par


\pard\li360\sb80  (Plat\u237? to aj pre odkazy v odkladacom priestore (scratchpad))\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\b\v\'11B11\'12\v0 Akcia \u8222?V\u253?zva\u8220?\b0  otvor\u237? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno \kerning36\b\lang3082 V\u253?ber akcie pre hypertextov\u253? odkaz\b0 \par


\pard\li360\kerning0\v\lang1033\'11I124\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:124,607,173"}}{\fldrslt {124_Clipb_09ene.png}}}}\lang1033\par


\pard\par


\pard\li360\sb80 Ak je vykonanou akciou \u8222?V\u253?zva\u8220? a odkaz ukazuje na s\u250?bor ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:// }}{\fldrslt{file://}}}}}\f0\fs20  alebo ekvivalent), KeyNote v\u225?s pred otvoren\u237?m s\u250?boru nepo\u382?iada o potvrdenie, ak ste povolili mo\u382?nos\u357? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<95|1641|0|4"}}{\fldrslt{Sp\u250?\u353?\u357?a\u357? URL file:// bez v\u253?zvy}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 M\u244?\u382?ete \b otvori\u357? webov\u233? odkazy\b0  (http, https, www) v \b novom okne prehliada\u269?a\b0  namiesto okna, ktor\u233? je pr\u225?ve otvoren\u233? (ako nov\u225? karta), pou\u382?it\u237?m akcie \u8222?Otvori\u357? v nov\u253?ch okn\u225?ch\u8220? namiesto \u8222?Otvori\u357?\u8220?.\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sb80 KeyNote \u353?tandardne pou\u382?ije \b predvolen\u253? webov\u253? prehliada\u269? syst\u233?mu\b0 , ale m\u244?\u382?ete nastavi\u357? konkr\u233?tny prehliada\u269? v Konfigur\u225?cii {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<103|766|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti | Pokro\u269?il\u233? | In\u233?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 Niekedy sa pri kliknut\u237? na odkaz na s\u250?bor alebo adres\u225?r ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:// }}{\fldrslt{file://}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) m\u244?\u382?e zobrazi\u357? chybov\u233? hl\u225?senie. Naj\u269?astej\u353?ie je to \ldblquote K\u243?d chyby 2: ....\u8220?. Znamen\u225? to, \u382?e s\u250?bor nebolo mo\u382?n\u233? n\u225?js\u357? alebo k nemu z\u237?ska\u357? pr\u237?stup: s\u250?bor pravdepodobne neexistuje, bol premenovan\u253? alebo presunut\u253? na in\u233? miesto.\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sb80 Pri otv\u225?ran\u237? s\u250?boru alebo prie\u269?inka priamo kliknut\u237?m, ke\u271? je nastaven\u225? akcia \u8222?V\u253?zva\u8220? z d\u244?vodu povolenej mo\u382?nosti {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<95|1641|0|4"}}{\fldrslt{Sp\u250?\u353?\u357?a\u357? URL file:// bez v\u253?zvy}}}}}\f0\fs20 , sa v pr\u237?pade nen\u225?jdenia namiesto samotnej chyby zobraz\u237? formul\u225?r \u8222?V\u253?ber akcie pre hypertextov\u253? odkaz\u8220?.\par


\pard\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ka\u382?d\u253? prechod z odkazu KNT vygeneruje \u8222?hist\u243?riu\u8220? (viac v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<39|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mechanizmus hist\u243?rie navig\u225?cie}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb100\ul Akcia \u8222?Vytvori\u357? alebo upravi\u357?\u8220?\ulnone  zmen\u237? ka\u382?d\u253? existuj\u250?ci odkaz (\u269?i u\u382? je alebo nie je hypertextov\u253?m odkazom) a nahrad\u237? ho hypertextov\u253?m odkazom, v ktorom sa aktu\u225?lny vidite\u318?n\u253? text ignoruje a berie sa do \u250?vahy iba URL. To spolu so skuto\u269?nos\u357?ou, \u382?e ovl\u225?dac\u237? prvok RTF automaticky zjednodu\u353?uje tie hypertextov\u233? odkazy, ktor\u233? mo\u382?no pova\u382?ova\u357? za jednoduch\u233? URL, vedie k z\u225?men\u225?m, ako s\u250? nasleduj\u250?ce:\par


\pard\li360 <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file://C:\\\\APL\\\\KeyNote NF\\\\Profiles\\\\F9\\\\scratch.rtf"}}{\fldrslt{file://C:\\APL\\KeyNote NF\\Profiles\\F9\\scratch.rtf}}}}}\f0\fs20 > \tab\tab\tab\tab -> {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///C:\\\\APL\\\\KeyNote NF\\\\Profiles\\\\F9\\\\scratch.rtf"}}{\fldrslt{C:\\APL\\KeyNote NF\\Profiles\\F9\\scratch.rtf}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///myfile.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20  \tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab -> {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///myfile.txt"}}{\fldrslt{myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20   \par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///E:\\\\Test\\\\myfile.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///E:\\Test\\myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20  \tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab -> {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///E:\\\\Test\\\\myfile.txt"}}{\fldrslt{E:\\Test\\myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file://myfile.txt"}}{\fldrslt{myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20  (vytvoren\u233? pomocou {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file://myfile.txt }}{\fldrslt{file://myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20  a \u8222?myfile.txt\u8220?) \tab\tab\tab -> {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file://myfile.txt }}{\fldrslt{file://myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///myfile.txt"}}{\fldrslt{myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20  (vytvoren\u233? pomocou {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///myfile.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20  (alebo myfile.txt) a \u8222?myfile.txt\u8220?) \tab -> {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///myfile.txt"}}{\fldrslt{myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20   (nezmenen\u233?)\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.myURL.com"}}{\fldrslt{myURL}}}}}\f0\fs20  \tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab -> {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.myURL.com }}{\fldrslt{http://www.myURL.com}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///E:\\\\Test\\\\myfile.txt"}}{\fldrslt{myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20  (vytvoren\u233? pomocou E:\\Test\\myfile.txt a \u8222?myfile.txt\u8220?)\tab\tab\tab -> {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///E:\\\\Test\\\\myfile.txt"}}{\fldrslt{E:\\Test\\myfile.txt}}}}}\f0\fs22\par


\pard\fs20\par

\par

\par

\cf3\b\v\fs26\'11B4\'12\v0 Form\u225?t intern\u233?ho odkazu KNT\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Aby bolo mo\u382?n\u233? prejs\u357? na vybran\u233? miesto v s\u250?bore, KeyNote pou\u382?\u237?va pre tak\u233?to odkazy \u353?peci\u225?lnu roz\u353?\u237?ren\u250? syntax. KeyNote vytv\u225?ra odkazy automaticky, tak\u382?e sa nemus\u237?te stara\u357? o \u353?peci\u225?lnu syntax \u8211? vyzer\u225? v\u353?ak takto:\par

\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 a)\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pnlcltr{\pntxta)}}
\fi-360\li360 odkaz na miesto v aktu\u225?lnom s\u250?bore KeyNote:\par


\pard\li360 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///*FolderID|NoteID|CursorPosition|SelectionLength|MarkID }}{\fldrslt{file:///*FolderID|NoteID|CursorPosition|SelectionLength|MarkID}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

alebo\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///<NoteGID|CursorPosition|SelectionLength|MarkID }}{\fldrslt{file:///<NoteGID|CursorPosition|SelectionLength|MarkID}}}}}\f0\fs20       (od verzie 1.9.3)\par


\pard\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 b)\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart2\pnlcltr{\pntxta)}}
\fi-360\li360 odkaz na miesto v inom s\u250?bore KeyNote:\par


\pard\li360 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///PathToKntFile.knt*FolderID|NoteID|CaretPosition|SelectionLength|MarkID }}{\fldrslt{file:///PathToKntFile.knt*FolderID|NoteID|CaretPosition|SelectionLength|MarkID}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

alebo\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///PathToKntFile.knt<NoteGID|CaretPosition|SelectionLength|MarkID }}{\fldrslt{file:///PathToKntFile.knt<NoteGID|CaretPosition|SelectionLength|MarkID}}}}}\f0\fs20    (od verzie 1.9.3)\par


\pard\par


\pard\li360 Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e od verzie 1.9.3 je pre intern\u233? odkazy KNT definovan\u253? nov\u253? predvolen\u253? form\u225?t zalo\u382?en\u253? na novom glob\u225?lnom identifik\u225?tore pozn\u225?mky (\b GID\b0 ), ktor\u253? jedine\u269?ne identifikuje pozn\u225?mku v s\u250?bore, a to nielen v prie\u269?inku. Pou\u382?itie GID a tohto nov\u233?ho form\u225?tu odkazov KNT umo\u382?\u328?uje, aby intern\u233? hypertextov\u233? odkazy ukazuj\u250?ce na pozn\u225?mku pokra\u269?ovali v pr\u225?ci aj vtedy, ke\u271? sa pozn\u225?mka presunie do in\u233?ho prie\u269?inka.\par


\pard\li360\sb80\ul D\u244?le\u382?it\u233?\ulnone : Ke\u271?\u382?e predch\u225?dzaj\u250?ce verzie nerozpozn\u225?vaj\u250? GID a tento nov\u253? form\u225?t, nemali by ste upravova\u357? s\u250?bor zmenen\u253? vo verzii 1.9.3  (alebo nov\u353?ej) v predch\u225?dzaj\u250?cej verzii. Viac inform\u225?ci\u237? v \u8222?Changes in 1.9.3 .01.txt\u8220?.\par


\pard\par

Napr. tento intern\u253? hypertextov\u253? odkaz na {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|3299|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Vkladanie odkazov}}}}}\f0\fs20  pou\u382?\u237?va nasleduj\u250?cu URL: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///<38|3299|0|1 }}{\fldrslt{file:///<38|3299|0|1}}}}}\f0\fs20   (ekvivalent k {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///*8|303|3299|0|1 }}{\fldrslt{file:///*8|303|3299|0|1}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\li360\sb60\b Tip\b0 : Pomocou \cf5 Alt+Click\cf0  na hypertextov\u253? odkaz m\u244?\u382?ete skop\u237?rova\u357? URL do schr\u225?nky\par


\pard\par


\pard\sb100 Zvy\u269?ajne neuvid\u237?te tieto URL, ale text, ktor\u253? je s nimi spojen\u253?, s v\u253?nimkou pr\u237?padu, ke\u271? vklad\u225?te intern\u233? hypertextov\u233? odkazy do pozn\u225?mky s \u269?ist\u253?m textom. KeyNote nedok\u225?\u382?e skry\u357? \u269?as\u357? s URL, a preto vlo\u382?\u237? intern\u233? hypertextov\u233? odkazy v tomto form\u225?te:\par


\pard\li360\sb100 \u8222?Hypertextov\u233? odkazy v KeyNote\u8220? ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///*8|303|2804|0|1 }}{\fldrslt{file:///*8|303|2804|0|1}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\li360\sb80\b Tip\b0 : Akcia \u8222?V\u253?zva\u8220? (napr. kliknutie prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom) otvor\u237? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno \ul V\u253?ber akcie pre hypertextov\u253? odkaz\ulnone , v ktorom uvid\u237?te \u250?pln\u250? cestu cie\u318?a.\par


\pard\li360\par

Ak URL zodpoved\u225? extern\u233?mu s\u250?boru alebo adres\u225?ru a text odkazu sa rovn\u225? URL (bez oh\u318?adu na predponu sch\u233?my URL), zobraz\u237? sa iba URL:\par


\pard\li720\sb100 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///E:\\\\readme.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///E:\\readme.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20     \par

namiesto:  \u8222?E:\\readme.txt\u8220? ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///E:\\\\readme.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///E:\\readme.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\par

\par

Vysvetlenie:\par

\par

\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx1969\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx8835 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa100 {\b{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:/// }}{\fldrslt{file:///}}}}}\f0\fs20\cell predpona sch\u233?my \u353?tandardnej URL\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx1969\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx8835 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa100\b PathToKntFile.knt\b0\cell \u250?pln\u225? cesta k s\u250?boru .KNT, na ktor\u253? odkaz ukazuje. Ak odkaz ukazuje na miesto v tom istom s\u250?bore, v ktorom je odkaz vlo\u382?en\u253?, cesta sa vynech\u225?.\par

Tip: M\u244?\u382?ete tie\u382? pou\u382?i\u357? relat\u237?vne cesty (ku keynote.exe). Pr\u237?klad:\par


\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sa100  {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///..\\\\Test\\\\myFile.knt*8|301 }}{\fldrslt{file:///..\\Test\\myFile.knt*8|301}}}}}\f0\fs20\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx1969\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx8835 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa100 * alebo <\cell Ke\u271?\u382?e znaky * a < sa v n\u225?zve s\u250?boru v syst\u233?me Windows nem\u244?\u382?u vyskytova\u357?, oznamuj\u250? aplik\u225?cii KeyNote, \u382?e ide o \u353?peci\u225?lny druh odkazu \u8211? \u8222?odkaz KNT\u8220?.\par

< je \u353?peci\u225?lny znak pou\u382?\u237?van\u253? pri odkazoch KNT zalo\u382?en\u253?ch na GID od verzie 1.9.3\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx1969\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx8835 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa100\b FolderID\b0\cell ID prie\u269?inka, na ktor\u253? odkaz prejde\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx1969\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx8835 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa100\b NoteID \b0 alebo\b  NoteGID\b0\cell 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa60 NoteID: ID pozn\u225?mky (uzla) v prie\u269?inku, na ktor\u253? odkaz prejde.\par


\pard\intbl\widctlpar\li120\sa100 Pr\u225?zdna hodnota, hodnota <=0 alebo neplatn\u225? celo\u269?\u237?seln\u225? hodnota sa bude ignorova\u357?. Odkaz bude ukazova\u357? priamo na prie\u269?inok, bez zmeny aktu\u225?lne vybran\u233?ho uzla.\par


\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sa100 NoteGID: odkazy KNT zalo\u382?en\u233? na \b GID\b0  (od verzie 1.9.3) pou\u382?\u237?vaj\u250? glob\u225?lny ID pozn\u225?mky. Na identifik\u225?ciu cie\u318?ovej pozn\u225?mky nevy\u382?aduj\u250? FolderID.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx1969\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx8835 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa100\b CaretPosition\b0\cell 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa60 Poz\u237?cia v editore, na ktor\u250? sa po prechode umiestni kurzor.\par


\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sa100 Z\u225?porn\u225? hodnota znamen\u225?, \u382?e sa nem\u225? meni\u357?.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx1969\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx8835 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa100\b SelectionLength\b0\cell D\u314?\u382?ka textu, ktor\u253? sa po prechode vyberie. Zvy\u269?ajne je 0, ale ak bol pri kliknut\u237? na pr\u237?kaz \ldblquote Ozna\u269?i\u357? miesto\rdblquote  vybran\u253? kus textu, odkaz si to zapam\u228?t\u225? a pri prechode v\u253?ber obnov\u237?.\par


\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sa100 Z\u225?porn\u225? hodnota znamen\u225?, \u382?e sa nem\u225? meni\u357? aktu\u225?lny v\u253?ber.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx1969\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx8835 
\pard\intbl\sb100\sa100\b MarkID\cell\b0 ID zna\u269?ky, na ktor\u250? odkaz ukazuje, ako alternat\u237?va k CaretPosition. Hodnota = 0 sa bude ignorova\u357?\cell\row 
\pard\par

\u352?peci\u225?lne \u269?asti odkazu sa odde\u318?uj\u250? znakom \u8222?|\u8220?. Pri odkazoch {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http:///* }}{\fldrslt{http:///*}}}}}\f0\fs20  s\u250? \u269?asti NoteID, CaretPosition, SelectionLength a MarkID volite\u318?n\u233? a nemusia by\u357? pr\u237?tomn\u233?, aby hypertextov\u253? odkaz fungoval. \par

\par


\pard\sb80 V\u353?etky nasleduj\u250?ce hypertextov\u233? odkazy s\u250? platn\u233?:\par


\pard\li360\sb80 (Predpokladajme, \u382?e pozn\u225?mka s FolderID=1 a NoteID=12 m\u225? NoteGID=15) \par


\pard\par


\pard\li120 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///c:\\\\My%20Documents\\\\diary.knt*1|12|30|4|2 }}{\fldrslt{file:///c:\\My%20Documents\\diary.knt*1|12|30|4|2}}}}}\f0\fs20  alebo {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///c:\\\\My%20Documents\\\\diary.knt<15|30|4|2 }}{\fldrslt{file:///c:\\My%20Documents\\diary.knt<15|30|4|2}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

