\pard\sb80 {\ul\protect\fs24{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "FOLD:"}}{\fldrslt{\f4\u10133?\f0  \f4 }}}}\protect\f0\fs20 Nieko\u318?ko \u271?al\u353?\u237?ch pr\u237?kladov na pochopenie mo\u382?nost\u237?; h\u318?adanie \u8222?task\u8220?; \ul So\ulnone  zna\u269?kami: \u8222?[x]\u8220? a \u8222?E0\u8220? a \ul Bez\ulnone  zna\u269?iek: \v  "BB"\par

