{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.22621}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 Vlastnosti s\u250?boru KeyNote\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par

\b\fs20 Vlastnosti s\u250?boru \b0 s\u250? mal\u225? skupina nastaven\u237? t\u253?kaj\u250?cich sa cel\u233?ho s\u250?boru .KNT, a nie konkr\u233?tnych prie\u269?inkov v \u328?om. M\u244?\u382?ete napr\u237?klad ur\u269?i\u357? form\u225?t, v ktorom sa m\u225? s\u250?bor uklada\u357?, zvoli\u357?, \u269?i m\u225? by\u357? s\u250?bor \u353?ifrovan\u253?, rozhodn\u250?\u357?, kde sa maj\u250? uklada\u357? obr\u225?zky, at\u271?.\par

\par

Ak chcete zmeni\u357? vlastnosti s\u250?boru pre aktu\u225?lne otvoren\u253? s\u250?bor, stla\u269?te \cf3\b Alt+Enter\cf0\b0  alebo zvo\u318?te pr\u237?kaz \b File|Properties \b0 . Dial\u243?gov\u233? okno obsahuje \u353?tyri karty (z ktor\u253?ch s\u250? vidite\u318?n\u233? len tri, ak v\u225?\u353? s\u250?bor KeyNote nie je \u353?ifrovan\u253?). Podrobnosti o nastaveniach dostupn\u253?ch na jednotliv\u253?ch kart\u225?ch n\u225?jdete po kliknut\u237? na odkazy ni\u382?\u353?ie.\par

\par

Vlastnosti s\u250?boru:\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<46|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Inform\u225?cie}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<47|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Nastavenia}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<48|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Ikony s\u250?borov}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<49|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Zabezpe\u269?enie}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

}
