\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs36 Vlastnosti s\u250?boru: Inform\u225?cie\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par


\pard\li360\v\'11I234\'12\v0\fs20\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:234,532,390"}}{\fldrslt {234_Clipb_19oct.png}}}}\fs26\lang1033\par


\pard\par

\fs20 Na tejto karte m\u244?\u382?ete zobrazi\u357? alebo zmeni\u357? v\u353?eobecn\u233? inform\u225?cie o aktu\u225?lnom s\u250?bore KeyNote.\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 N\u225?zov s\u250?boru\cf0\fs20\par


\pard\sb40\b0 Zobrazuje \u250?pln\u253? n\u225?zov aktu\u225?lne otvoren\u233?ho s\u250?boru. T\u225?to inform\u225?cia je len na zobrazenie. Ak chcete zmeni\u357? n\u225?zov s\u250?boru, zatvorte dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Vlastnosti s\u250?boru, potom zvo\u318?te pr\u237?kaz \b File|Save As\b0\f1  \f0  a ulo\u382?te s\u250?bor pod nov\u253?m n\u225?zvom.\par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Popis\par


\pard\sb40\cf0\b0\fs20 Ide o kr\u225?tky opisn\u253? text, ktor\u253? v\u225?m u\u318?ah\u269?\u237? identifik\u225?ciu s\u250?boru. Tento text sa zobrazuje v dial\u243?govom okne {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<50|496|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Koment\u225?r\par


\pard\sb40\cf0\b0\fs20 Rovnako ako pole Popis, aj pole Koment\u225?r poskytuje \u271?al\u353?\u237? priestor na opis s\u250?boru. Tento text sa tie\u382? zobrazuje v dial\u243?govom okne Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\b Pozn\u225?mka\b0 :  Ke\u271? s\u250?bor za\u353?ifrujete, polia Popis a Koment\u225?r sa ne\u353?ifruj\u250? a st\u225?le sa zobrazuj\u250? v dial\u243?govom okne Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov. Pozri \f1\ldblquote\f0 Vlastnosti s\u250?boru: Zabezpe\u269?enie\f1\rdblquote\f0 .\par


\pard\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Form\u225?t\par

\cf0\b0\fs20 Tento rozba\u318?ovac\u237? zoznam v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje zvoli\u357? form\u225?t, v ktorom sa m\u225? s\u250?bor KeyNote uklada\u357?:\par

\par

\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx2343\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx9090 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa100\b KeyNote nat\u237?vny\b0\cell Predvolen\u253?, z\u225?kladn\u253? form\u225?t\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trrh690\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx2343\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx9090 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa100\b KeyNote komprimovan\u253?\b0\cell Zvo\u318?te tento form\u225?t, ak chcete s\u250?bor komprimova\u357?. Mo\u382?no ho nastavi\u357? na karte {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<47|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Nastavenia}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\trleft-75\trbrdrl\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrt\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrr\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trbrdrb\brdrdash\brdrw15 \trpaddl60\trpaddr60\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx2343\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs \cellx9090 
\pard\intbl\widctlpar\sb100\sa100\b KeyNote \u353?ifrovan\u253?\b0\cell Zvo\u318?te tento form\u225?t, ak chcete s\u250?bor za\u353?ifrova\u357?, a potom kliknite na kartu {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<49|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Zabezpe\u269?enie}}}}}\f0\fs20 \cell\row 
\pard\li360\ri720\sb140\sa40\b Pozn\u225?mka\b0 : Od verzie 1.8.0 (j\u250?n 2023) KeyNote NF prestal podporova\u357? \b form\u225?t Dart\b0 . Viac inform\u225?ci\u237? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<120|425|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{tu}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\li360\ri720\sb20\sa40 V pr\u237?pade potreby m\u244?\u382?ete na konverzie pou\u382?i\u357? star\u353?ie verzie KeyNote. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e ak v\u225?\u353? s\u250?bor obsahuje pozn\u225?mky stromov\u233?ho typu, nemo\u382?no ho ulo\u382?i\u357? vo form\u225?te Dart Notes.\par


\pard\li360\par


\pard\cf1\b\fs22 Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\par


\pard\sb80\cf0\b0\fs20 Ak je za\u269?iarknut\u233?, umo\u382?\u328?uje vklada\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah do s\u250?borov ulo\u382?en\u253?ch v nat\u237?vnom alebo komprimovanom form\u225?te. To v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje vybra\u357? \b uzly\b0  a \b obr\u225?zky\b0 , ktor\u233? sa maj\u250? ulo\u382?i\u357? ako \u353?ifrovan\u233?.\par


\pard Rovnako ako pri \u353?ifrovanom form\u225?te, po za\u269?iarknut\u237? mus\u237?te nastavi\u357? heslo na karte {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<49|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Zabezpe\u269?enie}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard\sb40 \u352?ifrovan\u233? obr\u225?zky m\u244?\u382?ete uklada\u357? aj externe. Viac inform\u225?ci\u237? n\u225?jdete v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<51|2933|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{\u352?ifrovan\u253? form\u225?t vs. nat\u237?vny alebo komprimovan\u253? form\u225?t s mo\u382?nos\u357?ou \u8222?Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\u8220?}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard\li360\par

\par


\pard\b D\u244?le\u382?it\u233?: \par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb40\b0 Pozri {\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<51|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{\u352?ifrovanie s\u250?borov KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20  a dozviete sa viac o \u353?ifrovan\u237? s\u250?borov KeyNote, a to pomocou \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho form\u225?tu alebo mo\u382?nosti \u8222?\ul Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\ulnone \u8220?\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Pozrite si tie\u382? pozn\u225?mky o {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|4760|0|12"}}{\fldrslt{Kompresia a \u353?ifrovanie}}}}}\f0\fs20  pri pou\u382?\u237?van\u237? obr\u225?zkov.\par


\pard\par

\par

\par

Ni\u382?\u353?ie sa zobrazuj\u250? \u271?al\u353?ie inform\u225?cie o aktu\u225?lne otvorenom s\u250?bore vr\u225?tane d\u225?tumu vytvorenia s\u250?boru, ve\u318?kosti s\u250?boru a po\u269?tu pozn\u225?mok, ktor\u233? s\u250?bor obsahuje.\par

\par

\cf1\b\fs22 Syst\u233?mov\u233? tla\u269?idlo\par

\cf0\b0\fs20 Kliknut\u237?m na toto tla\u269?idlo otvor\u237?te \u353?tandardn\u233? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Windows \b Vlastnosti s\u250?boru\b0\f1  \f0 . Ide o to ist\u233? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno, ktor\u233? sa zobraz\u237?, ke\u271? v Prieskumn\u237?kovi Windows kliknete prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom my\u353?i na s\u250?bor a v ponuke zvol\u237?te pr\u237?kaz \b Vlastnosti\b0 .\par

\par

}
