\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs36 Vlastnosti s\u250?boru: Nastavenia\cf2\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par


\pard\li360\v\fs20\'11I235\'12\v0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:235,532,390"}}{\fldrslt {235_Clipb_19oct.png}}}}\par


\pard\par

Na tejto karte m\u244?\u382?ete zobrazi\u357? alebo zmeni\u357? nastavenia pre aktu\u225?lny s\u250?bor KeyNote.\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Otvori\u357? tento s\u250?bor v re\u382?ime iba na \u269?\u237?tanie\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zapnut\u225?, pri nasleduj\u250?com otvoren\u237? s\u250?boru v KeyNote sa s\u250?bor otvor\u237? ako iba na \u269?\u237?tanie. St\u225?le budete m\u244?c\u357? s\u250?bor upravova\u357?, ale nebudete ho m\u244?c\u357? ulo\u382?i\u357?. Aby ste s\u250?bor ulo\u382?ili, budete musie\u357? pou\u382?i\u357? pr\u237?kaz \b S\u250?bor|Ulo\u382?i\u357? ako\b0 .\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Nezachov\u225?va\u357? viacero z\u225?loh tohto s\u250?boru\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? umo\u382?\u328?uje pre tento s\u250?bor ignorova\u357? predvolen\u250? mo\u382?nos\u357? \b Maxim\u225?lna \u250?rove\u328? z\u225?lohovania\b0 , definovan\u250? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<94|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti z\u225?lohovania}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard\sb120 Ak za\u269?iarknete t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357?, vytvor\u237? sa len 1 z\u225?loha s\u250?boru, aj ke\u271? ste v dial\u243?govom okne Mo\u382?nosti ur\u269?ili vy\u353?\u353?iu \u250?rove\u328? z\u225?lohovania. (Je to u\u382?ito\u269?n\u233? predov\u353?etk\u253?m pre t\u253?ch, ktor\u237? vytvorili ve\u318?mi ve\u318?k\u233? s\u250?bory KNT a nechc\u250? plytva\u357? miestom na disku uchov\u225?van\u237?m mnoh\u253?ch z\u225?lo\u382?n\u253?ch verzi\u237? tak\u253?chto s\u250?borov, ale st\u225?le chc\u250? viacero z\u225?loh pre in\u233? s\u250?bory.)\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 \u218?rove\u328? kompresie\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard Pri pou\u382?it\u237? form\u225?tu \b komprimovan\u253? s\u250?bor Keynote\b0  je mo\u382?n\u233? vybra\u357? jednu z troch \u250?rovn\u237? kompresie:\par

Najr\u253?chlej\u353?ia, Predvolen\u225? a Maxim\u225?lna.\par

\par

Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<54|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Form\u225?ty s\u250?borov v KeyNote. Meranie \u269?asu}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs24 Ukladanie obr\u225?zkov\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard Umo\u382?\u328?uje nastavi\u357?, kam sa maj\u250? uklada\u357? obr\u225?zky zahrnut\u233? v \b aktu\u225?lnom s\u250?bore\b0 . V {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<90|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: Obr\u225?zky}}}}}\f0\fs20  m\u244?\u382?ete definova\u357? re\u382?im ukladania, ktor\u253? sa m\u225? pou\u382?i\u357? v \b nov\u253?ch \b0 s\u250?boroch Keynote. V uvedenom odkaze n\u225?jdete inform\u225?cie o r\u244?znych mo\u382?nostiach ukladania obr\u225?zkov.\par

\par

Tla\u269?idlom \b Prepo\u269?\u237?ta\u357? \u271?al\u353?ie ID...\b0  je mo\u382?n\u233? prepo\u269?\u237?ta\u357? ID \u271?al\u353?ieho obr\u225?zka, ktor\u253? sa m\u225? ulo\u382?i\u357?. M\u244?\u382?e by\u357? u\u382?ito\u269?n\u233?, ke\u271? ste do niektor\u253?ch uzlov s\u250?boru vlo\u382?ili ve\u318?a obr\u225?zkov a nesk\u244?r sa rozhodnete presun\u250?\u357? tieto uzly (so v\u353?etk\u253?mi obr\u225?zkami) do in\u233?ho s\u250?boru, \u269?\u237?m sa uzly a obr\u225?zky odstr\u225?nia zo zdrojov\u233?ho s\u250?boru.\par

\par

Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Spr\u225?va obr\u225?zkov v KeyNote NF}}}}}\f0\fs20 , kde n\u225?jdete viac inform\u225?ci\u237? o obr\u225?zkoch, {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|2263|0|6"}}{\fldrslt{ukladanie obr\u225?zkov}}}}}\f0\fs20  a {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|6204|0|13"}}{\fldrslt{nastavenie alebo zmena re\u382?imu ukladania}}}}}\f0\fs18 . Viac inform\u225?ci\u237? obsahuje aj \u269?as\u357? o tla\u269?idle Prepo\u269?\u237?ta\u357? \u271?al\u353?ie ID.\par

\fs20\par

}
