\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs36 Vlastnosti s\u250?boru: Ikony s\u250?boru\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par


\pard\li360\v\'11I174\'12\v0\fs20{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:174,532,330"}}{\fldrslt {174_Clipb_06mar.png}}}}\fs26\par


\pard\par

\fs20 Na tejto karte m\u244?\u382?ete zobrazi\u357? alebo zmeni\u357? ikony pou\u382?\u237?van\u233? pre \ul aktu\u225?lny\ulnone  s\u250?bor KeyNote.\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Zobrazova\u357? obr\u225?zky ikon na kart\u225?ch\cf0\fs20\par


\pard\b0 Ak je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zapnut\u225?, ikony sa bud\u250? zobrazova\u357? na kart\u225?ch ved\u318?a n\u225?zvu ka\u382?d\u233?ho prie\u269?inka. V opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade sa ikony na kart\u225?ch zobrazova\u357? nebud\u250?. Tento pr\u237?kaz pou\u382?ite na trval\u233? zapnutie alebo vypnutie ikon kariet pre aktu\u225?lny s\u250?bor.\par

\par


\pard\li240\b Tip: \b0 Ak chcete po\u269?as pr\u225?ce s KeyNote r\u253?chlo zobrazi\u357? alebo skry\u357? ikony kariet, vyberte pr\u237?kaz \b Zobrazi\u357?|Zobrazova\u357? ikony na kart\u225?ch\b0 . \par


\pard\li600  Tento pr\u237?kaz bude zak\u225?zan\u253? (neakt\u237?vny), ak je na karte Ikony s\u250?boru vypnut\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? \ul Zobrazova\u357? obr\u225?zky ikon na kart\u225?ch\ulnone .\par


\pard\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\b Predvolen\u233?\par


\pard\li360\b0 Pou\u382?ij\u250? sa predvolen\u233? ikony. To znamen\u225?, \u382?e tento s\u250?bor bude pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? rovnak\u250? sadu ikon kariet ako v\u353?etky ostatn\u233? s\u250?bory. Tieto ikony m\u244?\u382?ete prisp\u244?sobi\u357? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<98|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: Ikony kariet}}}}}\f0\fs20  dial\u243?govom okne.\par


\pard\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\b Vstavan\u233?\par


\pard\li360\b0 Pre tento s\u250?bor sa pou\u382?ij\u250? iba vstavan\u233? ikony. Vstavan\u250? sadu ikon nie je mo\u382?n\u233? prisp\u244?sobi\u357?. Ak svoj s\u250?bor zdie\u318?ate s in\u253?mi, toto nastavenie v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? zabezpe\u269?i\u357?, \u382?e ka\u382?d\u253? uvid\u237? rovnak\u233? ikony, aj ke\u271? si predvolen\u233? ikony kariet prisp\u244?sobili.\par


\pard\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\b In\u233?\par


\pard\li360\b0 Umo\u382?\u328?uje vybra\u357? konkr\u233?tny s\u250?bor .ICN (\u250?lo\u382?isko ikon), ktor\u253? obsahuje sadu vlastn\u253?ch ikon, ktor\u233? chcete pou\u382?i\u357? pre tento s\u250?bor KeyNote. Ak zvol\u237?te t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357?, budete musie\u357? zada\u357? n\u225?zov vlastn\u233?ho s\u250?boru .ICN do ni\u382?\u353?ie uveden\u233?ho edita\u269?n\u233?ho po\u318?a.\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Pou\u382?i\u357? vlastn\u250? ikonu pre tento s\u250?bor\par


\pard\cf0\b0\fs20 Toto nastavenie v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje ur\u269?i\u357?, \u382?e KeyNote m\u225? pri otvorenom aktu\u225?lnom s\u250?bore KeyNote zobrazova\u357? vlastn\u250? ikonu v \b oblasti syst\u233?movej li\u353?ty\b0  a na \b paneli \u250?loh\b0 . To v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? r\u253?chlo zisti\u357?, ktor\u253? s\u250?bor je pr\u225?ve otvoren\u253? v KeyNote, jednoducho pod\u318?a ikony. Ak zvol\u237?te t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357?, budete musie\u357? zada\u357? n\u225?zov vlastnej ikony (s\u250?bor .ICO) do ni\u382?\u353?ie uveden\u233?ho edita\u269?n\u233?ho po\u318?a.\par


\pard\sb80 Pozn\u225?mka: Cesta k s\u250?boru ikony bude ulo\u382?en\u225? relat\u237?vne k s\u250?boru .knt.\par


\pard\par

}
