\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs36 Vlastnosti s\u250?boru: Zabezpe\u269?enie\par

\cf2\fs24\par


\pard\li360\cf0\b0\v\fs20\lang3082\'11I245\'12\v0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:245,533,391"}}{\fldrslt {245_Clipb_14feb.png}}}}\fs26\lang1033\par


\pard\par

\fs20 Na tejto karte m\u244?\u382?ete ur\u269?i\u357? nastavenia zabezpe\u269?enia pre aktu\u225?lny s\u250?bor KeyNote.\par

\par

Karta \b Zabezpe\u269?enie\b0  je vidite\u318?n\u225? len vtedy, ak ste vybrali \ul KeyNote \u353?ifrovan\u253?\ulnone  v rozba\u318?ovacom zozname \b Form\u225?t\b0  alebo za\u269?iarkli \u8222?\ul Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\ulnone \u8220? na karte {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<46|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Inform\u225?cie}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par

S\u250?bor KeyNote nie je spo\u269?iatku \u353?ifrovan\u253?. Ke\u271? ako form\u225?t, v ktorom sa m\u225? s\u250?bor ulo\u382?i\u357?, vyberiete mo\u382?nos\u357? KeyNote \u353?ifrovan\u253?, karta Zabezpe\u269?enie sa zobraz\u237?, aby ste mohli ur\u269?i\u357? pr\u237?stupov\u250? fr\u225?zu, ktor\u225? sa pou\u382?ije na \u353?ifrovanie a de\u353?ifrovanie s\u250?boru.\par

\par

Zaka\u382?d\u253?m, ke\u271? zad\u225?te pr\u237?stupov\u250? fr\u225?zu, mus\u237?te ju nap\u237?sa\u357? dvakr\u225?t: do po\u318?a \cf1\b Pr\u237?stupov\u225? fr\u225?za\cf0\b0  a do po\u318?a \cf1\b Potvrdi\u357? fr\u225?zu\cf0\b0 .\par

\par

V poli \cf1\b Algoritmus\cf0\b0  m\u244?\u382?ete vybra\u357? kryptografick\u250? met\u243?du pou\u382?it\u250? na \u353?ifrovanie s\u250?boru.\par

\par

\cf1\b Transform\u225?cia k\u318?\u250?\u269?a. Iter\u225?cie: \cf0\b0 Pr\u237?stupov\u225? fr\u225?za sa transformuje pomocou funkcie na odvodenie k\u318?\u250?\u269?a. T\u253?m sa prid\u225?va faktor pr\u225?ce a s\u357?a\u382?uj\u250? sa slovn\u237?kov\u233? a h\u225?dacie \u250?toky. \u268?\u237?m viac iter\u225?ci\u237?, t\u253?m \u357?a\u382?\u353?ie s\u250? slovn\u237?kov\u233? a h\u225?dacie \u250?toky, ale aj na\u269?\u237?tanie s\u250?boru .knt trv\u225? dlh\u353?ie.\par

\par

Ke\u271? je v\u225?\u353? s\u250?bor za\u353?ifrovan\u253?, m\u244?\u382?ete kedyko\u318?vek zmeni\u357? pr\u237?stupov\u250? fr\u225?zu (a/alebo algoritmus a po\u269?et iter\u225?ci\u237?). Ak tak chcete urobi\u357?, kliknite na tla\u269?idlo \cf1\b Nastavi\u357? pr\u237?stupov\u250? fr\u225?zu\cf0\b0  a zadajte pr\u237?stupov\u250? fr\u225?zu, ako je op\u237?san\u233? vy\u353?\u353?ie.\par

\par

Ak u\u382? nechcete ma\u357? s\u250?bor za\u353?ifrovan\u253?, kliknite na kartu {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<46|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Inform\u225?cie}}}}}\f0\fs20  a vyberte in\u253? (neza\u353?ifrovan\u253?) form\u225?t s\u250?boru. Predvolen\u253? form\u225?t je nat\u237?vny form\u225?t KeyNote.\par

\par

\cf1\b\lang3082 Skry\u357? za\u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly v strome, ak \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah zostane \u8222?zatvoren\u253?\u8220?\cf0\b0\lang1033\par

Od verzie 2.1.5 je mo\u382?n\u233? pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? neza\u353?ifrovan\u253? form\u225?t s\u250?boru (nat\u237?vny alebo komprimovan\u253?) a s\u250?\u269?asne selekt\u237?vne \u353?ifrova\u357? ur\u269?it\u233? uzly a/alebo obr\u225?zky. Ak to chcete urobi\u357?, mus\u237?te za\u269?iarknu\u357? pol\u237?\u269?ko \u8222?Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\u8220? na karte \u8222?Inform\u225?cie\u8220?.\par

Ke\u271? povol\u237?te \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah, m\u244?\u382?ete touto mo\u382?nos\u357?ou skry\u357? za\u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly v strome namiesto jednoduch\u233?ho skrytia ich obsahu. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e skryt\u233? bud\u250? aj v\u353?etky podriaden\u233? uzly, aj ke\u271? nie s\u250? ozna\u269?en\u233? ako \u353?ifrovan\u233?.\par

Pozn\u225?mka: Toto za\u269?iarkavacie pol\u237?\u269?ko zostane skryt\u233?, k\u253?m sa \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah \u8222?neotvor\u237?\u8220? zadan\u237?m hesla.\par

\par

\b D\u244?le\u382?it\u233?: \par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb40\b0 Pozri {\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<51|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{\u352?ifrovanie s\u250?borov KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 , kde sa dozviete viac o \u353?ifrovan\u237? s\u250?borov KeyNote pomocou \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho form\u225?tu alebo mo\u382?nosti \u8222?Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\u8220?\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Pozri tie\u382? pozn\u225?mky o {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|4760|0|12"}}{\fldrslt{Kompresia a \u353?ifrovanie}}}}}\f0\fs20  pri pou\u382?\u237?van\u237? obr\u225?zkov.\par


\pard\par

\cf3\b\par

}
