\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 \u352?ifrovanie s\u250?borov KeyNote\cf0\b0\f0\fs20\lang1033\par


\pard\li360\qr\cf2\b\fs26 Predt\u253?m, ne\u382? za\u269?nete \u353?ifrova\u357? svoje s\u250?bory KeyNote, pre\u269?\u237?tajte si inform\u225?cie v tomto s\u250?bore!\par


\pard\li360\sb120\qr\fs20 VAROVANIE: WINDOWS \b0 95/98/NT/ME/XP/W7/W8/W10/W11\b  je vo svojej podstate NEBEZPE\u268?N\u221? SYST\u201?M!\cf0\b0\par


\pard\par

Ak\u233?ko\u318?vek inform\u225?cie obsiahnut\u233? v programe m\u244?\u382?e spr\u225?vca virtu\u225?lnej pam\u228?te syst\u233?mu vo\u318?ne \ldblquote odklada\u357? na disk\rdblquote  (skop\u237?rova\u357? do oblasti odkladacieho s\u250?boru na pevnom disku). Tieto inform\u225?cie M\u212?\u381?U ZOSTA\u356? \u268?ITATE\u317?N\u201? pre cie\u318?avedom\u233?ho zvedavca, dokonca aj po re\u353?tarte syst\u233?mu. Existuj\u250? \u353?peci\u225?lne n\u225?stroje na \u269?\u237?tanie disku, ktor\u233? to umo\u382?\u328?uj\u250?, a s\u250? dostupn\u233? zadarmo. Program v s\u250?\u269?asnosti nevyv\u237?ja \u382?iadne \u250?silie zabr\u225?ni\u357? tak\u233?muto odkladaniu alebo odswapovaniu \u250?dajov. To znamen\u225?, \u382?e inform\u225?cie ulo\u382?en\u233? v s\u250?bore KeyNote (*.knt), hoci s\u250? za\u353?ifrovan\u233?, M\u212?\u381?U skon\u269?i\u357? niekde na va\u353?om pevnom disku v \u269?itate\u318?nej (neza\u353?ifrovanej) podobe.\par

\par

Ak v\u225?s to znepokojuje, existuj\u250? programy, ktor\u233? bezpe\u269?ne VYMA\u381?\u218? nevyu\u382?it\u253? priestor na pevnom disku a/alebo odkladac\u237? s\u250?bor Windows. Jedn\u253?m z tak\u253?ch programov je:\par


\pard\fi-240\li240\bullet    \b BCWipe \b0 od Jetico, Inc. {{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.jetico.com }}{\fldrslt{http://www.jetico.com}}}}\f0\fs20  (program s grafick\u253?m rozhran\u237?m pre Windows; distribuuje sa aj ako s\u250?\u269?as\u357? vynikaj\u250?ceho bal\u237?ka na \u353?ifrovanie diskov BestCrypt)\par


\pard\par

\par

