\b\v\fs24\'11B2\'12\v0 V\u353?eobecn\u233? inform\u225?cie\fs20\par

\b0\par

Od verzie 0.90 beta podporuje KeyNote bezpe\u269?n\u233? \u353?ifrovanie. Ka\u382?d\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote mo\u382?no za\u353?ifrova\u357? jedn\u253?m z dvoch podporovan\u253?ch algoritmov (Blowfish a IDEA). To v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? chr\u225?ni\u357? citliv\u233? \u250?daje pr\u237?stupovou fr\u225?zou. Za\u353?ifrovan\u253? s\u250?bor nemo\u382?no otvori\u357? bez zadania pr\u237?stupovej fr\u225?zy, ktor\u225? bola pou\u382?it\u225? na jeho za\u353?ifrovanie.\par


\pard\li360\sb120\qr\cf2\b\fs22 POZOR!  Ak ZABUDNETE SVOJU PR\u205?STUPOV\u218? FR\u193?ZU, nebudete ma\u357? pr\u237?stup k svojmu za\u353?ifrovan\u233?mu s\u250?boru KeyNote!\par


\pard\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Neexistuj\u250? \u382?iadne zadn\u233? vr\u225?tka a pou\u382?it\u233? \u353?ifrovacie algoritmy nemaj\u250? \u382?iadne zn\u225?me slabiny, ktor\u233? by v\u225?m \u8211? alebo komuko\u318?vek in\u233?mu \u8211? umo\u382?nili prelomi\u357? \u353?ifrovanie, a to ani pomocou \u250?toku hrubou silou.\par


\pard\sb80 V s\u250?\u269?asnosti mi nie s\u250? zn\u225?me \u382?iadne chyby s\u250?visiace s touto funkciou, \u269?o v\u353?ak neznamen\u225?, \u382?e \u382?iadne neexistuj\u250?. Funkciu \u353?ifrovania pou\u382?\u237?vajte opatrne a svoje \u250?daje \u269?asto z\u225?lohujte. Ak n\u225?jdete ak\u233?ko\u318?vek probl\u233?my alebo chyby, ur\u269?ite ich nahl\u225?ste.\par


\pard\par

Po\u269?n\u250?c verziou 2.1.5 pon\u250?ka KeyNote s\u233?riu vylep\u353?en\u237? zameran\u253?ch na zv\u253?\u353?enie bezpe\u269?nosti:\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 \u352?ifrovan\u253? form\u225?t teraz pou\u382?\u237?va zjednodu\u353?en\u253? mechanizmus PBKDF2 na odvodzovanie k\u318?\u250?\u269?ov z hesiel s konfigurovate\u318?n\u253?m po\u269?tom iter\u225?ci\u237? (SHA-1). Tento mechanizmus pom\u225?ha chr\u225?ni\u357? pred \u250?tokmi hrubou silou\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb40 Bola pridan\u225? dodato\u269?n\u225? ochrana pred z\u225?kladn\u253?mi/stredne pokro\u269?il\u253?mi keyloggermi.\par


\pard\li360 Po ka\u382?dom stla\u269?en\u237? kl\u225?vesu pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?om v chr\u225?nenom poli (heslo) sa vygeneruje ur\u269?it\u253? po\u269?et falo\u353?n\u253?ch stla\u269?en\u237? kl\u225?vesov, pri\u269?om ka\u382?d\u233? obsahuje skuto\u269?n\u233? udalosti, ktor\u233? musia keyloggery zachyti\u357?. Tieto falo\u353?n\u233? stla\u269?enia ignoruje ovl\u225?dac\u237? prvok v KeyNote NF a neovplyv\u328?uj\u250? skuto\u269?ne zadan\u233? heslo. Po\u269?et stla\u269?en\u237? kl\u225?vesov aj falo\u353?n\u233? stla\u269?enia sa generuj\u250? n\u225?hodne.\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb40 Zranite\u318?nos\u357? po\u318?a hesla vo\u269?i n\u225?strojom na odhalenie hesla, ako je BulletsPassView, bola opraven\u225?\par


\pard\par

Napriek v\u353?etk\u253?m t\u253?mto vylep\u353?eniam si pre\u269?\u237?tajte inform\u225?cie na adrese: {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<51|17809|0|9"}}{\fldrslt{Bezpe\u269?nostn\u233? \u250?vahy}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B3\'12\v0 Nat\u237?vny alebo komprimovan\u253? form\u225?t s mo\u382?nos\u357?ou \u8222?Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\u8220?  vs. \v\'11B1\'12\v0 \u352?ifrovan\u253? form\u225?t\b0\fs20\par


\pard\sb80\par

Od verzie 2.1.5 m\u225?te okrem \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho form\u225?tu, ktor\u253? umo\u382?\u328?uje za\u353?ifrova\u357? cel\u253? obsah s\u250?boru, aj mo\u382?nos\u357? skombinova\u357? ne\u353?ifrovan\u253? form\u225?t (nat\u237?vny alebo komprimovan\u253?) so \u353?ifrovan\u237?m vybran\u253?ch prvkov (pozn\u225?mok a obr\u225?zkov). T\u225?to nov\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? je zalo\u382?en\u225? na rovnakom \u353?ifrovacom mechanizme ako \u353?ifrovan\u253? form\u225?t, s t\u253?m rozdielom, \u382?e do \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho bloku bud\u250? zahrnut\u233? len prvky ozna\u269?en\u233? na \u353?ifrovanie, zatia\u318? \u269?o ostatn\u233? zostan\u250? vidite\u318?n\u233? a priamo pr\u237?stupn\u233? zo s\u250?boru .knt.\par

\par

Existuj\u250? situ\u225?cie, v ktor\u253?ch m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? t\u225?to nov\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? zauj\u237?mavej\u353?ia ako pou\u382?itie \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho form\u225?tu:\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 V mnoh\u253?ch pr\u237?padoch m\u225?me s\u250?bory .knt, ktor\u233? potrebujeme \b zdie\u318?a\u357?\b0  s in\u253?mi \u318?u\u271?mi. Takmer cel\u253? obsah si mo\u382?no be\u382?ne prezera\u357?, no m\u244?\u382?e existova\u357? obsah, ktor\u253? by z r\u244?znych d\u244?vodov nemal by\u357? pr\u237?stupn\u253?. M\u244?\u382?eme ma\u357? pracovn\u253? s\u250?bor s inform\u225?ciami o ur\u269?itom projekte, do ktor\u233?ho sme zahrnuli niektor\u233? osobn\u233? \u250?daje, ako s\u250? kont\u225? alebo hesl\u225?, ktor\u233? s n\u237?m s\u250?visia, alebo v ktorom s\u250? \u250?daje, ktor\u233? by mali by\u357? dostupn\u233? len intern\u253?m \u269?lenom pracovn\u233?ho t\u237?mu, ale nie extern\u253?m pracovn\u237?kom at\u271?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}M\u244?\u382?e by\u357? tie\u382? v\u253?hodn\u233? ma\u357? po ruke v s\u250?bore, na ktorom pr\u225?ve pracujeme, nejak\u233? \u250?daje, ktor\u233? \u269?asto pou\u382?\u237?vame a ktor\u233? na rozdiel od ostatn\u253?ch treba chr\u225?ni\u357?. Pr\u237?stup k t\u253?mto chr\u225?nen\u253?m \u250?dajom, \u269?i u\u382? na ich zobrazenie alebo op\u228?tovn\u233? skrytie, je ve\u318?mi r\u253?chly.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Tam, kde nie je potrebn\u233?, aby bol obsah za\u353?ifrovan\u253?, m\u244?\u382?e zosta\u357? vidite\u318?n\u253?, a preto ho mo\u382?no upravova\u357? priamo v s\u250?bore .knt pomocou textov\u233?ho editora (v situ\u225?ci\u225?ch, ke\u271? to m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? potrebn\u233?).\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}S\u250?bory ulo\u382?en\u233? v \u353?ifrovanom form\u225?te nepon\u250?kaj\u250? \b kompresiu\b0 . S nov\u253?m mechanizmom je mo\u382?n\u233? uplatni\u357? po\u382?adovan\u250? kompresiu. Prirodzene, kompresia \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho bloku obsahu nedosiahne takmer \u382?iadne zmen\u353?enie, ale zmen\u353?\u237? vidite\u318?n\u253?, neza\u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Pri \u353?ifrovan\u237? \b obr\u225?zkov\b0  pon\u250?ka nov\u253? mechanizmus viac mo\u382?nost\u237?:\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sb80 Pri \u353?ifrovanom form\u225?te je jedin\u253? sp\u244?sob, ako zabezpe\u269?i\u357?, aby obr\u225?zok zostal za\u353?ifrovan\u253?, nastavi\u357? re\u382?im ukladania obr\u225?zkov na Embedded RTF alebo Embedded KNT. Pri Embedded KNT s\u250? obr\u225?zky umiestnen\u233? na konci s\u250?boru KNT v bin\u225?rnej podobe, \u269?\u237?m zaberaj\u250? ove\u318?a menej miesta. V oboch pr\u237?padoch sa v\u353?ak obr\u225?zok uklad\u225? do samotn\u233?ho s\u250?boru, \u269?\u237?m sa zv\u228?\u269?\u353?uje jeho ve\u318?kos\u357?. To zvy\u269?ajne nebude probl\u233?m, ak s\u250?bor obsahuje m\u225?lo obr\u225?zkov. Treba poznamena\u357?, \u382?e ak s\u250?bor pou\u382?\u237?va ve\u318?a obr\u225?zkov, aj ke\u271? v\u228?\u269?\u353?ina z nich nevy\u382?aduje ochranu, samotn\u225? skuto\u269?nos\u357?, \u382?e jeden obr\u225?zok ochranu vy\u382?aduje, by vyn\u250?tila pou\u382?itie Embedded RTF alebo Embedded KNT.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Pri povolenom \u353?ifrovanom obsahu m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? re\u382?im extern\u233?ho ukladania (Zip alebo prie\u269?inok) a ozna\u269?i\u357? obr\u225?zky, ktor\u233? vy\u382?aduj\u250? ochranu a musia by\u357? ulo\u382?en\u233? za\u353?ifrovan\u233?. Tieto vybran\u233? obr\u225?zky sa predvolene ukladaj\u250? za\u353?ifrovan\u233? vo form\u225?te Embedded KNT. Ostatn\u233? sa ulo\u382?ia pod\u318?a definovan\u233?ho re\u382?imu ukladania (ktor\u253?m m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? tie\u382? Embedded KNT). Prostredn\u237?ctvom konfigura\u269?nej mo\u382?nosti INI {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<104|12682|0|15"}}{\fldrslt{ImgAllowEncrExternal}}}}\f0\fs20  je mo\u382?n\u233? povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovanie obr\u225?zkov pri externom ukladan\u237?. Ke\u271? je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? povolen\u225?, takto za\u353?ifrovan\u233? extern\u233? obrazov\u233? s\u250?bory nebud\u250? vidite\u318?n\u233? mimo aplik\u225?cie KeyNote.\ul\b\par


\pard\li720\sb80 Pozn\u225?mka\ulnone\b0 : \ul obr\u225?zky, ktor\u233? s\u250? {{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|9265|0|7"}}{\fldrslt{\u8222?prepojen\u233?\u8220?}}}}\ulnone\f0\fs20  (nie \u8222?vlastnen\u233?\u8220?), mo\u382?no ozna\u269?i\u357? ako \u353?ifrovan\u233?, ale ich obsah sa nezmen\u237?. Aj ke\u271? ich obsah nie je za\u353?ifrovan\u253?, bud\u250? sa na ne vz\u357?ahova\u357? nasleduj\u250?ce pravidl\u225?, rovnako ako pri in\u253?ch za\u353?ifrovan\u253?ch obr\u225?zkoch:\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sb80 \u381?iadny obr\u225?zok ozna\u269?en\u253? ako za\u353?ifrovan\u253? nebude vidite\u318?n\u253? v s\u250?bore KNT, ak chr\u225?nen\u253? obsah nie je \u8222?otvoren\u253?\u8220? (zadan\u237?m hesla). Taktie\u382? n\u225?zov, popis a cesta ak\u233?hoko\u318?vek za\u353?ifrovan\u233?ho obr\u225?zka sa nezobrazia, k\u253?m je \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah \u8222?zatvoren\u253?\u8220?.\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80\b Virtu\u225?lne uzly\b0  mo\u382?no ozna\u269?i\u357? ako za\u353?ifrovan\u233?. Rovnako ako pri \u8222?prepojen\u253?ch\u8220? obr\u225?zkoch, \ul obsah nebude za\u353?ifrovan\u253?\ulnone , ale \ul nebude vidite\u318?n\u253? zo s\u250?boru KNT\ulnone . Cesta k prepojen\u233?mu s\u250?boru sa tie\u382? nezobraz\u237?. Vlastnosti, ktor\u233? ozna\u269?uj\u250?, \u382?e uzol je virtu\u225?lny, spolu s jeho cestami (VF a RV), bud\u250? ulo\u382?en\u233? v \u353?ifrovanom bloku s\u250?boru knt. Navy\u353?e, k\u253?m chr\u225?nen\u253? obsah zostane \ldblquote zatvoren\u253?\rdblquote , nebude ani zobrazen\u233?, \u382?e uzol je virtu\u225?lny.\par


\pard\sb80\highlight4\par

\highlight0 \u218?vahy t\u253?kaj\u250?ce sa pou\u382?\u237?vania \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho obsahu:\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 Pri na\u269?\u237?tan\u237? s\u250?boru so \u353?ifrovan\u253?m obsahom (ale bez \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho \u8222?form\u225?tu\u8220?) sa nebude vy\u382?adova\u357? heslo. Jednoducho nebudete ma\u357? pr\u237?stup k chr\u225?nen\u233?mu obsahu. Ak m\u225? s\u250?bor povolen\u250? mo\u382?nos\u357? \cf5\b Skry\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly v strome, ak \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah zostane \ldblquote zatvoren\u253?\rdblquote\cf0\b0 , \u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly nebud\u250? v strome vidite\u318?n\u233? a n\u225?zvy t\u253?chto uzlov bud\u250? ulo\u382?en\u233? za\u353?ifrovan\u233?. Taktie\u382? nebude mo\u382?n\u233? zisti\u357?, \u269?i je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? povolen\u225?, ke\u271?\u382?e samotn\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? zostane skryt\u225?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Pri pr\u237?stupe k \u353?ifrovan\u253?m uzlom (ak nie s\u250? skryt\u233?) sa ako obsah zobraz\u237? nasleduj\u250?ci text: \cf5\b ** UNAUTHORIZED CONTENT **   => View | Encrypted Content\cf0\b0\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}V neza\u353?ifrovan\u253?ch pozn\u225?mkach, ktor\u233? obsahuj\u250? za\u353?ifrovan\u233? obr\u225?zky, bud\u250? tieto poskytnut\u233? len ako odkazy s textom \cf5\b [IMAGE]\cf0\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}K\u253?m je \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah \u8222?zatvoren\u253?\u8220?, inform\u225?cie t\u253?kaj\u250?ce sa \ul zna\u269?iek chr\u225?nen\u253?ch uzlov\ulnone  bud\u250? skryt\u233?. So \u353?ifrovan\u253?mi uzlami sa bude zaobch\u225?dza\u357?, akoby nemali \u382?iadne zna\u269?ky. Preto sa v informa\u269?nom paneli editora pre \u353?ifrovan\u253? uzol nezobrazia \u382?iadne zna\u269?ky. Ak je tie\u382? za\u269?iarknut\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?Zobrazi\u357? pou\u382?itie zna\u269?iek v strome\u8220?, karta zna\u269?iek v paneli zdrojov bude uv\u225?dza\u357?, \u382?e sa pre tieto uzly zna\u269?ky nepou\u382?\u237?vaj\u250?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Chr\u225?nen\u253? obsah m\u244?\u382?ete \u8222?otvori\u357?\u8220? a t\u253?m ho zobrazi\u357? vykonan\u237?m pr\u237?kazu \cf5\b Zobrazi\u357? | \u352?ifrovan\u253? obsah\cf6\b0 . \cf0 . Kliknut\u237?m na odkaz \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho obr\u225?zka alebo pokusom o zmenu stavu \u353?ifrovania uzlov \u269?i obr\u225?zkov sa zobraz\u237? v\u253?zva na zadanie hesla. To ist\u233? sa stane napr\u237?klad vtedy, ak sa pok\u250?site zru\u353?i\u357? za\u353?krtnutie mo\u382?nosti \ldblquote Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\rdblquote  alebo zmeni\u357? heslo.\par


\pard\fi-400\li760\sb80\b Tip\b0 : Ak pri v\u253?bere mo\u382?nosti \u8222?Zobrazi\u357? | \u352?ifrovan\u253? obsah\u8220? podr\u382?\u237?te stla\u269?en\u253? kl\u225?ves \cf7\b Shift\cf0\b0  a n\u225?sledne zad\u225?te heslo, \ul \u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly bud\u250? zv\u253?raznen\u233?\ulnone  na\u269?erveno (zv\u253?raznen\u253? bude aj pr\u237?slu\u353?n\u253? st\u314?pec \u8222?Ozna\u269?en\u233?\u8220?, a to \u269?ervenkastou farbou) a ak\u233?ko\u318?vek zmeny vykonan\u233? v stave \u353?ifrovania uzlov sa prejavia aj v ich farbe. Po zatvoren\u237? \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho obsahu zv\u253?raznenia zmizn\u250?.\par


\pard\li720\sb40\sa40  Pozn\u225?mka: Kl\u225?ves Shift sta\u269?\u237? podr\u382?a\u357? iba pri kliknut\u237? na polo\u382?ku ponuky.\par


\pard\fi-400\li760\sb80\sa40  \b Tip\b0 : M\u244?\u382?ete tie\u382? pou\u382?i\u357? token pokro\u269?il\u233?ho h\u318?adania \cf2\b *?\cf0\b0  na filtrovanie stromu tak, aby zobrazoval iba \u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly, alebo na obmedzenie h\u318?adania na \u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly (je to dostupn\u233? len vtedy, ke\u271? je otvoren\u253? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah) (Pozri {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<27|29818|0|23"}}{\fldrslt{Filtrovanie stromu}}}}\f0\fs20\lang3082  a {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<40|17398|0|16"}}{\fldrslt{N\u225?js\u357? v\u353?etko}}}}\f0\fs20\lang1033 ). \par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 \u352?ifrovan\u253? obsah m\u244?\u382?ete kedyko\u318?vek \ul skry\u357?\ulnone  op\u228?tovn\u253?m vykonan\u237?m pr\u237?kazu \cf5\b Zobrazi\u357? | \u352?ifrovan\u253? obsah\cf0\b0 . Chr\u225?nen\u253? obsah sa tie\u382? \ul automaticky \u8222?zatvor\u237?\u8220?\ulnone  po obdob\u237? ne\u269?innosti, ak m\u225?te za\u269?iarknut\u250? mo\u382?nos\u357? \cf5\b Automaticky zavrie\u357? iba \u353?ifrovan\u233? s\u250?bory\cf0\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Zna\u269?ku \u353?ifrovania je kedyko\u318?vek mo\u382?n\u233? prida\u357? alebo odstr\u225?ni\u357? pri \u318?ubovo\u318?nom obr\u225?zku \u269?i pozn\u225?mke. Ke\u271? tak urob\u237?te a \ul s\u250?bor .knt sa ulo\u382?\u237?\ulnone , pr\u237?slu\u353?n\u233? pozn\u225?mky a obr\u225?zky sa za\u353?ifruj\u250? alebo de\u353?ifruj\u250?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ka\u382?d\u253? \ul nov\u253? uzol\ulnone  vytvoren\u253? ako \ul podriaden\u253? uzol \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho nadraden\u233?ho uzla\ulnone  bude automaticky ozna\u269?en\u253? ako \u353?ifrovan\u253? \ul iba\ulnone  vtedy, ke\u271? je otvoren\u253? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ka\u382?d\u253? \ul nov\u253? obr\u225?zok\ulnone  vlo\u382?en\u253? do \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho uzla bude automaticky ozna\u269?en\u253? ako \u353?ifrovan\u253?. Ak sa tento obr\u225?zok potom skop\u237?ruje do in\u253?ch ne\u353?ifrovan\u253?ch obr\u225?zkov, aj tieto \u271?al\u353?ie v\u253?skyty bud\u250? ozna\u269?en\u233? ako \u353?ifrovan\u233?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Pri \u318?ubovo\u318?nom v\u253?bere uzlov m\u244?\u382?ete \ul zmeni\u357? stav ochrany\ulnone  v\u253?berom mo\u382?nosti \cf5\b \u352?ifrovan\u233?\cf0\b0  z kontextov\u233?ho menu v editore (kliknut\u237?m prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom). Ak t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357? vyberiete so stla\u269?en\u253?m kl\u225?vesom \cf7\b Shift\cf0\b0 , zmena sa rekurz\u237?vne pou\u382?ije na v\u353?etky podriaden\u233? uzly.\par


\pard\fi-400\li760\sb80\b Pozn\u225?mka\b0 : Ak sa pok\u250?site upravi\u357? \ul viacero uzlov s\u250?\u269?asne\ulnone  so zatvoren\u253?m \u353?ifrovan\u253?m obsahom, v\u353?imnete si, \u382?e po zadan\u237? hesla zmen\u237? stav ochrany iba jeden z uzlov (vysvetlen\u233? v issue #985). \par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 M\u244?\u382?ete vybra\u357? jeden alebo viac obr\u225?zkov a prepn\u250?\u357? ich stav ochrany pomocou mo\u382?nosti \cf5\b Za\u353?ifrova\u357?/de\u353?ifrova\u357? obr\u225?zok(y)\cf0\b0  v kontextovom menu editora (kliknut\u237?m prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom). Obr\u225?zok je tie\u382? mo\u382?n\u233? za\u353?ifrova\u357? alebo de\u353?ifrova\u357? z intern\u233?ho prehliada\u269?a.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ke\u271? \ul sa pok\u250?site odstr\u225?ni\u357?\ulnone  \u353?ifrovan\u253? uzol alebo uzol s nejak\u253?mi \u353?ifrovan\u253?mi podriaden\u253?mi uzlami, pr\u237?padne uzol, ktor\u253? obsahuje \u353?ifrovan\u233? obr\u225?zky, bude vy\u382?iadan\u233? potvrdenie a oper\u225?cia sa povol\u237? len vtedy, ak je \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah \lquote otvoren\u253?\rquote  alebo ho mo\u382?no otvori\u357? pomocou hesla, ktor\u233? sa bude vy\u382?adova\u357?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Pri \ul zl\u250?\u269?en\u237? s\u250?boru\ulnone  so \u353?ifrovan\u253?m obsahom KeyNote vy\u382?iada heslo k tomuto s\u250?boru, aby mohol zahrn\u250?\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u233? prvky. Ak toto heslo zad\u225?te, cel\u253? obsah s\u250?boru, ktor\u253? sa m\u225? zl\u250?\u269?i\u357? (pre vybran\u233? prie\u269?inky), sa zahrnie do s\u250?boru a bude chr\u225?nen\u253? heslom aktu\u225?lneho s\u250?boru alebo heslom nastaven\u253?m pre\u328? pred ulo\u382?en\u237?m s\u250?boru, ke\u271?\u382?e aktu\u225?lny s\u250?bor dokonca nemus\u237? ma\u357? za\u269?iarknut\u250? mo\u382?nos\u357? \ldblquote Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\rdblquote .\par


\pard\li360\sb40\sa20 Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e ak s\u250?bor po zl\u250?\u269?en\u237? ulo\u382?\u237?te bez toho, aby ste predt\u253?m nastavili \ldblquote Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\rdblquote , zna\u269?ka \u353?ifrovania t\u253?chto importovan\u253?ch polo\u382?iek sa zahod\u237?.\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 Pou\u382?it\u237?m mo\u382?nost\u237? S\u250?bor|Kop\u237?rova\u357? do... a Ulo\u382?i\u357? ako... sa zachov\u225? ochrana \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho obsahu.\par


\pard\sb80\par

\b D\u244?le\u382?it\u233?\b0 :\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 Nezabudnite \ul ozna\u269?i\u357?, \u269?o sa m\u225? uklada\u357? za\u353?ifrovan\u233?\ulnone . Tie\u382? pam\u228?tajte na to, \u382?e \ul podriaden\u233? uzly \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho uzla\ulnone  nemusia by\u357? nevyhnutne \u353?ifrovan\u233?. V z\u225?vislosti od konfigur\u225?cie s\u250?boru sa m\u244?\u382?ete rozhodn\u250?\u357? nezobrazova\u357? ne\u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly v strome ani ich potomkov. Tie podriaden\u233? uzly, ktor\u233? neboli ozna\u269?en\u233? ako \ldblquote \u352?ifrovan\u233?\rdblquote , v\u353?ak bud\u250? vidite\u318?n\u233? zo s\u250?boru .knt. (Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e tieto podriaden\u233? uzly m\u244?\u382?u by\u357? \u8222?norm\u225?lne\u8220? uzly, na ktor\u233? sa odkazuje odinakia\u318?)\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Hoci je polo\u382?ka \lquote \u352?ifrovan\u233?\rquote  dostupn\u225? v kontextovom menu priradenom k uzlom stromu, \u353?ifrovan\u233? bud\u250? pr\u225?ve pozn\u225?mky, ktor\u233? s nimi s\u250?visia, tak\u382?e ka\u382?d\u253? \ul prepojen\u253? uzol\ulnone  bude tie\u382? chr\u225?nen\u253?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ak zapnete mo\u382?nos\u357? \cf5\b Skry\u357? za\u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly v strome, ak \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah zostane \ldblquote zatvoren\u253?\rdblquote\cf0\b0 , majte na pam\u228?ti, \u382?e skryt\u233? bud\u250? aj v\u353?etky \ul podriaden\u233? uzly\ulnone , a to aj vtedy, ke\u271? nie s\u250? ozna\u269?en\u233? ako \u353?ifrovan\u233?. To plat\u237? aj pre podriaden\u233? uzly prepojen\u253?ch uzlov. Tieto skryt\u233?, ale neza\u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly m\u244?\u382?u by\u357? dokonca dostupn\u233? a upravite\u318?n\u233?, ak na ne existuje odkaz, ktor\u253? na ne presko\u269?\u237?, a to aj z h\u318?adania \u8222?N\u225?js\u357? v\u353?etko\u8220?, v strome sa v\u353?ak nikdy nezobrazia.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}\ul Ak je do neza\u353?ifrovan\u233?ho uzla vlo\u382?en\u253? nov\u253? obr\u225?zok\ulnone , zostane neza\u353?ifrovan\u253?, aj ke\u271? sa skop\u237?ruje alebo presunie do \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho uzla a zvy\u353?n\u233? v\u253?skyty obr\u225?zka sa odstr\u225?nia. Ak si mysl\u237?te, \u382?e by mal by\u357? chr\u225?nen\u253?, nezabudnite ho ozna\u269?i\u357? ako \u353?ifrovan\u253?. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e aj ke\u271? sa obr\u225?zok nach\u225?dza iba v \u353?ifrovanom uzle, m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? vidite\u318?n\u253? z intern\u233?ho {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|23459|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{Prehliada\u269? obr\u225?zkov}}}}\f0\fs20 : nemo\u382?no ho n\u225?js\u357? pos\u250?van\u237?m obr\u225?zkov kl\u225?vesom \cf7 Ctrl\cf0 , ale je mo\u382?n\u233? po\u382?iada\u357? o zobrazenie obr\u225?zka pod\u318?a jeho ID.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}\ul \u352?ifrovan\u233? obr\u225?zky\ulnone  nemo\u382?no zobrazi\u357? ani zmeni\u357? ich stav \u353?ifrovania, ale \ul mo\u382?no ich jednotlivo odstr\u225?ni\u357?\ulnone , ak sa nach\u225?dzaj\u250? \ul v uzloch \ulnone ktor\u233? \ul nie s\u250? \u353?ifrovan\u233?\ulnone . V\u253?ber a odstr\u225?nenie textu obsahuj\u250?ceho \u353?ifrovan\u233? obr\u225?zky tie\u382? nevyvol\u225? \u382?iadne upozornenie. Ak je d\u244?le\u382?it\u233?, aby sa \u382?iadne \u353?ifrovan\u233? obr\u225?zky nedali omylom odstr\u225?ni\u357?, nezabudnite do \u353?ifrovan\u233?ho uzla zahrn\u250?\u357? ich k\u243?piu. Pam\u228?tajte, \u382?e KeyNote umo\u382?\u328?uje viacero odkazov na ten ist\u253? obr\u225?zok bez zv\u228?\u269?\u353?enia ve\u318?kosti s\u250?boru.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Pri \b exporte\b0 , ak m\u225? s\u250?bor \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah, bude k dispoz\u237?cii nov\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? \cf5\b \u352?ifrovan\u253? obsah\cf0\b0 . Predvolene nebude za\u269?iarknut\u225?. Ak ju za\u269?iarknete (na \u269?o budete musie\u357? \ldblquote otvori\u357?\rdblquote  chr\u225?nen\u253? obsah), do vygenerovan\u233?ho s\u250?boru sa zahrn\u250? v\u353?etky \u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly a obr\u225?zky nach\u225?dzaj\u250?ce sa v prie\u269?inkoch a uzloch ur\u269?en\u253?ch na export. \par


\pard\li360\sb40 - Ak je cie\u318?ov\u253?m \ul form\u225?tom .knt\ulnone , bud\u250? chr\u225?nen\u233? rovnak\u253?m heslom (m\u244?\u382?ete ho zmeni\u357? alebo odstr\u225?ni\u357? \u353?ifrovanie otvoren\u237?m tohto s\u250?boru a prechodom na S\u250?bor | Vlastnosti). \par

- Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e pri akomko\u318?vek \ul inom cie\u318?ovom form\u225?te\ulnone  exportovan\u253? obsah \cf2 NEBUDE\cf0  chr\u225?nen\u253?.\par


\pard\sb80\highlight4\par


\pard\highlight0\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B4\'12\v0 Ako za\u353?ifrova\u357? svoj s\u250?bor KeyNote\par

\b0\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa140 Vytvorte nov\u253? s\u250?bor alebo otvorte u\u382? existuj\u250?ci s\u250?bor .KNT. Ak chcete s\u250?bor za\u353?ifrova\u357?, stla\u269?te \cf7\b Alt+Enter\cf0\b0 , \u269?\u237?m otvor\u237?te dial\u243?gov\u233? okno \cf5\b Vlastnosti s\u250?boru\cf0\b0  (alebo zvo\u318?te pr\u237?kaz \cf5\b S\u250?bor/Vlastnosti\cf0\b0 ).\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Kliknite na rozba\u318?ovac\u237? zoznam \cf5\b Form\u225?t\cf0  \b0  a vyberte ako form\u225?t, ktor\u253? sa m\u225? pou\u382?i\u357? na ulo\u382?enie s\u250?boru, polo\u382?ku \cf5\b KeyNote \u353?ifrovan\u253? s\u250?bor\cf0  \b0 . Ke\u271? to urob\u237?te, v dial\u243?govom okne sa objav\u237? \u271?al\u353?ia karta s n\u225?zvom {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<49|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Zabezpe\u269?enie}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Kliknite na kartu \cf5\b Zabezpe\u269?enie\cf0  \b0 . Rozhodnite sa, ak\u250? pr\u237?stupov\u250? fr\u225?zu chcete pou\u382?i\u357?, a zadajte ju do \cf5\b edita\u269?n\u233?ho po\u318?a Pr\u237?stupov\u225? fr\u225?za\cf0\b0 . \u270?alej zadajte presne t\u250? ist\u250? pr\u237?stupov\u250? fr\u225?zu do \cf5\b edita\u269?n\u233?ho po\u318?a Potvrdi\u357? fr\u225?zu\cf0  \b0 . T\u253?m sa zabezpe\u269?\u237?, \u382?e ste pr\u237?stupov\u250? fr\u225?zu omylom nepreklepli.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li360\sb100\b Pozn\u225?mka: \b0 Pr\u237?stupov\u225? fr\u225?za nem\u244?\u382?e by\u357? krat\u353?ia ako \b P\u196?\u356? \b0 znakov. Skuto\u269?ne bezpe\u269?n\u225? pr\u237?stupov\u225? fr\u225?za by v\u353?ak mala by\u357? ove\u318?a dlh\u353?ia (10-30 znakov). V ide\u225?lnom pr\u237?pade by va\u353?a pr\u237?stupov\u225? fr\u225?za nemala obsahova\u357? iba p\u237?smen\u225? abecedy, ale aj \u269?\u237?slice a interpunk\u269?n\u233? znaky vr\u225?tane medzery. Pam\u228?tajte, \u382?e pr\u237?stupov\u225? fr\u225?za rozli\u353?uje mal\u233? a ve\u318?k\u233? p\u237?smen\u225?. Ak chcete otvori\u357? za\u353?ifrovan\u253? s\u250?bor, budete musie\u357? zada\u357? pr\u237?stupov\u250? fr\u225?zu PRESNE tak, ako ste ju nap\u237?sali v tomto dial\u243?govom okne.\par


\pard\par

M\u244?\u382?ete si tie\u382? vybra\u357?, ktor\u253? \u353?ifrovac\u237? \cf5\b Algoritmus\cf0\b0  pou\u382?i\u357?: \b Blowfish \b0 alebo \b IDEA\b0 .\par

\par

Pole \cf5\b Iter\u225?cie\cf0\b0  m\u244?\u382?ete nakonfigurova\u357?: Pr\u237?stupov\u225? fr\u225?za sa transformuje pomocou funkcie na odvodenie k\u318?\u250?\u269?a. T\u253?m sa prid\u225?va faktor pr\u225?ce a s\u357?a\u382?uj\u250? sa slovn\u237?kov\u233? a h\u225?dacie \u250?toky. \u268?\u237?m viac iter\u225?ci\u237?, t\u253?m \u357?a\u382?\u353?ie s\u250? slovn\u237?kov\u233? a h\u225?dacie \u250?toky, ale aj na\u269?\u237?tanie s\u250?boru .knt trv\u225? dlh\u353?ie. Pomocou tla\u269?idla \ul Test\ulnone  m\u244?\u382?ete ur\u269?i\u357? \u269?as potrebn\u253? na odvodenie k\u318?\u250?\u269?a v z\u225?vislosti od po\u269?tu iter\u225?ci\u237?. Odpor\u250?\u269?anou hodnotou m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? \u269?\u237?slo, ktor\u233? trv\u225? pribli\u382?ne sekundu alebo o nie\u269?o dlh\u353?ie.\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa140 Kliknite na \cf7\b OK\cf0\b0 .\par


\pard\par

Ke\u271? sa s\u250?bor n\u225?sledne ulo\u382?\u237?, bude na va\u353?om disku ulo\u382?en\u253? v za\u353?ifrovanom stave. Ke\u271? tento s\u250?bor nesk\u244?r otvor\u237?te, KeyNote v\u225?s vyzve na zadanie pr\u237?stupov\u233?ho hesla. KeyNote nebude m\u244?c\u357? otvori\u357? za\u353?ifrovan\u253? s\u250?bor, ak nezad\u225?te spr\u225?vne pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo.\par


\pard\sb100\b Pozn\u225?mka:  \b0 Ak zatvor\u237?te s\u250?bor alebo ukon\u269?\u237?te KeyNote bez ulo\u382?enia s\u250?boru, zmeny vykonan\u233? v dial\u243?govom okne \ldblquote Vlastnosti s\u250?boru\rdblquote  sa NEzachovaj\u250? (a s\u250?bor zostane neza\u353?ifrovan\u253?). Ak m\u225?te zapnut\u250? mo\u382?nos\u357? Automatick\u233? ukladanie, KeyNote zmeny ulo\u382?\u237? automaticky.\par


\pard\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B5\'12\v0 Ako za\u353?ifrova\u357? uzly a/alebo obr\u225?zky v nat\u237?vnom alebo komprimovanom s\u250?bore Keynote\par

\b0\fs20\par

Postup je rovnak\u253? ako v predch\u225?dzaj\u250?cej \u269?asti, s t\u253?mito rozdielmi:\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80 Namiesto v\u253?beru form\u225?tu \u8222?za\u353?ifrovan\u253? s\u250?bor Keynote\u8220? mus\u237?te zabezpe\u269?i\u357?, aby bol vybrat\u253? jeden z \u271?al\u353?\u237?ch dvoch form\u225?tov (nat\u237?vny alebo komprimovan\u253?), a za\u269?iarknu\u357? mo\u382?nos\u357? \lquote\cf5\b Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\cf0\b0\rquote .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Na karte Zabezpe\u269?enie budete ma\u357? okrem zadania hesla, algoritmu a po\u269?tu iter\u225?ci\u237? k dispoz\u237?cii e\u353?te jednu mo\u382?nos\u357?: \cf5\b Skry\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly v strome, ak \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah zostane \ldblquote zatvoren\u253?\rdblquote\cf0\b0 .\par


\pard\highlight4\par

\highlight0\b Tip\b0 : Ak m\u225?te otvoren\u253? s\u250?bor v \u353?ifrovanom form\u225?te a vyberiete nat\u237?vny alebo komprimovan\u253? form\u225?t a n\u225?sledne za\u269?iarknete mo\u382?nos\u357? \lquote Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\rquote , predvolene sa pou\u382?ije rovnak\u233? heslo, tak\u382?e ak chcete, m\u244?\u382?ete klikn\u250?\u357? na OK bez toho, aby ste ho menili.\par

\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B6\'12\v0 Ako zmeni\u357? pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo pre u\u382? za\u353?ifrovan\u253? s\u250?bor\par

\b0\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa140 Otvorte za\u353?ifrovan\u253? s\u250?bor a na v\u253?zvu zadajte svoje pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo. Stla\u269?en\u237?m \cf7\b Alt+Enter\cf0\b0  otvor\u237?te dial\u243?gov\u233? okno \ldblquote Vlastnosti s\u250?boru\rdblquote  (alebo zvo\u318?te pr\u237?kaz \cf5\b S\u250?bor/Vlastnosti\cf0\b0 ).\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Kliknite na kartu \cf5\b Zabezpe\u269?enie\cf0  \b0 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Kliknite na tla\u269?idlo \cf5\b Nastavi\u357? pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo\cf0  \b0  a do vstupn\u253?ch pol\u237? Pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo a \cf5\b Potvrdi\u357? heslo\cf0  \b0  zadajte nov\u233? pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo, ako je pop\u237?san\u233? vy\u353?\u353?ie.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Kliknite na \cf7\b OK\cf0\b0 .\par


\pard\li360\sb100\b Pozn\u225?mka:  \b0 Ak zatvor\u237?te s\u250?bor alebo ukon\u269?\u237?te KeyNote bez ulo\u382?enia s\u250?boru, zmeny vykonan\u233? v dial\u243?govom okne \ldblquote Vlastnosti s\u250?boru\rdblquote  sa NEzachovaj\u250? (a s\u250?bor zostane za\u353?ifrovan\u253? p\u244?vodn\u253?m, nezmenen\u253?m pr\u237?stupov\u253?m heslom). Ak m\u225?te zapnut\u250? mo\u382?nos\u357? Automatick\u233? ukladanie, KeyNote zmeny ulo\u382?\u237? automaticky.\par


\pard\par


\pard\sb80 Pozn\u225?mka: V s\u250?boroch s \ul povolen\u253?m \u353?ifrovan\u253?m obsahom\ulnone  m\u244?\u382?ete zmeni\u357? aj heslo. Budete o\u328? po\u382?iadan\u237? po kliknut\u237? na \lquote Nastavi\u357? pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo\rquote , ak \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah zostane \lquote zatvoren\u253?\rquote .\par


\pard\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B7\'12\v0 Ako presta\u357? \u353?ifrova\u357? svoj s\u250?bor KeyNote\par

\b0\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa140 Otvorte za\u353?ifrovan\u253? s\u250?bor a na v\u253?zvu zadajte svoje pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo. Stla\u269?en\u237?m \cf7\b Alt+Enter\cf0\b0  otvor\u237?te dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Vlastnosti s\u250?boru (alebo zvo\u318?te \cf5\b S\u250?bor/Vlastnosti\cf0\b0 ).\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Kliknite na rozba\u318?ovac\u237? zoznam \cf5\b Form\u225?t\cf0  \b0  a vyberte nat\u237?vny s\u250?bor Keynote ako form\u225?t, ktor\u253? sa m\u225? pou\u382?i\u357? na ulo\u382?enie s\u250?boru. Karta Zabezpe\u269?enie zmizne.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Kliknite na \cf7\b OK\cf0\b0 .\par


\pard\li360\sb100\b Pozn\u225?mka:  \b0 Ak zatvor\u237?te s\u250?bor alebo ukon\u269?\u237?te KeyNote bez ulo\u382?enia s\u250?boru, zmeny vykonan\u233? v dial\u243?govom okne \ldblquote Vlastnosti s\u250?boru\rdblquote  sa NEzachovaj\u250? (a s\u250?bor zostane za\u353?ifrovan\u253?). Ak m\u225?te zapnut\u250? mo\u382?nos\u357? Automatick\u233? ukladanie, KeyNote zmeny ulo\u382?\u237? automaticky.\par


\pard\par


\pard\sb80 Pozn\u225?mka: V s\u250?boroch s \ul povolen\u253?m \u353?ifrovan\u253?m obsahom\ulnone  m\u244?\u382?ete odzna\u269?i\u357? mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\u8220?.\par


\pard\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B8\'12\v0 Pozn\u225?mka o \u353?ifrovac\u237?ch algoritmoch BLOWFISH a IDEA\par

\b0\fs20\par

KeyNote podporuje dva \u353?ifrovacie algoritmy: Blowfish a IDEA. Tieto dve \u353?ifry sa v KeyNote pou\u382?\u237?vali preto, lebo ich pou\u382?\u237?vanie nie je obmedzen\u233? patentov\u253?mi z\u225?konmi (Blowfish), alebo preto, \u382?e hoci s\u250? patentovan\u233?, s\u250? bezplatn\u233? na nekomer\u269?n\u233? pou\u382?itie (IDEA). Ak pou\u382?\u237?vate KeyNote v komer\u269?nom prostred\u237?, mali by ste pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? iba \u353?ifru Blowfish, ktor\u225? je predvolenou vo\u318?bou.\par

\par

Podrobn\u233? opisy pou\u382?it\u253?ch kryptografick\u253?ch algoritmov n\u225?jdete tu:\par

\par

Blowfish:\tab {{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.counterpane.com/blowfish.html }}{\fldrslt{http://www.counterpane.com/blowfish.html}}}}\f0\fs20  \par

IDEA: \tab\tab {{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.momentus.com.br/PGP/doc/idea.html }}{\fldrslt{http://www.momentus.com.br/PGP/doc/idea.html}}}}\f0\fs20  \par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B9\'12\v0 Bezpe\u269?nostn\u233? \u250?vahy\b0\par

\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa140 Ak ste si e\u353?te nepre\u269?\u237?tali \cf2\b UPOZORNENIE\cf0\b0  na za\u269?iatku tohto s\u250?boru, urobte tak teraz.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}\cf2\b Z\u193?LO\u381?N\u201? s\u250?bory\cf0\b0 : KeyNote je zvy\u269?ajne nastaven\u253? tak, aby si ako z\u225?lohu uchov\u225?val predch\u225?dzaj\u250?cu ulo\u382?en\u250? verziu v\u225?\u353?ho s\u250?boru; tieto s\u250?bory maj\u250? pr\u237?ponu \ldblquote .bak\rdblquote . Jedna z mo\u382?n\u253?ch zranite\u318?nost\u237? t\u253?kaj\u250?cich sa z\u225?lo\u382?n\u253?ch s\u250?borov spo\u269?\u237?va v tom, \u382?e z\u225?lo\u382?n\u253? s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?e zosta\u357? neza\u353?ifrovan\u253? aj potom, \u269?o bol v\u225?\u353? s\u250?bor KeyNote ulo\u382?en\u253? v za\u353?ifrovanom stave. Ak vytvor\u237?te nov\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote, ulo\u382?\u237?te ho a potom sa ho rozhodnete za\u353?ifrova\u357?, za\u353?ifrovan\u253? s\u250?bor sa ulo\u382?\u237? a jeho predch\u225?dzaj\u250?ca verzia sa premenuje s pr\u237?ponou \ldblquote .bak\rdblquote . Predch\u225?dzaj\u250?ca verzia \u8211? uchovan\u225? ako z\u225?loha \u8211? je neza\u353?ifrovan\u225?. Ke\u271? svoj s\u250?bor KeyNote ulo\u382?\u237?te znova, nov\u225? z\u225?loha bude k\u243?piou u\u382? za\u353?ifrovan\u233?ho s\u250?boru. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e to ist\u233? plat\u237? aj v situ\u225?cii, ke\u271? zmen\u237?te pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo za\u353?ifrovan\u233?ho s\u250?boru: pri prvom ulo\u382?en\u237? s\u250?boru je z\u225?lohou k\u243?pia s\u250?boru za\u353?ifrovan\u225? predt\u253?m pou\u382?\u237?van\u253?m pr\u237?stupov\u253?m heslom.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ak pou\u382?\u237?vate \ldblquote\ul Virtu\u225?lne uzly\ulnone\rdblquote , ktor\u233? KeyNote podporuje od verzie 0.91, v\u353?imnite si, \u382?e skuto\u269?n\u233? s\u250?bory na disku prepojen\u233? s virtu\u225?lnymi uzlami NIE s\u250? za\u353?ifrovan\u233?. Ani nem\u244?\u382?u by\u357?, preto\u382?e ak by ich KeyNote za\u353?ifroval, nemohli by ste tieto s\u250?bory otvori\u357? v in\u253?ch aplik\u225?ci\u225?ch ako KeyNote, \u269?\u237?m by sa virtu\u225?lne uzly stali nepou\u382?ite\u318?n\u253?mi a mohlo by d\u244?js\u357? k strate \u250?dajov. Pri prvom pridan\u237? virtu\u225?lneho uzla do za\u353?ifrovan\u233?ho s\u250?boru alebo pri za\u353?ifrovan\u237? s\u250?boru s virtu\u225?lnymi uzlami sa zobraz\u237? upozornenie.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo chr\u225?ni v\u225?\u353? s\u250?bor len vtedy, ke\u271? je \ul za\u353?ifrovan\u253? na disku\ulnone . Ke\u271? je KeyNote spusten\u253? a m\u225? \ul s\u250?bor otvoren\u253?\ulnone , s\u250?bor \ul m\u244?\u382?e zobrazi\u357? alebo upravi\u357?\ulnone  ktoko\u318?vek, kto m\u244?\u382?e pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? v\u225?\u353? po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?, a\u382? k\u253?m s\u250?bor nezatvor\u237?te. Skontrolujte pros\u237?m mo\u382?nosti \u8222?\cf5\b Zavrie\u357? s\u250?bor Notes po [n] min\u250?tach ne\u269?innosti\cf0\b0 ", "\cf5\b Automaticky zavrie\u357? iba za\u353?ifrovan\u233? s\u250?bory\cf0\b0 \u8220? a \u8222?\cf5\b Znovu otvori\u357? automaticky zavret\u233? s\u250?bory pri obnoven\u237? (iba za\u353?ifrovan\u233?)\cf0\b0 \u8220? dostupn\u233? v {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<95|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti konfigur\u225?cie / Akcie}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ak potrebujete v\u228?\u269?\u353?ie zabezpe\u269?enie, ne\u382? ak\u233? pon\u250?ka KeyNote, alebo ak potrebujete bezpe\u269?ne za\u353?ifrova\u357? d\u225?tov\u233? s\u250?bory vytvoren\u233? in\u253?mi aplik\u225?ciami, m\u244?\u382?ete namiesto toho zv\u225?\u382?i\u357? pou\u382?itie softv\u233?ru na \u353?ifrovanie disku. Tak\u253?to softv\u233?r za\u353?ifruje v\u353?etky s\u250?bory na vybranej part\u237?cii disku, \u269?\u237?m zabezpe\u269?\u237? V\u352?ETKY va\u353?e \u250?daje a programy. Existuj\u250? bezplatn\u233? programy na \u353?ifrovanie disku, ako napr\u237?klad ScramDisk, aj komer\u269?n\u233? rie\u353?enia. Pou\u382?\u237?vatelia PGP si m\u244?\u382?u v\u353?imn\u250?\u357?, \u382?e {{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.pgpi.com }}{\fldrslt{http://www.pgpi.com}}}}\f0\fs20  m\u225? bezplatn\u250? verziu PGP, ktor\u225? obsahuje modul PGPDisk. \u270?al\u353?ou v\u253?hodou tak\u233?hoto rie\u353?enia je, \u382?e si potrebujete zapam\u228?ta\u357? iba JEDNO pr\u237?stupov\u233? heslo na pr\u237?stup ku v\u353?etk\u253?m svojim za\u353?ifrovan\u253?m \u250?dajom \u8211? a ak\u253?ko\u318?vek nov\u253? nain\u353?talovan\u253? softv\u233?r alebo ak\u233?ko\u318?vek nov\u233? d\u225?tov\u233? s\u250?bory umiestnen\u233? na za\u353?ifrovanej part\u237?cii disku s\u250? okam\u382?ite chr\u225?nen\u233? bez ak\u233?hoko\u318?vek \u271?al\u353?ieho \u250?silia z va\u353?ej strany.\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\b A pam\u228?tajte\b0 , \u382?e ako v\u228?\u269?\u353?ina desktopov\u253?ch aplik\u225?ci\u237? je KeyNote zranite\u318?n\u253? vo\u269?i:\par


\pard\li360   - keyloggerom be\u382?iacim v syst\u233?me\par

  - \u250?tokom prostredn\u237?ctvom v\u253?pisu pam\u228?te\par

  - malv\u233?ru so schopnos\u357?ou injekt\u225?\u382?e procesov\par


\pard   \par


\pard\li360 Ak je v\u225?\u353? syst\u233?m napadnut\u253? malv\u233?rom, \u382?iadna desktopov\u225? aplik\u225?cia nem\u244?\u382?e zaru\u269?i\u357? \u250?pln\u250? bezpe\u269?nos\u357? hesiel. Preto ako \b odpor\u250?\u269?ania\b0 :\par

 - Pou\u382?\u237?vajte siln\u233? hesl\u225?\par

 - Udr\u382?ujte svoj syst\u233?m bez malv\u233?ru\par

 - Pre citliv\u233? s\u250?bory pou\u382?\u237?vajte \u250?pln\u233? \u353?ifrovanie disku\par

 - Zv\u225?\u382?te pou\u382?itie \u353?pecializovan\u233?ho spr\u225?vcu hesiel pre kritick\u233? prihlasovacie \u250?daje\par


\pard\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B10\'12\v0 R\u244?zne pozn\u225?mky\b0\par

\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa140\ul V star\u253?ch verzi\u225?ch KeyNote\ulnone : KeyNote umo\u382?\u328?oval uklada\u357? \u250?daje vo form\u225?te, ktor\u253? pou\u382?\u237?va podobn\u225? aplik\u225?cia s n\u225?zvom DartNotes (pozri s\u250?bor \ldblquote dart.txt\rdblquote ). Ke\u271?\u382?e v\u353?ak DartNotes nepodporuje \u353?ifrovanie, s\u250?bory ulo\u382?en\u233? v tomto form\u225?te ste nemohli za\u353?ifrova\u357?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Pomocou dial\u243?gov\u233?ho okna Vlastnosti s\u250?boru m\u244?\u382?ete ku ka\u382?d\u233?mu s\u250?boru prida\u357? volite\u318?n\u253? popis a koment\u225?r. Ak je s\u250?bor za\u353?ifrovan\u253?, popis a koment\u225?r sa za\u353?ifruj\u250? tie\u382?. Zobrazia sa v\u353?ak V OTVORENOM TEXTE v dial\u243?govom okne {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<50|496|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov}}}}\f0\fs20 , ktor\u233? NIE je chr\u225?nen\u233? heslom. To sa m\u244?\u382?e v bud\u250?cnosti zmeni\u357?, ale zatia\u318? re\u357?azce popisu a koment\u225?ra nie s\u250? zabezpe\u269?en\u233?, aj ke\u271? samotn\u253? s\u250?bor je.\par


\pard\par

\b Pou\u382?it\u233? kryptografick\u233? algoritmy: DCPCrypt, bal\u237?k kryptografick\u253?ch komponentov pre Delphi od Davida Bartona:\b0\par


\pard\li240 {{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.cityinthesky.co.uk/cryptography.html }}{\fldrslt{http://www.cityinthesky.co.uk/cryptography.html}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240 Ak v\u225?s zauj\u237?ma, ako sa bal\u237?k DCPCrypt pou\u382?il v KeyNote, m\u244?\u382?ete si stiahnu\u357? \u269?asti zdrojov\u233?ho k\u243?du KeyNote s\u250?visiace s kryptografiou z {{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.tranglos.com/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.tranglos.com/}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

\cf2\b\par

}
