\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 Odpor\u250?\u269?ania \b0 o tom\b , kedy uklada\u357? \b0 a\b  ako vytv\u225?ra\u357? z\u225?lo\u382?n\u233? k\u243?pie\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par


\pard\sb100\sa60\f2\fs20\lang3082 KeyNote obsahuje mo\u382?nos\u357? \b Automaticky uklada\u357? zmeny\b0  "{\b{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<92|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{pri prepnut\u237? do inej aplik\u225?cie}}}}}\f2\fs20 ". To v\u353?ak znamen\u225?, \u382?e \b v\u382?dy, ke\u271?\b0  KeyNote strat\u237? fokus, vykon\u225? sa CEL\u221? proces ukladania vr\u225?tane vytvorenia v\u353?etk\u253?ch z\u225?lo\u382?n\u253?ch s\u250?borov pod\u318?a konfigur\u225?cie. To m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? ve\u318?mi \u8222?drah\u233?\u8220? na CPU / pevn\u253? disk, najm\u228? pri ve\u318?k\u253?ch s\u250?boroch. A mohlo by to zhor\u353?i\u357? v\u225?\u353? z\u225?\u382?itok s KNT. \par


\pard\sa100 Ja \ul neodpor\u250?\u269?am t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357?\ulnone  okrem od\u244?vodnen\u253?ch situ\u225?ci\u237? a v z\u225?sade pri mal\u253?ch ve\u318?kostiach s\u250?borov.\par


\pard\sb100\sa100 Odpor\u250?\u269?am pou\u382?i\u357? mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?\b Ka\u382?d\u253?ch X min\u250?t\b0 \u8220? spolu s mo\u382?nos\u357?ou \u8222?\b Z\u225?lohovanie v pravideln\u253?ch intervaloch\b0 \u8220?. Pri tejto poslednej mo\u382?nosti viete, \u382?e budete ma\u357? k\u243?pie, o ktor\u253?ch m\u225?te istotu, \u382?e nebud\u250? prep\u237?san\u233?: posledn\u233? 4 za t\u253?\u382?dne, raz za ka\u382?d\u253? mesiac, ... Budete ma\u357? aj k\u243?piu so situ\u225?ciou tesne pred prvou modifik\u225?ciou v danom dni. \par


\pard\sb20\sa100 U\u382?ito\u269?n\u225? je aj mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?\b Z\u225?lohova\u357? p\u244?vodn\u253? s\u250?bor pri ukladan\u237? zmien\b0 \u8220?, ale v\u353?imnite si, \u382?e ak ju pou\u382?ijete so zapnutou mo\u382?nos\u357?ou \u8222?pri prepnut\u237? do inej aplik\u225?cie\u8220?, m\u244?\u382?e to znamena\u357?, \u382?e star\u353?ie z t\u253?chto cyklick\u253?ch z\u225?loh bud\u250? pr\u237?li\u353? ned\u225?vne..., preto\u382?e sa bud\u250? neust\u225?le prepisova\u357?.\par


\pard Pam\u228?tajte, \u382?e samozrejme m\u244?\u382?ete kedyko\u318?vek manu\u225?lne stla\u269?i\u357? tla\u269?idlo Ulo\u382?i\u357?, ke\u271? m\u225?te pocit \u8222?ak vypadne pr\u250?d a strat\u237?m v\u353?etky neulo\u382?en\u233? zmeny, som v koncoch...\u8220? \f3\fs26 J\f2\fs20\par

\f0\lang1033\par

Vo v\u353?eobecnosti \cf3\b je v\u382?dy d\u244?razne odpor\u250?\u269?an\u233? uchov\u225?va\u357? z\u225?lohy\cf0\b0  s\u250?borov .knt (a v\u353?etk\u253?ch druhov s\u250?borov, ktor\u233? pova\u382?ujete za d\u244?le\u382?it\u233?)\par

\par

V\u353?imnite si, \u382?e \b ak pou\u382?\u237?vate komprimovan\u253? alebo \u353?ifrovan\u253? form\u225?t\b0 , potom je to e\u353?te d\u244?le\u382?itej\u353?ie, preto\u382?e ak sa s\u250?bor z ak\u233?hoko\u318?vek d\u244?vodu po\u353?kod\u237?, nebude ho mo\u382?n\u233? otvori\u357? v KNT. Naproti tomu pri nat\u237?vnom s\u250?bore by sme ho mohli sk\u250?si\u357? otvori\u357? v nejakom textovom editore, napr\u237?klad Notepad++, a mo\u382?no by sme dok\u225?zali obnovi\u357? niektor\u233? inform\u225?cie (hoci to vy\u382?aduje pozna\u357? vn\u250?tornosti KeyNote, ako je pop\u237?san\u233? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<55|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{form\u225?ty s\u250?borov}}}}}\f0\fs20 )  \par

   \par

Komprimovan\u233? a \u353?ifrovan\u233? form\u225?ty s\u250? bezpe\u269?n\u233?, \b ale dr\u382?te sa na bezpe\u269?nej strane\b0  a v\u382?dy \b si uchov\u225?vajte z\u225?lo\u382?n\u233? k\u243?pie\b0 , a to pomocou mo\u382?nosti \u8222?Z\u225?lohovanie v pravideln\u253?ch intervaloch\u8220?, a tie\u382?, ak m\u244?\u382?ete, uchov\u225?vajte k\u243?pie svojich osobn\u253?ch s\u250?borov \b na in\u253?ch diskoch\b0 , na \b NAS\b0 , alebo dokonca v \b cloude\b0  (m\u244?\u382?ete ma\u357? svoj prie\u269?inok synchronizovan\u253? so slu\u382?bami ako Dropbox, Google Drive, One Drive at\u271?.). A ak s\u250? \u250?daje citliv\u233?, m\u244?\u382?ete jednotlivo za\u353?ifrova\u357? v\u353?etky s\u250?bory v prie\u269?inku, ktor\u253? synchronizujete a ktor\u253? m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? ako z\u225?lo\u382?n\u253? prie\u269?inok. \par

Existuj\u250? programy, ktor\u233? to umo\u382?\u328?uj\u250? robi\u357? transparentne: synchronizovan\u253? prie\u269?inok je za\u353?ifrovan\u253? a k t\u253?mto s\u250?borom m\u244?\u382?ete pristupova\u357? cez lok\u225?lny virtu\u225?lny disk, ktor\u253? pri ukladan\u237? automaticky \u353?ifruje a pri otv\u225?ran\u237? de\u353?ifruje. Ako pr\u237?klad: Boxcryptor ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://www.boxcryptor.com/ }}{\fldrslt{https://www.boxcryptor.com/}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) (\i Pozn\u225?mka: Ke\u271? p\u237?\u353?em tieto pozn\u225?mky, vid\u237?m, \u382?e Dropbox z\u237?skava technol\u243?giu Boxcriptor, aby ju nat\u237?vne zabudoval do produktu Dropbox\i0 )\par

\par

\par

\b\v\'11B1\'12\v0 Pr\u225?ca s \ul re\u382?imami extern\u233?ho ukladania obr\u225?zkov\ulnone\b0\par

\par

Ako je uveden\u233? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|2263|0|6"}}{\fldrslt{Spr\u225?va obr\u225?zkov v KeyNote NF}}}}}\f0\fs20  m\u244?\u382?ete obr\u225?zky pridan\u233? do va\u353?ich s\u250?borov .knt uklada\u357? do extern\u253?ch \u250?lo\u382?\u237?sk (prie\u269?inok alebo zip).\par

Ke\u271? pou\u382?ijete jeden z t\u253?chto re\u382?imov extern\u233?ho ukladania, z\u225?lohy vytvoren\u233? aplik\u225?ciou KeyNote nebud\u250? obsahova\u357? tieto obr\u225?zky. \cf3 Je va\u353?ou zodpovednos\u357?ou z\u225?lohova\u357? obrazov\u233? s\u250?bory ulo\u382?en\u233? v extern\u253?ch \u250?lo\u382?isk\u225?ch\cf0 , ak je to potrebn\u233?.\par

\par

\b Tip\b0 : Jednoduch\u253? sp\u244?sob, ako vytvori\u357? \u250?pln\u233? z\u225?lohy s\u250?borov .knt, ktor\u233? obsahuj\u250? text aj obr\u225?zky, je ob\u269?as pou\u382?i\u357? pr\u237?kaz {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|5817|0|14"}}{\fldrslt{S\u250?bor | Kop\u237?rova\u357? do...}}}}}\f0\fs20 \par


\pard\sb80\f2\lang3082 Takto vytvoren\u233? k\u243?pie m\u244?\u382?u alebo nemusia obsahova\u357? obr\u225?zky v z\u225?vislosti od nasleduj\u250?cej konfigurovate\u318?nej mo\u382?nosti: {\b{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<90|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Re\u382?im ukladania pri exporte}}}}}\f2\fs20 : EmbeddedRTF, EmbeddedKNT, No export images. Mali by ste pou\u382?i\u357? \u8222?\b Embedded KNT\b0 \u8220?. Ak by ste potrebovali obnovi\u357? svoje \u250?daje z tohto s\u250?boru, budete m\u244?c\u357? pod\u318?a potreby zmeni\u357? re\u382?im ukladania sp\u228?\u357? na extern\u253? prie\u269?inok (alebo zip).\par


\pard\f0\lang1033\par

\f2\lang3082 Je tie\u382? mo\u382?n\u233? exportova\u357? v\u353?etky alebo niektor\u233? pozn\u225?mky do form\u225?tu KNT pomocou {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|5340|0|16"}}{\fldrslt{S\u250?bor | Exportova\u357?...}}}}}\f2\fs20 , s pou\u382?it\u237?m tej istej mo\u382?nosti, a tak zahrn\u250?\u357? text a obr\u225?zky do jedn\u233?ho s\u250?boru .knt.\par

\par

}
