\pard\sb100\sa180\cf5\b\v\f2\fs26\'11B5\'12\v0 Export pozn\u225?mok do \u269?ist\u253?ch s\u250?borov TreePad\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\fs20 V \u269?ase, ke\u271? bol nap\u237?san\u253? k\u243?d na export a import z programu TreePad, existovali dve ed\u237?cie programu: freewarov\u225? ed\u237?cia podporovala iba s\u250?bory s \u269?ist\u253?m textom, zatia\u318? \u269?o sharewarov\u225? ed\u237?cia podporovala \u269?ist\u253? text a s\u250?bory vo form\u225?te RTF a HTML. S\u250?bory KeyNote mo\u382?no exportova\u357? vo form\u225?te kompatibilnom s freewarovou alebo sharewarovou ed\u237?ciou t\u253?ch star\u353?\u237?ch verzi\u237? TreePad. \u270?al\u353?ie inform\u225?cie n\u225?jdete na {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.treepad.com }}{\fldrslt{http://www.treepad.com}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par

Kliknut\u237?m na kartu mo\u382?nost\u237? TreePad m\u244?\u382?ete skontrolova\u357? alebo zmeni\u357? nastavenia mo\u382?nost\u237?, ktor\u233? riadia export do form\u225?tu TreePad.\par

\par

\par


\pard\li360\v\'11I184\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:184,326,285"}}{\fldrslt {184_Clipb_31mar.png}}}}\lang1033\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa120\b Ak chcete vybra\u357? cie\u318?ov\u250? ed\u237?ciu TreePad\b0\par


\pard Kliknite na kartu mo\u382?nost\u237? TreePad a v poli Cie\u318?ov\u225? verzia TreePad vyberte form\u225?t, ktor\u253? potrebujete. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e pri exporte do freewarovej ed\u237?cie (iba \u269?ist\u253? text) sa strat\u237? v\u353?etko form\u225?tovanie textu, ale v\u253?sledn\u253? s\u250?bor bud\u250? m\u244?c\u357? \u269?\u237?ta\u357? obidve ed\u237?cie TreePad, freewarov\u225? aj sharewarov\u225?. Ak exportujete do sharewarovej ed\u237?cie, form\u225?tovanie textu sa zachov\u225?, ale s\u250?bor bude m\u244?c\u357? otvori\u357? iba sharewarov\u225? ed\u237?cia TreePad.\par

\par


\pard\sa120\b Export viacer\u253?ch prie\u269?inkov do s\u250?borov TreePad\b0\par


\pard S\u250?bor TreePad m\u244?\u382?e obsahova\u357? iba jeden \u8222?prie\u269?inok\u8220? na s\u250?bor, na rozdiel od KeyNote, kde m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? v jednom s\u250?bore viacero prie\u269?inkov. KeyNote v\u225?m preto d\u225?va na v\u253?ber, \u269?i exportova\u357? ka\u382?d\u253? prie\u269?inok do samostatn\u233?ho s\u250?boru TreePad, alebo spoji\u357? viacero prie\u269?inkov do jedn\u233?ho s\u250?boru TreePad. Ak zvol\u237?te druh\u250? mo\u382?nos\u357?, v\u353?etky exportovan\u233? prie\u269?inky sa umiestnia do jednej stromovej \u353?trukt\u250?ry TreePad. Ak chcete vybra\u357? jedno z t\u253?chto nastaven\u237?, kliknite na kartu \b Mo\u382?nosti TreePad\b0  a vyberte mo\u382?nos\u357? v poli \b Re\u382?im cie\u318?ov\u233?ho s\u250?boru\b0 .\par

\par


\pard\fi-640\li640\ul Pozn\u225?mka\ulnone :\b   \b0 Pri exporte do form\u225?tu TreePad nie je mo\u382?n\u233? vybra\u357? jednotliv\u233? uzly stromu ani skupiny uzlov. Exportova\u357? mo\u382?no iba cel\u233? prie\u269?inky.\par


\pard\par

\b D\u244?le\u382?it\u225? pozn\u225?mka: \par

\b0 \u352?trukt\u250?ra s\u250?boru TreePad m\u225? obmedzenie, ktor\u233? s\u250?bory KeyNote nemaj\u250?. S\u250?bor TreePad m\u244?\u382?e ma\u357? iba jeden uzol najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne (v KeyNote naz\u253?van\u253? \u8222?Master node\u8220?). V\u353?etky ostatn\u233? uzly v strome musia by\u357? podraden\u233? uzlu najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne. V KeyNote m\u244?\u382?ete ma\u357? to\u318?ko uzlov najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne, ko\u318?ko chcete. Napr\u237?klad nasleduj\u250?ca stromov\u225? \u353?trukt\u250?ra je v KeyNote podporovan\u225?, ale v TreePad nie:\par

\par

\b\f6 + Uzol najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne\tab  \tab  \b0 (\u250?rove\u328? 1)\b\par

| -- podraden\u253? uzol \tab\tab    \b0 (\u250?rove\u328? 2)\b\par

| -- podraden\u253? uzol \tab\tab    \b0 (\u250?rove\u328? 2)\b\par

+ \u270?al\u353?\u237? uzol najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne \b0 (\u250?rove\u328? 1)\b\par

| -- podraden\u253? uzol \tab\tab    \b0 (\u250?rove\u328? 2)\b\par

\b0\f0\par

V TreePad vy\u353?\u353?ie uveden\u225? stromov\u225? \u353?trukt\u250?ra nie je mo\u382?n\u225?: m\u244?\u382?e existova\u357? iba jeden uzol \u8222?\u250?rovne 1\u8220?. To sa st\u225?va probl\u233?mom pri exporte stromu KeyNote s viac ako jedn\u253?m uzlom najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne alebo pri exporte viacer\u253?ch pozn\u225?mok do jedn\u233?ho s\u250?boru TreePad. Ke\u271? KeyNote zist\u237? tak\u250?to situ\u225?ciu, vytvor\u237? dodato\u269?n\u253? \u8222?fikt\u237?vny\u8220? uzol, ktor\u253? sa umiestni ako uzol najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne v s\u250?bore TreePad, zatia\u318? \u269?o skuto\u269?n\u233? pozn\u225?mky KeyNote sa umiestnia ako podraden\u233? uzly fikt\u237?vneho uzla. Napr\u237?klad vy\u353?\u353?ie uveden\u225? stromov\u225? \u353?trukt\u250?ra by sa transformovala na nasleduj\u250?cu:\par

\par

\b\f6 + Fikt\u237?vny uzol najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne\b0  \tab\tab (\u250?rove\u328? 1)\par

\b |-- + Uzol najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne\b0  \tab\tab   (\u250?rove\u328? 2)\par

\b |   |-- podraden\u253? uzol\b0  \tab\tab    (\u250?rove\u328? 3)\par

\b |   |-- podraden\u253? uzol\b0  \tab\tab    (\u250?rove\u328? 3)\par

\b |-- + \u270?al\u353?\u237? uzol najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne\b0  \tab (\u250?rove\u328? 1)\par

\b |   |-- podraden\u253? uzol\b0  \tab\tab   (\u250?rove\u328? 2)\par

\f0\par

Dodato\u269?n\u253? \u8222?fikt\u237?vny\u8220? uzol sa napln\u237? s\u250?hrnn\u253?mi inform\u225?ciami odvoden\u253?mi z importovan\u233?ho s\u250?boru KeyNote: n\u225?zov s\u250?boru, popis a koment\u225?r s\u250?boru a d\u225?tum vytvorenia s\u250?boru.\par

\par

Predvolene sa tento dodato\u269?n\u253? uzol najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne vytvor\u237? iba v pr\u237?pade potreby (KeyNote nevykon\u225?va \u250?pln\u250? anal\u253?zu a rad\u353?ej vol\u237? opatrnos\u357?, t. j. kompatibilitu). KeyNote m\u244?\u382?ete prin\u250?ti\u357?, aby tento dodato\u269?n\u253? uzol vytv\u225?ral v\u382?dy: kliknite na kartu mo\u382?nost\u237? TreePad a vyberte svoju preferenciu v poli Uzol najvy\u353?\u353?ej \u250?rovne kompatibility.\par

\par

\par

}
