\pard\f0\fs20\lang3082\par

Rovnak\u225? konfigur\u225?cia ako v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<66|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Ex. Txt 3 - Indent.}}}}}\f0\fs20 , ale s \b D\u314?\u382?ka nadpisu\b0 ="80,\b 0\b0 ,10"\par

\fs16\par


\pard\sb100\sa100\f1\fs20 V tomto pr\u237?klade je v \cf2\b D\u314?\u382?ka nadpisu\cf0\b0  \u250?bytok 0, a tak by v\u353?etky riadky so symbolmi mali dosiahnu\u357? rovnak\u250? maxim\u225?lnu hodnotu (80), ale ke\u271?\u382?e je zapnut\u233? \cf2\b Ods\u225?dza\u357? uzly\cf0\b0  a TabSize=4 (a tie\u382? \cf2\b Zvy\u353?ova\u357? odsadenie o\cf0\b0 = 12 a \cf2\b Odsadenie o\cf0\b0 =24) v pozn\u225?mke, z ka\u382?dej novej \u250?rovne sa odoberie 8 znakov.\par


\pard M\u244?\u382?ete si v\u353?imn\u250?\u357?, \u382?e riadky nevyzeraj\u250? ma\u357? rovnak\u250? d\u314?\u382?ku. Je to sp\u244?soben\u233? pou\u382?it\u237?m tabul\u225?tora a t\u253?m, \u382?e priestor, ktor\u253? zaber\u225? 1 TAB, presne nezodpoved\u225? 4 medzer\u225?m. Ak tento text skop\u237?rujete a vlo\u382?\u237?te do Notepad++ alebo Notepad2 s nastaven\u237?m 1 Tab=4 medzery, uvid\u237?te, \u382?e konce naozaj vyzeraj\u250? zarovnan\u233?.\par


\pard\sb80 V bud\u250?cich verzi\u225?ch sa to pok\u250?sime vyrie\u353?i\u357?, ako je po\u382?adovan\u233? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/issues/615"}}{\fldrslt{Povoli\u357? konfigur\u225?ciu zar\u225?\u382?ok tabul\u225?tora (snaha zos\u250?ladi\u357? TAB so \u353?tyrmi medzerami)}}}}}\f1\fs20\par


