\pard\sb100\sa100\f1\fs20 Tento pr\u237?klad z\u225?rove\u328? ukazuje v\u253?sledok \b exportu odr\u225?\u382?ok\b0  a \b \u269?\u237?slovan\u253?ch zoznamov\b0  do \u269?ist\u233?ho textu s pou\u382?it\u237?m dvoch konfigurovate\u318?n\u253?ch mo\u382?nost\u237? v s\u250?bore .INI:\par


\pard\li360\b NumbTabInPlainText\b0 =" " \par

\b BulletsInPlainText\b0 ="- "\par


\pard\par


