{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue160;\red0\green0\blue255;\red128\green0\blue0;\red96\green96\blue96;\red0\green0\blue128;\red128\green128\blue0;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 \u352?abl\u243?ny\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Karta \u352?abl\u243?ny, dostupn\u225? cez {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<12|448|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Panel zdrojov}}}}}\f0\fs20 , zobrazuje zoznam s\u250?borov (.txt alebo .rtf), ktor\u233? m\u244?\u382?ete vlo\u382?i\u357? do Editora ako \u353?abl\u243?ny.\par

\par

Tieto s\u250?bory sa nach\u225?dzaj\u250? v podprie\u269?inku \u8222?Templates\u8220? (relat\u237?vne k umiestneniu s\u250?boru .exe).\par

Tieto s\u250?bory m\u244?\u382?ete vytvori\u357? v \u318?ubovo\u318?nom externom editore a prida\u357? ich do tohto podprie\u269?inka, alebo na tejto karte \u352?abl\u243?ny v KeyNote:\par

\par


\pard\li360\v\'11I166\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:166,216,223"}}{\fldrslt {166_Clipb_27ene.png}}}}\lang1033\par


\pard\par

\par

S\u250?bor sa vytvor\u237? z vybran\u233?ho textu (ak nejak\u253? je) alebo z cel\u233?ho textu akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mky (uzla). Form\u225?tovanie textu m\u244?\u382?ete zoh\u318?adni\u357? alebo ignorova\u357?, \u269?\u237?m vytvor\u237?te s\u250?bor .rtf alebo .txt.\par

\par

\b Tip\b0 : M\u244?\u382?ete si pripravi\u357? jednoduch\u233? form\u225?ty pr\u225?zdnych tabuliek a ulo\u382?i\u357? ich ako \u353?abl\u243?ny, aby ste ich mohli \u318?ahko pou\u382?i\u357?, ke\u271? ich potrebujete. Ka\u382?d\u250? \u353?abl\u243?nu m\u244?\u382?ete pomenova\u357? (napr. Table_3x2).\par


\pard\sb80 In\u233? mo\u382?n\u233? vyu\u382?itie: \u353?tandardn\u233? \u353?abl\u243?ny (pod\u318?a va\u353?ich vlastn\u253?ch potrieb) na zbieranie z\u225?pisov zo stretnut\u237?, odr\u225?\u382?aj\u250?ce diskutovan\u250? t\u233?mu, z\u250?\u269?astnen\u253?ch, \u250?lohy at\u271?.\par

V\u353?eobecne ak\u253?ko\u318?vek text alebo fragment, ktor\u253? \u269?asto p\u237?\u353?ete alebo opakovane pou\u382?\u237?vate.\par


\pard\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa80 Stla\u269?en\u237?m \cf3\b Enter\cf0\b0  alebo dvojit\u253?m kliknut\u237?m vlo\u382?\u237?te \u353?abl\u243?nu do aktu\u225?lnej pozn\u225?mky. \par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Stla\u269?en\u237?m \cf3\b Insert\cf0\b0  vytvor\u237?te nov\u250? \u353?abl\u243?nu. Ikona \v\'11I36\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:36,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {36_Main_36.png}}}}\lang1033  ved\u318?a \u353?abl\u243?ny ozna\u269?uje \u353?abl\u243?nu \cf4\b Rich Text\cf0\b0  (\u353?abl\u243?na, ktor\u225? obsahuje form\u225?tovanie textu); ikona \v\'11I37\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:37,17,17"}}{\fldrslt {37_Main_37.png}}}}\lang1033  ozna\u269?uje \u353?abl\u243?nu \cf4\b \u269?ist\u233?ho textu\cf0\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}K dispoz\u237?cii je kontextov\u233? menu s mo\u382?nos\u357?ami: Vlo\u382?i\u357? \u353?abl\u243?nu, Vytvori\u357? \u353?abl\u243?nu..., Odstr\u225?ni\u357? \u353?abl\u243?nu\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak prid\u225?te \u353?abl\u243?nu po\u269?as behu KeyNote, nemus\u237?te KeyNote re\u353?tartova\u357?, aby sa nov\u225? polo\u382?ka zobrazila. Sta\u269?\u237? stla\u269?i\u357? \cf3\b F9\cf0\b0 ; panel zdrojov sa skryje a potom znova zobraz\u237? a zoznam \u353?abl\u243?n sa obnov\u237?.\par


\pard\par

\par

\v\'11B1\'12\v0 RTF \u353?abl\u243?ny m\u244?\u382?u pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? nasleduj\u250?ce \b tokeny\b0  na umo\u382?nenie ur\u269?itej \ul konfigur\u225?cie farieb\ulnone :\par

  \par

     \cf5\b %NCOLOR%\cf0\b0     Odkazuje na farbu pozadia pozn\u225?mky\par

     \cf5\b %TSCOLOR%\cf0\b0\tab ,,     farba textu v\u253?beru  ,,\par

     \cf5\b %TCOLOR%\cf0\b0\tab ,,     Farba textu (Form\u225?t|Farba textu,  \cf3 Ctrl+R\cf0 )\par

     \cf5\b %THCOLOR%\cf0\b0\tab ,,     Farba zv\u253?raznenia textu (Form\u225?t|Pou\u382?i\u357? farbu zv\u253?raznenia,  \cf3 Ctrl+H\cf0 )\par

  \par

Bud\u250? nahraden\u233? v\u253?razmi v tvare \u8222?\\redX\\greenY\\blueZ\u8220? a s\u250? ur\u269?en\u233? na pou\u382?itie v bloku \u8222?colortbl\u8220?, ktor\u253? sa nach\u225?dza na za\u269?iatku k\u243?du RTF.\par

  \par

Pr\u237?klady pou\u382?itia t\u253?chto tokenov s\u250? dostupn\u233? v nieko\u318?k\u253?ch \u353?abl\u243?nach distribuovan\u253?ch v prie\u269?inku Templates, v podprie\u269?inku s n\u225?zvom \u8222?Examples\u8220?. Pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<20|25599|0|19"}}{\fldrslt{vkladanie riadka do editora}}}}}\f0\fs20  a {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<20|21073|0|20"}}{\fldrslt{vkladanie tabuliek}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

M\u244?\u382?ete vidie\u357?, \u382?e obsahuj\u250?:\par

  \cf6\{\\rtf1\\ansi\{\\colortbl ;%NCOLOR%;%TCOLOR%;\}\cf0\par

  ...\par

  \par

  \cf6\{\\rtf1\\ansi\{\\colortbl ;\\red255\\green255\\blue255;\\red0\\green0\\blue0;\\red0\\green0\\blue255;%TSCOLOR%;%THCOLOR%;%TCOLOR%;\}\cf0\par

  ...\par

  \par

}
