\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\par

Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly sa zobrazuj\u250? na paneli prostriedkov. Stla\u269?en\u237?m \cf3\b F9\cf0\b0  zobraz\u237?te panel prostriedkov.\par

\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<72|196|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly: V\u353?eobecn\u233? inform\u225?cie pre pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?ov}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<72|1856|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly: V\u353?eobecn\u233? inform\u225?cie pre v\u253?voj\u225?rov}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<72|2833|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<72|5068|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{S\u357?ahovanie z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<72|5561|0|6"}}{\fldrslt{\u268?o dok\u225?\u382?u z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<72|8265|0|7"}}{\fldrslt{Rezidentn\u233? z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<72|9621|0|8"}}{\fldrslt{Obmedzenia}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs22\'11B1\'12\v0 Z\u193?SUVN\u201? MODULY: V\u352?EOBECN\u201? INFORM\u193?CIE PRE POU\u381?\u205?VATE\u317?OV\b0\par

\fs20\par

Od verzie 0.999 podporuje KeyNote NF jednoduch\u250?, ale \u250?\u269?inn\u250? technol\u243?giu z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov. Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly s\u250? samostatn\u233? mal\u233? programy, ktor\u233? dok\u225?\u382?u komunikova\u357? s KeyNote NF a roz\u353?irova\u357? jeho mo\u382?nosti. Napr\u237?klad z\u225?suvn\u253? modul m\u244?\u382?e zobrazi\u357? kalend\u225?r alebo zoznam \u250?loh, previes\u357? pozn\u225?mku do form\u225?tu HTML, vypo\u269?\u237?ta\u357? \u353?tatistiku textu, zobrazi\u357? kalkula\u269?ku alebo prevodn\u237?k jednotiek, pr\u237?padne spusti\u357? kontrolu pravopisu.\par

\par

Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly prin\u225?\u353?aj\u250? dve v\u253?znamn\u233? v\u253?hody: m\u244?\u382?u ich p\u237?sa\u357? aj in\u237? autori softv\u233?ru (pomocou \u318?ubovo\u318?n\u233?ho kompil\u225?tora, ktor\u253? dok\u225?\u382?e vytv\u225?ra\u357? s\u250?bory DLL pre Windows) a prid\u225?vaj\u250? KeyNote NF funk\u269?nos\u357? bez zv\u228?\u269?\u353?enia hlavn\u233?ho programu. Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly sa na\u269?\u237?tavaj\u250? v\u253?hradne pod\u318?a potreby a ke\u271? nie s\u250? akt\u237?vne, nespotreb\u250?vaj\u250? pam\u228?\u357? ani syst\u233?mov\u233? prostriedky.\par

\par

V s\u250?\u269?asnosti (j\u250?n 2001) sa KeyNote NF distribuuje s malou sadou uk\u225?\u382?kov\u253?ch z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov. Ako bud\u250? vznika\u357? \u271?al\u353?ie z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly, bud\u250? dostupn\u233? na stiahnutie z hlavnej domovskej str\u225?nky KeyNote NF; pozri ni\u382?\u353?ie \u269?as\u357? \ldblquote S\u357?ahovanie z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov\rdblquote .\par

\par

Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly s\u250? s\u250?bory s pr\u237?ponou \ldblquote .KNL\rdblquote  a v\u353?etky musia by\u357? umiestnen\u233? v podprie\u269?inku \ldblquote\\plugins\rdblquote  v prie\u269?inku, kde je nain\u353?talovan\u253? KeyNote NF. Napr\u237?klad ak je KeyNote NF nain\u353?talovan\u253? v\par


\pard\li360 c:\\Program Files\\Keynote\par


\pard\par

v\u353?etky z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly by mali by\u357? umiestnen\u233? v\par


\pard\li360 c:\\Program Files\\Keynote\\Plugins\par


\pard\par

Tento podprie\u269?inok automaticky vytvor\u237? in\u353?tala\u269?n\u253? program.\par

\par

Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly mo\u382?no stiahnu\u357? z domovskej str\u225?nky KeyNote NF. Aktu\u225?lne dostupn\u233? z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly treba bra\u357? len ako \ldblquote overenie koncepcie\rdblquote , no v\u353?etky vykon\u225?vaj\u250? funkcie, o ktor\u233? pou\u382?\u237?vatelia KeyNote NF ob\u269?as po\u382?iadali.\par

\par

Inform\u225?cie o pou\u382?\u237?van\u237? z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov n\u225?jdete ni\u382?\u353?ie v \u269?asti \ldblquote Pou\u382?\u237?vanie z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov\rdblquote .\par

\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs26\'11B2\'12\v0 Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly: V\u353?eobecn\u233? inform\u225?cie pre v\u253?voj\u225?rov\b0\par

\fs20\par

Ak ste program\u225?tor (a z\u225?rove\u328? pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318? KeyNote NF), mo\u382?no by ste chceli vytv\u225?ra\u357? vlastn\u233? z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly. Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly s\u250? s\u250?bory DLL, tak\u382?e by ste ich mali zvl\u225?dnu\u357? vytvori\u357? pomocou \u318?ubovo\u318?n\u233?ho kompil\u225?tora, ktor\u253? dok\u225?\u382?e vytv\u225?ra\u357? DLL, nie nevyhnutne Borland Delphi. Podrobn\u250? dokument\u225?ciu, pr\u237?klady a zdrojov\u253? k\u243?d na za\u269?iatok n\u225?jdete v:\par

\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/tree/master/plugins }}{\fldrslt{https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/tree/master/plugins}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B3\'12\v0 Pou\u382?\u237?vanie z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov\b0\par

\fs20\par

V KeyNote NF existuj\u250? dva sp\u244?soby pou\u382?itia z\u225?suvn\u233?ho modulu: v\u253?berom zo zoznamu dostupn\u253?ch z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov alebo aktivovan\u237?m naposledy pou\u382?it\u233?ho z\u225?suvn\u233?ho modulu.\par

\par


\pard\sa80\b\fs22 1. Ak chcete zobrazi\u357? zoznam dostupn\u253?ch z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov, \b0 , \fs20 kliknite na kartu \ldblquote Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly\rdblquote  na paneli prostriedkov (\cf3\b F9\cf0\b0 ).\par


\pard Karta obsahuje mal\u253? panel n\u225?strojov s nieko\u318?k\u253?mi tla\u269?idlami:\par

\par


\pard\sa80\b Tla\u269?idlo Spusti\u357?\b0\par


\pard Zatvor\u237? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno a spust\u237? vybran\u253? z\u225?suvn\u253? modul\par


\pard\li360\sb100\b Tip: \b0 Z\u225?suvn\u253? modul m\u244?\u382?ete spusti\u357? aj dvojit\u253?m kliknut\u237?m na\u328?.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\b Tla\u269?idlo Konfigurova\u357?\b0\par


\pard Spust\u237? konfigura\u269?n\u253? postup pre vybran\u253? z\u225?suvn\u253? modul. Zvy\u269?ajne sa zobraz\u237? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno, v ktorom m\u244?\u382?ete ur\u269?i\u357? r\u244?zne mo\u382?nosti vybran\u233?ho z\u225?suvn\u233?ho modulu, ale ke\u271?\u382?e tento postup vytv\u225?ra autor z\u225?suvn\u233?ho modulu, KeyNote NF nevie, \u269?o z\u225?suvn\u253? modul po kliknut\u237? na toto tla\u269?idlo rob\u237?, a nem\u225? nad t\u253?m kontrolu. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e niektor\u233? z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly nemusia podporova\u357? \u382?iadny konfigura\u269?n\u253? postup.\par

\par


\pard\li360\sb100\b Pozn\u225?mka:\b0   Pri prvom zobrazen\u237? zoznamu nain\u353?talovan\u253?ch z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov v KeyNote NF d\u244?jde k miernemu zdr\u382?aniu. Je to preto, \u382?e KeyNote NF mus\u237? vyp\u237?sa\u357? v\u353?etky nain\u353?talovan\u233? z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly a pred ich zobrazen\u237?m z ka\u382?d\u233?ho z\u237?ska\u357? n\u225?zov, popis a inform\u225?cie o stave. \u270?al\u353?ie otvorenia dial\u243?gov\u233?ho okna bud\u250? r\u253?chlej\u353?ie.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li360\sb100\b Tip: \b0  Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly mo\u382?no prida\u357? aj po\u269?as behu KeyNote NF. KeyNote NF to nezist\u237? automaticky, ale m\u244?\u382?ete ho k tomu prin\u250?ti\u357?. Ak chcete KeyNote NF ozn\u225?mi\u357?, \u382?e mus\u237? znova inicializova\u357? zoznam dostupn\u253?ch z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov, kliknite prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom my\u353?i na zoznam z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov a zvo\u318?te pr\u237?kaz \ldblquote Obnovi\u357? zoznam\rdblquote .\par

\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa80\b\fs22 2. Opakovanie naposledy spusten\u233?ho z\u225?suvn\u233?ho modulu:\b0  \par


\pard\fs20 Zvo\u318?te pr\u237?kaz \b N\u225?stroje|Spusti\u357? posledn\u253? z\u225?suvn\u253? modul\b0 .\par

\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B5\'12\v0 S\u357?ahovanie z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov\b0\fs20\par

\par

Z lokality KeyNote NF na GitHube je k dispoz\u237?cii nieko\u318?ko z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov na stiahnutie:\par

  {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/tree/master/3rd_party/_Add-ons"}}{\fldrslt{3rd_party/Add-ons}}}}}\f0\fs20   \par

  {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/tree/master/plugins/Binary%20examples"}}{\fldrslt{plugins/Binary examples}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\sb160 P\u244?vodne zahrnut\u233? v starej domovskej str\u225?nke KeyNote: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.tranglos.com/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.tranglos.com/}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard Str\u225?nku si m\u244?\u382?ete pozrie\u357? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/blob/master/doc/References.md"}}{\fldrslt{Odkazy a kontaktn\u233? inform\u225?cie}}}}}\f0\fs20 , v GitHube\par

\par

Niektor\u233? z nich:\par

\par


\pard\li360\sa80\ul plugintest.knl\ulnone\par


\pard\li360 Testovac\u237? z\u225?suvn\u253? modul \u8211? \ldblquote minim\u225?lny\rdblquote  z\u225?suvn\u253? modul, ktor\u253? nerob\u237? ni\u269? ve\u318?mi u\u382?ito\u269?n\u233?, ale d\u225? sa pou\u382?i\u357? na testovacie \u250?\u269?ely.\par

\par


\pard\li360\sa80\ul kncalendar.knl\par


\pard\li360\ulnone Zobraz\u237? mal\u233? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno s rozba\u318?ovac\u237?m kalend\u225?rom, ktor\u233? v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? vybra\u357? d\u225?tum a vlo\u382?i\u357? ho do textu akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mky. D\u225?tum mo\u382?no vlo\u382?i\u357? v dlhom (26. j\u250?n 2001) alebo kr\u225?tkom (21-06-2001) form\u225?te. Pou\u382?it\u253? form\u225?t d\u225?tumu je ten, ktor\u253? ste nastavili v aplete \ldblquote Medzin\u225?rodn\u233? nastavenia\rdblquote  v Ovl\u225?dacom paneli.\par


\pard\par

Okrem in\u253?ch existuj\u250? z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly scratchpad (pozn\u225?mkov\u253? blok), automatick\u233? opakovanie kl\u225?vesov a Discordian Calendar (discordi\u225?nsky kalend\u225?r). K dispoz\u237?cii je aj \ul funckey.knl\ulnone , z\u225?suvn\u253? modul, ktor\u253? bol jedin\u253?m sp\u244?sobom, ako priradi\u357? kl\u225?vesov\u233? skratky makr\u225?m, \u353?abl\u243?nam, \u353?t\u253?lom, z\u225?suvn\u253?m modulom a p\u237?smam; dnes je u\u382? zastaran\u253? (hoci m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? u\u382?ito\u269?n\u253?, ak v\u225?s zauj\u237?ma v\u253?voj z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modulov)\par

\par

\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B6\'12\v0 \u268?o z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly dok\u225?\u382?u\b0\par

\fs20\par


\pard\sa100\b Vo v\u353?eobecnosti z\u225?suvn\u253? modul m\u244?\u382?e:\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 a)\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pnlcltr{\pntxta)}}
\fi-360\li360\b0 prij\u237?ma\u357? text z pozn\u225?mky, ktor\u225? je pr\u225?ve akt\u237?vna\par

{\pntext\f0 b)\tab}vykona\u357? svoju funkciu (Spusti\u357?)\par

{\pntext\f0 c)\tab}vr\u225?ti\u357? nejak\u253? text sp\u228?\u357? do KeyNote NF. KeyNote NF tento text vlo\u382?\u237? do akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mky alebo vytvor\u237? nov\u250? pozn\u225?mku a vlo\u382?\u237? text do nej.\par


\pard\li360\sb100 Mo\u382?nosti (a) aj (c) s\u250? volite\u318?n\u233?. To znamen\u225?, \u382?e z\u225?suvn\u253? modul m\u244?\u382?e, ale NEMUS\u205? prij\u237?ma\u357? alebo vraca\u357? nejak\u253? text.\par


\pard\par

Pr\u237?kladom z\u225?suvn\u233?ho modulu, ktor\u253? prij\u237?ma a vracia text, by bola kontrola pravopisu alebo prevodn\u237?k RTF na HTML. Pr\u237?kladom z\u225?suvn\u233?ho modulu, ktor\u253? text len prij\u237?ma a nevracia, by bol z\u225?suvn\u253? modul, ktor\u253? vypo\u269?\u237?ta \u353?tatistiku textu a zobraz\u237? inform\u225?cie vo vlastnom dial\u243?govom okne. Pr\u237?kladom z\u225?suvn\u233?ho modulu, ktor\u253? text ani neprij\u237?ma, ani nevracia, by bolo jednoducho \u269?oko\u318?vek, na \u269?o program\u225?tor pr\u237?de :) Napr\u237?klad z\u225?suvn\u253? modul by mohol be\u382?a\u357? popri KeyNote NF a zobrazova\u357? hodiny, cit\u225?t d\u328?a alebo dokonca tipy na pou\u382?\u237?vanie KeyNote NF, ktor\u233? sa menia pod\u318?a toho, ako pracujete.\par

\par

Z\u225?suvn\u233? moduly s\u250? navy\u353?e pru\u382?n\u233? v tom, ako prij\u237?maj\u250? a vracaj\u250? text. Z\u225?suvn\u253? modul ozn\u225?mi KeyNote NF, ak\u253? form\u225?t textu (ak v\u244?bec nejak\u253?) chce prij\u237?ma\u357? a ak\u253? form\u225?t textu (ak v\u244?bec nejak\u253?) vracia.\par

\par


\pard\sa100\b Z\u225?suvn\u253? modul m\u244?\u382?e PRIJ\u205?MA\u356?:\b0\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 \u382?iadny text\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}cel\u253? text akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mky vo form\u225?te RTF\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}cel\u253? text akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mky v \u269?istom texte\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}pr\u225?ve ozna\u269?en\u253? text v pozn\u225?mke vo form\u225?te RTF\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}pr\u225?ve ozna\u269?en\u253? text v pozn\u225?mke v \u269?istom texte\par


\pard\li360\sb100 Z\u225?suvn\u253? modul navy\u353?e m\u244?\u382?e ur\u269?i\u357?, \u382?e na jeho spustenie MUS\u205? by\u357? ozna\u269?en\u253? nejak\u253? text. V takom pr\u237?pade KeyNote NF z\u225?suvn\u253? modul nespust\u237?, ak v akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mke najprv neozna\u269?\u237?te nejak\u253? text.\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa100\b Z\u225?suvn\u253? modul m\u244?\u382?e VR\u193?TI\u356?:\b0\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 ni\u269?\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}text vo form\u225?te RTF\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}\u269?ist\u253? text\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}text dial\u243?gov\u233?ho okna\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}\u250?daje schr\u225?nky\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa100 V pr\u237?pade textu RTF a \u269?ist\u233?ho textu sa vr\u225?ten\u253? text vlo\u382?\u237? do pr\u225?ve akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mky.\par

V pr\u237?pade textu dial\u243?gov\u233?ho okna KeyNote NF zobraz\u237? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno s textom vr\u225?ten\u253?m z\u225?suvn\u253?m modulom. Ak v dial\u243?govom okne kliknete na \cf3\b OK\cf0\b0 , text sa vlo\u382?\u237? do akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mky.\par

V pr\u237?pade \u250?dajov v schr\u225?nke KeyNote automaticky vlo\u382?\u237? \u250?daje zo schr\u225?nky do akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mky alebo zobraz\u237? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno informuj\u250?ce, \u382?e plugin umiestnil nejak\u233? \u250?daje do schr\u225?nky. V druhom pr\u237?pade m\u244?\u382?ete v dial\u243?govom okne klikn\u250?\u357? na \cf3\b OK\cf0\b0 , aby sa \u250?daje vlo\u382?ili, alebo klikn\u250?\u357? na \cf3\b Zru\u353?i\u357?\cf0\b0  na zatvorenie dial\u243?gov\u233?ho okna a vlo\u382?i\u357? \u250?daje sami tam, kam chcete.\par


\pard\li360\sb100\b Tip: \b0 V dial\u243?govom okne \ldblquote Mo\u382?nosti\rdblquote  aplik\u225?cie KeyNote m\u244?\u382?ete ur\u269?i\u357?, \u269?i m\u225? KeyNote automaticky vlo\u382?i\u357? \u250?daje zo schr\u225?nky vr\u225?ten\u233? pluginmi, alebo \u269?i m\u225? KeyNote zobrazi\u357? potvrdzuj\u250?ce dial\u243?gov\u233? okno.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li360\sb100\b Tip: \b0 \u218?daje v schr\u225?nke nemusia by\u357? text: pr\u225?ve preto je mo\u382?nos\u357? schr\u225?nky poskytnut\u225? autorom pluginov. Napr\u237?klad plugin m\u244?\u382?e rovnako \u318?ahko umiestni\u357? do schr\u225?nky obr\u225?zok, ktor\u253? potom m\u244?\u382?ete vlo\u382?i\u357? do pozn\u225?mky.\par


\pard\fi-480\li480\par

\par


\pard\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B7\'12\v0 Rezidentn\u233? pluginy\par

\b0\fs20\par

Plugin sa zvy\u269?ajne spr\u225?va podobne ako be\u382?n\u233? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno: k\u253?m plugin be\u382?\u237?, nem\u244?\u382?ete pristupova\u357? k hlavn\u233?mu oknu KeyNote, otv\u225?ra\u357? in\u233? dial\u243?gov\u233? okn\u225? at\u271?. Pluginy nemusia otv\u225?ra\u357? \u382?iadne okn\u225?, ale princ\u237?p zost\u225?va: k\u253?m plugin be\u382?\u237?, nem\u244?\u382?ete pristupova\u357? ku KeyNote.\par

\par

Autor pluginu v\u353?ak m\u244?\u382?e vytvori\u357? \u353?peci\u225?lny typ pluginu, ktor\u253? tu budeme naz\u253?va\u357? \ldblquote rezidentn\u253? plugin\rdblquote . Rezidentn\u253? plugin je \ldblquote nemod\u225?lny\rdblquote , \u269?o znamen\u225?, \u382?e m\u244?\u382?e be\u382?a\u357? popri KeyNote a nijako neblokuje pr\u237?stup k nej. Napr\u237?klad plugin m\u244?\u382?e zobrazova\u357? hodiny a hodiny zostan\u250? vidite\u318?n\u233? v samostatnom okne, k\u253?m s KeyNote norm\u225?lne pracujete.\par

\par

Rezidentn\u233? pluginy m\u244?\u382?u (ale nemusia) prij\u237?ma\u357? text z KeyNote tak, ako je pop\u237?san\u233? v \ldblquote \u268?o pluginy dok\u225?\u382?u\rdblquote , ale NIKDY nevracaj\u250? \u382?iadny text sp\u228?\u357? do KeyNote. Rezidentn\u253? plugin spust\u237?te a okam\u382?ite sa vr\u225?tite do KeyNote. Rezidentn\u253? plugin sa m\u244?\u382?e s\u225?m ukon\u269?i\u357? (napr\u237?klad po vykonan\u237? nejakej oper\u225?cie) alebo m\u244?\u382?e poskytn\u250?\u357? pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?sk\u233? rozhranie na svoje zatvorenie.\par

\par

M\u244?\u382?ete s\u250?\u269?asne spusti\u357? viac ako jeden rezidentn\u253? plugin, ale od ka\u382?d\u233?ho dan\u233?ho rezidentn\u233?ho pluginu m\u244?\u382?ete ma\u357? len jednu in\u353?tanciu. Ak sa pok\u250?site spusti\u357? rezidentn\u253? plugin, ktor\u253? u\u382? be\u382?\u237?, KeyNote zobraz\u237? chybov\u233? hl\u225?senie.\par

\par

\tab\par

\par

\b\v\fs24\'11B8\'12\v0 Obmedzenia\par

\b0\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa160 Pluginy moment\u225?lne nem\u244?\u382?u ovl\u225?da\u357? \u269?innos\u357? samotnej aplik\u225?cie KeyNote. Toto m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? v bud\u250?cnosti doplnen\u233?, ak to bud\u250? autori pluginov vy\u382?adova\u357?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Plugin m\u244?\u382?e prij\u237?ma\u357? alebo vraca\u357? text len z akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mky a do nej. Pri pozn\u225?mkach typu strom to znamen\u225?, \u382?e plugin dostane len text vybran\u233?ho (akt\u237?vneho) uzla stromu. Pluginy v\u353?ak dost\u225?vaj\u250? n\u225?zov aktu\u225?lne na\u269?\u237?tan\u233?ho s\u250?boru KNT, tak\u382?e ni\u269? nebr\u225?ni pluginu pre\u269?\u237?ta\u357? cel\u253? s\u250?bor .KNT a pracova\u357? s n\u237?m nez\u225?visle od KeyNote. Plugin dost\u225?va aj n\u225?zov akt\u237?vnej pozn\u225?mky.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Pluginy moment\u225?lne nedost\u225?vaj\u250? od KeyNote \u382?iadne inform\u225?cie o stave ani \u382?iadne inform\u225?cie t\u253?kaj\u250?ce sa stromov pozn\u225?mok nad r\u225?mec toho, \u269?o je uveden\u233? vy\u353?\u353?ie. Plugin najm\u228? nem\u244?\u382?e meni\u357? mo\u382?nosti konfigur\u225?cie KeyNote, otv\u225?ra\u357? dial\u243?gov\u233? okn\u225? KeyNote, sp\u250?\u353?\u357?a\u357? makr\u225? at\u271?.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Plugin BY do istej miery MOHOL ovl\u225?da\u357? akt\u237?vny editor RTF (napr. plugin by mohol editoru posiela\u357? windowsov\u233? spr\u225?vy), ale vo v\u353?eobecnosti by sa pluginy o to NEMALI pok\u250?\u353?a\u357?, preto\u382?e neexistuje z\u225?ruka, \u382?e pr\u237?kaz sa vykon\u225?. Napr\u237?klad ak je akt\u237?vna pozn\u225?mka len na \u269?\u237?tanie, pr\u237?kazy odoslan\u233? z pluginu by ju mohli zmeni\u357? proti v\u244?li pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?a. A \u193?NO, je mo\u382?n\u233? vypn\u250?\u357? alebo dokonca zhavarova\u357? KeyNote nespr\u225?vnym pr\u237?kazom alebo spr\u225?vou z pluginu. Autori pluginov by si samozrejme mali d\u225?va\u357? pozor, aby to nerobili.\par

}
