\pard\cf1\b\f0\fs20\lang1045\par

\fs36 Konvertor KNT\cf0\b0\fs20\lang3082\par

\par


\pard\sb120\lang1033 Konvertor KeyNote (kntconvert.exe) je star\u225? sprievodn\u225? aplik\u225?cia ku KeyNote. Jeho \u250?\u269?elom je konvertova\u357? textov\u233? s\u250?bory r\u244?znych form\u225?tov na s\u250?bory KeyNote.\par

Konvertor je nez\u225?visl\u253? od samotnej aplik\u225?cie KeyNote. Namiesto priameho importu s\u250?borov do KeyNote konvertor jednoducho pre\u269?\u237?ta zdrojov\u253? s\u250?bor, vytvor\u237? nov\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote (s pr\u237?ponou .knt) a importuje zdrojov\u253? s\u250?bor ako jednu pozn\u225?mku typu strom do novo vytvoren\u233?ho s\u250?boru. Volite\u318?ne m\u244?\u382?e konvertor importova\u357? s\u250?bor do u\u382? existuj\u250?ceho s\u250?boru KeyNote.\par

\par

Pridal som sem {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<74|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{s\u250?bor readme}}}}}\f0\fs20  a {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<75|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{s\u250?bor n\u225?povedy}}}}}\f0\fs20 , ktor\u233? boli s\u250?\u269?as\u357?ou tohto n\u225?stroja. \par

M\u244?\u382?ete si ho stiahnu\u357? a vysk\u250?\u353?a\u357? z nasleduj\u250?cej adresy URL na str\u225?nke KeyNote NF na GitHube: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/blob/master/3rd_party/_Add-ons"}}{\fldrslt{3rd_party/Add-ons}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\b Pozn\u225?mka\b0 :\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb120 Tento n\u225?stroj sa otvor\u237? v poriadku a mal by st\u225?le fungova\u357?, \ul ale e\u353?te som ho nesk\u250?\u353?al\ulnone .\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Obsah s\u250?boru n\u225?povedy bol extrahovan\u253? z kntconvert.hlp pomocou helpdc21.zip (HelpDeco od Sida Penstona):\par


\pard\li360\sb80 c:> helpdeco kntconvert.hlp  \tab\tab --> 3 s\u250?bory: .hpj, .ph a .rtf\par


\pard\li360 c:> helpdeco kntconvert.hlp /c \tab\tab --> kntconvert.cnt s jedinou \u250?rov\u328?ou.\par


\pard\sb120\par

