\cf3\f1\par

\par


\pard\page\v\'11B12\'12\cf2\b\v0\fs32 Import spr\u225?v z Pegasus Mail\par

\cf3\b0\fs20\par

\b V prvom rade sa nepok\u250?\u353?ajte konvertova\u357? s\u250?bory s pr\u237?ponou \u8222?pmm\u8220?.\b0  Ide o bin\u225?rne s\u250?bory, ktor\u233? konvertor nedok\u225?\u382?e pou\u382?i\u357?.\par

\par

\u270?al\u353?\u237? probl\u233?m: Pegasus zrejme nepon\u250?ka skuto\u269?n\u250? funkciu \u8222?Export\u8220?. Na ulo\u382?enie jednej alebo viacer\u253?ch spr\u225?v do s\u250?boru m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? pr\u237?kaz \u8222?Save as\u8220?, ale takto vytvoren\u233? s\u250?bory nie s\u250? plnohodnotne form\u225?tovan\u233? s\u250?bory Unix mailbox, a hoci ich konvertor dok\u225?\u382?e importova\u357?, spr\u225?vy nebud\u250? spr\u225?vne zoraden\u233? ani dek\u243?dovan\u233?.\par

\par

Ak\u253? je teda trik? \b Spr\u225?vy z Pegasu v\u244?bec nemus\u237?te exportova\u357?.\b0  Pegasus dok\u225?\u382?e uklada\u357? spr\u225?vy interne v dvoch r\u244?znych form\u225?toch. Jedn\u253?m z t\u253?chto form\u225?tov je vy\u353?\u353?ie spom\u237?nan\u253? s\u250?bor \u8222?pmm\u8220?; druh\u253?m je... s\u250?bor Unix mailbox. Presne tak\u253? typ s\u250?boru, ak\u253? konvertor potrebuje. Ke\u271? v Pegase vytvor\u237?te nov\u253? prie\u269?inok so spr\u225?vami, op\u253?ta sa v\u225?s, ak\u253? form\u225?t m\u225? pou\u382?i\u357?. Predvolene zvol\u237? form\u225?t \u8222?Pegasus Mail 2.x\u8220? (ktor\u253? vytvor\u237? s\u250?bor \u8222?pmm\u8220?), ale m\u244?\u382?ete klikn\u250?\u357? na zoznam a vybra\u357? \u8222?Unix mailbox format\u8220?. \par

\par

Ak va\u353?e po\u353?tov\u233? prie\u269?inky v Pegase u\u382? pou\u382?\u237?vaj\u250? form\u225?t Unix, jednoducho ich n\u225?jdite v prie\u269?inku \u8222?Mail\u8220? v Pegase (kdeko\u318?vek je nastaven\u253?) a tieto s\u250?bory pou\u382?ite v konvertore. Pegasus ich naz\u253?va \u8222?folders\u8220?, ale v skuto\u269?nosti s\u250? to len s\u250?bory s pr\u237?ponou \b .MBX \b0 . Konvertor s t\u253?mito s\u250?bormi bez probl\u233?mov pracuje.\par

\par

Alebo ak va\u353?e existuj\u250?ce prie\u269?inky so spr\u225?vami v Pegase pou\u382?\u237?vaj\u250? ten druh\u253? form\u225?t, vytvorte v Pegase nov\u253? prie\u269?inok, pri jeho vytv\u225?ran\u237? nezabudnite uvies\u357? \b \u8222?Unix mailbox format\u8220?\b0  a SKOP\u205?RUJTE do\u328? spr\u225?vy, ktor\u233? chcete importova\u357? do KeyNote. Potom n\u225?jdite s\u250?bor, v ktorom je tento prie\u269?inok ulo\u382?en\u253? (bude ma\u357? n\u225?zov ako \u8222?Unx02373.mbx\u8220?, Pegasus d\u225?va s\u250?borom n\u225?hodne vyzeraj\u250?ce n\u225?zvy), a tento s\u250?bor poskytnite konvertoru.\par

\par

\par

\page\v\'11B13\'12\cf2\b\v0\fs32 Import spr\u225?v z Forte Agent\par

\cf3\b0\fs20\par

Forte Agent je bezpochyby najviac v s\u250?lade so \u353?tandardmi e-mailov\u253? a diskusn\u253? klient pre Windows. A samozrejme pon\u250?ka funkciu exportu na ulo\u382?enie spr\u225?v vo form\u225?te Unix mailbox. V programe Forte Agent mus\u237?te vykona\u357? tieto kroky:\par

\par

V paneli spr\u225?v vyberte spr\u225?vy, ktor\u233? chcete konvertova\u357? na s\u250?bor KeyNote. (Nez\u225?le\u382?\u237? na tom, ako s\u250? spr\u225?vy zoraden\u233?.)\par

\par

V ponuke \u8222?File\u8220? zvo\u318?te pr\u237?kaz \u8222?Save messages as...\u8220?.\par

\par

V dial\u243?govom okne \u8222?Save messages as\u8220? zadajte n\u225?zov s\u250?boru, do ktor\u233?ho sa maj\u250? spr\u225?vy ulo\u382?i\u357?. \par

\par

V dial\u243?govom okne \u8222?Save messages as\u8220? je potrebn\u233? pou\u382?i\u357? tieto nastavenia mo\u382?nost\u237?:\par

\par

Form\u225?t s\u250?boru: \b UNIX message file\b0\par

Polia hlavi\u269?ky na zahrnutie: \b All fields\b0\par

Ulo\u382?i\u357? surov\u250? (neform\u225?tovan\u250?) spr\u225?vu: \b CHECKED\b0\par

\par

Kliknut\u237?m na tla\u269?idlo \u8222?Save\u8220? exportujte spr\u225?vy. S\u250?bor, ktor\u253? Agent vytvoril, poskytnite programu KNTConvert.\par


\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1  \par


\pard\page\v\'11B10\'12\cf2\b\v0\fs32 Kontaktn\u233? inform\u225?cie\par

