\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720 Prepn\u250?\u357? fokus: Editor / Panel stromu\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Nastavi\u357? fokus v paneli editora\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Nastavi\u357? fokus v paneli stromu\par


\pard\li360\sb120 Prv\u253? z nich v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje definova\u357? alternat\u237?vu k skratke \cf3\b Ctrl+\\\cf0\b0 . Pomocou \u271?al\u353?\u237?ch dvoch m\u244?\u382?ete tie\u382? vytvori\u357? nov\u233? kl\u225?vesov\u233? skratky na explicitn\u233? nastavenie fokusu v paneli editora alebo stromu.\par


\pard\li360 V\u353?imnite si, \u382?e aj ke\u271? prv\u233?mu pr\u237?kazu menu prirad\u237?te in\u250? skratku, aktu\u225?lna skratka prep\u237?nania (\cf3 Ctrl+\\\cf0 ) bude st\u225?le fungova\u357?, ak ju nenahrad\u237? \u382?iadna in\u225? skratka.\par

\b Tip\b0 : \cf3 Ctrl+\\\cf0  a \cf3 Shift+Tab \cf0 (ak nie je \u269?o zru\u353?i\u357? odsadenie) tie\u382? prepn\u250? fokus z editora pozn\u225?mkov\u233?ho bloku do editora pozn\u225?mky.\par

\par

* KeyNote si pam\u228?t\u225?, \u269?i bol pri poslednom ulo\u382?en\u237? s\u250?boru fokus na strome alebo v editore, a ten ist\u253? prvok z\u237?ska fokus pri op\u228?tovnom otvoren\u237? s\u250?boru. (Predvolene je fokus v editore RTF)\par


\pard  \par

\par


\pard\sa120\b\fs26 \u270?al\u353?ie skratky\par


\pard\cf3\fs20 F5\cf0\b0\tab\tab\tab Upravi\u357? mo\u382?nosti konfigur\u225?cie programu  \par


\pard\sb120\cf3\b F8\cf0\b0\tab\tab\tab Udr\u382?iava\u357? okno programu nad v\u353?etk\u253?mi ostatn\u253?mi oknami aplik\u225?ci\u237?  \par


\pard\cf3\b F9\cf0\b0\tab\tab\tab Zobrazi\u357? alebo skry\u357? panel zdrojov (alternat\u237?va: dvojklik na stavov\u253? riadok)\par


\pard\fi-2160\li2160\sb100\cf3\b Esc\cf0\b0\tab Z\u225?vis\u237? od mo\u382?nosti \u8222?On Escape key\u8220? (v Mo\u382?nosti konfigur\u225?cie | V\u353?eobecn\u233? nastavenia):  Minimalizova\u357? KeyNote, Ukon\u269?i\u357? KeyNote, nerobi\u357? ni\u269?. \par


\pard\fi-2160\li2160\sb80\tab Ak prebieha pr\u237?kaz H\u318?ada\u357?, kl\u225?ves Esc h\u318?adanie preru\u353?\u237?.\par

\tab Ak prebieha pr\u237?kaz Nahradi\u357?, kl\u225?ves Esc ho preru\u353?\u237?. \par

\tab Ak je fokus na rozba\u318?ovacom zozname n\u225?zvu p\u237?sma alebo na poli ve\u318?kosti p\u237?sma na paneli n\u225?strojov Form\u225?t, kl\u225?ves Esc z nich vyst\u250?pi a prepne fokus do editora.\par

\tab Ak sa nahr\u225?va makro, zastav\u237? nahr\u225?vanie makra.\par

\tab Ak sa prehr\u225?va makro, zastav\u237? prehr\u225?vanie makra.\par

\tab Ak je fokus na ktorejko\u318?vek karte panela zdrojov (okrem Scratch), Esc prepne fokus do editora.\par

\tab Ak je fokus v editore Scratch a mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?On Escape key\u8220? je nastaven\u225? na \u8222?Minimize KeyNote\u8220?, Esc minimalizuje aplik\u225?ciu; v opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade prepne fokus do editora.\par


\pard\sb160\cf3\b Shift+F10\cf0\b0\tab\tab Otvor\u237? kontextov\u233? menu v editore RTF, paneli stromu a v pozn\u225?mkovom bloku\par


\pard\par


