V\u353?imnite si, \u382?e existuj\u250? ur\u269?it\u233? nastavenia konfigur\u225?cie, ktor\u233? nemo\u382?no upravi\u357? v existuj\u250?com dial\u243?govom okne Mo\u382?nosti. Tieto dodato\u269?n\u233? nastavenia mo\u382?no upravi\u357? \u250?pravou konfigura\u269?n\u233?ho s\u250?boru KeyNote, keynote.ini. (Viac v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<104|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{\u270?al\u353?ie nastavenia KeyNote.ini}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

