\pard\sa80\cf1\v\fs24\'11B7\'12\v0 Ukladanie v nov\u253?ch s\u250?boroch\cf0\fs20\par


\pard\sa100\b0 Pozn\u225?mka: Tieto dve mo\u382?nosti umo\u382?\u328?uj\u250? definova\u357? ukladanie v \ul nov\u253?ch s\u250?boroch\ulnone . \par

Re\u382?im ukladania aktu\u225?lneho s\u250?boru je mo\u382?n\u233? zmeni\u357? v okne {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|4436|0|10"}}{\fldrslt{S\u250?bor | Vlastnosti}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\b\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\fs22 Re\u382?im\tab\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: Vlo\u382?en\u233? KNT\cf1\b\fs26\par


\pard\sa160\cf0\b0\fs20 V nov\u253?ch s\u250?boroch je mo\u382?n\u233? definova\u357? jeden z nasleduj\u250?cich \b re\u382?imov ukladania\b0 :\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa40\b Vlo\u382?en\u233? RTF\b0 : Zodpoved\u225? be\u382?n\u233?mu umiestneniu obr\u225?zkov v s\u250?boroch RTF: v samotnom obsahu RTF, ako hexadecim\u225?lne hodnoty ulo\u382?en\u233? v ASCII.\par


\pard\li360\sa100 Form\u225?t t\u253?chto obr\u225?zkov je zvy\u269?ajne wmetafile8, ve\u318?mi objemn\u253?. Zodpovedalo by to vypnutej funkcionalite spr\u225?vy obr\u225?zkov.\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa40\b Vlo\u382?en\u233? KNT\b0 : Obr\u225?zky s\u250? umiestnen\u233? na konci s\u250?boru KNT v bin\u225?rnej podobe.\par


\pard\li360\sa100 Tento typ ukladania m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? zauj\u237?mav\u253? pre obr\u225?zky, ktor\u233? maj\u250? zosta\u357? v \u353?ifrovan\u253?ch s\u250?boroch KNT, alebo ke\u271? chcete, aby boli dostupn\u233? bez z\u225?vislosti od in\u233?ho samostatn\u233?ho s\u250?boru (alebo prie\u269?inka). Je optim\u225?lnej\u353?\u237? ako vkladanie do k\u243?du RTF (ako ASCII v re\u382?ime HEX)\tab\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100\b Extern\u233?\b0 : Obr\u225?zky nie s\u250? umiestnen\u233? v s\u250?bore .knt, ale v extern\u253?ch s\u250?boroch, v externom prie\u269?inku alebo v arch\u237?ve Zip.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}\b Extern\u233? + EmbeddedKNT\b0 : Umo\u382?\u328?uje skombinova\u357? pou\u382?\u237?vanie obr\u225?zkov vlo\u382?en\u253?ch bin\u225?rne v s\u250?bore KNT s extern\u253?m ukladan\u237?m, ktor\u253?m m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? Zip alebo prie\u269?inok.\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Extern\u233?\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\cf0\b0\fs20 Predvolen\u233?: Prie\u269?inok\cf1\b\fs22\par


\pard\sa100\cf0\b0\fs20 Umo\u382?\u328?uje definova\u357? typ extern\u233?ho ukladania, ktor\u253? sa m\u225? pou\u382?i\u357? v nov\u253?ch s\u250?boroch .knt:\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\b Prie\u269?inok\b0 : \tab Obr\u225?zky sa ulo\u382?ia do prie\u269?inkov a podprie\u269?inkov v syst\u233?me s\u250?borov.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}\b Zip\b0 : \tab S\u250?bory obr\u225?zkov sa ukladaj\u250? v komprimovanom form\u225?te Zip.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li360 Pozn\u225?mka: V oboch pr\u237?padoch sa obr\u225?zky vytvoria v podprie\u269?inku zodpovedaj\u250?com prie\u269?inku, z ktor\u233?ho bol nov\u253? obr\u225?zok vlo\u382?en\u253? prv\u253?kr\u225?t, ak je zapnut\u233? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<90|8187|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{Uklada\u357? do podprie\u269?inkov}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\v\fs22\'11B9\'12\v0 Kompresia v ukladan\u237? ZIP\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: Deflate\cf1\b\fs22\par


\pard\cf0\b0\fs20 Umo\u382?\u328?uje vybra\u357? typ kompresie, ktor\u253? sa pou\u382?ije pri prid\u225?van\u237? ka\u382?d\u233?ho nov\u233?ho obr\u225?zka do re\u382?imu ukladania Zip (extern\u233?):\par


\pard\li360  \par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Store\tab Ulo\u382?\u237? s\u250?bor obr\u225?zka bez pou\u382?itia akejko\u318?vek kompresie.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Deflate\tab Je najbe\u382?nej\u353?\u237?m typom kompresie pri prid\u225?van\u237? s\u250?borov do arch\u237?vu Zip.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Deflate64 \par


\pard\par

\b Pozn\u225?mka:\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\b0 Re\u382?im ukladania obr\u225?zkov dan\u233?ho s\u250?boru .KNT m\u244?\u382?ete zmeni\u357?, rovnako ako prejs\u357? z extern\u233?ho ukladania Zip na in\u253? prie\u269?inok a naopak, alebo ur\u269?i\u357? nov\u233? miesto ulo\u382?enia. Viac inform\u225?ci\u237? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|34|0|6"}}{\fldrslt{Ukladanie obr\u225?zkov}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\v\fs22\'11B3\'12\v0 Predvolen\u253? form\u225?t zo schr\u225?nky\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: PNG\cf1\b\fs22\par


\pard\cf0\b0\fs20 Umo\u382?\u328?uje vybra\u357? form\u225?t obr\u225?zka pri vkladan\u237? obr\u225?zkov zo schr\u225?nky, ak je ich intern\u253? form\u225?t bitmap alebo metafile. Vybra\u357? mo\u382?no PNG alebo JPG.\par

Vlo\u382?en\u253? obr\u225?zok sa predvolene skonvertuje na vybran\u253? form\u225?t. Pozri tie\u382? mo\u382?nos\u357? \b Pomer ve\u318?kosti\b0 , kde zist\u237?te, ako mo\u382?no definova\u357? v\u253?nimky.\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\v\fs22\'11B4\'12\v0 Pomer ve\u318?kosti\tab\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: 1.5\cf1\b\fs22\par


\pard\cf0\b0\fs20 Umo\u382?\u328?uje pri vkladan\u237? obr\u225?zkov zo schr\u225?nky vybra\u357? najvhodnej\u353?\u237? form\u225?t s oh\u318?adom na ve\u318?kos\u357?, ktor\u225? vznikne konverziou do oboch form\u225?tov:\par

  \par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je ve\u318?kos\u357? pomeru > 0, vykon\u225? sa konverzia do oboch form\u225?tov (PNG a JPG). \par


\pard\li360 Ak je \b predvolen\u253? form\u225?t\b0  (napr. PNG) v\u228?\u269?\u353?\u237? ako alternat\u237?vny form\u225?t, v pomere v\u228?\u269?\u353?om alebo rovnakom ako uveden\u225? hodnota, pou\u382?ije sa alternat\u237?vny form\u225?t (napr. JPG)\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je ve\u318?kos\u357? pomeru <= 0, vlo\u382?en\u233? obr\u225?zky sa v\u382?dy skonvertuj\u250? do form\u225?tu nastaven\u233?ho v \b Predvolen\u253? form\u225?t zo schr\u225?nky\b0 .\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\v\fs22\'11B5\'12\v0 Pixelov\u253? form\u225?t Bmp\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: 24 bit\cf1\b\fs22\par


