\cf1\b\fs36 Mo\u382?nosti: S\u250?bory KeyNote\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard\li360\v\'11I246\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\b0\highlight0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:246,381,368"}}{\fldrslt {246_Clipb_02mar.png}}}}\lang1033\par


\pard\par

\par

\b Pozn\u225?mka\b0 : Pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?sk\u253? s\u250?bor a posledn\u253? s\u250?bor sa spr\u225?vne rozpoznaj\u250? s absol\u250?tnymi aj relat\u237?vnymi cestami a ukladaj\u250? sa s relat\u237?vnou cestou (z\u225?kladn\u225? cesta pre relat\u237?vne cesty je prie\u269?inok keynote.exe)\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Na\u269?\u237?ta\u357? naposledy pou\u382?it\u253? s\u250?bor\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote sa automaticky spust\u237? so s\u250?borom, ktor\u253? bol naposledy otvoren\u253? pred zatvoren\u237?m KeyNote.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, KeyNote sa nepok\u250?si automaticky otvori\u357? naposledy pou\u382?it\u253? s\u250?bor.\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Na\u269?\u237?ta\u357? konkr\u233?tny s\u250?bor\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote na\u269?\u237?ta zadan\u253? s\u250?bor.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, KeyNote neotvor\u237? \u382?iadny zadan\u253? s\u250?bor.\par


\pard\par


\pard\sb100\ul Tip:\ulnone\b  \b0 S\u250?bory m\u244?\u382?ete otvori\u357? aj dvojit\u253?m kliknut\u237?m na s\u250?bor KeyNote (s\u250?bor s pr\u237?ponou .KNT) v Prieskumn\u237?kovi Windows alebo spusten\u237?m keynote.exe s parametrom .knt (pozri {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<16|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Preh\u318?ad pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadka}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Vytvori\u357? pr\u225?zdny nov\u253? s\u250?bor, ak sa nena\u269?\u237?ta \u382?iadny s\u250?bor\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard Pri otvoren\u237?, ak je povolen\u233? a nie je \u382?iadny s\u250?bor na na\u269?\u237?tanie, KeyNote vytvor\u237? pr\u225?zdny nov\u253? s\u250?bor (\u269?akaj\u250?ci na ulo\u382?enie).\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Automaticky uklada\u357? zmeny v s\u250?bore KeyNote\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote automaticky ulo\u382?\u237? v\u225?\u353? s\u250?bor, ak bol zmenen\u253? a zatv\u225?rate ho (pomocou S\u250?bor|Zavrie\u357?, ukon\u269?en\u237?m KeyNote, vytvoren\u237?m nov\u233?ho s\u250?boru alebo otvoren\u237?m in\u233?ho s\u250?boru; vo v\u353?eobecnosti v\u382?dy, ke\u271? vyvol\u225?te pr\u237?kaz, ktor\u253? by sp\u244?sobil stratu \u250?dajov, keby sa s\u250?bor predt\u253?m neulo\u382?il). \par


\pard\sb80 V opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade, ak bol s\u250?bor zmenen\u253?, KeyNote zobraz\u237? v\u253?zvu s ot\u225?zkou, \u269?i sa m\u225? s\u250?bor pred zatvoren\u237?m ulo\u382?i\u357?.\par


\pard\par

Ak je povolen\u233?, m\u244?\u382?ete KeyNote tie\u382? volite\u318?ne ur\u269?i\u357?, aby s\u250?bor ulo\u382?il pri ur\u269?itej udalosti: \u8222?\b Pri prepnut\u237? do inej aplik\u225?cie\b0 \u8220? a \u8222?\b Ka\u382?d\u253?ch [n] min\u250?t\b0 "\par

\par

\b Tip\b0 : T\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357? m\u244?\u382?ete povoli\u357? alebo zak\u225?za\u357? pomocou S\u250?bor | {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|3021|0|9"}}{\fldrslt{Automatick\u233? ukladanie}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Pri prepnut\u237? do inej aplik\u225?cie\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard Ke\u271? je povolen\u233? \b Automaticky uklada\u357? zmeny v s\u250?bore KeyNote\b0 :\par


\pard\sb80 Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote automaticky ulo\u382?\u237? s\u250?bor \ul\b zaka\u382?d\u253?m\ulnone\b0 , ke\u271? prepnete do inej aplik\u225?cie.\par


\pard\sb40 Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e to tie\u382? spust\u237? oper\u225?cie z\u225?lohovania.\par

\b Tip\b0 : \ul Neodpor\u250?\u269?a sa ako v\u353?eobecn\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357?\ulnone . Pou\u382?\u237?vajte len v \u353?peci\u225?lnych pr\u237?padoch a s mal\u253?mi s\u250?bormi.\par


\pard\par

\par

Pozri {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<52|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Odpor\u250?\u269?ania, kedy uklada\u357? a ako vytv\u225?ra\u357? z\u225?lo\u382?n\u233? k\u243?pie}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Ka\u382?d\u253?ch [n] min\u250?t\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO (10 min\u250?t)\par


\pard Ke\u271? je povolen\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? \b Automaticky uklada\u357? zmeny v s\u250?bore KeyNote\b0 :\par


\pard\sb80 Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote uklad\u225? s\u250?bor v \u269?asovom intervale, ktor\u253? ur\u269?\u237?te (v min\u250?tach).\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Nevy\u382?adova\u357? potvrdenie pri ukladan\u237? nov\u253?ch s\u250?borov\tab\tab\tab\cf0\b0\fs20 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote v\u225?s pri vytvoren\u237? nov\u233?ho s\u250?boru KeyNote vyzve na jeho ulo\u382?enie.\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Zamkn\u250?\u357? pri otvoren\u237?\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote sa pri otvoren\u237? pok\u250?si s\u250?bor zamkn\u250?\u357?, \u269?\u237?m zabr\u225?ni in\u253?m pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?om (ani procesom patriacim rovnak\u233?mu pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?ovi) upravova\u357? s\u250?bor s\u250?\u269?asne.\par

T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? umo\u382?\u328?uje bezpe\u269?nej\u353?iu spolupr\u225?cu viacer\u253?ch pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?ov\par

\par

Pri otv\u225?ran\u237? s\u250?boru uzamknut\u233?ho in\u253?m pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?om/procesom sa zobraz\u237? upozornenie a budete m\u244?c\u357? pokra\u269?ova\u357? v re\u382?ime len na \u269?\u237?tanie.\par

Ak\u253?ko\u318?vek pokus o ulo\u382?enie do uzamknut\u233?ho s\u250?boru bude nahl\u225?sen\u253? a automaticky sa prepne do re\u382?imu len na \u269?\u237?tanie (pou\u382?ite \u8222?Ulo\u382?i\u357? ako\u8220?).\highlight3\par

\highlight0\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Kontrolova\u357? uvo\u318?nenie / \u250?pravu s\u250?boru ka\u382?d\u253?ch [n] min\u250?t\tab\cf0\b0\fs20 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO (5 min\u250?t)\par


\pard KeyNote sleduje zmeny s\u250?borov a uvo\u318?nenie z\u225?mkov prostredn\u237?ctvom syst\u233?mu (pomocou Advanced/Folder Monitor). \par

Ak je povolen\u225?, mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?Kontrolova\u357? uvo\u318?nenie/\u250?pravu s\u250?boru\u8220? zais\u357?uje, \u382?e tieto zmeny bud\u250? zisten\u233? aspo\u328? ka\u382?d\u253?ch p\u225?r min\u250?t, ak ich syst\u233?m neozn\u225?mi.\par

\par

Pozri tie\u382? {\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<83|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Zdie\u318?anie KeyNote vo viacpou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?skom syst\u233?me}}}}\f0\fs20\par

}
