\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs36 Mo\u382?nosti: Mo\u382?nosti s\u250?borov\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par


\pard\li360\v\'11I132\'12\v0\fs20{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:132,358,342"}}{\fldrslt {132_Clipb_17ene.png}}}}\fs26\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Pam\u228?ta\u357? si naposledy pou\u382?it\u233? s\u250?bory\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote si pam\u228?t\u225? naposledy pou\u382?it\u233? s\u250?bory a zobrazuje ich zoznam v ponuke \b S\u250?bor|Naposledy pou\u382?it\u233? s\u250?bory\b0 . Tie\u382? ur\u269?ite po\u269?et s\u250?borov, ktor\u233? si m\u225? KeyNote pam\u228?ta\u357?.\par


\pard\sb100\ul\b Tip\ulnone : \b0 K zoznamu naposledy pou\u382?it\u253?ch s\u250?borov sa dostanete e\u353?te r\u253?chlej\u353?ie kliknut\u237?m na \u353?\u237?pku nadol ved\u318?a tla\u269?idla \b Otvori\u357?\b0  na hlavnom paneli n\u225?strojov.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Zobrazi\u357? ako podponuku\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u225?, zoznam naposledy pou\u382?it\u253?ch s\u250?borov sa zobraz\u237? ako podponuka v ponuke \b S\u250?bor\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u225?, zoznam naposledy pou\u382?it\u253?ch s\u250?borov sa zobraz\u237? v ponuke \b S\u250?bor\b0 .\par


\pard\li360\sb100\i Mus\u237? by\u357? povolen\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? Pam\u228?ta\u357? si naposledy pou\u382?it\u233? s\u250?bory.\i0\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Zobrazova\u357? \u250?pln\u250? cestu v ponuke MRU\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard Ak je povolen\u225?, ponuka naposledy pou\u382?it\u253?ch s\u250?borov zobrazuje \u250?pln\u233? n\u225?zvy s\u250?borov (s cestami). V opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade zobrazuje iba n\u225?zvy s\u250?borov\par


\pard\li240\sb100\i Mus\u237? by\u357? povolen\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? Pam\u228?ta\u357? si naposledy pou\u382?it\u233? s\u250?bory.\i0\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Otvori\u357? v re\u382?ime len na \u269?\u237?tanie\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard Ak s\u250? povolen\u233? mo\u382?nosti \b S\u250?bory na disket\u225?ch\b0  a/alebo \b S\u250?bory na sie\u357?ov\u253?ch diskoch\b0 , KeyNote otv\u225?ra tak\u233?to s\u250?bory iba na prezeranie.\par


\pard\sb80 S\u250?bory otvoren\u233? v re\u382?ime len na \u269?\u237?tanie mo\u382?no upravova\u357?, ale budete ich musie\u357? ulo\u382?i\u357? pod in\u253?m n\u225?zvom (pomocou pr\u237?kazu S\u250?bor | \b Ulo\u382?i\u357? ako\b0 ) alebo ich zavrie\u357? bez ulo\u382?enia zmien.\par


\pard\li240\sb100\ul Pozn\u225?mka\ulnone\b :  \b0 V niektor\u253?ch in\u253?ch pr\u237?padoch sa s\u250?bory otvoria automaticky ako len na \u269?\u237?tanie. Napr\u237?klad s\u250?bory, ktor\u233? u\u382? maj\u250? nastaven\u253? atrib\u250?t len na \u269?\u237?tanie, alebo s\u250?bory na diskoch CD-ROM sa v tomto re\u382?ime otvoria v\u382?dy.\par


\pard\sb100\b Tip\b0 : KeyNote m\u244?\u382?ete prin\u250?ti\u357? otvori\u357? ur\u269?it\u253? s\u250?bor .knt len na \u269?\u237?tanie pomocou mo\u382?nosti \u8222?Otvori\u357? '<current file>' ako len na \u269?\u237?tanie\u8220? v dial\u243?govom okne \cf2\ul Vlastnosti s\u250?boru\cf0\ulnone .\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Upozorni\u357? pri otv\u225?ran\u237? s\u250?boru v re\u382?ime len na \u269?\u237?tanie\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote zobraz\u237? pri otv\u225?ran\u237? s\u250?boru v re\u382?ime len na \u269?\u237?tanie spr\u225?vu.\par


\pard\sb100\ul Pozn\u225?mka\ulnone\b : \b0 Pri s\u250?boroch otvoren\u253?ch v re\u382?ime len na \u269?\u237?tanie zobrazuje KeyNote v stavovom riadku jasne \u269?erven\u233? X nad ikonou prisl\u250?chaj\u250?cou form\u225?tu s\u250?boru. Napr\u237?klad pri nat\u237?vnom form\u225?te sa zobraz\u237?: \v\'11I141\'12\v0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:141,21,19"}}{\fldrslt {141_Clipb_18ene.png}}}}. V dial\u243?govom okne \cf2\ul Vlastnosti s\u250?boru\cf0\ulnone  (karta Nastavenia) sa tie\u382? zobraz\u237? spr\u225?va \u8222?S\u250?bor bol otvoren\u253? len na \u269?\u237?tanie\u8220?\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Automaticky registrova\u357? typ s\u250?boru (priradi\u357? s\u250?bory .KNT k KeyNote)\cf0\fs20\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote sa pok\u250?si zaregistrova\u357? svoj typ s\u250?boru (.KNT) v syst\u233?me Windows, aby ste mohli s\u250?bory KeyNote otv\u225?ra\u357? dvojklikom v Prieskumn\u237?kovi Windows.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u225?, KeyNote sa pri spusten\u237? nepok\u250?\u353?a registrova\u357? svoj typ s\u250?boru. Pr\u237?ponu s\u250?boru .KNT m\u244?\u382?ete st\u225?le zaregistrova\u357? ru\u269?ne v Prieskumn\u237?kovi Windows (kliknut\u237?m prav\u253?m tla\u269?idlom na s\u250?bor a v\u253?berom mo\u382?nosti Otvori\u357? pomocou...).\par


\pard\li240\sb100\ul Pozn\u225?mky:\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li600\sb40\ulnone Kontrola registr\u225?cie mierne spoma\u318?uje spustenie programu.\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li600 In\u353?tala\u269?n\u253? program KeyNote tie\u382? umo\u382?\u328?uje zaregistrova\u357? toto priradenie a je to odpor\u250?\u269?an\u253? sp\u244?sob.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Vyzva\u357? pred vytvoren\u237?m priradenia s\u250?boru\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote sa v\u225?s pred registrovan\u237?m svojho typu s\u250?boru (.KNT) op\u253?ta\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u225?, KeyNote automaticky zaregistruje svoj typ s\u250?boru bez op\u253?tania.\par


\pard\li240\sb100\b\i Mus\u237? by\u357? povolen\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? Automaticky registrova\u357? \b0 typ s\u250?boru.\par


\pard\i0\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? alternat\u237?vnu pr\u237?ponu (.KNE) pre \u353?ifrovan\u233? s\u250?bory\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote uklad\u225? \u353?ifrovan\u233? s\u250?bory s odli\u353?nou pr\u237?ponou (KNE).\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u225?, KeyNote pou\u382?\u237?va rovnak\u250? pr\u237?ponu (KNT) pre \u353?ifrovan\u233? aj ne\u353?ifrovan\u233? s\u250?bory.\par


\pard\par

}
