\pard\sa80\cf1\fs22 Minimalizova\u357? KeyNote po [n] min\u250?tach ne\u269?innosti\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote sa po zadanom po\u269?te min\u250?t ne\u269?innosti minimalizuje. V opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade zostane otvoren\u253?\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Zavrie\u357? s\u250?bor pozn\u225?mok po [n] min\u250?tach ne\u269?innosti\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote po zadanom po\u269?te min\u250?t ne\u269?innosti zavrie otvoren\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote. V opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade zostane otvoren\u253?\par


\pard\li240\sb100\ul Pozn\u225?mka\ulnone : Nov\u233? (e\u353?te neulo\u382?en\u233?) s\u250?bory sa nebud\u250? automaticky zatv\u225?ra\u357?.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Automaticky zatv\u225?ra\u357? iba \u353?ifrovan\u233? s\u250?bory\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\cf1\b\fs22\par


\pard\cf0\b0\fs20 Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote po zadanom po\u269?te min\u250?t ne\u269?innosti zavrie otvoren\u233? s\u250?bory KeyNote iba vtedy, ak je ich form\u225?t \u353?ifrovan\u253?. V opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade zostan\u250? otvoren\u233?.\par


\pard\sb80\i Vy\u382?aduje povolen\u250? mo\u382?nos\u357? \b Zavrie\u357? s\u250?bor pozn\u225?mok po [n] min\u250?tach ne\u269?innosti\b0 .\par


\pard\i0\par

Pozn\u225?mka: V s\u250?boroch, ktor\u233? nepou\u382?\u237?vaj\u250? \u353?ifrovan\u253? form\u225?t, ale maj\u250? povolen\u233? \b \u353?ifrovanie obsahu\b0 , t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? nesp\u244?sob\u237? zavretie s\u250?boru, ale iba skrytie chr\u225?nen\u233?ho obsahu (uzlov a obr\u225?zkov). Ak je to nastaven\u233?, \u353?ifrovan\u233? uzly sa u\u382? nebud\u250? zobrazova\u357? v strome. A ich obsah samozrejme nemo\u382?no vyh\u318?ada\u357? pomocou funkcie N\u225?js\u357? v\u353?etko.\par


\pard\sb80 Pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<51|2933|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{\u352?ifrovan\u253? form\u225?t vs. nat\u237?vny alebo komprimovan\u253? form\u225?t s mo\u382?nos\u357?ou \u8222?Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\u8220?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

\par

\par


