\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Nastavenia pre akt\u237?vnu kartu a neakt\u237?vne karty\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Vyberte \b Akt\u237?vna karta\b0  a potom kliknite na tla\u269?idlo \b P\u237?smo\b0  alebo \b Farba\b0  na nastavenie p\u237?sma a farby karty pre kartu akt\u237?vneho prie\u269?inka. Kliknut\u237?m na Reset sa vr\u225?tite k predvolen\u233?mu nastaveniu.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Vyberte \b Neakt\u237?vna karta\b0  na nastavenie p\u237?sma a farby pre v\u353?etky neakt\u237?vne karty.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa100\cf1\b\fs22 Zobrazi\u357? ikony na kart\u225?ch\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote zobrazuje ikony na kart\u225?ch prie\u269?inkov. V opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade sa na kart\u225?ch prie\u269?inkov ikony nezobrazuj\u250?.\par


\pard\sb100\ul Pozn\u225?mka\ulnone\b :  \b0 Ikony m\u244?\u382?ete alternat\u237?vne zapn\u250?\u357? alebo VYPN\u218?\u356? samostatne pre ka\u382?d\u253? s\u250?bor pr\u237?kazom \cf2\ul S\u250?bor|Vlastnosti\cf0\ulnone .\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Zv\u253?raznenie pri prejden\u237? my\u353?ou na kart\u225?ch\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, karty prie\u269?inkov sa zv\u253?raznia, ke\u271? na ne presuniete kurzor my\u353?i.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, karty prie\u269?inkov nereaguj\u250? na prejdenie my\u353?ou.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Poloha kariet\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard Vyberte umiestnenie kariet prie\u269?inkov v okne programu KeyNote (Hore, Dole, V\u318?avo, Vpravo)\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Viacriadkov\u233? karty (usporiada\u357? do riadkov, ke\u271? sa nezmestia)\cf0\fs20\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote usporiada karty prie\u269?inkov do viacer\u253?ch riadkov, ak sa nezmestia do okna KeyNote.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, zobrazia sa pos\u250?vacie \u353?\u237?pky, pomocou ktor\u253?ch m\u244?\u382?ete pos\u250?van\u237?m zobrazi\u357? skryt\u233? karty prie\u269?inkov.\par


\pard\par

}
