\pard\par

\fs20 T\u225?to karta v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje prisp\u244?sobi\u357? ikony pou\u382?\u237?van\u233? pre karty prie\u269?inkov a uzly.\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa80 Ke\u271? pou\u382?ijete \b vlastn\u233? ikony\b0  na uzloch stromu (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<32|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Vlastnosti prie\u269?inka: Nastavenia stromu}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) alebo \b zobrazenie ikon na kart\u225?ch\b0  (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<97|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: Chrome}}}}}\f0\fs20 ), v\u353?etky tieto ikony sa ozna\u269?uj\u250? \u269?\u237?slom, pomocou ktor\u233?ho sa ikona nesk\u244?r vyh\u318?ad\u225? v zozname ikon vedenom na tejto str\u225?nke.\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 T\u225?to str\u225?nka mo\u382?nost\u237? bude zak\u225?zan\u225?, ak je \b Zobrazi\u357? obr\u225?zky ikon na kart\u225?ch\b0  zak\u225?zan\u233? (alebo je povolen\u233?, ale je vybrat\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? \b Vstavan\u233?\b0 ) na karte {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<48|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{S\u250?bor | Vlastnosti}}}}}\f0\fs20  (\ul Ikony s\u250?borov\ulnone )\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720 Namiesto \u8222?Prisp\u244?sobi\u357? ikony kariet (keynote.icn)\u8220? sa zobraz\u237? \u8222?Vlastn\u233? ikony s\u250? ZAK\u193?ZAN\u201?\u8220?\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}S\u250?bor bude pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? vstavan\u253? zoznam ikon (aktu\u225?lne 26).\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80\sa80 Ke\u271? s\u250? vlastn\u233? ikony povolen\u233?, nadpis bude zobrazova\u357? n\u225?zov s\u250?boru \b .icn \b0 , ktor\u253? KeyNote pou\u382?\u237?va.\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Predvolene bude KeyNote h\u318?ada\u357? s\u250?bor .ICN s rovnak\u253?m n\u225?zvom ako pou\u382?it\u253? s\u250?bor .INI v rovnakom umiestnen\u237?, ale in\u253? vlastn\u253? s\u250?bor m\u244?\u382?ete vybra\u357? pomocou mo\u382?nosti \b In\u253?\b0  v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<48|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{S\u250?bor | Vlastnosti}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\li360\sa80 Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<16|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Preh\u318?ad pr\u237?kazov\u233?ho riadka}}}}}\f0\fs20  a {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<86|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie profilov}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak \b sa nen\u225?jde \u382?iadny s\u250?bor .ICN\b0 , KeyNote pou\u382?ije vstavan\u253? zoznam ikon, ktor\u253? m\u244?\u382?ete upravi\u357?, a v tomto pr\u237?pade sa do v\u225?\u353?ho prie\u269?inka profilu ved\u318?a s\u250?boru .INI zap\u237?\u353?e vlastn\u253? s\u250?bor .ICN.\par


\pard\par

Pripom\u237?name, z {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<48|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{S\u250?bor | Vlastnosti}}}}}\f0\fs20 :\par


\pard\sb80 * Ikony kariet je mo\u382?n\u233? zapn\u250?\u357? alebo vypn\u250?\u357? samostatne pre ka\u382?d\u253? s\u250?bor .KNT.\par


\pard * Pre ka\u382?d\u253? s\u250?bor .KNT m\u244?\u382?ete ur\u269?i\u357? vlastn\u250? ikonu\par

* Pre ka\u382?d\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote m\u244?\u382?ete ma\u357? in\u250? vlastn\u250? sadu obr\u225?zkov kariet (s\u250?bor .icn).\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Prida\u357?\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard Otvor\u237? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno na v\u253?ber s\u250?boru a prid\u225? vybrat\u250? ikonu na koniec zoznamu.\par


\pard\sb80\b Tip\b0 : Naraz m\u244?\u382?ete prida\u357? viac ako jednu ikonu\highlight3\par


\pard\highlight0\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Vlo\u382?i\u357?\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard Otvor\u237? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno na v\u253?ber s\u250?boru a vlo\u382?\u237? vybrat\u250? ikonu na aktu\u225?lnu poz\u237?ciu v zozname.\par


\pard\li240\sb100\cf4\b Upozornenie\b0 : Vlo\u382?enie ikony posunie v\u353?etky nasleduj\u250?ce ikony dopredu. V\u253?sledkom je, \u382?e existuj\u250?ce prie\u269?inky a uzly bud\u250? teraz zobrazova\u357? in\u233? ikony.\cf0\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Odstr\u225?ni\u357?\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard Odstr\u225?ni vybran\u250? ikonu zo zoznamu.\par


\pard\li240\sb100\cf4\b Upozornenie\b0 : Odstr\u225?nen\u237?m ikony sa v\u353?etky nasleduj\u250?ce ikony posun\u250? vzad. V d\u244?sledku toho bud\u250? existuj\u250?ce prie\u269?inky a uzly teraz zobrazova\u357? in\u233? ikony.\cf0\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Tla\u269?idlo Obnovi\u357?\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard Znovu na\u269?\u237?ta vstavan\u250? sadu ikon a vr\u225?ti sp\u228?\u357? v\u353?etky zmeny, ktor\u233? ste v zozname ikon vykonali.\par

\par

}
