\pard\sa80\cf1\fs22 Zak\u225?za\u357? sledovanie prie\u269?inka\tab\tab\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak nie je za\u269?iarknut\u233?, KeyNote sleduje extern\u233? zmeny otvoren\u233?ho s\u250?boru a pok\u250?\u353?a sa zisti\u357?, \u269?i in\u225? aplik\u225?cia neupravila s\u250?bor, ktor\u253? je pr\u225?ve otvoren\u253? v KeyNote. V takom pr\u237?pade v\u225?s KeyNote vyzve na op\u228?tovn\u233? na\u269?\u237?tanie s\u250?boru z disku. Sledovanie prie\u269?inka v\u353?ak funguje len so s\u250?bormi na lok\u225?lnom disku, nie v sieti.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, KeyNote nesleduje zmeny v otvoren\u253?ch s\u250?boroch.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Zobrazova\u357? uk\u225?\u382?ky p\u237?siem v rozba\u318?ovacom zozname p\u237?siem\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\cf1\b\fs22\par


\pard\cf0\b0\fs20 Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote zobrazuje n\u225?zvy p\u237?siem v zozname p\u237?siem na paneli Form\u225?t pomocou skuto\u269?n\u233?ho p\u237?sma. V opa\u269?nom pr\u237?pade pou\u382?ije predvolen\u233? p\u237?smo.\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 \u352?ir\u353?ie rozba\u318?ovacie zoznamy na paneloch n\u225?strojov\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote zobrazuje o nie\u269?o \u353?ir\u353?ie rozba\u318?ovacie zoznamy na paneloch n\u225?strojov. Napr\u237?klad sa tak v zozname p\u237?siem na paneli n\u225?strojov Form\u225?t zobraz\u237? cel\u253? n\u225?zov p\u237?sma. \par


\pard\sb100\ul Tip\ulnone\b : \b0 Po\u269?et polo\u382?iek m\u244?\u382?ete zmeni\u357? aj pomocou k\u318?\u250?\u269?ov\u233?ho slova \b ComboDropDownCount\b0  v sekcii [KeyOptions] s\u250?boru \b keynote.ini\b0 .\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Povoli\u357? opravy pre Rich Edit verzie 3.0\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, zabra\u328?uje strate form\u225?tovania pri pou\u382?\u237?van\u237? verzie 3.0 s\u250?boru riched20.dll.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, pri pou\u382?\u237?van\u237? verzie 3.0 s\u250?boru riched20.dll (predvolen\u233? pre syst\u233?my Windows 95) m\u244?\u382?ete strati\u357? niektor\u233? inform\u225?cie o form\u225?tovan\u237?.\par


\pard\li360\sb100\ul Tip\ulnone\b : \b0 Ak m\u225?te verziu 4.0 alebo nov\u353?iu s\u250?boru riched20.dll, m\u244?\u382?ete t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zak\u225?za\u357? a pr\u237?padne zlep\u353?i\u357? v\u253?kon KeyNote.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Dial\u243?gy v\u253?beru farieb v starom \u353?t\u253?le\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, pri v\u253?bere pr\u237?kazov \b Form\u225?t|Farba textu \b0 alebo \b Form\u225?t|Pou\u382?i\u357? zv\u253?raznenie\b0  sa zobraz\u237? dial\u243?g v\u253?beru farby.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, v\u253?ber pr\u237?kazu pou\u382?ije farbu vybran\u250? pre tla\u269?idlo farby textu alebo farby zv\u253?raznenia na paneli n\u225?strojov Form\u225?t.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Povoli\u357? automatick\u233? sp\u250?\u353?\u357?anie makier\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, makr\u225? s automatick\u253?m spusten\u237?m sa spustia v\u382?dy, ke\u271? sa vytvor\u237? nov\u253? s\u250?bor alebo nov\u225? pozn\u225?mka. \u270?al\u353?ie inform\u225?cie n\u225?jdete v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<71|7607|0|6"}}{\fldrslt{Automaticky sp\u250?\u353?\u357?an\u233? makr\u225?}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, makr\u225? s automatick\u253?m spusten\u237?m treba spusti\u357? ru\u269?ne.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Bezpe\u269?n\u253? re\u382?im tla\u269?e\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, text \ul RTF\ulnone  sa najprv prefiltruje cez star\u353?iu verziu ovl\u225?dacieho prvku richedit, \u269?o odstr\u225?ni probl\u233?m s prebyto\u269?n\u253?mi stranami, ale sp\u244?sob\u237? stratu ur\u269?it\u253?ch atrib\u250?tov form\u225?tovania, ktor\u233? star\u353?ia verzia richedit nepodporovala (napr. zv\u253?raznenie, riadkovanie odsekov, \u353?t\u253?l p\u237?sma vyzeraj\u250?ci ako \ldblquote zak\u225?zan\u253?\rdblquote  a nieko\u318?ko \u271?al\u353?\u237?ch).\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, pou\u382?ij\u250? sa v\u353?etky mo\u382?nosti tla\u269?e ovl\u225?dacieho prvku richedit. Pri tla\u269?i sa m\u244?\u382?u vyskytn\u250?\u357? pr\u225?zdne strany navy\u353?e.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Opravi\u357? posuvn\u237?ky\tab\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote sa pok\u250?\u353?a vyrie\u353?i\u357? probl\u233?m s neaktualizuj\u250?cimi sa posuvn\u237?kmi.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, KeyNote nemus\u237? spr\u225?vne aktualizova\u357? obrazovku a posuvn\u237?ky. M\u244?\u382?e to ma\u357? za n\u225?sledok (napr. v Linux-WINE), \u382?e Editor nezobrazuje spr\u225?vnu polohu kurzora a posuvn\u237?ky neodr\u225?\u382?aj\u250? aktu\u225?lnu polohu. Posunut\u237?m str\u225?nky nahor alebo nadol sa vzh\u318?ad textu m\u244?\u382?e opravi\u357?.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Neuklada\u357? nastavenia okna do registra\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, ve\u318?kos\u357? a poloha okna a zoznam naposledy pou\u382?it\u253?ch s\u250?borov sa ukladaj\u250? do s\u250?boru \b keynote.mru\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, tieto inform\u225?cie sa ukladaj\u250? do registra Windows.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Nezobrazova\u357? inform\u225?cie o aktualiz\u225?cii\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote v\u225?s pri prvom spusten\u237? po aktualiz\u225?cii na nov\u250? verziu nevyzve na zobrazenie s\u250?boru \b history.txt\b0  ani nezobraz\u237? dial\u243?g Tip d\u328?a.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, KeyNote sa pri spusten\u237? op\u253?ta, \u269?i chcete zobrazi\u357? s\u250?bor \b history.txt\b0 , a zobraz\u237? dial\u243?g Tip d\u328?a.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Znovu na\u269?\u237?ta\u357? \u250?daje panela Prostriedky pri zobrazen\u237?\tab\cf0\fs20\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote znovu na\u269?\u237?ta \u250?daje panela Prostriedky z disku (obsah z\u225?pisn\u237?ka, makr\u225?, \u8230?) iba vtedy, ke\u271? panel Prostriedky zobraz\u237?te a vyberiete pr\u237?slu\u353?n\u250? kartu.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, \u250?daje panela Prostriedky sa na\u269?\u237?taj\u250? len pri prvom pou\u382?it\u237?.\par


\pard\par

\par

}
