\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Automaticky vybra\u357? jazyk p\u237?sma\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, automaticky sa vyberie p\u237?smo pod\u318?a syst\u233?mov\u233?ho jazyka, o ktorom si ovl\u225?dac\u237? prvok RichEdit mysl\u237?, \u382?e sa pou\u382?\u237?va. M\u244?\u382?e to by\u357? potrebn\u233? pre in\u233? ako latinsk\u233? jazyky.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, jazyk p\u237?sma zostane nezmenen\u253?.\par


\pard\li360\sb100\ul Tip\ulnone\b : \b0 Nechajte t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zak\u225?zan\u250?, pokia\u318? nem\u225?te probl\u233?my s pou\u382?\u237?van\u237?m KeyNote v inom ako latinskom jazyku.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Automaticky vybra\u357? kl\u225?vesnicu\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\cf1\b\fs22\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\cf0\b0\fs20 Ak je povolen\u233?, automaticky sa vyberie rozlo\u382?enie kl\u225?vesnice pod\u318?a syst\u233?mov\u233?ho jazyka, o ktorom si ovl\u225?dac\u237? prvok RichEdit mysl\u237?, \u382?e sa pou\u382?\u237?va. M\u244?\u382?e to by\u357? potrebn\u233? pre in\u233? ako latinsk\u233? jazyky.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, jazyk kl\u225?vesnice zostane nezmenen\u253?.\par


\pard\li360\sb100\ul Tip\ulnone\b : \b0 Nechajte t\u250?to mo\u382?nos\u357? zak\u225?zan\u250?, pokia\u318? nem\u225?te probl\u233?my s pou\u382?\u237?van\u237?m KeyNote v inom ako latinskom jazyku.\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\v\fs22\'11B1\'12\v0 Pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? predvolen\u253? webov\u253? prehliada\u269? syst\u233?mu\tab\tab\tab\tab\cf0\b0\fs20 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\cf1\b\fs22\par

Pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? nasleduj\u250?ci webov\u253? prehliada\u269?\par


\pard\cf0\b0\fs20 M\u244?\u382?ete povoli\u357? otv\u225?ranie webov\u253?ch odkazov v predvolenom prehliada\u269?i alebo v\u253?slovne ur\u269?i\u357? cestu k prehliada\u269?u. Druh\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? u\u382?ito\u269?n\u225?, ak pou\u382?\u237?vate KeyNote v prenosnom re\u382?ime a nechcete z\u225?visie\u357? od predvolen\u233?ho prehliada\u269?a.\par

(Viac o {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Hypertextov\u233? odkazy v KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 H\u318?ada\u357? slovo pod kurzorom\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: \u193?NO\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, slovo pod kurzorom sa zobraz\u237? v poli \b H\u318?adan\u253? text\b0  v dial\u243?govom okne \b H\u318?ada\u357?\b0 .\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, v poli \b H\u318?adan\u253? text\b0  sa zobraz\u237? naposledy pou\u382?it\u253? h\u318?adan\u253? text.\par


\pard\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Automaticky zavrie\u357? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno H\u318?ada\u357?\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: NIE\par


\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Ak je povolen\u233?, KeyNote po kliknut\u237? na H\u318?ada\u357? zavrie dial\u243?gov\u233? okno \b H\u318?ada\u357?\b0 . Stla\u269?en\u237?m \cf3\b F3\cf0\b0  m\u244?\u382?ete znova n\u225?js\u357? ten ist\u253? h\u318?adan\u253? text.\par

{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233?, dial\u243?gov\u233? okno \b H\u318?ada\u357?\b0  zostane otvoren\u233?, k\u253?m ho nezavriete.\par


\pard\par

\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Obnovi\u357? H\u318?ada\u357? \u271?al\u353?ie po\cf0\fs20\tab\tab\tab\tab\tab\b0 Predvolen\u233?: 0\par


\pard Ak je nastaven\u225? hodnota > 0 (napr\u237?klad \u8222?N\u8220?), KeyNote si pri v\u253?bere \ul H\u318?ada\u357? | H\u318?ada\u357? \u271?al\u353?ie\ulnone  (alebo \cf3 F3\cf0 ) vy\u382?iada nov\u253? vzor h\u318?adania, ak od posledn\u233?ho pou\u382?itia funkcie H\u318?ada\u357? \u271?al\u353?ie uplynulo viac ako \u8222?N\u8220? sek\u250?nd.\par


\pard\sb80 T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje be\u382?ne pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? H\u318?ada\u357? | H\u318?ada\u357? \u271?al\u353?ie (\cf3 F3\cf0 ) namiesto \ul H\u318?ada\u357? | H\u318?ada\u357?...\ulnone  a umo\u382?\u328?uje priradi\u357? obvykl\u250? skratku \cf3 Ctrl+F\cf0  funkcii \ul H\u318?ada\u357? | N\u225?js\u357? v\u353?etko...\ulnone \par


\pard\par


\pard\sa80\cf1\b\fs22 Ve\u318?kos\u357? p\u237?sma vo v\u253?sledkoch funkcie N\u225?js\u357? v\u353?etko\cf0\b0\fs20\par


\pard M\u244?\u382?ete ur\u269?i\u357? ve\u318?kos\u357? p\u237?sma pou\u382?\u237?van\u250? na zobrazenie v\u253?sledkov s v\u253?\u328?atkami z pozn\u225?mky zh\u244?d na karte H\u318?ada\u357? (panel zdrojov).\par

\par

\par

