\cf3\b\v\fs26\'11B1\'12\v0 [KeyOptions]\cf0\b0\fs24\par

\fs20\par

\b ColorDlgBig\b0 =1\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ur\u269?uje, \u269?i sa dial\u243?gov\u233? okn\u225? v\u253?beru farby na za\u269?iatku otvoria v roz\u353?\u237?renom stave (\u8222?ve\u318?k\u233?\u8220?) alebo v zbalenom stave (mal\u233?). Ak je nastaven\u225? hodnota 1, dial\u243?gov\u233? okn\u225? sa na za\u269?iatku zobrazia ako \u8222?ve\u318?k\u233?\u8220? s vidite\u318?n\u253?m panelom \u8222?Vlastn\u233? farby\u8220?. Ak je nastaven\u225? hodnota 0, dial\u243?gov\u233? okn\u225? sa zobrazia len so \u353?tandardn\u253?mi farbami a dial\u243?gov\u233? okno roz\u353?\u237?rite kliknut\u237?m na tla\u269?idlo \u8222?Definova\u357? vlastn\u233? farby\u8220?.\par


\pard\par

\b ComboFontLen\b0 =[pixely]\par

\b ComboMacroLen\b0 =[pixely]\par

\b ComboStyleLen\b0 =[pixely]\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Tieto tri nastavenia ur\u269?uj\u250? \u353?\u237?rku jednotliv\u253?ch rozba\u318?ovac\u237?ch zoznamov (zn\u225?mych aj ako combo boxy): zoznamu n\u225?zvov p\u237?siem, zoznamu makier a zoznamu \u353?t\u253?lov. M\u244?\u382?ete ich roz\u353?\u237?ri\u357? alebo skr\u225?ti\u357? pod\u318?a ve\u318?kosti a rozl\u237?\u353?enia monitora, ktor\u253? pou\u382?\u237?vate.\par


\pard\par

\b ComboDropDownCount\b0 =16\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ur\u269?uje maxim\u225?lny po\u269?et polo\u382?iek, ktor\u233? ka\u382?d\u253? rozba\u318?ovac\u237? zoznam zobraz\u237? bez nutnosti pos\u250?vania nahor alebo nadol. Aplik\u225?cie zvy\u269?ajne zobrazuj\u250? len 8 polo\u382?iek, \u269?o nie je ve\u318?a. V KeyNote je predvolen\u225? hodnota 16 a m\u244?\u382?ete ju zmeni\u357? \u250?pravou tejto hodnoty.\par


\pard\par

\b ExtHTML\b0 =.list.of.extensions.\par

\b ExtRTF\b0 =.list.of.extensions.\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Toto s\u250? zoznamy pr\u237?pon s\u250?borov, ktor\u233? KeyNote rozpozn\u225?va ako s\u250?bory HTML a RTF. Tieto pr\u237?pony sa pou\u382?\u237?vaj\u250? na ur\u269?enie, \u269?i m\u244?\u382?e KeyNote povoli\u357? prepojenie s\u250?boru ako virtu\u225?lneho uzla. Zoznamy sa spr\u225?vaj\u250? rovnako ako zoznam pr\u237?pon identifikuj\u250?cich \u269?ist\u233? textov\u233? s\u250?bory, ktor\u253? je mo\u382?n\u233? upravi\u357? v dial\u243?govom okne Mo\u382?nosti. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e KeyNote v s\u250?\u269?asnosti nevykon\u225?va \u382?iadne \u353?peci\u225?lne spracovanie s\u250?borov HTML; s\u250?bory identifikovan\u233? ako HTML sa sprac\u250?vaj\u250? rovnako ako \u269?ist\u233? textov\u233? s\u250?bory.\par


\pard\par


\pard\fi-1200\li1440\b D\u244?le\u382?it\u233?:\b0   pr\u237?pony musia obsahova\u357? \u250?vodn\u250? bodku a zoznam mus\u237? kon\u269?i\u357? bodkou, napr.: ExtHTML=.htm.html.cgi.asp.php.\par


\pard\par

\b SaveDARTWarn\b0 =1\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ak je nastaven\u225? hodnota 1, KeyNote v\u225?s upozorn\u237?, ak ulo\u382?\u237?te s\u250?bor KNT vo form\u225?te DartNotes. Form\u225?t DartNotes sa poskytuje iba pre kompatibilitu, ale KeyNote uklad\u225? ove\u318?a viac inform\u225?ci\u237? do svojich vlastn\u253?ch d\u225?tov\u253?ch s\u250?borov, tak\u382?e pri ukladan\u237? v tomto form\u225?te strat\u237?te niektor\u233? nastavenia. Ak \u269?asto vymie\u328?ate \u250?daje medzi KeyNote a DartNotes, m\u244?\u382?ete t\u250?to hodnotu nastavi\u357? na 0, aby ste upozornenie potla\u269?ili.\par


\pard\li100\par

(Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e ak s\u250?bor obsahuje jednu alebo viac pozn\u225?mok typu strom, nebudete m\u244?c\u357? s\u250?bor v\u244?bec ulo\u382?i\u357? vo form\u225?te DartNotes, preto\u382?e DartNotes nepodporuje stromy.)\par


\pard\par

\b ShellExecuteShowAllErrors\b0 =1\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ur\u269?uje, \u269?i KeyNote v\u382?dy zobraz\u237? v\u353?etky chyby, ktor\u233? m\u244?\u382?u nasta\u357? pri kliknut\u237? na hypertextov\u253? odkaz (internetov\u250? URL alebo odkaz na miestny s\u250?bor). Ak je nastaven\u225? hodnota 1, zobrazia sa v\u353?etky chyby. Ak je nastaven\u225? hodnota 0, KeyNote odfiltruje niektor\u233? chyby, ktor\u233? aplik\u225?cie ob\u269?as hl\u225?sia nespr\u225?vne. (Niektor\u237? pou\u382?\u237?vatelia si v\u353?imli, \u382?e sa ob\u269?as zobrazila chybov\u225? spr\u225?va \u8222?S\u250?bor sa nena\u353?iel\u8220?, hoci odkaz sa vykonal spr\u225?vne. Nejde o chybu v KeyNote; KeyNote jednoducho dostane od Windows nespr\u225?vne vydan\u253? k\u243?d chyby. Nastaven\u237?m tejto hodnoty na 0 potla\u269?\u237?te zobrazovanie t\u253?chto zav\u225?dzaj\u250?cich chybov\u253?ch spr\u225?v.)\par


\pard\par

\b StatBarDlbClkAction\b0 =6\par

\b StatBarDlbClkActionShft\b0 =2\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Tieto dve nastavenia ur\u269?uj\u250?, \u269?o sa stane pri dvojitom kliknut\u237? na stavov\u253? riadok (StatBarDlbClkAction) a pri dvojitom kliknut\u237? na stavov\u253? riadok so stla\u269?enou kl\u225?vesou \cf4\b Shift\cf0\b0 ). Mo\u382?n\u233? hodnoty s\u250?:\par

0 = ni\u269? nerobi\u357?\par


\pard\li100 1 = minimalizova\u357? KeyNote\par

2 = otvori\u357? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Vlastnosti s\u250?boru\par

3 = otvori\u357? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov\par

4 = otvori\u357? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Vlastnosti pozn\u225?mky\par

5 = vytvori\u357? nov\u250? pozn\u225?mku\par

6 = zobrazi\u357? alebo skry\u357? panel zdrojov\par


\pard\par

\cf5\b StartNoteType\b0 =1 [Zastaran\u233?]\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ur\u269?uje, ak\u253? druh pozn\u225?mky sa automaticky vytvor\u237? pri pou\u382?it\u237? pr\u237?kazu S\u250?bor | Nov\u253?. Ak je nastaven\u225? hodnota 0, ka\u382?d\u253? nov\u253? s\u250?bor bude za\u269?\u237?na\u357? jednoduchou (nie stromovou) pozn\u225?mkou. Ak je nastaven\u225? hodnota 1, ka\u382?d\u253? novovytvoren\u253? s\u250?bor bude za\u269?\u237?na\u357? pozn\u225?mkou typu strom.\par


\pard\sb40   (Pozn\u225?mka: \u8222?DefaultNoteType\u8220? si pam\u228?t\u225? posledn\u253? vytvoren\u253? typ pozn\u225?mky)\par


\pard\cf0\par

\b SaveDefaultFormat\b0 =0\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ur\u269?uje predvolen\u253? form\u225?t, v ktorom sa m\u225? s\u250?bor KeyNote uklada\u357? v novovytvoren\u253?ch s\u250?boroch. Mo\u382?n\u233? hodnoty s\u250?:\par

 0 = nffKeyNote\par

 1 = nffKeyNoteZip\par

 2 = nffEncrypted      \par


\pard\par

\b StyleShowSamples\b0 =0\par


\pard\li100\sb60\v\'11B8\'12\v0 Ur\u269?uje, \u269?i rozba\u318?ovac\u237? zoznam \u352?t\u253?ly zobrazuje uk\u225?\u382?ky \u353?t\u253?lov. Ak je nastaven\u225? hodnota 0, zoznam zobrazuje iba n\u225?zvy \u353?t\u253?lov. Ak je nastaven\u225? hodnota 1, zoznam zobrazuje n\u225?zov ka\u382?d\u233?ho \u353?t\u253?lu s pou\u382?it\u237?m vlastnost\u237? p\u237?sma pre dan\u253? \u353?t\u253?l.\par


\pard\par

\b WarnSingleInstance\b0 =1\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ak SingleInstance=1 a WarnSingleInstance=1, KeyNote pri otvorenej \u271?al\u353?ej in\u353?tancii zobraz\u237? nasleduj\u250?cu spr\u225?vu: \u8222?KeyNote NF je nakonfigurovan\u253? tak, aby povo\u318?oval iba jednu in\u353?tanciu naraz. Zatv\u225?ram t\u250?to in\u353?tanciu...\u8220?\par

Ak WarnSingleInstance=0, t\u225?to in\u353?tancia sa zavrie a druh\u225? sa aktivuje, ale bez ak\u233?hoko\u318?vek varovn\u233?ho hl\u225?senia.\par


\pard\par

\b ResolveLNK\b0 =1\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ur\u269?uje, \u269?i dial\u243?gov\u233? okn\u225? bud\u250? automaticky rozklada\u357? odkazy na skratky na skuto\u269?n\u233? s\u250?bory, na ktor\u233? ukazuj\u250?. To je u\u382?ito\u269?n\u233? najm\u228? pre sekciu Ob\u318?\u250?ben\u233? v paneli Zdroje. Ak je t\u225?to hodnota nastaven\u225? na 0, odkazy sa nebud\u250? rozklada\u357?. To znamen\u225?, \u382?e ak vyberiete s\u250?bor s pr\u237?ponou .lnk (t. j. skratku Windows), KeyNote umiestni pr\u225?ve tento s\u250?bor do zoznamu Ob\u318?\u250?ben\u233?. Ak je nastaven\u225? na 1, skratky .lnk sa rozlo\u382?ia a ak vyberiete tak\u253?to s\u250?bor, KeyNote ulo\u382?\u237? odkaz na skuto\u269?n\u253? s\u250?bor, na ktor\u253? skratka ukazuje (napr\u237?klad keynote.lnk sa rozlo\u382?\u237? na keynote.exe).\par


\pard\par

\b URLFileDecodeSpaces\b0 =1\par

\b URLFileNoPrefix\b0 =1\par

\b URLFileQuoteSpaces\b0 =0\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Tieto tri nastavenia poskytuj\u250? pokro\u269?il\u250? kontrolu nad t\u253?m, ako KeyNote sprac\u250?va hypertextov\u233? odkazy na lok\u225?lne s\u250?bory (klikate\u318?n\u233? odkazy s predponou <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///"}}{\fldrslt{file:///}}}}}\f0\fs20 >). Nastavenia sl\u250?\u382?ia na jemn\u233? doladenie spr\u225?vania KeyNote pri sp\u250?\u353?\u357?an\u237? hypertextov\u253?ch odkazov <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///"}}{\fldrslt{file:///}}}}}\f0\fs20 > v syst\u233?moch, kde predvolen\u233? hodnoty m\u244?\u382?u sp\u244?sobova\u357? probl\u233?my (napr. niektor\u233? in\u353?tal\u225?cie XP alebo syst\u233?my s nespr\u225?vne zaregistrovan\u253?m protokolom \u8222?file\u8220?). Predvolen\u233? hodnoty bud\u250? spr\u225?vne na v\u228?\u269?\u353?ine syst\u233?mov, ale ak naraz\u237?te na probl\u233?my so sp\u250?\u353?\u357?an\u237?m hypertextov\u253?ch odkazov, sk\u250?ste tieto nastavenia upravi\u357?.\par


\pard\par


\pard\fi-240\li240 -   ak je URLFileDecodeSpaces nastaven\u233? na 0, medzery v URL s\u250?borov sa nedek\u243?duj\u250? (KeyNote spust\u237? odkaz s vlo\u382?en\u253?m hexadecim\u225?lnym k\u243?dom %20); ak je nastaven\u233? na 1, hexadecim\u225?lny k\u243?d sa zmen\u237? sp\u228?\u357? na znaky medzery.\par


\pard\par


\pard\fi-240\li240 -   ak je URLFileNoPrefix nastaven\u233? na 0, KeyNote spust\u237? URL vr\u225?tane predpony <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///"}}{\fldrslt{file:///}}}}}\f0\fs20 > (napr. KeyNote vykon\u225? \u8222?<{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///c:\\\\Documents\\\\readme.txt"}}{\fldrslt{file:///c:\\Documents\\readme.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20 >\u8220?). Nebude to fungova\u357? na v\u353?etk\u253?ch syst\u233?moch, tak\u382?e hodnotu m\u244?\u382?ete zmeni\u357? na 1, \u269?\u237?m KeyNote odstr\u225?ni predponu a namiesto toho vykon\u225? \u8222?c:\\Documents\\readme.txt\u8220?.\par


\pard\par


\pard\fi-240\li240 -   ak je URLFileQuoteSpaces nastaven\u233? na 0, KeyNote nebude uzatv\u225?ra\u357? cestu k s\u250?boru do dvojit\u253?ch \u250?vodzoviek, aj ke\u271? cesta obsahuje medzery. Ak je nastaven\u233? na 1, cesta obsahuj\u250?ca medzery bude pri sp\u250?\u353?\u357?an\u237? hypertextov\u253?ch odkazov <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///"}}{\fldrslt{file:///}}}}}\f0\fs20 > uzavret\u225? do dvojit\u253?ch \u250?vodzoviek.\par


\pard\par

\par

\b URLFileEncodeName\b0 =0\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Ak je povolen\u233? (1), cesta k s\u250?borom a prie\u269?inkom bude URL-k\u243?dovan\u225? ako predt\u253?m\par

Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233? (0, predvolen\u233?), nebud\u250? URL-k\u243?dovan\u233?. Konkr\u233?tne, medzery sa nebud\u250? konvertova\u357? na %20 a odkaz bude v pr\u237?pade potreby uzavret\u253? medzi < a >.\par


\pard\li100\sb140 T\u253?ka sa to URL s\u250?borov vytvoren\u253?ch bez hypertextov\u253?ch odkazov, {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|3027|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{pou\u382?\u237?vanie rozpozn\u225?vania URL v editore RTF}}}}}\f0\fs20 , napr\u237?klad v pozn\u225?mkach s \u269?ist\u253?m textom.\par


\pard\li100 V d\u244?sledku toho sa odkaz na \u8222?C:\\Test\\NAME OF NOTE.txt\u8220? vytvor\u237? v pozn\u225?mke s \u269?ist\u253?m textom ako:\par


\pard\li100\sb60   0 -> \tab <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///E:\\\\Test\\\\NAME OF NOTE.txt"}}{\fldrslt{file:///E:\\Test\\NAME OF NOTE.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20 >\par

  1 -> \tab 'C:\\Test\\NAME OF NOTE.txt' ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///C:\\\\Test\\\\NAME%20OF%20NOTE.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///C:\\Test\\NAME%20OF%20NOTE.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\par

\par

\b URLFilePrefNoHyp\b0 =0\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Preferujte jednoduch\u233? odkazy namiesto hypertextov\u253?ch odkazov\par


\pard\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li460 Ak je zak\u225?zan\u233? (0, predvolen\u233?), odkazy na s\u250?bor sa v\u382?dy vytvoria ako hypertextov\u233? odkazy, ak je to mo\u382?n\u233? (v pozn\u225?mkach s \u269?ist\u253?m textom to mo\u382?n\u233? nie je)\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Ak je povolen\u233? (1), pri vkladan\u237? odkazu na s\u250?bor alebo prie\u269?inok pomocou {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<112|2194|0|8"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?i\u357? | Odkaz na s\u250?bor...}}}}}\f0\fs20  alebo pretiahnut\u237?m my\u353?ou odkaz nepou\u382?ije hypertextov\u233? odkazy. Vlo\u382?\u237? cestu s pridan\u237?m \u8222?{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:/// }}{\fldrslt{file:///}}}}}\f0\fs20 \u8220? a v pr\u237?pade potreby ju uzavrie medzi < a >.\par


\pard\li460\sb80 V editore potom vid\u237?te URL, ktor\u250? m\u244?\u382?ete priamo upravi\u357?.\par


\pard\li100\sb180 Ak KeyOptions.URLFilePrefNoHyp = 1 a KeyOptions.URLFileEncodeName=0, pretiahnutie nasleduj\u250?cich s\u250?borov do be\u382?nej pozn\u225?mky sa vlo\u382?\u237? ako:\par


\pard\li360 "E:\\Test\\NAME.txt" \tab\tab\tab -> {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///E:\\\\Test\\\\NAME.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///E:\\Test\\NAME.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

"E:\\Test\\NAME OF NOTE.txt" \tab -> <{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///E:\\\\Test\\\\NAME OF NOTE.txt"}}{\fldrslt{file:///E:\\Test\\NAME OF NOTE.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20 >\par


\pard\li100\sb140 Ak KeyOptions.URLFilePrefNoHyp = 1 a KeyOptions.URLFileEncodeName=1, pretiahnutie nasleduj\u250?cich s\u250?borov do be\u382?nej pozn\u225?mky sa vlo\u382?\u237? ako:\par


\pard\li360 "E:\\Test\\NAME.txt" \tab\tab\tab -> {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK file:///E:\\\\Test\\\\NAME.txt }}{\fldrslt{file:///E:\\Test\\NAME.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

"E:\\Test\\NAME OF NOTE.txt" \tab -> {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///E:\\\\Test\\\\NAME OF NOTE.txt"}}{\fldrslt{E:\\Test\\NAME OF NOTE.txt}}}}}\f0\fs20    (pou\u382?ije sa hypertextov\u253? odkaz)\par


\pard\li100\sb140 Ak KeyOptions.URLFilePrefNoHyp = 0, v\u353?etky tieto odkazy sa vytvoria ako hypertextov\u233? odkazy.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b Pozn\u225?mka\b0 : Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e \u250?prava ak\u233?hoko\u318?vek odkazu akciou Vytvori\u357? alebo Upravi\u357? alebo z dial\u243?gov\u233?ho okna v\u382?dy skonvertuje tento odkaz na verziu s hypertextov\u253?m odkazom.\par


\pard\par

\par

\b\v\'11B10\'12\v0 URLFileSepParams\b0 =##\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Ak nie je pr\u225?zdne, umo\u382?\u328?uje zada\u357? parametre v hypertextov\u253?ch odkazoch za t\u253?mito znakmi\par

Predvolene je definovan\u233? ako '##', ale m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? nahraden\u233? in\u253?m znakom/znakmi s niektor\u253?mi v\u253?nimkami. M\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? napr\u237?klad '==' alebo '<=', ale nie '<', '<<', '>>' alebo '>='. Niektor\u233? z t\u253?chto re\u357?azcov by sa nemali pou\u382?\u237?va\u357?, preto\u382?e s\u250? problematick\u233?, ak ich sk\u250?site pou\u382?i\u357? v pozn\u225?mkach s \u269?ist\u253?m textom. In\u233? jednoducho nefunguj\u250? ani v RTF pozn\u225?mkach. Pred zmenou tejto mo\u382?nosti m\u244?\u382?ete otestova\u357?, \u269?i sa d\u225? be\u382?ne pou\u382?i\u357?, a to tak, \u382?e ju zahrniete do URL (v editoroch RTF a \u269?ist\u233?ho textu) \par


\pard\par

\b\v\'11B11\'12\v0 URLFileSpaceInParams\b0 =+\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Ak nie je pr\u225?zdne, umo\u382?\u328?uje pou\u382?\u237?vanie medzier v hypertextov\u253?ch odkazoch pozn\u225?mok s \u269?ist\u253?m textom (kde sa medzery m\u244?\u382?u pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? iba v \u269?asti programu/dokumentu a v\u228?\u269?\u353?inou len vtedy, ak s\u250? uzavret\u233? medzi < a >). Predvolene je definovan\u233? ako '+'.\par

T\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? sa bude ignorova\u357? v RTF pozn\u225?mkach, preto\u382?e tam m\u244?\u382?ete medzery v hypertextov\u253?ch odkazoch pou\u382?\u237?va\u357? be\u382?ne.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Viac inform\u225?ci\u237? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|13732|0|12"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie parametrov s hyperodkazmi}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

\par

\b\v\'11B9\'12\v0 URLWebDecode\b0 =1\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Ak je nastaven\u233? na 1 (povolen\u233?), bude \u8222?dek\u243?dova\u357?\u8220? webov\u233? URL odkazy a preklada\u357? sekvencie %XY na im zodpovedaj\u250?ce znaky UTF-8. Pr\u237?klad:\par

  {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%92%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%B0,_%D0%9B%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B5_%D0%B4%D0%B5 }}{\fldrslt{https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%92%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%B0,_%D0%9B%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B5_%D0%B4%D0%B5}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

bude skonvertovan\u233? na:\par

  {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/\f2\'c2\'e5\'e3\'e0,_\'cb\'ee\'ef\'e5_\'e4\'e5 }}{\fldrslt{https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/\u194?\u229?\u227?\u224?,_\u203?\u238?\u239?\u229?_\u228?\u229?}}}}}\f2\fs20\lang1049\par


\pard\li100\sb220 Ur\u269?it\u233? znaky, ktor\u233? by mohli by\u357? zak\u243?dovan\u233? pomocou %X\f0\lang3082 Y\f2\lang1049 , sa nebud\u250? konvertova\u357?:\par


\pard\li100\sb60     ' ', '/', '?','!','''', '&', '%', '#', '$', '[', ']', '(',')', ',', ';', '*', ':', '@', '=', '+'\par


\pard\li100\sb140 Napr.: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.example.com/space%20here.html }}{\fldrslt{http://www.example.com/space%20here.html}}}}}\f2\fs20  sa nezmen\u237?\par


\pard\li100\sb180 V dial\u243?goch \u8222?Vlo\u382?i\u357? URL\u8220? a \u8222?Vybra\u357? akciu pre URL\u8220?\f0\lang3082  (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Hypertextov\u233? odkazy}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\f2\lang1049 , aj ke\u271? URLWebDecode=1, m\u244?\u382?ete vyn\u250?ti\u357?, aby sa URL nezmenila stla\u269?en\u237?m \cf4\b\f0\lang1033 Shift\cf0\b0\f2\lang1049  pri opusten\u237? po\u318?a URL alebo pri kliknut\u237? na OK (Vlo\u382?i\u357? URL) alebo Upravi\u357? (Vybra\u357? akciu pre URL).\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Aj ke\u271? sa URL nezmen\u237? (kv\u244?li \cf4\f0\lang1033 Shift\cf0\f2\lang1049  alebo URLWebDecode=0), ke\u271? je text pr\u225?zdny alebo sa rovn\u225? URL, nastav\u237? sa\f0\lang3082  \f2\lang1049 dek\u243?dovan\u225? verzia po\u318?a URL.\par

Tak\u382?e napr\u237?klad, ak ste stla\u269?ili \cf4\f0\lang1033 Shift\cf0\f2\lang1049  pri zmene fokusu z po\u318?a \u8222?URL\u8220? na \u8222?Text\u8220?, pole URL si zachov\u225? znaky %XY, ale pole \u8222?Text\u8220? sa nastav\u237? dek\u243?dovan\u233?.\par

\par

Pri pou\u382?it\u237? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<35|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{ClipCap}}}}}\f2\fs20  alebo {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<34|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Web Clip}}}}}\f2\fs20  sa URL schr\u225?nky automaticky prisp\u244?sob\u237?, ak URLWebDecode= 1.\f0\lang3082  \f2\lang1049 Ak\u233?ko\u318?vek in\u233? vlo\u382?en\u233? hypertextov\u233? odkazy, rozmiestnen\u233? v texte, sa prisp\u244?sobia iba otvoren\u237?m a \u250?pravou v dial\u243?govom okne \u8222?Vybra\u357? akciu pre URL\u8220?.\f0\lang1033\par


\pard\par

\par

\b ImgViewerPath\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Umo\u382?\u328?uje zada\u357? absol\u250?tnu alebo relat\u237?vnu (vo\u269?i keynote.exe) cestu k extern\u233?mu prehliada\u269?u obr\u225?zkov\par


\pard\par

\b ImgFormatInsideRTF\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Aby boli obr\u225?zky v editore vidite\u318?n\u233?, v RTF s\u250? v ovl\u225?dacom prvku RichEdit moment\u225?lne dostupn\u233? a pou\u382?ite\u318?n\u233? tieto form\u225?ty: \\wmetafile8, \\emfblip, \\pngblip alebo \\jpegblip\par

Pri programovom vkladan\u237? obr\u225?zka z\u225?vis\u237? form\u225?t, ktor\u253? KeyNote NF pou\u382?ije, od tejto mo\u382?nosti:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li460\sa60 ifWmetafile8 [0] \par


\pard\li460\sa100 V\u353?etky obr\u225?zky bud\u250? vlo\u382?en\u233? do RTF vo form\u225?te \\wmetafile8. Bude to jedin\u225? pon\u250?kan\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? na syst\u233?moch so star\u353?ou verziou RichEdit (<= 4 ).\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li460\sa60 ifAccordingImage [1]\par


\pard\li460\sa100 Aplik\u225?cia pou\u382?ije form\u225?t jpegblip pre obr\u225?zky JPG, emfblip pre obr\u225?zky poch\u225?dzaj\u250?ce z EMF \i s\u250?borov\i0 , wmetafile8 pre tie, ktor\u233? poch\u225?dzaj\u250? z WMF \i s\u250?borov\i0 , a pngblip pre ostatn\u233?: PNG, GIF, TIF, BMP a ICO.\par


\pard\li460\sb40\sa100 Pam\u228?tajte: Pri vkladan\u237?/registr\u225?cii nov\u233?ho obr\u225?zka aplik\u225?cia rozli\u353?uje medzi \ul form\u225?tom, v ktorom ho bude uchov\u225?va\u357?\ulnone , \u269?o bude form\u225?t, ktor\u253? pon\u250?ka pri vkladan\u237? (alebo pretiahnut\u237?) zo s\u250?boru; a \ul form\u225?tom pou\u382?it\u253?m na jeho zobrazenie\ulnone  v ovl\u225?dacom prvku RichEdit, teda t\u253?m, ktor\u253? sa pou\u382?ije spolu s RTF zna\u269?kou \cf6\\pict\cf0 . ImgFormatInsideRTF ovl\u225?da ten druh\u253?.\par


\pard   \par

\b\v\'11B15\'12\v0 ImgAllowEncrExternal\b0 =0\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0\lang3082 Mo\u382?nos\u357?, ktor\u225? ur\u269?uje, kam mo\u382?no uklada\u357? za\u353?ifrovan\u233? obr\u225?zky, ke\u271? je povolen\u233? \u353?ifrovanie obsahu\par

Ak je nastaven\u233? na 0 (predvolen\u233?), za\u353?ifrovan\u253? obr\u225?zok sa v\u382?dy ulo\u382?\u237? interne do vstavan\u233?ho \u250?lo\u382?iska KNT.\par

Ak je nastaven\u233? na 1, za\u353?ifrovan\u253? obr\u225?zok sa ulo\u382?\u237? do nakonfigurovan\u233?ho \u250?lo\u382?iska, aj ke\u271? je extern\u233? (ZIP alebo prie\u269?inok).\par


\pard\li100\sb140\lang1033 Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<51|2933|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{\u352?ifrovan\u253? form\u225?t vs. nat\u237?vny alebo komprimovan\u253? form\u225?t s mo\u382?nos\u357?ou \u8222?Povoli\u357? \u353?ifrovan\u253? obsah\u8220?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard   \par

\b UseCtrlHideTreePanel\b0 =1\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Ak je nastaven\u233? na 1, povol\u237? pou\u382?itie \cf4\b Ctrl+ Shift+F11 \cf0\b0 na skrytie panela stromu pri zachovan\u237? \u353?\u237?rky editora, \u269?\u237?m sa do\u269?asne zmen\u353?\u237? \u353?\u237?rka hlavn\u233?ho okna. Pr\u237?klad pou\u382?itia n\u225?jdete v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<27|11897|0|9"}}{\fldrslt{Skr\u253?vanie panelu stromu}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard\lang3082  \par

\b\lang1033 ModifiedOnTreeResized\b0 =0\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0\lang3082 Ak je nastaven\u233? na 1 (povolen\u233?), zmena \u353?\u237?rky (alebo maxim\u225?lnej \u353?\u237?rky) ktor\u233?hoko\u318?vek panela stromu ozna\u269?\u237? s\u250?bor ako zmenen\u253?, a tak sa tieto zmeny m\u244?\u382?u ulo\u382?i\u357?.\par


\pard\lang1033\par

\b MarginAltLeft\b0 =80\b\par

MarginAltRight\b0 =80\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Definuj\u250? alternat\u237?vne vidite\u318?n\u233? okraje (v pixeloch). Medzi predvolenou hodnotou (minimum) a t\u253?mito hodnotami m\u244?\u382?ete prep\u237?na\u357? pr\u237?kazom \ul Zobrazenie | Alternat\u237?vne okraje\ulnone .\par


\pard     \par

\b\v\'11B12\'12\v0 HintsAccesible\b0 =0\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0\lang3082 Mo\u382?nos\u357? u\u318?ah\u269?i\u357? nevidiacim a zrakovo postihnut\u253?m \u318?u\u271?om \u269?\u237?tanie n\u225?poved\u237? cez stavov\u253? riadok.\par


\pard\li100\sb100 Ak je nastaven\u233? na 1 (povolen\u233?), ke\u271? sa zobraz\u237? n\u225?pove\u271?, v\u353?etky textov\u233? panely stavov\u233?ho riadku okrem panela zodpovedaj\u250?ceho n\u225?povedi sa zobrazia pr\u225?zdne, aby \u269?\u237?ta\u269? obrazovky (napr\u237?klad NVDA) mohol priamo pre\u269?\u237?ta\u357? text (n\u225?pove\u271?) bez toho, aby musel predt\u253?m pre\u269?\u237?ta\u357? v\u353?etky ostatn\u233? panely, ktor\u233? obsahuj\u250? n\u225?zov s\u250?boru, polohu kurzora, stav zmeny s\u250?boru at\u271?.\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Napr\u237?klad \u269?\u237?ta\u269?ka NVDA umo\u382?\u328?uje \u269?\u237?ta\u357? stavov\u253? riadok kombin\u225?ciou \cf4 [NVDA]+End\cf0 .\cf4\b\par


\pard\li100\sb100\cf0\b0 Pozn\u225?mka: NVDA (Non-Visual Desktop Access) umo\u382?\u328?uje nevidiacim a zrakovo postihnut\u253?m \u318?u\u271?om pristupova\u357? k opera\u269?n\u233?mu syst\u233?mu Windows a interagova\u357? s n\u237?m, ako aj s mnoh\u253?mi aplik\u225?ciami tret\u237?ch str\u225?n.\par


\pard\lang1033\par

\par

\b EditorInfoPanelTop\b0 =0\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0\lang3082 Mo\u382?nos\u357?, ktor\u225? umo\u382?\u328?uje zmeni\u357? umiestnenie informa\u269?n\u233?ho panela (hore alebo dole)\par


\pard\li100\sb100\lang1033 Ak je nastaven\u225? na 1, bude umiestnen\u253? v hornej \u269?asti editora pozn\u225?mok.\par


\pard\li100\sb20 Ak je nastaven\u225? na 0 (predvolen\u233?), bude umiestnen\u253? v dolnej \u269?asti editora pozn\u225?mok.\par


\pard\par

\par

\b\v\'11B13\'12\v0 RTLkeyShct\b0 =0\par

Mo\u382?nos\u357?, ktor\u225? umo\u382?\u328?uje zak\u225?za\u357? kl\u225?vesov\u233? skratky na zmenu predvolen\u233?ho obojsmern\u233?ho re\u382?imu kl\u225?vesnice (RTL alebo LTR) \par


\pard\li360 Ak je nastaven\u225? na 0 (predvolen\u233?): nepou\u382?\u237?vaj\u250? sa kl\u225?vesov\u233? skratky na detekciu RTL (RTL: RCtrl+RShft  LTR: LCtrl+LShft,  pri uvo\u318?nen\u237? kl\u225?vesu)\par

\par

T\u225?to predvolen\u225? hodnota mo\u382?nosti bola nastaven\u225? na 0, aby sa predi\u353?lo komplik\u225?ci\u225?m, ktor\u233? so sebou prin\u225?\u353?a spracovanie RTL pre ovl\u225?dac\u237? prvok RichEdit, \u269?o by mohlo sp\u244?sobi\u357? probl\u233?my pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318?om, ktor\u237? by ho mohli omylom aktivova\u357? (ako bolo p\u244?vodne nahl\u225?sen\u233? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/issues/816"}}{\fldrslt{probl\u233?m #816}}}}}\f0\fs20  v d\u244?sledku pou\u382?\u237?vania AutoHotKey).\par


\pard\par

\b IMEAutoKeyboard\b0 =1\par

Mo\u382?nos\u357?, ktor\u225? ur\u269?uje, \u269?i je povolen\u233? automatick\u233? prep\u237?nanie kl\u225?vesnice pri nastaven\u237? editora do obojsmern\u233?ho re\u382?imu (RTL)\par

Ak je automatick\u233? prep\u237?nanie kl\u225?vesnice zapnut\u233?, ovl\u225?dac\u237? prvok automaticky zmen\u237? rozlo\u382?enie kl\u225?vesnice, ke\u271? pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318? v\u253?slovne prepne na in\u233? p\u237?smo alebo ke\u271? pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318? v\u253?slovne presunie bod vlo\u382?enia na nov\u233? miesto v texte. \par


\pard\li360\sb80 Ak je nastaven\u225? na 1 (predvolen\u233?), IMF_AUTOKEYBOARD zostane zapnut\u253?, ke\u271? sa automaticky zapne pre obojsmern\u233? ovl\u225?dacie prvky  (Predvolen\u233?: 1)\par


\pard       Ak je nastaven\u225? na 0, IMF_AUTOKEYBOARD sa vypne hne\u271? po nastaven\u237? re\u382?imu RTL \par

\par

\b IMEAutoFont\b0 =1\par

Mo\u382?nos\u357?, ktor\u225? umo\u382?\u328?uje ovl\u225?daciemu prvku RichEdit automaticky meni\u357? p\u237?sma, ke\u271? pou\u382?\u237?vate\u318? v\u253?slovne prepne na in\u233? rozlo\u382?enie kl\u225?vesnice \par


\pard\li360 Ak je nastaven\u225? na 1 (predvolen\u233?), IMF_AUTOFONT bude v\u382?dy zapnut\u253?.\par


\pard       Ak je nastaven\u225? na 0, IMF_AUTOFONT sa vypne\par

\par

\par

Pozrite si toto {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/issues/816#issuecomment-2781550615"}}{\fldrslt{koment\u225?r k probl\u233?mu #816}}}}}\f0\fs20  pre podrobnej\u353?\u237? opis mo\u382?nost\u237? RTLkeyShct\b , \b0  IMEAutoKeyboard a IMEAutoFont.\par

\par

\par

\par

\cf3\b\v\fs26\'11B2\'12\v0 [ClipOptions]\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\b SleepTime\b0 =1\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ur\u269?uje, ako dlho KeyNote \u269?ak\u225? po zachyten\u237? textu zo schr\u225?nky, k\u253?m prijme \u271?al\u353?ie zachytenie. Toto nastavenie sa pou\u382?\u237?valo na to, aby KeyNote opakovane nezachyt\u225?val rovnak\u253? klip z ur\u269?it\u253?ch aplik\u225?ci\u237? (najm\u228? Word a Acrobat Reader). \u268?as \u269?akania sa uv\u225?dza v desatin\u225?ch sekundy, tak\u382?e hodnota 5 znamen\u225? pol sekundy. Nastavenie sa st\u225?le pou\u382?\u237?va, ale KeyNote m\u225? teraz ove\u318?a lep\u353?iu ochranu proti duplicitn\u253?m klipom, ktor\u250? mo\u382?no nastavi\u357? v dial\u243?govom okne Mo\u382?nosti (mo\u382?nos\u357? \u8222?Ignorova\u357? duplicitn\u233? klipy\u8220?).\par


\pard\par

\b URLOnly\b0 =1\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Ak je povolen\u225? (1), ke\u271? skop\u237?rujete najviac jedno slovo, tento text sa ignoruje a namiesto neho sa zobraz\u237? URL (a n\u225?zov, ak je k dispoz\u237?cii). (Zoh\u318?ad\u328?uje sa iba pre Web Clip)\par


\pard\par

\par

\par

\cf3\b\v\fs26\'11B3\'12\v0 [TabOptions]\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\b ColorAllTabs\b0 =0\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ak je nastaven\u225? na 0, farba p\u237?sma karty, ktor\u250? zad\u225?te v Mo\u382?nosti|Chrome, sa pou\u382?ije iba pre aktu\u225?lne akt\u237?vnu kartu a v\u353?etky neakt\u237?vne karty pou\u382?\u237?vaj\u250? \u353?tandardn\u250? farbu p\u237?sma (zvy\u269?ajne \u269?iernu). Ak je nastaven\u225? na 1, rovnak\u225? farba p\u237?sma sa pou\u382?ije pre akt\u237?vnu kartu aj v\u353?etky neakt\u237?vne karty.\par


\pard\par

\par

\par

\cf3\b\v\fs26\'11B4\'12\v0 [EditorOptions]\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\b DisableINSKey\b0 =0\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ak je nastaven\u225? na 1, \u250?plne zak\u225?\u382?e kl\u225?ves Insert. To je u\u382?ito\u269?n\u233? pre t\u253?ch, ktor\u237? \u269?asto omylom stla\u269?ia kl\u225?ves INS a prepn\u250? sa do re\u382?imu prepisovania.\par


\pard\par

\b EditProtected\b0 =1\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ak je nastaven\u225? na 0, zabr\u225?ni v\u225?m upravova\u357? text naform\u225?tovan\u253? ako \u8222?chr\u225?nen\u253?\u8220?. T\u250?to vlastnos\u357? form\u225?tovania nie je mo\u382?n\u233? nastavi\u357? v KeyNote, ale m\u244?\u382?e sa prepoji\u357? napr\u237?klad s textom vlo\u382?en\u253?m z Wordu. Ke\u271? je text chr\u225?nen\u253?, nemo\u382?no ho odstr\u225?ni\u357? ani upravi\u357?, pokia\u318? t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? nie je nastaven\u225? na 1 (predvolen\u233?).\par

\par


\pard\b\v\'11B14\'12\v0 BulletsInPlainText\b0 ="- "\par


\pard\li100\sb60\lang3082 Umo\u382?\u328?uje nahradi\u357? \lang1033 odr\u225?\u382?ky alternat\u237?vnym re\u357?azcom pri vkladan\u237? ako \u269?ist\u253? text.\par


\pard\li100\sb80 Pozrite tie\u382? {\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<20|16135|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Odr\u225?\u382?ky a \u269?ist\u253? text}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\li100\sb60\par


\pard\b NumbTabInPlainText\b0 =" "\par


\pard\li100\sb60\lang3082 Umo\u382?\u328?uje nahradi\u357? znak TAB, ktor\u253? sa v\u382?dy pou\u382?\u237?va pri vkladan\u237? \u269?\u237?slovan\u253?ch zoznamov ako \u269?ist\u253? text (syst\u233?mov\u225? konverzia), alternat\u237?vnym re\u357?azcom. \f3 Predvolene je definovan\u225? medzera \u8222? \u8220?.\f0\lang1033\par


\pard\li100\par


\pard\b FixEmojisProblem\b0 =1\par


\pard\li100\sb60\f3\lang3082 Ak je nastaven\u225? na 1, zabr\u225?ni probl\u233?mu sp\u244?soben\u233?mu ur\u269?it\u253?mi sekvenciami Unicode pou\u382?\u237?van\u253?mi ako modifik\u225?tory v emoji [Pozri probl\u233?m #896]\f0\lang1033\par


\pard\li100\sb80\fs18\lang3082 Ak je povolen\u225?, KeyNote sa pok\u250?si identifikova\u357? a odstr\u225?ni\u357? pr\u237?tomnos\u357? ur\u269?it\u253?ch \u353?peci\u225?lnych znakov, ktor\u233? m\u244?\u382?u sp\u244?sobi\u357? probl\u233?my v ovl\u225?dacom prvku RichEdit kv\u244?li obmedzeniu parsera RTF:\par


\pard\li360\sb80 U+FE0E (\\u-498?)\tab Variation Selector-15        \tab\ldblquote Vyn\u250?ti\u357? textov\u253? re\u382?im\rdblquote\par


\pard\li360 U+FE0F (\\u-497?)\tab Variation Selector-16        \tab\ldblquote Vyn\u250?ti\u357? emoji re\u382?im\rdblquote\par

U+20E3 (\\u8419?)\tab Combining Enclosing Keycap\tab\ldblquote R\u225?mik kl\u225?vesu\rdblquote\par


\pard\li100\fs20\lang1033\par

\par


\pard\cf3\b\v\fs26\'11B5\'12\v0 [TreeOptions]\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\b FullRowSelect\b0 =0\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ak je nastaven\u225? na 1, povol\u237? funkciu stromu \u8222?v\u253?ber cel\u233?ho riadka\u8220?, tak\u382?e pruh v\u253?beru sa tiahne od \u318?av\u233?ho po prav\u253? okraj okna stromu namiesto toho, aby pokr\u253?val iba n\u225?zov uzla.\par


\pard\par

\b NodeDelimiter\b0 =/\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Jeden znak pou\u382?\u237?van\u253? na odde\u318?ovanie ciest uzlov stromu. Tieto cesty sa zobrazuj\u250? v stavovom riadku po kliknut\u237? na uzol a v zozname v\u253?sledkov h\u318?adania na paneli zdrojov. Typicky cesta vyzer\u225? takto:\par


\pard\li100\tab KeyNote/Funkcie/Stromy/Uzly\par

Toto nastavenie v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje zmeni\u357? znak '/' na nie\u269?o in\u233?.\par


\pard\par

\b RemovableMediaVNodes\b0 =1\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ur\u269?uje, \u269?i KeyNote umo\u382?\u328?uje vytv\u225?ra\u357? virtu\u225?lne uzly, ktor\u233? odkazuj\u250? na s\u250?bory na vymenite\u318?n\u253?ch m\u233?di\u225?ch, ako s\u250? diskety alebo CD-ROM. Mo\u382?n\u233? hodnoty s\u250?:\par

0 - virtu\u225?lne uzly nemo\u382?no prepoji\u357? so s\u250?bormi na vymenite\u318?n\u253?ch m\u233?di\u225?ch\par


\pard\li100 1 - virtu\u225?lne uzly mo\u382?no prepoji\u357? so s\u250?bormi na vymenite\u318?n\u253?ch m\u233?di\u225?ch, ale KeyNote zobraz\u237? upozornenie zaka\u382?d\u253?m, ke\u271? tak\u253?to uzol vytvor\u237?te\par

2 - virtu\u225?lne uzly mo\u382?no prepoji\u357? so s\u250?bormi na vymenite\u318?n\u253?ch m\u233?di\u225?ch a nezobraz\u237? sa \u382?iadne upozornenie\par

\par

Zmena tejto hodnoty neovplyvn\u237? virtu\u225?lne uzly, ktor\u233? u\u382? existuj\u250?.\par


\pard\par

\par

\b RelativeKNTLinks\b0 =1\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Spolu s \ul CaretInKNTLinks\ulnone  ur\u269?uje, ako sa zobrazuj\u250? intern\u233? odkazy a ako sa zostavuje vidite\u318?n\u253? text (ak sa vklad\u225? bez v\u253?beru textu) (Viac v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|12871|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Vkladanie intern\u253?ch odkazov Keynote (KNT odkazov)}}}}}\f0\fs20  )\par

Ke\u271? je t\u225?to mo\u382?nos\u357? =1, cesta bodu vlo\u382?enia sa porovn\u225? s cestou hypertextov\u233?ho odkazu KNT. Spolo\u269?n\u237? predkovia sa skryj\u250?.\par


\pard\par

\b CaretInKNTLinks\b0 =0\b\par


\pard\li100\sb60\b0 Spolu s \ul RelativeKNTLinks\ulnone  ur\u269?uje, ako sa zobrazuj\u250? intern\u233? odkazy a ako sa zostavuje vidite\u318?n\u253? text (ak sa vklad\u225? bez v\u253?beru textu) (Viac v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|12871|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Vkladanie intern\u253?ch odkazov Keynote (KNT odkazov)}}}}}\f0\fs20  )\par

Poz\u237?cia kurzora sa zahrnie do zobrazen\u233?ho textu iba vtedy, ak je t\u225?to hodnota 1 alebo RelativeKNTLinks=1 a odkaz KNT a jeho cie\u318? sa nach\u225?dzaj\u250? v tej istej pozn\u225?mke/uzle.\par

V prvom pr\u237?pade m\u244?\u382?ete vidie\u357? nie\u269?o ako \u8222?Pozn\u225?mka1/Uzol1 -34\u8220? a v druhom ako \u8222?Poz.34\u8220?\par


\pard\par

\par

\cf3\b\v\fs26\'11B7\'12\v0 [ExportOptions]\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\b SimpleFileName\b0 =0\par


\pard\li100\sb60 Ur\u269?uje, ako sa naz\u253?vaj\u250? exportovan\u233? s\u250?bory:\par

0 - Pou\u382?ite n\u225?zvy s\u250?borov ako: \u8222?01 - Prie\u269?inok - Uzol.rtf\u8220?\par


\pard\li460 \u8222?01\u8220? je index vygenerovan\u233?ho s\u250?boru, pri\u269?om \u8222?00\u8220? sa pou\u382?\u237?va pre obsah (ak je zahrnut\u253?), \u8222?01\u8220? pre prv\u253? s\u250?bor, \u8222?02\u8220? pre druh\u253? at\u271?.\par


\pard\li100\sb60 1 - Pou\u382?\u237?vajte pre n\u225?zvy s\u250?borov iba n\u225?zov uzla, ako:  \u8222?Uzol.rtf\u8220?\par


\pard\par

\par

\cf3\b\v\fs26\'11B6\'12\v0 [ResPanelOptions]\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

\b\par

}
