{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|4356|0|12"}}{\fldrslt{Import...}}}}}\f0\fs20\tab Umo\u382?\u328?uje vybra\u357? jeden alebo viac s\u250?borov na import do KeyNote\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|5340|0|16"}}{\fldrslt{Export...}}}}}\f0\fs20\tab Umo\u382?\u328?uje exportova\u357? \u269?as\u357? alebo cel\u253? otvoren\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote do samostatn\u233?ho s\u250?boru (TXT, RTF, HTML, KNT alebo TreePad)\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|5480|0|15"}}{\fldrslt{Nastavenie str\u225?nky...}}}}}\f0\fs20\tab Zobraz\u237? \u353?tandardn\u233? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Windows \ldblquote Nastavenie str\u225?nky\rdblquote  na konfigur\u225?ciu ur\u269?it\u253?ch aspektov tla\u269?e pozn\u225?mok\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|6493|0|17"}}{\fldrslt{Tla\u269?...}}}}}\f0\fs20\tab Tla\u269? s roz\u353?\u237?ren\u253?mi mo\u382?nos\u357?ami\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|5817|0|14"}}{\fldrslt{Kop\u237?rova\u357? do...}}}}}\f0\fs20\tab Umo\u382?\u328?uje vytvori\u357? k\u243?piu aktu\u225?lne otvoren\u233?ho s\u250?boru vo vybranom prie\u269?inku\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<109|6191|0|13"}}{\fldrslt{Ukon\u269?i\u357?}}}}}\f0\fs20\tab Zatvor\u237? program\par


\pard\cf3\par

\b\par

\par

\cf1\v\fs26\'11B1\'12\v0 Nov\u253?\cf0\b0\fs20  \cf3\b\par

\cf0\b0 Vytvor\u237? nov\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote. \par

Ak je zapnut\u225? mo\u382?nos\u357? \b Automatick\u233? ukladanie\b0 , KeyNote v\u225?s vyzve, aby ste nov\u233?mu s\u250?boru dali n\u225?zov a ulo\u382?ili ho (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<15|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: S\u250?bory KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 ). Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e mo\u382?nos\u357? automatick\u233?ho ukladania nem\u244?\u382?e fungova\u357?, k\u253?m nov\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote prv\u253?kr\u225?t neulo\u382?\u237?te.\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I1\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:1,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {1_Main_01.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_FileNew\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Shift+Ctrl+N\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMFileNew\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B2\'12\v0 Otvori\u357?...\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Otvor\u237? s\u250?bor KeyNote na va\u353?om disku.\par

\par


\pard\li240\b Tip:\b0  S\u250?bor v KeyNote m\u244?\u382?ete otvori\u357? nieko\u318?k\u253?mi sp\u244?sobmi. M\u244?\u382?ete napr\u237?klad vybra\u357? ned\u225?vno pou\u382?it\u253? s\u250?bor z ponuky \u8222?Ned\u225?vne s\u250?bory\u8220?, pretiahnu\u357? s\u250?bor KeyNote z Prieskumn\u237?ka Windows a pusti\u357? ho na okno KeyNote, alebo otvori\u357? s\u250?bor cez {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<50|496|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov}}}}}\f0\fs20 dial\u243?gov\u233? okno (pozri ni\u382?\u353?ie).\par


\pard\li240\sb40 Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<50|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Otv\u225?ranie a ukladanie s\u250?borov KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\li240\par

\b Tip: \b0 KeyNote dok\u225?\u382?e otv\u225?ra\u357? a uklada\u357? s\u250?bory s pr\u237?ponami .KNT, .KNE a .N_TEXT. S\u250?bory in\u253?ch typov je mo\u382?n\u233? importova\u357?. Pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<56|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Importovanie s\u250?borov v KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par

\b Tip: \b0 KeyNote m\u244?\u382?e v\u225?\u353? s\u250?bor ob\u269?as otvori\u357? v re\u382?ime iba na \u269?\u237?tanie. Napr\u237?klad s\u250?bory na jednotk\u225?ch CD-ROM nie je mo\u382?n\u233? upravova\u357?, tak\u382?e sa otvoria ako iba na \u269?\u237?tanie. Dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Mo\u382?nosti umo\u382?\u328?uje nastavi\u357?, ktor\u233? \u271?al\u353?ie s\u250?bory sa maj\u250? otv\u225?ra\u357? v re\u382?ime iba na \u269?\u237?tanie (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<93|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: Mo\u382?nosti s\u250?boru}}}}}\f0\fs20 ). Ke\u271? je s\u250?bor otvoren\u253? v re\u382?ime iba na \u269?\u237?tanie, st\u225?le ho m\u244?\u382?ete upravova\u357?, ale nebudete ho m\u244?c\u357? ulo\u382?i\u357?, pokia\u318? nezmen\u237?te n\u225?zov a/alebo umiestnenie s\u250?boru.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I2\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:2,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {2_Main_02.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_FileOpen\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Ctrl+O\b0\f2\fs20  \cf0 / \cf4 MMFileOpen\cf5\b\f0\par


\pard\cf0\b0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B3\'12\v0 Ulo\u382?i\u357?\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Ulo\u382?\u237? aktu\u225?lny s\u250?bor KeyNote na disk.\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\f2\'11I3\'12\v0\f0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:3,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {3_Main_03.png}}}}\f2\lang1033  \cf4\lang3082 TB_FileSave\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Ctrl+S\b0\f2\fs20  \cf0 / \cf4 MMFileSave\cf5\b\f0\par


\pard\cf0\b0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B4\'12\v0 Ulo\u382?i\u357? ako...\cf3\fs20  \par

\cf0\b0 Ulo\u382?\u237? aktu\u225?lny s\u250?bor KeyNote na disk pod nov\u253?m n\u225?zvom. \par

M\u244?\u382?ete zmeni\u357? n\u225?zov s\u250?boru a jeho umiestnenie (jednotku a/alebo adres\u225?r).\par

\cf5\b\par


\pard\li240\cf4\b0\f2 MMFileSaveAs\cf5\b\f0\par


\pard\cf0\b0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B5\'12\v0 Zatvori\u357?\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zatvor\u237? aktu\u225?lny s\u250?bor KeyNote. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e v\u228?\u269?\u353?ina pr\u237?kazov a n\u225?strojov KeyNote nie je dostupn\u225?, ke\u271? nie je otvoren\u253? \u382?iadny s\u250?bor.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Ctrl+Q\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMFileClose\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\ul\b\v\fs26\'11B6\'12\v0 Ned\u225?vne s\u250?bory\cf3\ulnone\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? podponuku (volite\u318?ne) so zoznamom n\u225?zvov s\u250?borov, ktor\u233? ste ned\u225?vno otvorili alebo ulo\u382?ili v KeyNote.\par

Je to ve\u318?mi r\u253?chly sp\u244?sob, ako otvori\u357? ned\u225?vno pou\u382?it\u253? s\u250?bor. Dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Mo\u382?nosti umo\u382?\u328?uje nastavi\u357? nieko\u318?ko nastaven\u237? t\u253?kaj\u250?cich sa ponuky Ned\u225?vne s\u250?bory (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<93|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: Mo\u382?nosti s\u250?boru}}}}}\f0\fs20 ).\par

\par


\pard\li240\b Pozn\u225?mka: \b0 Ak pou\u382?ijete pr\u237?kaz Vymaza\u357? zoznam MRU, pr\u237?kaz Ned\u225?vne s\u250?bory zmizne.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\cf1\b\v\fs24\'11B7\'12\v0 Vymaza\u357? zoznam MRU\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vyma\u382?e zoznam naposledy pou\u382?it\u253?ch s\u250?borov.\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs24\'11B8\'12\v0 Odstr\u225?ni\u357? zastaran\u233?\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Odstr\u225?ni zo zoznamu MRU s\u250?bory, ktor\u233? u\u382? neexistuj\u250?.\par


\pard\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B9\'12\v0 Automatick\u233? ukladanie\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Prep\u237?na mo\u382?nos\u357? automatick\u233?ho ukladania. Ke\u271? je mo\u382?nos\u357? zapnut\u225?, KeyNote bude v\u225?\u353? s\u250?bor uklada\u357? automaticky. \par

Ke\u271? je mo\u382?nos\u357? vypnut\u225?, KeyNote v\u225?s v pr\u237?pade potreby vyzve na ulo\u382?enie zmien. Dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Mo\u382?nosti umo\u382?\u328?uje nastavi\u357? nieko\u318?ko nastaven\u237? t\u253?kaj\u250?cich sa mo\u382?nosti automatick\u233?ho ukladania (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<92|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: S\u250?bory KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 ).\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMFileAutoSave\cf5\par


\pard\cf0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B10\'12\v0 Vlastnosti\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno vlastnost\u237? s\u250?boru ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<45|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Vlastnosti s\u250?boru KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20 ).\par

Okrem in\u253?ch funkci\u237? v\u225?m toto dial\u243?gov\u233? okno umo\u382?\u328?uje bezpe\u269?ne za\u353?ifrova\u357? v\u225?\u353? s\u250?bor KeyNote a ochr\u225?ni\u357? ho pred neopr\u225?vnen\u253?m pr\u237?stupom (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<49|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Vlastnosti s\u250?boru: Zabezpe\u269?enie}}}}}\f0\fs20 ).\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\f2\'11I17\'12\v0\f0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:17,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {17_Main_17.png}}}}\f2\lang1033  \cf4\lang3082 TB_FileInfo\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Alt+Enter\b0\f2\fs20  \cf0 / \cf4 MMFileProperties\cf0\par


\pard\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B11\'12\v0 Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov\cf3\fs20   \par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<50|496|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov}}}}}\f0\fs20 ), ktor\u233? v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje r\u253?chlo otvori\u357? jeden z predt\u253?m pou\u382?it\u253?ch s\u250?borov KeyNote. \par

Dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Spr\u225?vca s\u250?borov tie\u382? zobrazuje opisy a koment\u225?re priraden\u233? k va\u353?im s\u250?borom KeyNote, aby ste ich mohli \u318?ahko identifikova\u357?.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\v\f2\lang3082\'11I13\'12\cf0\v0\f0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:13,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {13_Main_13.png}}}}\cf4\f2  TB_FileMgr\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 F12\b0\f2\fs20  \cf0 / \cf4 MMFileManager\cf5\par


\pard\cf0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B12\'12\v0 Importova\u357?...\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Umo\u382?\u328?uje vybra\u357? jeden alebo viac s\u250?borov na import do KeyNote. M\u244?\u382?ete importova\u357? s\u250?bory KNT (a .KNE), RTF, TXT, HTML, TreePad a obr\u225?zkov\u233? s\u250?bory. \par

\par

V z\u225?vislosti od pr\u237?pony n\u225?zvu s\u250?boru m\u244?\u382?ete:\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 Vytvori\u357? hypertextov\u253? odkaz na s\u250?bor\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Importova\u357? ako nov\u253? prie\u269?inok\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Importova\u357? ako uzol alebo uzly stromu\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Importova\u357? ako virtu\u225?lny uzol alebo uzly stromu\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Importova\u357? obsah s\u250?boru na aktu\u225?lnu poz\u237?ciu kurzora\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Otvori\u357? alebo zl\u250?\u269?i\u357? s\u250?bor s aktu\u225?lne otvoren\u253?m s\u250?borom KeyNote (len s\u250?bory KeyNote)\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\b Tip: \b0 S\u250?bory m\u244?\u382?ete importova\u357? aj ich potiahnut\u237?m a pusten\u237?m do KeyNote (do panela Strom, panela Editor alebo na in\u250? \u269?as\u357? okna programu KeyNote: panel n\u225?strojov, stavov\u253? riadok, \u8230?).\par

\par


\pard Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<56|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Importovanie s\u250?borov v KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMToolsImport\cf5\par


\pard\cf0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B16\'12\v0 Export...\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Umo\u382?\u328?uje exportova\u357? \u269?as\u357? alebo cel\u253? otvoren\u253? s\u250?bor KeyNote do samostatn\u233?ho s\u250?boru (TXT, RTF, HTML, KNT alebo TreePad).\par


\pard\sb80 Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<57|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Export pozn\u225?mok}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMToolsExport\cf5\par


\pard\cf0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B15\'12\v0 Nastavenie str\u225?nky...\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? \u353?tandardn\u233? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Windows \ldblquote Nastavenie str\u225?nky\rdblquote , ktor\u233? v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? nastavi\u357? niektor\u233? aspekty tla\u269?e prie\u269?inkov. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e nastavenia vykonan\u233? v dial\u243?govom okne Nastavenie str\u225?nky sa ignoruj\u250?, ak povol\u237?te mo\u382?nos\u357? \ldblquote Bezpe\u269?n\u225? tla\u269?\rdblquote  (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<99|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: Pokro\u269?il\u233?}}}}}\f0\fs20 ).\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMFilePageSetup\cf5\par


\pard\cf0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B17\'12\v0 Tla\u269?...\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Otvor\u237? rovnak\u253? dial\u243?g dostupn\u253? cez S\u250?bor|Export... s predvolen\u253?m form\u225?tom \u8222?Tla\u269?iare\u328? (PDF, ...)\u8220?. Umo\u382?\u328?uje tla\u269? a n\u225?h\u318?ad s pou\u382?it\u237?m roz\u353?\u237?ren\u253?ch mo\u382?nost\u237?. Pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<57|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Export alebo tla\u269? pozn\u225?mok a prie\u269?inkov}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMFilePrint\cf5\par


\pard\cf0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B14\'12\v0 Kop\u237?rova\u357? do...\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Otvor\u237? \u353?tandardn\u233? dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Windows \u8222?Prejs\u357? do prie\u269?inka\u8220?, ktor\u233? v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? vybra\u357? adres\u225?r, do ktor\u233?ho chcete skop\u237?rova\u357? aktu\u225?lne otvoren\u253? s\u250?bor. Je to r\u253?chly sp\u244?sob, ako vytvori\u357? z\u225?lo\u382?n\u250? k\u243?piu s\u250?boru, napr. na externom disku. Dial\u243?gov\u233? okno si zapam\u228?t\u225? posledn\u253? zvolen\u253? adres\u225?r a automaticky sa otvor\u237? s n\u237?m predvolen\u253?m.\par


\pard\sb80 Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<52|2809|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Pr\u225?ca s re\u382?imami extern\u233?ho ukladania obr\u225?zkov}}}}}\f0\fs20  \par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMFileCopyTo\cf5\par


\pard\cf3\b\f0\par

\par

\cf1\v\fs26\'11B13\'12\v0 Ukon\u269?i\u357?\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zatvor\u237? program.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMFileExit\cf5\par


\pard\cf0\f0\par

\par

}
