\cf1\v\fs26\'11B2\'12\v0 Sp\u228?\u357?\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zru\u353?\u237? (odvol\u225?) naposledy vykonan\u250? oper\u225?ciu \u250?pravy. \par

Dial\u243?gov\u233? okno Mo\u382?nosti v\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje ur\u269?i\u357? \u8222?\u250?rove\u328? sp\u228?\u357?\u8220?, teda po\u269?et oper\u225?ci\u237? \u250?prav, ktor\u233? mo\u382?no vr\u225?ti\u357? sp\u228?\u357? (pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<89|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: Editor form\u225?tovan\u233?ho textu}}}}}\f0\fs20 ).\par

\par


