\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B39\'12\v0 Prilepi\u357? ako webov\u253? v\u253?stri\u382?ok\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Prilep\u237? text z extern\u253?ch programov (napr. prehliada\u269?ov) konfigurovate\u318?n\u253?m sp\u244?sobom, \u269?o umo\u382?\u328?uje prida\u357? k z\u225?znamu kontextov\u233? inform\u225?cie, ako \u269?as, URL alebo n\u225?zov.\par


\pard\sb80 Zahrnie v\u353?etko form\u225?tovanie zdrojov\u233?ho textu\par


\pard\par


\pard\sb80 Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<34|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie Web Clip}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Ctrl+W \cf0\b0\f2\fs20 / \cf4 MMEditPasteAsWebClip\cf5\b\par


