\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B40\'12\v0 Prilepi\u357? ako webov\u253? v\u253?stri\u382?ok (text)\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Prilep\u237? text z extern\u253?ch programov (napr. prehliada\u269?ov) konfigurovate\u318?n\u253?m sp\u244?sobom, \u269?o umo\u382?\u328?uje prida\u357? k z\u225?znamu kontextov\u233? inform\u225?cie, ako \u269?as, URL alebo n\u225?zov.\par


\pard\sb80 Umo\u382?\u328?uje {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<33|2492|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{\u8222?Vlastn\u233? \u269?ist\u233?\u8220? vlo\u382?enie}}}}}\f0\fs20 , ktor\u253? pod\u318?a toho, \u269?i je nastaven\u253? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<101|678|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Re\u382?im \u269?ist\u233?ho textu}}}}}\f0\fs20 , pon\u250?kne \u250?pln\u233? \u269?ist\u233? prilepenie alebo zahrnie ur\u269?it\u233? aspekty form\u225?tovania.\par

Pozri tie\u382? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<34|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie Web Clip}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par


