\pard\sb40 Aktivuje re\u382?im, ktor\u253? automaticky skr\u253?va za\u353?krtnut\u233? uzly. Ke\u271? m\u225?te v strome zobrazen\u233? za\u353?krt\u225?vacie pol\u237?\u269?ka, na v\u353?etk\u253?ch uzloch alebo len na podraden\u253?ch uzloch vybran\u253?ch uzlov, ka\u382?d\u253? uzol sa po za\u353?krtnut\u237? skryje. Navy\u353?e sa skryj\u250? v\u353?etky u\u382? ozna\u269?en\u233? uzly. (Pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<27|13504|0|11"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?vanie skryt\u253?ch uzlov}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\sb80\b Tip\b0 : s kl\u225?vesom \cf5\b Ctrl\cf0\b0 : zobrazi\u357? nefiltrovan\u233? uzly. \par


\pard\par


