\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B39\'12\v0 Farba textu\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zmen\u237? farbu vybran\u233?ho textu na farbu vybran\u250? na paneli n\u225?strojov form\u225?tovania.\par

Zvo\u318?te pr\u237?kaz \b N\u225?stroje | Mo\u382?nosti konfigur\u225?cie \b0 , v nastaven\u237? \b Pokro\u269?il\u233?\b0  vyberte vo\u318?bu Dial\u243?gy v\u253?beru farieb v starom \u353?t\u253?le, aby sa pri zvolen\u237? pr\u237?kazu \b Farba textu\b0  zobrazilo dial\u243?gov\u233? okno v\u253?beru farby.\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I98\'12\v0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:98,35,21"}}{\fldrslt {98_TextColor.png}}}} \cf4\f2 TB_Color\lang3082\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Ctrl+R\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMFormatTextColor\cf5\b\par


