\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B40\'12\v0 Farba pozadia\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vyberie in\u250? farbu pozadia aktu\u225?lneho uzla alebo pozn\u225?mky (panel Editor).\par

Zvo\u318?te pr\u237?kaz \b N\u225?stroje| Mo\u382?nosti\b0  konfigur\u225?cie, v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<99|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pokro\u269?il\u233?}}}}}\f0\fs20  nastaven\u237? vyberte vo\u318?bu Dial\u243?gy v\u253?beru farieb v starom \u353?t\u253?le, aby sa pri zvolen\u237? pr\u237?kazu \b Farba pozadia\b0  zobrazilo dial\u243?gov\u233? okno v\u253?beru farby.\par


\pard\fi-320\li680\sb80\b Tip: \b0 Farbu pozadia m\u244?\u382?ete \b zmeni\u357? pre V\u352?ETKY UZLY v strome\b0 : podr\u382?te stla\u269?en\u253? kl\u225?ves \cf5\b Shift\cf0\b0  pri v\u253?bere {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<113|14103|0|40"}}{\fldrslt{Form\u225?t | Farba pozadia}}}}}\f0\fs20 . KeyNote v\u225?s potom upozorn\u237?, \u382?e nov\u225? farba sa pou\u382?ije na v\u353?etky uzly stromu, a m\u244?\u382?ete potvrdi\u357? alebo zru\u353?i\u357?.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Ctrl+D\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMFormatBGColor\cf5\b\par


