\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B5\'12\v0 Tla\u269?i\u357? prie\u269?inok...\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vytla\u269?\u237? akt\u237?vny prie\u269?inok.\par

M\u244?\u382?ete zvoli\u357? tla\u269? iba vybran\u233?ho uzla, v\u353?etk\u253?ch uzlov v prie\u269?inku, s\u250?visl\u253?ch uzlov alebo v\u353?etk\u253?ch uzlov v prie\u269?inku, pri\u269?om ka\u382?d\u253? za\u269?\u237?na na novej strane. Takto sa nezahrnie ani p\u225?ta, ani hlavi\u269?ka strany, iba text uzlov.\par


\pard\sb120 Pozn\u225?mka: Ove\u318?a viac mo\u382?nost\u237? m\u225?te k dispoz\u237?cii v pr\u237?kaze \b S\u250?bor | Tla\u269?i\u357?...\b0  (alebo S\u250?bor | Exportova\u357?...). Pozri {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<57|4839|0|13"}}{\fldrslt{Tla\u269? pozn\u225?mok (export do tla\u269?iarne)}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


