Pou\u382?ite pr\u237?kaz \b N\u225?stroje/Mo\u382?nosti konfigur\u225?cie\b0  a nastavenie \b Form\u225?ty\b0  na nastavenie predvolen\u233?ho form\u225?tu \u269?asu. Inform\u225?cie o prisp\u244?soben\u237? \u269?asu n\u225?jdete v s\u250?bore \f3\ldblquote\b\f0 dateformats.txt\b0\f3\rdblquote\f0 .\par

