\lang3082\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B5\'12\v0 Nastavi\u357? z\u225?lo\u382?ku\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobrazi\u357? podmenu, ktor\u233? v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? vlo\u382?i\u357? z\u225?lo\u382?ku ozna\u269?en\u250? cel\u253?m \u269?\u237?slom od 0 do 9.\par

Na prechod na z\u225?lo\u382?ku m\u244?\u382?ete pou\u382?i\u357? pr\u237?kaz \b H\u318?ada\u357? | Prejs\u357? na z\u225?lo\u382?ku\b0 .\par

\par


\pard\li240\b Pozn\u225?mka:  \b0 Z\u225?lo\u382?ky existuj\u250? iba dovtedy, k\u253?m nezatvor\u237?te s\u250?bor KeyNote. Ke\u271? s\u250?bor znova otvor\u237?te, \u382?iadne z\u225?lo\u382?ky nebud\u250?.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\cf6\b\fs18 Shift+Alt+[x]\f3\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf5 MMBkmSet[x]\tab\cf0\f0 kde [x] je cel\u233? \u269?\u237?slo 0-9\par


\pard\par

\lang3082\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B6\'12\v0 Prejs\u357? na z\u225?lo\u382?ku\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobrazi\u357? podmenu, ktor\u233? v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? prejs\u357? na z\u225?lo\u382?ku nastaven\u250? pr\u237?kazom \b H\u318?ada\u357? | Nastavi\u357? z\u225?lo\u382?ku\b0 .\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf6\b\fs18 Alt+[x]\f3\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf5 MMBkmJ[x]\tab\tab\cf0\f0 kde [x] je cel\u233? \u269?\u237?slo 0-9\cf6\b\f3\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\lang3082\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B7\'12\v0 N\u225?js\u357? zodpovedaj\u250?cu z\u225?tvorku\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Prejs\u357? na zodpovedaj\u250?cu zlo\u382?en\u250? z\u225?tvorku, okr\u250?hlu z\u225?tvorku, hranat\u250? z\u225?tvorku alebo \u353?picat\u250? z\u225?tvorku pre ozna\u269?en\u250? z\u225?tvorku.\par

Stavov\u253? riadok zobraz\u237? spr\u225?vu, \u269?i sa zodpovedaj\u250?ca z\u225?tvorka na\u353?la.\par

\par


\pard\li240\b Tip: \b0 Kurzor m\u244?\u382?e by\u357? aj na\u318?avo od z\u225?tvorky.\par


\pard\par


